window.FWN_ALCHEMY_DIVINE_DAO_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_ALCHEMY_DIVINE_DAO_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":4801,"title":"Chapter 4801: Exterminated","paragraphs":["The strongest Saint of all eternity!","Zong Yuze and the others all inhaled sharply. If Ling Han really had battle prowess on the level of Pseudo-Emperor, then the title of the strongest Saint in all eternity was indeed not the slightest bit arrogant.","\"Alright, now that the puzzle-solving segment is over, I’m about to make my move,\" Ling Han said with a smile.","Zong Yuze and the others all smirked coldly.","When Ling Han was a Saint, he already possessed battle prowess on the level of Pseudo-Emperor. This was indeed amazing, but no matter how strong you were, you would only be comparable to a One Star Pseudo-Emperor, right?","Thus, if this guy made a move, that would simply be courting death.","The eight of them exchanged a look, and reached a concensus.","—If Ling Han took the field, they would join forces to kill Ling Han. In this way, the rock golem would become an ownerless Source Spirit. Without command, it could only fight based on instincts, and would be much easier to deal with.","’Come on, you arrogant brat.’","Ling Han leaped out, and charged towards Zong Yuze.","\"You’re seeking death!\" Zong Yuze smirked coldly, and countered Ling Han with a palm strike.","He wanted to send Ling Han flying with a single strike. Then, his companions would naturally continue and follow up with another attack, dealing a fatal blow to Ling Han.","A Pseudo-Emperor was indeed not easy to kill, but who asked Ling Han to be so arrogant?","If he wanted to seek death, who could he blame?","Ling Han smiled, and his iron fists clenched, blasting towards Zong Yuze.","Right until the instant when the fist and palm were about to make contact, only then did Ling Han suddenly channel out Destructive Energy and light of great dao.","Zong Yuze had a first impression of Ling Han, and thought that since Ling Han was a Saint, Ling Han’s battle prowess definitely wouldn’t be all that strong. Thus, his mind was filled with plans to send Ling Han flying, and shatter his defenses. Then, his companions would follow up with another attack, easily dealing with Ling Han.","Thus, how could he possibly be on guard at this moment?","Peng! The fist and palm collided, and Zong Yuze was instantly sent flying. Moreover, his right arm had abruptly disappeared.","Ning Xuelin and the others were all shocked.","Indeed, someone had been sent flying, but why wasn’t it Ling Han but rather Zong Yuze?","Were they seeing things?","Impossible! They were Pseudo-Emperors, so how could they have blurred vision?","Boom!","The rock golem attacked aggressively, shattering their idle thoughts.","Ling Han activated the Phoenix Wings Divine Flight. With a quick stride, he caught up to Zong Yuze and threw another punch.","It was too fast!","It should be known that aside from cultivation level, Ling Han was superior to Zong Yuze in all aspects. Since the initiative was already in his hands, how could Zong Yuze block him?","Peng! Peng! Peng!","Ling Han threw a few consecutive punches, and each punch landed solidly. It could be clearly seen that Zong Yuze’s body was continuously disappearing, and in the end, his head was blasted apart with a single punch, both form and spirit destroyed.","Hiss, this was too terrifying!","Ning Xuelin and the others all felt a chill run down their spines, and they couldn’t help but tremble.","Saints were hard to kill, and Pseudo-Emperors were even harder to kill.","However, in Ling Han’s hands, with just a few punches, Zong Yuze was beaten to burst.","Just what kind of colossal power gap was this?","\"Run!\" They didn’t hesitate any longer. If Ling Han and the rock golem formed a pincer attack, they wouldn’t be able to resist at all. They would only be defeated one by one.","However, if the seven of them fled together, Ling Han and the rock golem would only be able to catch up to one each, at most. There were still five people who could escape.","Ling Han cracked a smile, \"You guys are really thinking too much.\"","With a leap, he stood on the shoulder of the rock golem, and set off in pursuit of Ning Xuelin and the others.","The rock golem wasn’t skilled in speed, and normally speaking, there was not much of a gap in terms of speed among Pseudo-Emperors, so theoretically speaking, the rock golem couldn’t possibly catch up to Ning Xuelin and the others.","But the problem was, what was this place?","The mountain was too slippery, and once one slipped, it was possible that he would crash into the icicles, which would pierce into his body, and the strong poison would invade, directly taking his life.","Hence, they all had to be careful, and walk slowly.","However, the rock golem didn’t need to do that.","It barged around, and soon caught up to a person.","Ling Han and the rock golem attacked together, so how many strikes could that person block?","In less than a hundred moves, that person was blasted into smithereens.","Ling Han sighed. Pseudo-Emperors were really hard to kill. He had a great advantage in battle prowess, and also possessed such deadly weapons like Destructive Energy and light of great dao, but it still actually took him over a hundred moves to be able to kill his target.","Even when he was at the Venerate Tier, killing low-level Saints wasn’t as difficult as this.","—If this kind of lament was known to others, they would definitely roll their eyes at him, and reprimand him for showing off.","In theory, as long as a Pseudo-Emperor wanted to flee, even a Great Emperor would find it very difficult to kill him. You, a Saint, only used a hundred over moves to succeed, so what else do you want?","\"Big Rock, let’s continue the chase!\" Ling Han jumped onto the rock golem’s body and began their hunt again.","Taking advantage of this little bit of time, Ning Xuelin and the others had already run very far away, but they could not hold up against Ling Han, who had the reckless rock golem.","Peng, peng, peng! The rock golem didn’t care about the icicles. It simply barged through, and not long after, it caught up to another person.","However, the price for this was that its body had shrunk again.","It was fine. He could hold on.","Ling Han and the rock golem joined forces. If they battled in such a dangerous place, what Pseudo-Emperor would be able to withstand it?","The two of them continued their pursuit, leaving behind a trail of corpses.","However, after killing seven people, the rock golem shrunk back to a normal size, and could no longer be injured. Otherwise, its core would be exposed, and that would be too dangerous.","Ling Han turned around to grab the rock golem, and travelled on his own.","In this way, his speed naturally decreased greatly, but it was all right. He was still running faster than Yang Deyu, who was in front of him.","A hint of delight appeared on Yang Deyu’s face. This was because the plains were within sight.","He had already rushed down the mountain.","He hurriedly used all his movement techniques, and ran madly for his life.","A while later, Ling Han also came down from the mountain, and had the rock golem wait for him at the foot of the mountain. He used Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, and his speed began to spike madly.","Three days later, he finally caught up to Yang Deyu.","Boom!","Without another word, Ling Han directly threw a punch.","This punch was so terrifying that Yang Deyu had no choice but to turn around to parry it.","However, after blocking a punch, he turned around and fled.","He was already fully aware of Ling Han’s battle prowess. He was completely no match for him, and if he fought him head-on, he would definitely die.","However, faced with Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, his speed was too slow.","Ling Han instantly caught up to him, and continued to attack madly.","\"Ling Han, what enmity do you have with us? Why are you so ruthless?\" Yang Deyu shouted harshly.","Ling Han pondered for a moment before asking, \"Because you guys are ugly?\"","Pei, what kind of reason was that?","Yang Deyu was filled with grief and indignation. ’It’s already come to this, and you still want to humiliate me?’","I am ugly, and you are good-looking?","Ling Han made another move, then said calmly, \"Our positions are different. Ultimately, there will be a bloody battle.\"","Yang Deyu was rendered speechless upon hearing this.","That was because he had also recalled that he had once received a death command. As long as an outsider entered, there was no need for any reason at all. He was to kill the other party.","Thus, there were no grievances or anything of the sort. It was simply a matter of position.","Boom!","The two of them fought fiercely, and Yang Deyu still didn’t give up on the idea of fleeing. However, in front of Ling Han, how could he possibly succeed?","After several hundred moves, he was also killed."]},{"number":4802,"title":"Chapter 4802: Repelling Great Emperors","paragraphs":["Without the restrictions of the environment, a Pseudo-Emperor was really too hard to kill.","If Ling Han hadn’t grasped the fastest movement technique in the world, Yang Deyu would have definitely fled.","Even so, it still took him a few hundred moves.","Ling Han turned around and didn’t let the rock golem follow him. He went up the mountain peak alone, then filled a large amount of Cold Water of Death into a vessel.","Without a Spatial Spirit Tool, he could only carry it physically.","Thankfully, the vessel was sealed. Otherwise, it would really be difficult to deal with.","Ling Han descended the snowy mountain. After confirming that he was safe, he then went to think of a way to better carry this liquid.","This thing could bring death, and was incredibly frightening. If one was not careful, even a Great Emperor could possibly be affected.","Hence, this could be used as a secret weapon.","However, vessels could only be carried physically. If he had to carefully take out the vessel and then open the seal when facing a Great Emperor... Uh, what Great Emperor would still be affected?","Could he draw it into the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower?","Ling Han was a little worried. This thing could cause any existence to die and wilt. Who knew if it would affect the Origin Gold.","After all, there was a sliver of Ling Han’s divine sense in this. If it was destroyed, it would still cause some damage to Ling Han.","He would give it a try.","He controlled the Origin Gold, and absorbed a little bit of the Cold Water of Death into the tower.","It seemed like... there was nothing wrong with it.","A smile appeared on Ling Han’s face. This was good.","He drew all the Cold Water of Death into the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower. This way, when fighting enemies, he only had to suddenly activate the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, and the Cold Water of Death would spill out. In a moment of carelessness, it could cause great damage.","\"Big Rock, let’s go.\"","Ling Han brought the rock golem to the plains. Although there weren’t large swathes of rocks here, the rock golem didn’t mind. It absorbed one here, followed by another there, and after a few months, it still recovered to its largest size.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","This big guy stepped on the ground, releasing a loud boom. There was really nothing that could be done. Its weight was clear to see, so even if it wanted to be light, it couldn’t be light. After all, the gravity fields here were too terrifying.","The two of them began to wander around again, searching everywhere for Genesis Substance.","Many years later, Ling Han suddenly stopped.","He sensed that unique aura of Genesis Substance.","He hurriedly followed the trail. True enough, there was a Celestial medicine ahead of him, and it was gently swaying in the breeze.","However, Ling Han’s eyes instantly narrowed.","That was because beside the Celestial medicine, there was presently a massive beast lying prostrate.","He had seen it before.","Qiong Qi Emperor!","This was a trap set up against him, using Genesis Substance to lure him out.","At this moment, Qiong Qi Emperor slowly stood up and said, \"You’ve come.\"","His voice was calm, and there wasn’t a shred of killing intent in it.","In the eyes of a Great Emperor, Ling Han was nothing but an ant, regardless of how powerful he was.","Killing a mere ant, what need was there for killing intent?","He could just casually stomp him to death.","Now that things had come to this, Ling Han relaxed instead. He first sent out a message through divine sense, and had the rock golem flee.","Qiong Qi Emperor didn’t pay any heed to this at all. He only wanted to kill Ling Han.","Ling Han appeared even calmer, and said with a smile, \"I’m here. Can you give me that Celestial medicine?\"","The Qiong Qi Emperor faltered upon hearing this. It was as if he hadn’t expected Ling Han to be so calm.","Shua, he waved a paw, and that Celestial medicine flew towards Ling Han.","So what if he gave it to him? Would he still be able to eat it? F***!","Even the Great Emperor couldn’t help but gape.","That was because Ling Han had really begun to gnaw on the Celestial medicine after he had gotten hold of it. Furthermore, his speed was extremely fast. In just a few moves, he had swallowed the whole Celestial medicine.","This!","Qiong Qi Emperor felt like he had underestimated the shamelessness of this young man in front of him. That was practically shameless to the point of having no pride at all.","However, Qiong Qi Emperor immediately withdrew his slightly fluctuating emotions.","So what if I feed you a Celestial medicine?","Could it be that you could immediately break through to become a Great Emperor?","He moved directly, and delivered a palm strike at Ling Han.","Boom, a colossal hand appeared, bringing with it rolling black Qi.","Ling Han didn’t hesitate at all. He immediately turned around and fled.","Fighting head-on with a Great Emperor?","Hehe, he was not that stupid.","However, he had just turned around, when he saw another Great Emperor appear.","Bi Fang.","The two Great Emperors attacked from the front and back.","Where could Ling Han flee to?","Weng, the Clear Bamboo Sword revived, and Ling Han immediately slashed at Bi Fang Emperor.","\"You’re like a mantis trying to stop a chariot,\" Bi Fang Emperor sneered. Wanting to stop him with just an Imperial Weapon?","How naive!","Peng! With a single strike, the Clear Bamboo Sword was were immediately sent flying. Meanwhile, Ling Han also activated his second layer of defense, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower.","Under the shockwave of the terrifying power, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower continued to emit booming sounds as if it couldn’t hold on any longer and was about to collapse.","There was no need to be afraid. Origin Gold was completely capable of withstanding the barrage of attacks from a Great Emperor, and the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower had been strengthened by the Metal of Creation, which was considerably stronger than the normal Origin Gold, so there was even less need to worry.","However, relying on an Imperial Weapon and a Pseudo-Imperial Weapon, even if Ling Han managed to cope with the strike of a Great Emperor, the shockwave still caused streams of blood to spray from all over his body.","Only one Great Emperor would appear in an era, so how could he not be inconceivably strong?","Ling Han didn’t have time to make any adjustments. Behind him, the Qiong Qi Emperor had already charged over.","\"Go!\"","Ling Han unleashed the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, and a water screen instantly swept toward the two Great Emperors.","\"Cold Water of Death!\" the two Great Emperors exclaimed in astonishment. They hadn’t expected that Ling Han would possess such a powerful weapon, and they definitely wouldn’t be guarded against a Saint. They had simply charged over without any preparation at all, and their speed was astonishingly quick.","This caused the Cold Water of Death to pour so much that it directly arrived in front of them.","They hurriedly pushed out their claws, setting up a defense in front of them. At this moment, the terror of the Cold Water of Death was completely clear. A small portion actually penetrated their defense, and spilled on their claws.","Instantly, the two Great Emperors groaned in pain, their vitality dropping drastically.","However, this also revealed the strength of a Great Emperor. Even if they were touched by the Cold Water of Death, they did not die immediately. Instead, they were only severely injured, but they still possessed a terrifying battle prowess, far superior to a Pseudo-Emperor.","Ling Han sighed. It was clearly impossible to truly kill Emperors with this.","He didn’t stop at all, and he continued to sprint forward.","After suffering such a blow, even the two Great Emperors had to rest and recuperate, and no longer had the time to pursue Ling Han.","Weng, a terrifying divine sense surged around Ling Han, as if warning him that even if he managed to escape this time, his fate was still destined.","Ling Han was unmoved, and merely ran madly. Very soon, he had rushed out of the area that was affected by the divine sense of the Great Emperors.","He secretly called himself lucky. If it was not for the fact that the Divine Beasts in the Primitive Abyss did not have any Imperial Weapons, then the two Great Emperors would definitely not have been injured by the Cold Water of Death, as they would be protected by the Imperial Weapons.","—He himself was using a Pseudo-Imperial Weapon to store the Cold Water of Death.","This was truly a blessing in disguise. This time, the Great Emperors had set a trap for him. Thankfully, he had previously obtained the Cold Water of Death. Otherwise, how would he have been able to resolve this situation?","And now, not only had he come out, he had even eaten a Genesis-level Celestial medicine.","Ling Han hurriedly sat down in a cross-legged position, and began to refine the medicinal power. This was something that definitely could not be wasted."]},{"number":4803,"title":"Chapter 4803: Success is at hand","paragraphs":["Half a day later, Ling Han refined all the medicinal effects.","His improvement wasn’t great, and he had only raised the number of Regulations he could absorb to 87.","It could not be helped. The higher the cultivation level, the more difficult it was to improve. Moreover, the level of Celestial medicine that the Qiong Qi Emperor had used to lure him into a trap was also a little low. It was already quite impressive that he could grasp one more Regulation with it.","\"Qiong Qi , Qiong Qi. No wonder, its name has the word ’poor’, so how could it possibly be <anno data-annotation-id=\"cc2c5e8b-be7b-445b-8e4a-8022ab0c5bc7\" data-title=\"generous?\">generous? 1 </anno>\"","Ling Han murmured to himself.","Not long after, the rock golem returned.","The two of them continued onwards, and began a very long roundabout journey.","By now, the Divine Beast Emperors would definitely be looking for Ling Han. Thus, he definitely could not take the \"normal\" route. He could only circle around, circle around, and circle around again.","However, all the Great Emperors in the entire second level moved for Ling Han’s sake. In fact, even the Great Emperors in the first level actually appeared as well. Such a great commotion was merely for the sake of finding and killing a Saint.","No one would believe this if they heard about it. Since when had Great Emperors become so cheap? A whole group of them had actually been mobilized to kill a measly Saint?","However, Ling Han knew that if the Divine Stone corresponding to the Genesis World was a part of the Stone of Life, then he, Ding Shu and the others were seeds that the Great Emperor Wu Ya and the others had released many years ago.","Perhaps this was a step that had changed the structure of the Primitive Abyss. Thus, the thirty-six Divine Beasts were doing their best to stop his \"return\".","Ling Han had been channeling the Strange Shadow Steps the entire time, and the rock golem had stayed far away from him, so it wouldn’t expose him.","On the long journey, Ling Han discovered multiple Divine Beast Emperors streaking through the skies. They released their divine sense to search for him, but such a \"rough\" search method naturally could not possibly find him.","After all, he too had Pseudo-Emperor-level battle prowess.","However, after a few more years, the search of the Great Emperors became even more meticulous. It was clear that they were determined to find him even if they had to dig three feet deep.","Under such circumstances, Ling Han didn’t dare to bring the rock golem along with him anymore.","This would very easily expose him.","He had the rock golem enter a stone forest, and wait there for his return.","Originally, the rock golem couldn’t possibly obey commands, but after Ling Han revived it, Ling Han’s influence on it increased several levels, and it was very easy to command it.","Ling Han once again advanced alone. Now that there was no longer any burden on him, his heart and spirit also relaxed.","Seven years later, he was finally discovered by a Great Emperor, who began to hunt him down. However, Ling Han used his full strength, and also summoned the Cold Water of Death, and finally managed to escape successfully.","He had repeatedly escaped from the hands of Great Emperors. If there was a record that was specifically targeted at this number, Ling Han reckoned that he would be able to reach the position of number one.","In the process of fleeing, Ling Han accidentally barged into a valley, and actually discovered a Genesis-level Celestial medicine.","\"Does this mean that one will definitely have good fortune after surviving a great disaster?\"","Ling Han laughed loudly, and naturally plucked the Celestial medicine without any reservations. Then, he began to refine the Celestial medicine.","This Celestial medicine contained a considerable amount of Genesis Substance, causing the number of Regulations that Ling Han had grasped to instantly increase to as many as 90.","\"How strong is my present battle prowess?\" Ling Han murmured. Even if it was conventional battle prowess, he should still be superior to Buddha Doga, and could overwhelm all Pseudo-Emperors.","\"But to match a Great Emperor... it is still a little lacking.\"","Because this was not the first time he had come into contact with a Great Emperor, Ling Han was deeply aware of how strong a Great Emperor was.","Right now, he was still no match for a Great Emperor.","However!","Because his whereabouts had been discovered, even more Great Emperors had come to the vicinity these few days, and began a thorough search, forcing Ling Han to appear again.","Ling Han once again charged out of the siege, and moved unhindered in the vast Primitive Abyss.","Previously, when he had broken free from the pursuit of the Great Emperors, he had paid the price of severe injury, but this time, the injuries he had sustained were clearly much lighter.","This proved that his strength was steadily improving.","In the following few thousand years, Ling Han was constantly being hunted down and forced to break out of a siege.","He was continuously injured. At times, it would only be light injuries, but at other times, he would be severely injured. Under the tempering of such extremely arduous battles, his willpower had been tempered to an incredibly tough state, and his battle prowess was also stronger than ever before.","And in these few thousand years, it was not that he had not gained anything. Occasionally, he would still encounter Genesis-level Celestial medicines, and they would elevate his cultivation level step by step.","91 flashes, 92 flashes, 93 flashes... the number of Regulations he could accommodate was getting closer and closer to the limit, and he had still only undergone Silent Destruction four times.","This meant that once he broke through to the level of Pseudo-Emperor, in terms of cultivation level, he would be a five-star Pseudo-Emperor.","And in terms of battle prowess, hoho, that was definitely a true Emperor!","96... 97... 98!","Ling Han’s eyes suddenly snapped open, an expression of both excitement and disappointment appearing on his face.","Previously, he had also harvested another Genesis-level Celestial medicine. At first, he had thought that after refining the Celestial medicine, he would be able to rush up to the height of 99 Regulations, but after refining the Celestial medicine, he discovered that he was still a step away.","However, as long as he had the slightest bit of improvement now, he would reach the true limit of the Silent Destruction Tier.","He was only one step away.","Ling Han stood up abruptly. Not far ahead of him, a city that looked like a giant fish was in sight.","It looked like a fish, but also had a pair of wings, as if it could flap its wings and fly at any time, turning into a bird.","Roc?","No, it was Luoyu, one of the thirty-six Divine Beasts.","After so many years, Ling Han finally arrived at the third level.","He didn’t disguise himself, and he simply ran over. However, under the effects of the Strange Shadow Steps, even if he walked in front of Saints, it was guaranteed that no one would be able to see him.","Just like that, he boldly entered into Luoyu City.","At first, he only wanted to pass through, but after entering into the city, he discovered that this place was extraordinarily lively.","He listened to the discussions of the masses, and only then did he know that the disciple of the Great Emperor, Jiang Ling, had just returned. It was said that he had harvested a Genesis-level Great Herb. When the news spread out, it made all the people in Luoyu City excited.","This was a Genesis-level Great Herb, so it naturally would cause a commotion.","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel a jolt in his heart. If he could snatch this Celestial medicine, wouldn’t he be able to reach the peak stage of Saint Tier?","What a good person.","Hidden in the shadows, he listened to the praises of the masses, and soon found out where Jiang Ling was.","Then, he moved out.","It wasn’t long before the manor of the disciple of the Great Emperor appeared before him.","Ling Han climbed over the wall and entered silently.","Similar to the residences of other disciples of Great Emperors, this manor occupied a large area, but its layout was simple.","Because he couldn’t alert the Great Emperor, Ling Han didn’t even release his divine sense to probe the surroundings. Instead, he retracted his aura and acted like a ghost, using the Strange Shadow Steps.","After spending some time, he finally located Jiang Ling’s location.","This person was presently seated in a cross-legged position, and there was a Celestial medicine placed in front of him.","He was adjusting his condition. Only when he had reached his optimal condition would he consume the Celestial medicine, maximizing its effects.","After all, this was a Genesis-level Celestial medicine, and it was difficult to harvest even a single stalk in tens of thousands of years.","Ling Han smiled. This was really a great help to him.","He quietly set up a formation, imprisoning this area, preventing any commotion from being heard.","Then, he appeared, pushed open the doors and entered.","<annotations style=\"display: none;\">’Qiong’ literally translates to ’poor’ in Chinese.</annotations>"]},{"number":4804,"title":"Chapter 4804: Consummate level of Saint Tier","paragraphs":["\"You?\" Jiang Ling suddenly recovered from his state of calm, his eyes bursting with an astonishing divine light.","He was truly stunned. Someone had actually entered his room, and only now did he come to his senses?","Who was this person, and what cultivation level was he at?","He was too unfamiliar. There was definitely no such person in the city.","\"Who allowed you to come in?\" He immediately suppressed the fluctuation in his heart. As a dignified Pseudo-Emperor, what did he have to fear?","Ling Han cracked a smile, and pointed at that Celestial medicine, \"It.\"","F***!","Anger involuntarily flashed across Jiang Ling’s face. Would a Celestial medicine summon you in?","Are you a Flower Fairy?","In an instant, countless grievances surged in his heart.","\"Who are you?\" he asked.","\"My name is Ling Han,\" Ling Han said with a smile.","Jiang Ling’s expression instantly changed drastically, \"You are Ling Han!\"","\"Yi, you’ve heard of me?\" Ling Han appeared slightly surprised.","\"Humph, being able to escape the Great Emperors’ pursuit time and time again, I thought you had three heads and six <anno data-annotation-id=\"bdd78b5a-eda4-47f1-bd29-70ffb0d8caf8\" data-title=\"arms\">arms 1 </anno>. As it turned out, you are nothing more than this!\" Jiang Ling said disdainfully. He could sense Ling Han’s aura; he was clearly a Saint.","He could crush a measly Saint with a single finger.","Being able to repeatedly escape from the hands of Great Emperors, it could only be said that this person’s ability to escape was top-notch.","Ling Han chuckled and said, \"My cultivation level is too low. I’m truly sorry about that.\"","Jiang Ling raised a brow, \"You are really arrogant!\" He was actually still in the mood to show off at a time like this. Just how confident was this person?","\"Ya, isn’t that modesty?\" Ling Han scratched his head, and said, \"Alright, then I’ll tell the truth. I can deal with trash like you with a single move, so I’m naturally filled with confidence.\"","Jiang Ling couldn’t help but raise his brow again. \"Your cultivation level isn’t high, yet you’re spouting nonsense. Fine, after I capture you, I’d like to see how arrogant you can be!\"","He stretched out a hand, and grabbed out at Ling Han.","Pa!","Ling Han sent out a palm strike, and Jiang Ling did not even have the chance to dodge or parry. He was heavily sent flying, and crashed into the wall. Then, he bounced back, and after rolling seven or eight times on the ground, he finally lay still.","The force of this slap was so great that even a groove appeared on the wall, which was a ghastly sight.","However, the structure of heaven and earth in the Primitive Abyss was too sturdy. Even such a heavy impact did not destroy the rooms.","Jiang Ling was dizzy, and everything he saw was blurry. His vision was completely spinning around in circles.","However, a Pseudo-Emperor was a Pseudo-Emperor, after all. In an instant, he bounced up again, faced Ling Han, and assumed a defensive posture.","Ling Han didn’t think much of it, and said with a smile, \"How about it? I’m strong enough, right? Can I do as I please?\"","How arrogant!","However, Jiang Ling had completely lost his fighting spirit. Whether he was skilled or not, he would know with a single try. He didn’t even know how Ling Han attacked, and he had already collapsed. Just how wide was the gap in strength between them?","He finally knew that the fact that Ling Han could repeatedly escape from the hands of the Great Emperors was not only because of luck, but also because of his abilities.","He glanced at the door. As long as he rushed out, he would be saved.","It should be known that this was the Luoyu City, where there was a Great Emperor overseeing things.","No matter how strong you were, could you be stronger than a Great Emperor?","Sou, he immediately rushed out.","Yet Ling Han merely smiled, and made no move to stop him.","Haha, then just wait to die.","Jiang Ling broke into a grin, \"Ling Han, you are arrogant—\"","Peng!","He suddenly crashed into a wall of air, and then was immediately bounced back. However, cracks also began to appear on the wall of air, and it slowly crumbled.","This was a restriction that Ling Han had set up. It could block a Pseudo-Emperor. However, being crashed into by a Pseudo-Emperor like this, the restriction was also immediately destroyed.","After all, he was a Pseudo-Emperor, so how could he be so weak?","However, Ling Han had already moved. Pa, a palm strike descended, incredibly heavy.","Jiang Ling was forcefully imprisoned, and he felt as if he couldn’t even move a single finger. In fact, his divine sense was also operating at an exceedingly slow pace, and he couldn’t even send out a signal for help.","\"What did you say just now?\" Ling Han asked with a smile. He pressed down with his palm, completely restricting Jiang Ling’s cultivation level. Then, he picked Jiang Lingup and pressed him onto the ground.","Jiang Ling was speechless, and ten thousand curse words raced through his mind.","—You are so strong, so why didn’t you just directly move to subdue him? Is there any meaning to toying around with others like this?","Ling Han tossed Jiang Ling aside, then looked towards that Celestial medicine, revealing an excited expression.","As long as he refined this Celestial medicine, he would be able to cultivate Saint Tier to consummate level.","\"Thank you,\" he said to Jiang Ling.","’Holy f*ck!’","If it wasn’t for the fact that Jiang Ling’s cultivation level had been sealed, he would definitely have fought Ling Han to the death at this moment.","He had gone too far!","Killing someone was only a matter of having his head touch the <anno data-annotation-id=\"e8d325f2-8e80-4ba2-b26b-66f7ebb54cc9\" data-title=\"ground\">ground 1 </anno>. You have humiliated him time and time again; you can’t play around like this.","Ling Han picked up the Celestial medicine and washed it with Regulations.","This made Jiang Ling even more depressed. ’Do you think I’m dirty?’","However, when he saw Ling Han begin to chew on the Celestial medicine in large mouthfuls, he felt even worse.","That was something that he had spent a great deal of effort to obtain.","You b@stard!","He forcibly endured it, because he had previously reported to Luoyu Emperor that he would only be in seclusion for three years this time. Thus, if he did not come out of seclusion by then, the Great Emperor would definitely send someone over to check on him.","Humph, by then, you would be in deep trouble.","Of course, the prerequisite was that Ling Han had to stay here long enough.","Ling Han sat down cross-leggedly, and began to refine this Celestial medicine.","Weng, the Genesis Substance surged within his body, and then a streak of great dao surged out from the top of Ling Han’s head.","What!","When Jiang Ling saw this, he couldn’t help but stare in shock and disbelief.","Was that... the Dao of Heaven and Earth?","But why could it surge out of a person’s body?","They had both ingested Genesis-level Celestial medicines, so why had such an unusual phenomenon never happened to him before?","The pillar of light soared into the sky, but Ling Han wasn’t worried. Everyone knew that it was Jiang Ling who had ingested the Celestial medicine, so they would definitely think that it was him who had caused this strange phenomenon.","However, seven days later, the Genesis Substance was exhausted, and the Dao of Heaven and Earth disappeared.","True enough, not one person came over.","The disciple of the Great Emperor was presently cultivating in seclusion. Who would dare come and disturb him?","Ling Han smiled faintly, and breathed a long sigh of relief.","99 Regulations formed.","He had finally reached the consummate level of the Silent Destruction Tier. Meanwhile, he had only experienced five times of Silent Destruction. This was definitely unprecedented.","Theoretically speaking, he was a Five-Star Saint, but had the ability to suppress all Pseudo-Emperors with battle prowess, and once he became a Pseudo-Emperor, he would directly reach the level of five stars. This was like a dream.","\"Now that I am here, it’s truly begun.\"","Ling Han’s gaze was resolute. Ahead of him was a group of Great Emperors. If he didn’t cultivate to the level of Pseudo-Emperor, he wouldn’t even be qualified to match them, so how could he stop them?","Again!","He was still in seclusion, continuing to break through to the level of Pseudo-Emperor.","As long as he could cultivate to the level of Pseudo-Emperor, so what if he was discovered by the Luoyu Emperor? He was completely capable of facing him head-on.","Seeing that Ling Han was still in seclusion, Jiang Ling couldn’t help but sneer.","’Very good, very good. You can continue to waste your time like this. As long as you delay it until the deadline of three years, you will be discovered. At that time, when the Great Emperor makes his move, who knows how terrible your fate would be.’","He waited and waited. In fact, he was even a little excited, and hoped that this day would come soon.","<annotations style=\"display: none;\">This is a Chinese idiom that means one is infinitely resourceful.Imagine the executioner raising the axe, and at that moment, when the head is chopped off, it just touches the ground for a moment and then it’s over. This is a Chinese idiom meaning an action is excessive, crossing limits, or too much.</annotations>"]},{"number":4805,"title":"Chapter 4805: Found","paragraphs":["One year, two years...","Though Ling Han had just stepped onto the limits of Saint Tier, he definitely did not lack accumulation.","Before this, he had continuously battled with the Great Emperors. Though he had always been on the run, under such heavy pressure, his potential had also been completely unleashed. His battle prowess had similarly been tempered to an incredibly pure level.","He really did not need to accumulate any more experience.","Furthermore, aside from him, a Pseudo-Emperor would be able to break through when he had cultivated about twenty Regulations. Even if it was the Great Emperors of the past, they would only be able to reach thirty Regulations at most, right?","Yet Ling Han had 99 streaks, which was three times more than the Great Emperors of the past.","Just how terrifying was his accumulation?","\"From Venerate Tier to Saint Tier, that is the process of Silent Destruction of one’s body, assimilating with heaven and earth.\"","\"However, Saint-level to Pseudo-Emperor is a process of resuscitating the body and becoming a self-contained body.\"","\"For me, this shouldn’t be too difficult.\"","Even for the past generations of Great Emperors, the step from Saint-level to Pseudo-Emperor-level was something that could not be accomplished without accumulating for a few hundred or a few thousand years.","However, Ling Han was different.","That was because becoming a self-contained body was something that he had long since accomplished.","With the Genesis World inside him, wasn’t this self-contained?","Thus, what he had to do now was to revive his body, which was as simple as that.","However, even if it was only this one step, this was not something that could be resolved in a short while.","Silent Destruction of one’s body was difficult, but recovering his body was even more difficult!","Throughout history, just how many had managed to become Saints? And just how many had managed to become nine-star Saints?","However, compared to the quantity of Pseudo-Emperors, the number of Nine-Star Saints would have to be a hundred times, or even a thousand times more than that, right?","Thus, it was difficult for one’s body to undergo Silent Destruction, and even more difficult to revive it.","Ling Han was extremely calm, and merely focused on reviving his own body. Once he revived, it would trigger a qualitative change, allowing him to advance into the position of Pseudo-Emperor in a single stroke.","There were still nine months.","There were still eight months.","There were still seven months.","And...","Jiang Ling counted the days on the sidelines. Because Ling Han was in a state of ’cultivation’, he didn’t hide it at all, so he saw the holy flame several times.","Green.","This meant that Ling Han was a Five-Star Saint.","He smirked coldly. Though Ling Han’s strength was practically heaven-defying, a Five Star Saint being able to easily subdue a Three Star Pseudo-Emperor like him, if a Pseudo-Emperor compared with a Great Emperor, they were from two completely different worlds.","Thus, as long as the Great Emperor made a move, a Five-Star Saint would be trash.","Soon, the time was getting closer and closer.","Six months, five months... one month.","Three years had passed.","Jiang Ling breathed a sigh of relief, and then a cold smirk appeared at the corners of his lips.","Now, it was possible that someone would come to check on the situation at any time, so, hoho.","As expected, after half a month, someone came to the door.","\"Lord Jiang, Lord Jiang,\" that person called out softly.","However, Jiang Ling could not make any sound, and could only lie down and stare blankly.","However, he was in no hurry. He was sure that this servant was not an idiot. If he did not get a response from him, then even if he did not guess that he had been kidnapped, he would definitely realize that something had happened, such as going mad.","That person called out a few more times, and when he still did not get a response from Jiang Ling, he became a little anxious.","\"Lord Jiang, this subordinate is coming in.\" That person pushed open the doors, and with a creak, the doors were pushed open.","W-what?","When he saw Ling Han sitting cross-legged in his room, and Jiang Ling lying on the ground, that person was shocked. His mouth was half-gaping, and there was no reaction at all.","Jiang Ling was extremely anxious. Idiot, couldn’t you have shouted first?","Right at this moment, Ling Han suddenly opened his eyes. Weng! An incredibly powerful aura surged out. Peng! That person was sent flying.","Jiang Ling was anxious, but after just barely sensing for a while, he discovered that the person who had been sent flying had only fainted temporarily, and had not died. Only then did he he heave a sigh of relief.","Of course, he was not worried about that person, but rather that if the other party had not died, he would be able to quickly spread the news. Otherwise, he would have to wait for a few more days.","Ling Han had no intention of attacking at all, and closed his eyes again.","He had already reached the most crucial moment.","After countless attempts, he directly viewed his body as another Genesis World, reviving his body just like how he had revived the rock golem.","Success was close at hand.","Thus, Ling Han would rather take a risk at this moment than stop.","If he did not grasp this kind of enlightenment, who knew when he would be able to grasp it again.","A whole five days later, that servant that had been knocked unconscious finally regained consciousness. He glanced at the house, and hurriedly broke into a run and fled.","Only when he could no longer sense this person’s aura did Jiang Ling heave a sigh of relief.","Very good, the reinforcements should arrive soon.","True enough, after only a while, a great many people ran over. They were all Saints that were wearing Bronze Battle Armors.","\"Who are you? Hurry up and release Lord Jiang!\" the Saints roared.","They had only thought that Jiang Ling had been careless in his defense when he had been cultivating in seclusion, and that was why he had been captured by Ling Han. Thus, they were not too wary about Ling Han’s strength.","After all, cultivators were the weakest when they were cultivating.","Ling Han completely ignored them, and merely focused on cultivating.","Jiang Ling watched anxiously from the sidelines. ’You idiots, can’t you save me first?’","Seeing that Ling Han was only sitting in a cross-legged position and not responding, a Saint couldn’t help but take a few steps forwards to test the waters.","Ling Han still had no reaction.","He stepped forward again, again, again. However, Ling Han still didn’t respond.","The Saint became even bolder. He shot forward, and grabbed Jiang Ling. Xiu! He immediately leaped back.","\"Charge!\" The remaining seven Saints moved in unison. They drew their battle spears, and stabbed them towards Ling Han.","Jiang Ling couldn’t speak, and he naturally couldn’t stop them either. However, he still held onto a sliver of hope that Ling Han was truly immersed in cultivation. His defenses would be weak, and he couldn’t resist at all.","Though this was a little annoying, it was still acceptable to be able to personally witness Ling Han being killed.","Boom!","The seven Saints were dressed in Battle Armors, which boosted their battle prowess by around five stars, and added with the Saint Tool in their hands, the combined power was enough to kill a Pseudo-Emperor who was not resisting.","Pu, pu, pu, pu, seven spears stabbed down at the same time.","Good!","Jiang Ling wanted nothing more than to jump up and applaud. However, his cultivation level had been sealed, so not only was he unable to jump up, he couldn’t even call out ’good’.","He was dead, dead, dead!","However, what followed was a numbing shock. That was because the spears had pierced into Ling Han’s body, yet were completely unable to penetrate through his skin.","F***, what kind of skin do you have, how could you be so thick?","To say nothing of Jiang Ling, the seven Saints who had attacked him were naturally even more stunned. In fact, they even felt a powerful chill rise up in their hearts.","Was the person in front of him... really human?","Why did they feel like it was a primitive great beast? It was only napping now, but the moment it opened its eyes, it could explode with endless killing intent, causing them to die on the spot.","However, they were duty-bound, so how could they retreat now?","They raised their battle spears once more, and once again stabbed down heavily.","Once, twice, thrice. They stabbed endlessly, but the expressions on their faces became more and more fearful."]},{"number":4806,"title":"Chapter 4806: Pseudo-Emperor!","paragraphs":["F***, how could there be such a freak?","Stab, stab, stab. At this moment, the seven Saints were all mechanically stabbing the battle spears in their hands. Due to their overwhelming shock, their minds had already gone completely blank. They couldn’t think of anything else.","Weng! Right at this moment, a nine-colored divine light suddenly erupted from Ling Han’s body. It was indescribably dazzling.","Then, an exuberant vitality surged, as if all life had revived.","At this moment, everyone was rendered speechless.","What was going on?","What kind of bizarre phenomenon was this?","Right at this moment, Ling Han’s eyes suddenly snapped open. Nine-colored divine light flickered in his pupils, as if his gaze could penetrate the heaven and earth.","He had a feeling that he was severing his connection with the heaven and earth, becoming a self-contained entity.","Pseudo-Emperor!","No, there was still a slight gap. It was not complete, and he needed to further stimulate it, but at most, it would only take half a day’s time.","Peng!","A battle spear suddenly stabbed down, striking Ling Han’s body.","Ling Han turned around to look. That was a Saint, but his hands were trembling.","\"You still haven’t had your fill of stabbing?\" he asked.","The Saint’s face had already turned pale, and he said weakly, \"My hand slipped.\"","Really, he was too nervous, and accidentally stabbed out the battle spear.","This infuriated Jiang Ling to death. ’Why are you explaining to him?’","We are enemies, and since we are enemies, so what if we attack you? Do we still need to apologize or give a reason?","This was too humiliating!","Ling Han smiled, \"Do you want to continue stabbing?\"","\"No, no, no. I wouldn’t dare,\" the Saint hurriedly said with a shake of his head.","\"All right, step aside,\" Ling Han said.","The Saint gave an \"oh\", and obediently retreated.","\"What about you guys?\" Ling Han looked towards the other six Saints, his expression calm, without the slightest bit of anger.","Even so, the six Saints were still trembling with fear. They felt that Ling Han’s aura was like that of a Great Emperor, and they didn’t dare to look at him directly.","Involuntarily, they all retreated. Moreover, they didn’t dare to retreat too quickly, as if they were afraid of being disrespectful to Ling Han.","\"You guys—\" Jiang Ling forced out through gritted teeth. The moment the words left his mouth, he couldn’t help but be startled. Yi, he could speak now?","He raised his hand again. Not only did he raise his hand, but his power was also unbound.","He had recovered the cultivation level of Pseudo-Emperor.","\"Ao!\" He roared towards the sky, sending a message to Luoyu Emperor, as he looked coldly at Ling Han.","\"I have to say, you are really outrageously bold!\" he declared, \"After snatching my Celestial medicine, you still boldly refined the Celestial medicine here, and actually broke through to become a Six Star Saint!\"","\"However, the Great Emperor has already received news, and will immediately come out of seclusion to kill you.\"","\"No matter how heaven-defying you are, how can you stand against a Great Emperor while you yourself are only a Saint?\"","Just now, Ling Han’s body was glowing with nine-colored divine light, and his aura was like an ocean. It was obvious that he had broken through.","In that case, he had only been a five-star Saint previously. If he broke through now, wouldn’t he be a six-star Saint?","Even an idiot could think of this.","What!","When the others heard Jiang Ling’s words, they all paled in shock.","This freakishly powerful guy was actually only a six-star Saint?","This, this, this, who could believe this?","But would the disciple of the Great Emperor speak without thinking?","Weng, right at this moment, an indescribably powerful aura suddenly descended, causing everyone to involuntarily bow.","There were only two exceptions—Ling Han and Jiang Ling.","Jiang Ling was a Pseudo-Emperor. Since he had the word ’Emperor’, he naturally could resist Imperial Might.","A giant fish with wings appeared in the air, exuding an astonishing imperial might.","One of the 36 Divine Beasts, Luoyu Emperor.","\"You have broken through to Pseudo-Emperor!\" Luoyu Emperor spoke up, his voice booming like thunder.","What!","Everyone was once again numb with shock. This, this, this, this, why was he a Pseudo-Emperor now?","Hadn’t Jiang Ling said that this guy was a six-star Saint?","However, between Pseudo-Emperor and Great Emperor, which would they believe?","The Great Emperor was definitely to be believed.","Meanwhile, Jiang Ling was shocked, humiliated, and confused. He was 100% sure that Ling Han had been a Five-Star Saint before. Then, after breaking through once, shouldn’t he be a Six-Star Saint?","How did he become a Pseudo-Emperor?","Was there anyone that had jumped from a Five-Star Saint to become a Pseudo-Emperor in a single step?","That was impossible.","Without going through the Silent Destruction nine times, how could one possibly come back to life from the brink of death, and advance into the level of Pseudo-Emperor?","However, how could it be that the Great Emperor would speak without thinking?","Thus, Ling Han must be a Pseudo-Emperor.","However, he had just been boasting, saying that Ling Han was only a six-star Saint, and there was no way he could match the Great Emperor. But in the blink of an eye, the Great Emperor had personally proven that Ling Han was a Pseudo-Emperor.","Just how painful was this slap to his face?","However, so what if he was a Pseudo-Emperor? With the word \"Pseudo\", how could he possibly be a match for a real Great Emperor?","Ling Han smiled slightly, and shook his head, \"I am still a sliver away from the level of Pseudo-Emperor. Why don’t you go back first, and come back later? I should be a complete Pseudo-Emperor by then.\"","He had already revived a portion of his body, but it was not complete yet. Thus, his present state was very delicate, somewhere between the Saint Tier and Pseudo-Emperor Tier.","But at most, in less than half a day, he would become a real Pseudo-Emperor.","\"Do you think that I will give you such an opportunity?\" Luoyu Emperor smirked coldly.","Ling Han smiled, \"Why not? You are a Great Emperor, so what would you be afraid of?\"","\"Humph, fancy words!\" Luoyu Emperor did not waste any more words. With a flap of his wings, xiu, xiu, xiu, countless streaks of light descended towards Ling Han.","These were scales, and there were nine-star Regulations entwined around each scale. These were the supreme Regulations that could crush all life.","Ling Han let out a battle cry, and shot out a punch at the skies.","This punch was entwined with 99 flashes of Regulations, as well as an indescribable power.","Peng!","The power of the punch soared, and a jaw-dropping scene appeared. Scales shattered one after another, fluttering in the air.","Under the attack of Luoyu Emperor, all the buildings on the ground were destroyed. However, the area where Ling Han was standing was completely unaffected.","It was his punch that had dispersed the attack that this area had sustained.","Hiss!","Everyone couldn’t help but inhale sharply, revealing expressions of complete disbelief.","The Great Emperor had made his move, yet he had actually failed?","’F*ck!’","Jiang Ling directly cursed. It could be said that he had exchanged blows with Ling Han before. However, he was 100% sure that Ling Han definitely hadn’t been this strong back then.","This guy... had really directly jumped from a Five Star Saint to a become a Pseudo-Emperor.","Heavens! Heavens! Heavens!","\"Humph!\" Luoyu Emperor attacked again. Xiu, xiu, xiu! More fish scales fell from the sky, and their might was even more domineering.","This time, Luoyu Emperor was finally getting serious.","Ling Han roared loudly, and Destructive Energy and light of great dao channeled at the same time, greeting the incoming attack.","Peng, peng, peng! The attacks that filled the sky all disappeared, but Ling Han was also gritting his teeth, feeling immense pressure.","He was still no match for Luoyu Emperor.","If he had to rank his strength, then Imperial Weapon would be the weakest grade. The unawakened Lords of Death would be the second last grade, followed by the 36 Divine Beasts and the strongest would be the awakened Lords of Death.","Ling Han was presently in the weakest level, which was about the same level as the Imperial Weapon.","Was that weak?"]},{"number":4807,"title":"Chapter 4807: Battling the Great Emperor","paragraphs":["In terms of Ling Han’s expectations, this was a little weak. After all, he was still unable to truly stand against the Great Emperor.","However, from any person’s point of view, Ling Han’s strength was unreasonable.","He had just advanced into the level of Pseudo-Emperor, and could just barely match a Great Emperor already. What justice was there left in this world?","However, Ling Han wasn’t disappointed, because... his revival wasn’t over yet. His abilities could still be improved.","Furthermore, there was another more important point, and that was though Ling Han had touched the threshold of Emperor Tier, because he was in the Primitive Abyss, he was unable to cultivate the Nine Star Regulations.","How was an Emperor so powerful?","Wasn’t it because he had grasped the Nine Star Regulations? This was something that could crush everything.","The Great Emperor’s words were like the decree of heaven and earth. This was the power of the Nine Star Regulations.","Now, Ling Han was unable to come into contact with the Nine Star Regulations, so he was naturally unable to grasp it either, which led to him, a Pseudo-Emperor, being slightly weaker.","It didn’t matter. As long as he stabilized his cultivation level and grasped the Nine Star Regulations, even if it was just a little bit, his strength would still experience a leap.","At that time, he may be able to leap into the third level, and match a Lord of Death who had not awakened yet.","Furthermore, even if Ling Han had really advanced into Pseudo-Emperor Tier, that would still only be Five Stars, so there was still a lot of room for improvement.","If he could beat up a Great Emperor just by being a middle level Pseudo-Emperor, hoho, then a Great Emperor Spirit was really too cheap.","An overlord could only appear once in an era!","But even if Ling Han was no match for the Great Emperor, just the fact that he could fight back and survive was already enough to make everyone go numb with shock. They could not believe this.","Heavens, what kind of monster was this?","Luoyu Emperor unleashed a barrage of attacks, unleashing the full might of the Great Emperor. However, Ling Han’s battle prowess was extraordinary, and his physique was also powerful. He could definitely hold on for a very, very long time.","By this time, Ling Han finally possessed the strength to face the Great Emperor head-on, though he was still at a disadvantage.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","A great battle broke out between the two characters with Emperor-level battle prowess. Even with the strength of this city, it was still on the verge of collapse.","This could withstand the shockwaves of Pseudo-Emperor-level battles. In fact, under the direct bombardment, it would only be the matter of breaking one or two walls, at most. However, against genuine Emperor Tier-level battle prowess, it was completely useless.","Emperor, the strongest in the world!","The shockwave rolled over mercilessly, and one after another, buildings collapsed, destroying everything in their path.","Logically speaking, the strength of Luoyu Emperor far surpassed Ling Han. At that time, when the True Dragon Emperor moved, he practically beat up the Lord of Death. Now, Ling Han’s strength was inferior to the unawakened Lord of Death, so he was even less of a match for Luoyu Emperor.","In theory, that was indeed the case, but Ling Han had grasped the Destructive Energy and light of great dao. Even against a Great Emperor, this was still a great deterrent. Added with the fact that Luoyu Emperor also knew that Ling Han still had the Cold Water of Death in his possession, he also had to distance himself from Ling Han, and did not dare to force him too far.","This gave Ling Han enough space to move around. Furthermore, as time passed, he was getting closer and closer to becoming a real Pseudo-Emperor, and his abilities were naturally steadily improving, so his condition was also naturally steadying.","Thus, a miracle that had never happened before in history happened.","A Pseudo-Emperor could match a Great Emperor, and did not did in a head-on confrontation!","Heavens!","Everyone was watching dumbly. All of them were numb with shock, their minds blank.","Boom, boom, boom, the whole city was collapsing.","Ling Han felt extremely pleased. Now that things had come to this, he finally no longer had to fear anyone.","Even if he was still no match for his opponents in terms of battle prowess, there was already no need for him to be able to only flee in disarray when he encountered them.","However, after only two days, a powerful aura swept over.","Another Great Emperor had arrived.","The Divine Beast, Jiaodan, belonging to the third level.","Boom! The moment the new Great Emperor appeared, he immediately launched an attack at Ling Han without saying another word.","Two Great Emperors had appeared!","No matter how freakish Ling Han was, he had only just advanced into Pseudo-Emperor-level, and his cultivation level hadn’t even stabilized yet, so how could he possibly stand against two Great Emperors?","Thus, he did not hesitate any longer, and directly turned around and fled.","When he stabilized his cultivation level and cultivated the Nine Star Regulations, he would truly be able to compete with the Great Emperor.","Retreat.","The two Great Emperors set off in pursuit at the same time. However, after advancing into the position of Pseudo-Emperor, the extreme speed brought by Phoenix Wings Divine Flight also soared to another level. In fact, he was actually slightly faster than these two Great Emperors.","Thus, as soon as Ling Han broke out of the siege, though the two Great Emperors pursued him relentlessly, the distance between them and Ling Han was widening.","Unless a storm of heaven and earth appeared, it was absolutely impossible for them to catch up to Ling Han.","Unfortunately, this kind of thing did not happen.","It wasn’t long before they lost Ling Han.","Ling Han stopped, found a place, and continued his seclusion.","He needed to completely stabilize his cultivation level.","In less than half a day, a part of Ling Han’s body was completely revived.","A Five-Star Pseudo Emperor!","This breakthrough brought him directly to the level of Five Star Pseudo-Emperor. Throughout history, Ling Han should be the only one.","He did not rush to stand up, but rather continued to sit in a cross-legged position, because he had discovered a very big problem.","Er, perhaps it should not be called a problem.","When a Saint reached Pseudo-Emperor Tier, his body that had gone through Silent Destruction would awaken, and correspondingly, the holy flame would also be extinguished.","This wasn’t a regression, but rather a complete fusion of the holy flame and his body, further improving his battle prowess.","It should be known that as the Saint approached step by step, and his body went through Silent Destruction, this was actually nurturing and strengthening the holy flame. Thus, when the holy flame completely fused with his body, it would naturally increase his own strength greatly.","However, Ling Han’s holy flame was still there.","Yi?","No, it shouldn’t be said that the holy flame was still there. He was certain that he had indeed extracted the energy of the holy flame and fused it with himself. However, there was a part that could not be fused with him.","Was this because this was the Seed of the Holy Flame?","Ling Han waved his hand. Boom! The holy flame started to burn on his fist. However, this time, he didn’t feel any signs of the holy flame decreasing.","In other words, this was an endless supply, and could be channeled continuously.","Then, with the addition of Destructive Energy and light of great dao, how much might would he be able to unleash?","With a thought from Ling Han, he channelled out the Destructive Energy and the light of great dao. Now, he could cast his trump cards without any scruples. Just how terrifying could their might reach?","Ah!","When Destructive Energy was used, a strange thing happened. It actually fused with the holy flame.","In an instant, the initially green holy flame immediately turned black.","No, no, no. This was not black, but rather more like darkness itself, representing endless destruction.","Ling Han could clearly sense that the fused Destructive Energy had become even more terrifying.","It seemed to be even purer.","Ling Han pondered for a moment, and thought that the Seed of the Holy Flame and the Destructive Energy should come from the same source. Thus, they could be fused together, and after fusing, they would also be closer to the source, and only then would their might become stronger.","This kind of source was... Destruction!","Ling Han suddenly recalled that the Dao of Heaven and Earth was actually formed from four foundations—creation, destruction, life, and death.","Now, could it be that what he had grasped was the element of destruction in the foundation stones of heaven and earth?"]},{"number":4808,"title":"Chapter 4808: Arrival","paragraphs":["This kind of energy was entwined around Ling Han’s hand. He lightly touched the ground, and wherever he passed, a groove would immediately appear in the ground.","And in this process, Ling Han actually didn’t use any power himself. He simply pressed down casually.","Such terrifying corrosive power!","No, this shouldn’t be called corrosive power, because corrosion would turn an object into liquid or gas, but this was only a change in physical form.","And with the new version of Destructive Energy, it directly turned objects into nothing, as if they had disappeared into thin air.","Creation corresponded to... destruction!","What kind of power was this?","En, this had already surpassed the range of power, and had also surpassed Regulations. Instead, it was a foundation stone of heaven and earth, a key element.","Ling Han was a little excited. This should be an ability that even a Great Emperor could not grasp, and now, he could use it even before he had become a Great Emperor.","He had a feeling that this was still not the strongest power of the \"essence\" of destruction. It was like a main branch that had many forks. Only by obtaining all the forks would he be able to piece together the appearance of the main branch.","Destructive Energy Energy and Seed of the Holy Flame were both two of these branches.","Ling Han couldn’t help but think. The Stone of Life and Destructive Energy should have been created by the Great Emperor Wu Ya and the others, while the Seed of Holy Flame had been obtained from Empress Qing Zhu. The similarity between these different elements were that they all originated from the Primitive Abyss, and were all meant to resolve the great crisis of this era.","In other words, ordinary Great Emperors would no longer be able to suppress the darkness. They would have to become even stronger!","Ling Han nodded. Though he had never thought of himself as a hero, at this kind of moment, he had to step out bravely, and shoulder his responsibilities.","\"Now... let’s continue forward!\"","He stood up, and gazed into the distance.","He wanted to pass through these levels and enter into the core area of the Primitive Abyss. He wanted to find the Great Emperor Wu Ya and the others.","He wanted to know who the enemy of the Great Emperor Wu Ya and the others was.","Moreover, there were no Regulations of heaven and earth here, so Ling Han wanted to obtain some Genesis Substance as well. He wanted to comprehend the Nine Star Regulations and elevate his battle prowess to another level.","Even if he couldn’t comprehend the Nine Star Regulations, allowing him to awaken a portion of his body, reaching Six Star or Seven Star Pseudo-Emperor would still be good.","Ling Han believed that if he became a nine-star Pseudo-Emperor, he wouldn’t be inferior to the Divine Beast Emperors, at least. His battle prowess would be enough to soar into the second level.","This time, he did not circle around. Even if he encountered the Great Emperors again, he would still be able to confront it head-on, and retreat calmly.","Since he was at the level of Emperor, wouldn’t it be easy for him to leave?","However, in the Primitive Abyss, the Great Emperor was definitely not the greatest threat.","It was the storm of heaven and earth.","In just a few days, a storm fell without any prior warning. Even if Ling Han already had battle prowess on par with a Great Emperor, he could only defend with all his might in the face of such a natural storm, and search for a place of protection.","This was too terrifying. Every drop of rainwater was extraordinarily heavy, causing Ling Han to cry out in pain.","He could only summon the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, to protect himself within.","For the moment, he was still unable to compete with the Origin Gold in physique.","While dodging the wind and rain, Ling Han continued to temper the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower.","He already possessed the cultivation level of a Great Emperor, so could he upgrade the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower to become a genuine Imperial Weapon?","However, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower was not versed in Destructive Energy, nor could it grasp the light of great dao. Without these two factors, even if the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower barely possessed Emperor-level battle prowess, it still belonged to the bottom tier of Imperial Weapons.","\"Even if I have grasped a sliver of the Nine Star Regulations, because there is only a sliver, I am still unable to fully unleash the might of the Origin Gold. Its might is still limited.\"","\"This is enough to suppress Pseudo-Emperors, but it is still a bit lacking against Great Emperors.\"","It should be known that the Imperial Weapon was only ranked fourth in terms of Emperor-level battle prowess, and the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower’s might was the weakest among the Imperial Weapons, so it was definitely even weaker.","\"Unless there is enough Metal of Creation, and when I become a Great Emperor, I can upgrade the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower to become a Transcendent Weapon. Then, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower will complement me, and can be considered the best partner.\"","This kind of fateful opportunity could only be obtained from the core of the Primitive Abyss.","After dodging the storm of heaven and earth, Ling Han continued to advance. Just how fast was his current speed?","Using Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, he was at least ten times faster than before.","Merely three days later, a majestic great city was already in sight.","However, looking at the city’s exterior, Ling Han was unable to distinguish which Great Emperor was overseeing this place, because there were many Divine Beasts with four legs, horns, and spikes on their backs, and in the case of a city, after all, it was impossible for it to be built too similarly.","This was the Primitive Abyss, so where did so many architects come from?","Ling Han clasped his hands behind his back and strolled forward.","Undoubtedly, this was the time for him to show off.","Unfortunately, the big doggy and the others were not here.","Sigh, he felt a little regret at having to travel at night in embroidered clothes, with no one to admire his brilliance.","In just a few steps, Ling Han arrived at the city gates.","\"Who are you?\" someone immediately chided. This was a Saint-level guard.","Ling Han cracked a smile, \"I’m here to crash the party.\"","W-what?","The guard faltered, completely stupefied.","This was a place where the Great Emperor was keeping watch, and you have come to crash the party?","’I really don’t know whether you’re brave or stupid.’","\"Who exactly are you!\" the guard reiterated loudly.","Ling Han pointed at himself and said, \"Logically speaking, I should be very famous by now. Why do I still need to introduce myself?\"","\"Disciple of a Great Emperor?\" The guard followed Ling Han’s words. After all, Ling Han wasn’t wearing any armor, yet he could still come from outside the city. It was clear that his cultivation level was Pseudo-Emperor-level.","Ling Han shook his head, \"Wrong.\"","He couldn’t be bothered to waste his breath. With a tap of his finger, peng, the entire city gate was instantly sent flying.","Boom! Terrifying explosions rang out repeatedly, and the city walls also collapsed one after another, fully displaying the might of Emperor Tier.","\"How, how dare you!\" That guard called out loudly, but his voice was trembling.","Heavens, what kind of terrifying power was this?","Xiu, xiu, xiu. Multiple figures flew out of the city, landing at the city gates.","Yi, there was no Great Emperor?","Ling Han found this strange. It seemed like every time something happened, the Great Emperor would be the last to arrive.","Of course, this was unless he used his divine sense to alert the Great Emperor.","What did the Divine Beast Emperors usually do? Sleeping?","\"Who are you?\" A young man walked out. His aura was clearly not obvious, but he had an indescribable domineering aura, that others would revere.","Pseudo-Emperor!","He was the disciple of the Great Emperor of this place, Zhuang Xueshi.","\"Me?\" Ling Han smiled faintly, \"Ling Han.\"","\"You are Ling Han!\" Zhuang Xueshi was first stunned, then looked pleasantly surprised, \"Hahaha, all the Great Emperors have searched everywhere for you. I never thought that you would actually walk right into a trap.\"","\"Er, isn’t your news a bit behind schedule?\" Ling Han was a little depressed. He clearly had Emperor Tier battle prowess, so why was he still looked down on by others?","These Divine Beast Emperors were really too much. They did not even help him spread out the information. Wasn’t that deliberately asking him to show off?","But it was also very boring to keep showing off.","In this instant, Ling Han’s mind was very active."]},{"number":4809,"title":"Chapter 4809: True Phoenix City","paragraphs":["\"Since you’re already here, there’s no need for you to leave,\" Zhuang Xueshi said calmly.","He was not just saying this. He stretched out a hand, and grabbed out at Ling Han.","Ling Han smiled faintly and said, \"Do you know the consequences of disrespecting an Emperor?\"","\"Humph, we’re both Pseudo-Emperors, so what do I have to fear?\" Zhuang Xueshi said disdainfully.","According to the information he knew, Ling Han had Pseudo-Emperor-level battle prowess, and to him, didn’t Pseudo-Emperor-level battle prowess mean that he was a Pseudo-Emperor?","Could it be that a Saint could also possess Pseudo-Emperor-level battle prowess?","Hehe, what a joke.","Boom, the large hand formed by Regulations had already grabbed onto Ling Han. All five fingers were made up of eight-star Regulations, but there was also a thin line of nine-star Regulations.","Don’t underestimate this nine-star Regulations that was as thin as a hair. It was precisely because of its existence that a Pseudo-Emperor had surpassed the Saint Tier, and could claim the title of \"Emperor\".","\"Haha, nothing more than this!\" Zhuang Xueshi had already grabbed hold of Ling Han, and couldn’t help but laugh loudly. This kind of idiot actually caused the Great Emperors to fail to catch him time and time again?","Er, he really did not know what was going on with those Great Emperors.","\"As expected of Lord Zhuang!\"","\"Lord Zhuang is mighty!\"","\"Haha, in front of our Lord Zhuang, even those heaven-defying freaks have to bow down.\"","The people in the area were all sucking up to him. However, this was a Pseudo-Emperor with overwhelming battle prowess.Their praise was no exaggeration.","Ling Han also waved his hands and began clapping. Pa, pa, pa! The sound was crisp and clear.","This!","Everyone thought that this person was a little crazy. You are a prisoner, so why are you joining in on the excitement?","\"Yi, did I cause the silence?\" Ling Han asked with a smile.","\"Humph, you still dare to speak cheekily?\" Zhuang Xueshi smirked coldly. His fingers tightened, wanting to give Ling Han a little suffering.","Peng! However, as he clenched his hand, cold sweat immediately appeared on his forehead.","That was because the five fingers that he had manifested had all shattered!","What!","This scene was naturally seen by the others as well. All of them looked stunned, completely unable to believe their eyes.","How was this possible?","Hadn’t Ling Han already been restrained?","But why had Zhuang Xueshi’s fingers been broken?","Though they was only manifested from Regulations.","Ling Han smiled faintly, \"Are you very surprised?\"","\"You—\" Zhuang Xueshi frowned. This was something that he could not imagine. How could a Pseudo-Emperor Pthat was the same as him be so strong?","\"Sigh!\" Ling Han sighed. He summoned the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower and casually smashed it onto Zhuang Xueshi’s body.","\"Ah!\" Zhuang Xueshi released a terrible scream, and instantly sprawled out on the ground. He wanted to get up, but the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower was extraordinarily heavy, and he couldn’t turn over at all.","It should be known that the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower was already an Imperial Weapon, and with the Imperial Weapon closing in on him from such a close distance, would a Pseudo-Emperor be able to make a comeback?","What a joke.","This!","Everyone’s scalps went numb, and they were extremely confused.","There was only a tower pressing down on Zhuang Xueshi’s back, so why couldn’t he turn the tables?","Hiss, who exactly was this guy?","Zhuang Xueshi was both furious and shocked, but more than that, he was terrified.","This opponent was simply unbelievably strong!","He had no choice but to send out a wave of divine sense to ask for help from the Great Emperor.","Weng, suddenly, a frightening aura swept over, causing reverence to rise up from deep within one’s bones.","The Divine Beast Emperor finally appeared.","Ling Han glanced over, and only then did he know which Divine Beast was standing guard here.","Heaven Breaker.","\"I never thought that you would still dare to run here!\" the Heaven Breaker Emperor said calmly. With a flap of his wings, he lashed out at Ling Han. The Nine Star Regulations entwined around him, and this attack was indescribably terrifying.","After all, this was the second level.","Ling Han raised his fist to parry. He wanted to test out the might of the new version of Destructive Energy.","Peng!","The two parties with Emperor Tier battle prowess clashed, and Ling Han was instantly sent flying. However, the tail of the Heaven Breaker Emperor was also missing!","This... everyone’s heads were about to explode from watching.","That was a Great Emperor, and he had actually been wounded!","Though his injuries weren’t severe, and couldn’t even be considered serious, it was still shocking.","Who had ever seen a Great Emperor wounded before?","Moreover, the one who had wounded the Great Emperor... was actually a Pseudo-Emperor.","Since when did a Pseudo-Emperor become a match for a Great Emperor?","Meanwhile, Zhuang Xueshi was directly stunned. Only now did he know why he couldn’t even block a single move from Ling Han.","—It would be strange if he could block a single move from Ling Han, whose battle prowess was Emperor Tier-level.","The Heaven Breaker Emperor frowned, and said, \"Damn it! You’ve actually mastered a portion of the element of destruction!\"","\"These damn old guys, always causing trouble!\"","He roared loudly, and continued to attack Ling Han. However, this time, he deliberately increased the distance between them, and no longer engaged in close-quarter combat with Ling Han.","It was fine. With how strong the Great Emperor was, even if there was some distance between them, its might was still overwhelming. It could easily suppress a Pseudo-Emperor.","Unfortunately, though Ling Han’s cultivation level was Pseudo-Emperor-level, Ling Han’s battle prowess was Great Emperor-level.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","Ling Han continued to block the chaotic attacks of the Heaven Breaker Emperor. Although he was at a disadvantage, the situation wasn’t too dire.","After all, even the Heaven Breaker Emperor was wary of his power of destruction. In fact, there was still the Cold Water of Death.","Ling Han frowned, and beckoned with his hand, \"Come!\"","Weng, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower instantly flew into the air, unleashing blazing white lightning at Heaven Breaker Emperor.","Now, it was equivalent to the combined attack of two Great Emperors.","However, the strength of these two Great Emperors was too weak. They both had battle prowess at the fourth and third levels. Even if the two of them worked together, they were still no match for the Heaven Breaker Emperor. They only managed to turn the tables slightly.","Ling Han shook his head. He couldn’t do this, as his abilities hadn’t been greatly boosted. He was still unable to fully oppose the Divine Beast Emperor.","It was the second level, after all.","Ling Han let out a battle cry, and began to break out of the siege.","\"You can’t escape!\" Heaven Breaker Emperor said in a baleful voice as he set off in pursuit.","\"Haha, if you’re dissatisfied, just come and chase me,\" Ling Han said with a smile. Phoenix Wings Divine Flight was used, and his speed was astonishingly fast.","Though the Heaven Breaker Emperor was in pursuit, the distance between him and Ling Han was getting larger and larger.","In the end, he could only stop reluctantly.","He stood still and motionless, but his eyelids were trembling slightly, exuding an unknown fluctuation, capable of communicating with an endless distance.","...","Ling Han walked forwards, looking everywhere for Genesis Substance.","As long as he obtained some more Genesis Substance and the great dao reappeared, he would be able to extract the Nine Star Regulations from within. Then, his battle prowess would soar, and he may even be able to advance into the level of Six Star Pseudo-Emperor.","Unfortunately, Genesis Substance was pitifully rare, and he was fully focused on charging forward, so how could he possibly find it?","After passing through one area after another, experiencing all kinds of storms of heaven and earth, Ling Han broke through the third level and arrived in front of the first city of the fourth level.","\"True Phoenix!\" Ling Han looked ahead in surprise. A city that looked like a phoenix that was spreading its wings and soaring high was presently standing tall.","Er, would he encounter the True Phoenix here?","He couldn’t help but think that if he encountered the True Phoenix Emperor, he would be no match for the True Phoenix in terms of mastery of Phoenix Wings Divine Flight.","After all, it was the True Phoenix that had created the Phoenix Wings Divine Flight.","If he was detained by the True Phoenix Emperor, and then sandwiched by the other Divine Beast Emperors, that would not be a good thing."]},{"number":4810,"title":"Chapter 4810: Encountering Emperor’s corpse again","paragraphs":["Yi?","Just as Ling Han was considering how he should pass through this True Phoenix City, he saw two people dressed in Bronze Battle Armor walk out of the city.","After a while, these two people had already arrived near him.","Ling Han coughed, and jumped down from a large rock.","\"You—\" The two of them got a scare, then immediately became respectful, and clasped their hands together, \"Greetings, Lord!\"","To be able to travel in the wild without wearing a Battle Armor, this must be a Pseudo-Emperor.","Disciple of a Great Emperor?","Ling Han smiled and said, \"Take off your Battle Armor.\"","Ah!","The two of them were very confused. What was going on?","’You’re the disciple of a Great Emperor, so what do you need Battle Armor for?’","Thankfully, neither of them thought that Ling Han was a pervert.","\"Lord, without the Battle Armor, we won’t be able to withstand the extreme weight of this place at all. We’ll die,\" a Saint said weakly.","Ling Han smiled faintly, \"My name is Ling Han, an outsider. I need your Battle Armor to sneak into the city.\"","The two Saints looked at each other, shock on their faces.","Recently, this name called \"Ling Han\" could be said to have been bombarding their ears. This was a person that the Great Emperors wanted to kill at all costs, which showed how terrifying he was.","And now, this person had actually appeared in front of them, alive and well. How could they not be shocked?","\"Run!\"","The two of them hurriedly ran in the direction of the True Phoenix City. Even the Great Emperors could not kill this kind of existence, so they naturally were even less qualified to resist. They could only run.","With a single thought from Ling Han, peng, peng! The two Saints collapsed to the ground, dead.","After becoming a Pseudo-Emperor, the barrage of murderous aura became even more terrifying. To say nothing of Saints, even a Pseudo-Emperor could be killed with a single thought — as long as he was not too far away.","Ling Han walked over and removed their Battle Armors. He then wore one of them.","After becoming a Pseudo-Emperor, this Battle Armor couldn’t increase his battle prowess in the slightest.","It was fine. This was only used to conceal his identity.","As he walked, Ling Han’s appearance also changed, becoming the same as one of the two people just now.","\"Yi, Zhao Dong, why have you returned?\" At the city gates, someone immediately asked.","Ling Han smiled and said, \"I left something behind. I need to go back and retrieve it.\"","\"All right, all right, all right.\" The guard nodded, without the slightest doubt.","Ling Han entered the city, and naturally came directly to the other side of the city. He found a random excuse, and left the city.","It could be said that among the 36 Divine Beasts, the only one that could pose a threat to him was the True Phoenix Emperor.","After all, if he was facing other Great Emperors, he could still flee if he was no match for them. However, if he was facing the True Phoenix Emperor, the outcome would be in doubt.","Even if there were problems with the Great Emperors here, they all had their own unique traits. Perhaps the True Phoenix still retained his extreme speed.","After leaving the city, Ling Han was no longer concerned. He used Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, and his speed was astonishingly fast.","He was filled with anticipation. He had already broken through the blockade of the fourth level. Then, what lay ahead of him should be the core area of the Primitive Abyss. Soon, he would be able to see the Great Emperor Wu Ya, the Battle Saint Emperor, the Canopy Demon Emperor, and so on.","All the questions could now be answered.","However, after Ling Han walked for five days, he discovered that even if he had already passed through the fourth level of the blockade, the Primitive Abyss was still overwhelmingly large.","At least, in these five days, he was still walking on a desolate plain.","Just how fast was the speed of a Great Emperor? And Ling Han’s speed was also second to none among Great Emperors.","The desolate plain was filled with an air of death. To say nothing of life, not even a single rock could be seen.","After spending two months, Ling Han finally passed through this area. Then, a desert appeared ahead of him again.","He advanced without hesitation. He possessed the battle prowess of a Great Emperor, so there was naturally nothing for him to be afraid of.","This trip took another month or so.","’Hmm?’","Ling Han suddenly saw a massive object lying in front of him. After walking for a while, he shockingly discovered that this was actually a human body lying on the ground.","It was too big. Even if it was lying on the ground, its height still exceeded three hundred thousand meters, and its width was even more terrifying.","The aura of a Great Emperor!","Ling Han immediately sensed that this corpse was exuding a weak Emperor Tier aura.","It was not a Pseudo-Emperor, but a real Great Emperor.","He sped up, and arrived in front of the head of this corpse.","This was a man. His corpse had not rotted, and still maintained the state he had been in when he was alive. It could be seen that this man was already very old. His brows and beard were white, and he was even covered with age spots. He did not have the slightest bit of the sage-like air of a Great Emperor.","Ling Han finally understood. This should be a Great Emperor in his twilight years who had come to the Primitive Abyss to search for a way to achieve immortality. In the end, he had not yet gained anything, but his lifespan had already dried up, and he had died here.","He couldn’t help but feel rueful. So what if he had once been an invincible Great Emperor? Faced with the end of their lifespan, they were all equals.","Yi?","Ling Han discovered that there was actually a sliver of remnant soul inside the body of this Great Emperor.","It should be known that once the Great Emperor died, his soul would directly fuse with the heaven and earth, and could not possibly enter into the Netherworld, and if he wanted to leave behind a sliver of his soul, he would have to pay an extremely great price.","Logically speaking, this Great Emperor had clearly died when his lifespan had dried up. Then, at the end of his lifespan, he actually still had the ability to leave behind a remnant soul?","That’s not right.","Ling Han discovered that this remnant soul wasn’t something that the Great Emperor wanted to leave behind for future generations. Instead, it was a true remnant soul that was exuding an aura of chaos.","But right at this moment, this Great Emperor actually moved.","F***, he had come back to life!","Ling Han knew that this was because that remnant soul had sensed his existence, and aroused the instincts of this Great Emperor.","Boom, a large hand immediately swatted over, really covering the skies and covering the earth.","Ling Han threw a punch, and they exchanged a blow.","Peng! The hand of the Great Emperor was immediately sent flying. Meanwhile, Ling Han remained unmoving.","This was only the corpse of a Great Emperor, after all. There was a remnant soul inside, but there was pitifully little of it. How much of the past strength of the Great Emperor could it unleash?","One thousandth? Ten thousandth?","It was more than enough to suppress a Pseudo Emperor, but against Ling Han, hoho.","However, this Great Emperor’s corpse was only left with its battle instincts. Even if it lost, it would not shrink back. Instead, it began to attack madly again.","If Ling Han attacked with his full strength, with the standard of the Great Emperor’s corpse that was only left with its instincts, he could completely use Destructive Energy to eliminate it completely.","However, it was too difficult to become a Great Emperor. That was an overlord of an era, and Ling Han did not want to desecrate the corpse of such an existence either.","Thus, he merely parried, and did not counterattack.","However, there were only wisps of remnant soul inside the Great Emperor’s corpse in the first place, so how could it withstand such a high-intensity resistance?","Merely half a day later, this remnant soul had exhausted all its Spiritual Power, and returned to the heaven and earth.","Boom! The colossal Emperor’s corpse collapsed to the ground.","Ling Han sighed, and stretched out a hand in a grab. A large amount of yellow sand swept over from either side, covering this Great Emperor.","The Great Emperor had been invincible all his life, and he couldn’t die in such a miserable manner, with his corpse left out in the wilderness like this.","Unfortunately, when this Great Emperor died, he was already indescribably old. Furthermore, he did not bring the Imperial Weapon with him. Thus, Ling Han was unable to match him with any Great Emperor in history.","\"Rest in peace.\" Ling Han buried this Great Emperor, offered condolences for a while, then continued on his way.","He felt rueful. The Great Emperor, who had once been invincible in the world, had been buried here all alone. When he died, there was no one by his side to send him off."]},{"number":4811,"title":"Chapter 4811: Element Developing","paragraphs":["After walking for a short while, a black sandstorm suddenly appeared ahead of him.","’Holy f*ck!’","Ling Han couldn’t help as his expression darkened, because every grain of sand in this sandstorm contained Destructive Energy.","This was too terrifying.","It should be known that the grains of sand here were comparable to stars. Merely an ordinary sandstorm was already terrifying enough, and now added with Destructive Energy?","Who could block it?","Even a Great Emperor would be in trouble, all right?","Retreat, retreat, retreat. Ling Han hurriedly retreated. Even if he too had grasped Destructive Energy, he did not dare to take it head-on at this time.","Thankfully, his speed was fast enough. His figure retreated rapidly, faster than the corrosive speed of the sandstorm.","He retreated all the way until a limit was reached, and the sandstorm finally stopped advancing, and merely wreaked havoc on the spot. Then, its might slowly subsided, and finally ended completely.","Ling Han continued to advance, his heart filled with surprise.","Destructive Energy, no, the element of Destruction!","Was this approaching the core of heaven and earth? Thus, the basic elements that formed the core of heaven and earth had appeared.","He walked out of this area, and a plain appeared ahead of him, filled with exuberant vitality. In this place, there were all kinds of animals and plants, and Ling Han was only looking from afar, and shockingly discovered that these animals were actually Pseudo-Emperor-level.","Then, when he got closer, he saw that all these animals had instantly fallen to the ground, and the plants had also completely dried and wilted.","All of them had died.","With a single thought, heaven and hell, life and death.","Ling Han did not dare to rashly walk into that area. Though his cultivation level was Emperor-level, even Pseudo-Emperors had died in such a strange manner. He had no wish to take such a risk.","However, it was only an instant again. Those animals that had fallen to the ground previously all got back to their feet, once again glowing with vitality, and the plants were the same. They were all colourful, and had boundless vitality.","This... Ling Han was truly stunned.","This was not the evolution of time that was occurring too quickly, but rather the evolution of the two extremes of life and death.","Life and death, the two fundamental elements of heaven and earth, converged here. At times, endless vitality would be brought, and at other times, it would be withering and death.","Ling Han couldn’t help but think, ’What if I walk in on my own?’","In an instant, he would colapse, but in the next instant, he would get back up, and the cycle repeats?","However, hopping between life and death, would he still be able to retain his original memories?","Was he going to become a walking corpse, forever trapped in that place?","Imprisoning a Great Emperor?","This sounded ridiculous, but this was the Primitive Abyss, so it was completely possible that something like this would happen.","Ling Han circled around. He felt that unless he could completely grasp the element of Destruction, he should not be able to resist this kind of life and death.","He circled around and continued to advance.","He had only taken a few steps, when he suddenly felt a strong sense of danger. He suddenly retreated rapidly, pushing his speed to the extreme.","Even if he was a Pseudo-Emperor, he still felt like his body was about to fall apart. It was clear just how terrifyingly fast his retreat had been. It had also placed a huge burden on his body.","Ahead of him, there was shockingly a mountain, whose height was unknown.","It had suddenly appeared just like that, without the slightest sign.","If Ling Han hadn’t retreated in time, he would definitely be inside the mountain by now.","With the sturdiness of the heaven and earth here, how terrifying would the pressure be if he was sandwiched in the mountain?","It should be known that an ordinary sandstorm would need a Pseudo-Emperor to summon an Imperial Weapon to stand against it. Then, what kind of concept was a mountain pressing down on them?","A Pseudo-Emperor would definitely die on the spot, and even a Great Emperor could possibly be severely wounded as well.","The Primitive Abyss was extremely terrifying.","But why would such a colossal mountain appear so abruptly?","Even someone as powerful as Ling Han actually only became alert at the last instant?","Ling Han looked at the great mountain ahead of him. This was definitely not an illusion, but rather a real existence, extraordinarily tall and steep.","This was even stranger.","Ling Han sat down in a cross-legged position, calmly observing.","Three days later, without any prior warning, this mountain had completely disappeared. Not only that, even the original plain had disappeared, turning into a massive sinkhole.","This!","Ling Han gritted his teeth. It had disappeared.","It had come so suddenly, and disappeared just as suddenly.","A thought flashed in his mind. Was this the essence of Creation and Destruction?","By the looks of it, he was really close to the core of the universe. Otherwise, the four elements could not possibly evolve so frequently in front of him.","He waited for a few more days, and saw that this sinkhole had suddenly disappeared, and what lay before him was a plain.","Looks like the next step would be to have the tall mountain appear, and this process would be repeated endlessly.","As expected, four days later, the great mountain appeared once more.","Ling Han climbed the mountain. Though the gravity field on the mountain was extraordinarily strong, and the mountain rocks were incredibly sharp, as if it was laden with weapons, for the present Ling Han, this was no big deal.","He threw a punch, and Destructive Energy swept over. Any mountain rock would be shattered, so how could it cause any damage to him?","This mountain was too big. With Ling Han’s speed, he actually didn’t make it to the top in three days. Then, this mountain suddenly disappeared. Ling Han missed a step, and instantly fell from the sky.","However, with a thought, he was already standing in midair.","This was only expending some power.","Ling Han took a few steps, and landed on the ground. Then, he continued onwards.","He didn’t run in the pit. Obviously, this place would become a plain in a few days, so it was best not to take risks.","As expected, five days later, the plain appeared once more.","This was irregular, Ling Han thought.","Sometimes, it would take three days to change. Sometimes, it would take four days to change. Sometimes, it would take five days. There was no fixed pattern.","Thankfully, he had also finally walked out of this area.","Ahead of him, there was a pillar of light that pierced through the heavens and earth, exuding a fluctuation that would cause one’s heart to palpitate. It was extremely powerful.","However, there was still a vast ocean separating Ling Han and this pillar of light.","He didn’t rashly cross the sea. Instead, he wanted to see if the seawater had any destructive power.","He walked to the coast, wanting to grab some seawater for observation, but when he saw his own reflection, he was suddenly shocked.","It wasn’t him, but a skeletal figure.","Could it be that there was something at the bottom of the sea?","Ling Han looked again, and saw that this skeleton was also staring at him.","He waved his hand, and the skeletal figure also waved back at him. It was exactly the same.","What the hell was this?","The skeletal person was his future?","Ling Han didn’t believe it. He sifted through the distracting thoughts and used the Regulations as his palm. He wanted to scoop up some seawater, but when this hand touched the seawater, it immediately \"died\".","In fact, an indescribable power was transmitted through a sliver of his divine sense, wanting to enter his body.","Ling Han hurriedly took a step back, then severed this sliver of divine sense from himself.","At this time, that power immediately lost its direction. Boom, it retreated back into the great ocean.","Ling Han couldn’t help but inhale sharply. If that power entered his body, his body would instantly become dead, and he would become a corpse.","Even if he had the cultivation level of a Great Emperor!","This was a sea of death? Was this all Cold Water of Death?","That’s not right.","The two were indeed very similar. They both destroyed vitality, but there was a very great difference.","However, Ling Han couldn’t explain clearly how the two were different."]},{"number":4812,"title":"Chapter 4812: Battle Saint Emperor","paragraphs":["After Ling Han tried a few more times, he could confirm that there was some kind of power hidden under this great ocean, causing these waters to also possess the power of death.","That was because after he had filled his vessel with some seawater, he discovered that the seawater was actually normal, and did not pose much danger.","Thus, that boundless power of death originated from beneath the ocean waters.","Ling Han didn’t want to figure it out, because with his current strength, he was still not qualified.","He had to cross first.","Ling Han leaped up, and walked through the air.","Though the gravity fields were powerful, the restrictions on him were already very weak.","He was Emperor-level, after all!","Boom!","In the distance, a pillar of water suddenly shot into the sky at an extraordinarily fast speed, like a fountain.","Ling Han felt a chill in his heart. If he was hit by the pillar of water, he would suddenly lose a large amount of vitality, and even he could possibly fall into the sea.","And once he fell into the ocean waters... he would definitely be done for.","He raised his alertness, and was extremely cautious.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","The deeper he went into the sea, the more frequent the water pillars shooting out would be.","Ling Han tried to fly higher into the sky, but he immediately discovered that the sky seemed to bear the weight of the entire universe. It was so heavy that even he couldn’t resist it. He couldn’t fly high at all.","Thus, he could only be extremely careful, guarding against those pillars of water that were soaring into the sky.","Just how fast was the speed of a Great Emperor?","However, the pillar of light in the distance didn’t seem far, but it was actually extremely far. Ling Han flew for half a month, yet he felt that he hadn’t closed the distance between himself and this pillar of light at all.","He naturally wouldn’t give up. Instead, he continued to charge forward with all his might.","One month, two months... Time passed, and Ling Han finally discovered that the pillar of light was getting closer.","Heavens, just how far away was this?","At this moment, Ling Han was already spiritually and mentally exhausted. At every moment, he had to guard against the water pillars that surged up from below. If this lasted too long, even a Great Emperor would feel tired.","It should be known that when these pillars of water shot out, it was equivalent to the attack of a Great Emperor. Furthermore, it would only be \"him\" attacking, while he himself could only defend passively. The moment he was hit, he would die immediately.","How could such pressure not be heavy?","Thankfully, Ling Han’s spirit had long since been tempered to become incredibly tough. Though it was tiring, he was completely capable of holding on.","One year, two years, three years, time flew by. Ling Han also flew above this sea for a whole nine years.","He was really tired.","However, that pillar of light was also really getting closer.","He saw that a massive island had appeared ahead of him. That pillar of light originated from the centre of the island.","Xiu, Ling Han’s figure landed on the ground. After landing on the ground, he hurriedly began to recuperate.","It was too tiring. It was as if he had never been so tired in his entire life. Even Ling Han only wanted to collapse and sleep now.","Half a day later, Ling Han suddenly woke up from his rest.","He could sense an extremely powerful aura assaulting him.","Too strong, so strong that his whole body bristled.","He immediately bounced up, turned his head to look to his left, and saw a figure appear.","This was a... monkey?","Its height was comparable to an ordinary person, and it was dressed in golden plated armor, but it was already tattered. Upon a closer look, it should have been damaged.","This monkey was standing on its hind legs like a human, and there was a purple-gold staff slung over its shoulder. It was currently casting a sideways glance at Ling Han, exuding a powerful killing intent and viciousness.","Boom!","The monkey moved, and struck out with his staff.","’Holy f*ck!’","The Battle Saint Emperor!","Ling Han immediately thought to himself. He would never have imagined that he would encounter the Battle Saint Emperor when he had just arrived at the core area of the Primitive Abyss. Moreover, he had been thrashed for no reason at all.","Boom! The staff swept over, indescribably terrifying.","Even though Ling Han already possessed Emperor-level battle prowess, he still didn’t dare to face this attack head-on. He hurriedly retreated.","\"Senior Battle Saint!\" he called out, wanting to clarify things.","\"You want to trick your Grandpa Monkey?\" the Battle Saint Emperor roared. He swung his golden-purple staff again.","Hong long long, the heaven and earth changed, and the winds and clouds paled.","This was a true Great Emperor, unlike the Divine Beast Emperors, who had all kinds of problems, and the Lords of Death, who could only be helpless. He could completely unleash his Imperial Might, which was incredibly terrifying.","The highest tier of power, a complete Great Emperor!","Ling Han’s current strength was only in the fourth tier. Even if he used the Destructive Energy and the light of great dao, it would only allow him to reach the peak stage of the fourth tier of battle prowess, at most. It would only pose a threat to any Great Emperor in the first tier.","A Great Emperor of the first tier unleashed his might, and he also had the Imperial Weapon in hand. How could he block this attack?","He hurriedly summoned the Clear Bamboo Sword and the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower. The two Imperial Weapons channelled at the same time, clashing head-on with the purple-gold staff.","However, it was not like the more Imperial Weapons he had, the better it would be. He controlled two Imperial Weapons at the same time, and immediately felt strained. He could only activate the might of one to the fullest.","Boom!","The three Imperial Weapons exchanged a blow, and Ling Han and the two Imperial Weapons were both sent flying. The difference in strength could not be more obvious.","However, Ling Han discovered that the purple-gold staff was actually showing signs of cracking.","Yi?","Shouldn’t the Imperial Weapon be the sturdiest existence in the world?","He had not even finished the thought, when the Battle Saint Emperor had already charged over again, brandishing his golden-purple staff. His fighting spirit soared sky-high, and it was as if he had an addiction to fighting.","Ling Han was rendered speechless. This was indeed Brother Monkey’s family.","The line of the Battle Saint could only have one word when encountering an enemy: fight!","Who cares if they can win or not? Just fight first, and we’ll see.","He didn’t face it head-on anymore. Instead, he used Phoenix Wings Divine Flight to continuously dodge.","\"Senior, my name is Ling Han. I have received a message from Senior Wu Ya, and have deliberately come.\" As he dodged, he continued to explain.","He could just barely exchange blows with the Divine Beast Emperors, but the fact that he could face them head-on was because the Divine Beast Emperors had to be wary of his Destructive Energy and light of great dao, but the problem now was, could he use the Destructive Energy or light of great dao on the Battle Saint Emperor?","In the first place, his battle prowess was already at the fourth tier, and now that he had restrained himself, how could he possibly be a match for a first tier Great Emperor?","Boom!","The Battle Saint Emperor attacked aggressively, and the heaven and earth resonated with each other. Even if the heaven and earth here was extremely sturdy, so what? With a sweep of the staff, he still sent large rocks flying, and then they were shattered.","’So powerful!’","Ling Han thought to himself. If it was not for the fact that Phoenix Wings Divine Flight was the fastest movement technique in the world, he would probably be blasted into smithereens by the Battle Saint Emperorwithin ten moves.","However, it was not a good idea to keep dodging like this.","Ling Han gritted his teeth. Why was the first Great Emperor he encountered the Battle Saint Emperor?","Why was it this person who had the most explosive temper and loved to fight?","Couldn’t it be Great Emperor Wu Ya?","The Ancestral King Lingtian would do as well.","\"Senior, forgive this junior for being rude!\" Ling Han shouted loudly. Boom, he finally used Destructive Energy and light of great dao.","The present Destructive Energy was a strengthened version, and the feeling of danger of turning everything into nothing was even stronger.","However, the Battle Saint Emperor ignored this completely, brandishing his staff and attacking directly.","Er, it was indeed the same bloodline as Brother Monkey.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","The metal rod struck directly, but as long as it was swept by the Destructive Energy, even the metal rod would be slightly damaged."]},{"number":4813,"title":"Chapter 4813: Fate arises","paragraphs":["Pu!","Pu!","Pu!","Ling Han vomited blood continuously. The attacks of the Battle Saint Emperor were too terrifying. This was a first tier Great Emperor, the true strongest in the world, a supreme overlord that could only appear once in an era.","F***, I have come to save the world, not to be beaten up.","Ling Han decided to retreat first. The Battle Saint Emperor was a boorish character, and couldn’t be reasoned with at all.","However, before he could flee, he felt another supremely domineering aura appear. Then, he was shocked to see that another Battle Saint Emperor had appeared.","His face was also filled with violence, and he also had a metal rod in hand.","This!","\"Gagaga.\" The two Battle Saint Emperors laughed loudly at the same time, yet stopped their attacks.","What was going on?","Ling Han’s expression darkened. It was as if... he had been played with!","\"Brat, come with me,\" a Battle Saint Emperor said.","He turned around and left. The other Battle Saint Emperor also turned around. It was as if he didn’t care whether Ling Han followed him or not.","Er, let’s go.","Ling Han really could not contain his own curiosity. Furthermore, upon further thought, though every move of the Battle Saint Emperor was overbearing, the Battle Saint Emperor had held back, and would definitely not take his life.","Otherwise, he would not have been able to last so many moves.","Which also meant that the Battle Saint Emperor knew who he was from the very beginning, yet still fought with him.","Was he deliberately toying with him, or was it that he had been itching for a fight?","Ling Han felt that the possibility of the latter was higher. The line of the Battle Saint indeed all had this kind of personality.","—If you bully me like this, be careful that I will return and thrash your great-great-grandson!","After walking for a while, they entered into a cave.","\"What a dense aura of life!\" Ling Han exclaimed in shock. Previously, he had been hit by the Battle Saint Emperor, and had suffered a considerable number of injuries. However, after just walking into the cave for a short while, these injuries began to heal.","In fact, he discovered that his life force was presently strengthening.","It should be known that in order to break through his limits previously, he had almost expended all his life force. Afterwards, when his cultivation level increased, he had recovered some life force to a certain extent, but the loss was still greater than the replenishment.","\"This is the Cave of Life,\" one of the Battle Saint Emperors said. \"The foundations of Life among the four elements of heaven and earth, which can heal all your injuries and restore your body to perfection.\"","Ling Han was just about to speak, when he suddenly heard a loud bang. In fact, even the cave trembled a few times.","What!","He was shocked. How could it be that he was not aware of just how sturdy this place was?","Hence, what had happened that could actually cause the mountain cave to tremble along with it?","\"Senior—\"","However, the Battle Saint Emperor waved his hand, interrupting Ling Han.","\"I know you have a lot of questions, and I will tell you everything from beginning to end.\" This Old Brother Monkey was truly an impatient character. Clearly, he was impatient with how Ling Han would ask one question, and he was to answer, and the process would be repeated.","Too annoying! Too slow! Too boring!","Hence, he directly started from the beginning.","\"In the past, I entered the Primitive Abyss to search for the path to immortality.","\"After experiencing great danger, I found my way to this island.\"","\"However, when I arrived, a battle was presently taking place here.\"","\"I found out about it. On one side are the Demon Emperors that achieved Dao before me, and on the other side... there is only one, and that is a Divine Beast from the Ancient Age!\"","\"This Divine Beast has already grasped the three great factors of Creation, Life and Destruction. As long as it can obtain the key factor of Death, it will become the strongest existence in this world. Even if all the Great Emperors and Divine Beasts of the past join forces, they would still be no match for it.\"","\"Thus, I joined the battle against this Divine Beast.\"","But was that the end of it?","Ling Han looked at the Battle Saint Emperor. The old Saint Emperor already looked impatient, and looked like he couldn’t hold himself back from getting into a fight.","Hold on, hold on, after you say that, I’m still completely confused, all right?","\"Senior Battle Saint, why are there two of you?\" he asked.","Could it be that the Battle Saint Emperors were two brothers who had achieved Dao together?","\"Oh, these are my two Dao Manifestations,\" a Battle Saint Emperor said. Peng! He pointed at the other Battle Saint Emperor, and the latter immediately vanished into thin air, turning into a hair.","\"My Mystical Power, added with the essence of Life, took form.\"","Ling Han couldn’t help but stare in shock. This was too awesome, wasn’t it?","It was only a doppelganger, and the doppelgangers actually possessed the battle prowess of the first tier?","How could the Lords of Death endure this?","As long as the Battle Saint Emperor went out, and plucked a few of his hairs, wouldn’t they be able to sweep aside all those Lords of Death?","\"Senior, the situation outside is also extremely urgent!\" Ling Han hurriedly related the plot of the Lords of Death.","\"Hmm?\" The Battle Saint Saint raised a brow, and said, \"That’s not right, that’s not right!\"","His expression was filled with violence, as if he was a little anxious.","\"The stability of Yin and Yang is the Dao of heaven and earth. If Yin and Yang are unbalanced, even the great dao would be impacted... I understand now!\" The Battle Saint Emperor suddenly clapped his hands, \"It must be that old Divine Beast’s doing. The two realms of Yin and Yang are unbalanced, and under such a powerful impact, what would be brought about is destruction and death!\"","\"In this way, he would be able to grasp the essence of Death as quickly as possible, and become the strongest.\"","Ling Han was quite confused, and asked, \"Senior, who exactly is the old Divine Beast that you speak of?\"","\"I don’t know either.\" The Battle Saint Emperor shook his head, and said, \"Among the Divine Beasts of the past eras, he also exists. However, judging by the time he’s experienced, it’s clearly the beginning of heaven and earth, the same era as the various Divine Beasts.\"","\"Why is everyone targeting him?\" Ling Han asked. From what the Battle Saint Emperor had said, the Divine Beast only wanted to become stronger.","Was it wrong to become stronger?","The Battle Saint Emperor faltered for a moment before replying, \"He was the strongest, so I fought him.\"","This... could be considered a reason?","However, it was an extremely fitting reason for the Battle Saint Emperor.","\"However, this Divine Beast is incredibly evil. If he were to grasp the essence of Death, he would definitely destroy the heaven and earth,\" the Battle Saint Emperor added.","Ling Han nodded. Though the Battle Saint Emperor was rash and bellicose, how could a Great Emperor be an idiot?","He was extremely smart, all right?","\"Senior, senior, can you explain in more detail?\" Ling Han only had a vague idea now.","\"Why are you so noisy?\" the Battle Saint Emperor asked impatiently.","Though he was still annoyed, this old Saint Emperor still answered Ling Han’s question in detail.","Simply put, this island was the core of the entire Primitive Abyss. It was also the true starting point of heaven and earth.","In this place, there were four major factors that formed heaven and earth: Creation, Destruction, Life, and Death.","At that time, the old Divine Beast should have also come for the sake of immortality. After arriving on the island, he broke through all the obstacles, and grasped the three elements of Creation, Life and Destruction.","But right at this moment, a very, very long time had already passed. Thus, another Great Emperor that sought immortality had arrived.","Because he was about to die, the first thing he had to grasp was naturally the essence of Life.","In this process, this Great Emperor discovered the evil that the old Divine Beast had hidden.","Thus, this Great Emperor did not hesitate in starting a battle with the old Divine Beast."]},{"number":4814,"title":"Chapter 4814: Four Elements","paragraphs":["\"Uh, Senior, can you use a name instead?\" Ling Han couldn’t help but ask. At the same time, he couldn’t help but complain in his mind.","The Battle Saint Emperor gritted his teeth, and said, \"The first Great Emperor that came here should be the Heaven Slashing Demon Emperor, right? His original form is a rabbit.\"","By the looks of it, he didn’t seem to like the Heaven Slashing Demon Emperor.","Alright, a monkey and a rabbit. Perhaps there was some familial enmity between them.","A thought suddenly occurred to Ling Han, and he asked, \"Senior, what is that old Divine Beast like?\"","The Battle Saint Emperor described it, and Ling Han couldn’t help but hiss in surprise, because this was exactly the same as the Divine Beast he had seen in the memories of the Azure Phoenix Great Emperor.","This was a Divine Beast that had not left its name in history. It was extremely strange, yet after the Divine Beasts had died, it had entered into their burial ground, and \"stolen\" their corpses.","Why did he steal them?","Was it for the sake of creating the present thirty-six Divine Beast Emperors?","However, the 36 Divine Beast Emperors had still been created \"in recent times\", and in the long passage of history, this Divine Beast had always been at war with the Battle Saint Emperor and the others, so why didn’t it revive the 36 Divine Beast Emperors as soon as possible?","It was clear that the 36 Divine Beasts were far from enough to deal with the Battle Saint Emperorand the others. Thus... the purpose of their creation wasn’t to target the Battle Saint Emperor and the others. Instead, it was to prevent him from entering.","This \"him\" was actually a backup plan that the Great Emperor Wuya and the others had set up. It could be Ling Han, Ding Shu and the others, or in fact, if Ling Han hadn’t been able to become the Genesis World’s Master at that time, it could even be Hysteria.","Ling Han related what he knew, which made the Battle Saint Emperor feel extremely curious.","As it turned out, there was such a thing.","In fact, they didn’t even know that there were another 36 Divine Beast Emperors in the outer region.","\"That old Divine Beast has grasped the fundamentals of Creation and Life, and added with the corpses of the 36 Divine Beasts, the Divine Beasts can indeed be reproduced.\" The Battle Saint Emperor pondered for a moment. \"However, the creation can actually also reach the level of a Great Emperor. This doesn’t make sense!\"","If one had grasped the essence of Creation, they could create things out of thin air, and if they had grasped the essence of Life, they could bestow life. Thus, it was theoretically possible for the 36 Divine Beasts to reappear.","But as for Great Emperors?","If something like a Great Emperor could also be created... that would really be too terrifying.","What secrets did they not know?","Alright, Ling Han continued to ask.","The Heaven Slashing Demon Emperor and the old Divine Beast battled fiercely. However, the old Divine Beast had grasped the three major factors of Life, Creation and Destruction, and its battle prowess was inconceivably strong. The Heaven Slashing Demon Emperor was completely no match for it. Thankfully, there was a Cave of Life here. No matter how heavily injured the Heaven Slashing Demon Emperor was, he would be able to recover very quickly.","What he had to do was also very simple, and that was not to give the old Divine Beast enough time to break open the Cave of Death, and calmly comprehend Dao.","—Actually, he could be considered lucky, because the Cave of Life couldn’t be directly entered at the beginning, and thanks to the old Divine Beast, it had taken him who knew how many years to open it.","Otherwise, perhaps, the Heaven Slashing Demon Emperor would have already died of old age before he managed to open the Cave of Life.","This was not uncommon. It had already happened here.","Afterwards, even more Great Emperors entered, and resolutely stood on the side of the Heaven Slashing Demon Emperor, opposing the old Divine Beast.","Ling Han interrupted him, and said, \"In other words, after arriving here, the strength of the Great Emperor can actually still increase?\"","\"That’s right.\" The Battle Saint Emperor nodded, \"In the outside world, one can only cultivate to consummate level of Nine Star Regulations at most. This is something that practically any Great Emperor can do. However, after coming here, one can continue to grasp the four fundamental factors. With every aspect that one grasps, battle prowess would be qualitatively improved.\"","Hiss, in that case, there should be eight tiers in Emperor-level battle prowess.","The first tier of battle prowess was currently vacant. The second tier of battle prowess was the old Divine Beast, who had grasped the three elements of Life, Creation and Destruction. The third tier of battle prowess had grasped two elements, and the fourth tier of battle prowess had grasped one.","The fifth was the ordinary Great Emperor. The sixth was the Divine Beast Emperors, the seventh tier was the Lords of Death, and the eighth tier was the Imperial Weapon, battle prowess which had just broken through to Emperor-level.","Coming back to the Battle Saint Emperor, he continued to answer his questions.","Though more and more Great Emperors had come, and all of them wanted to stop the old Divine Beast, the old Divine Beast was too strong. They could only slow it down, but could not stop it.","After so many years, the old Divine Beast was close to opening the Cave of Death.","And once he succeeded... he would be able to kill all the Great Emperors in an instant. Even if they had grasped the essence of Life, it would be useless.","That was because in a clash of fundamental factors, it would depend on who was stronger.","Thankfully, in the Primitive Abyss, time was the least valuable. The so-called \"very fast\" would need hundreds of millions of years or even longer, even in the outside world.","And for the Great Emperors that had come here, because the island was filled with the essence of Life, even if they had not grasped it, their lifespan was still unlimited.","Of course, the prerequisite was that they had to stay here. Otherwise, their lifespan would have long since dried up, and they would definitely die immediately when they left.","Because they could only delay the old Divine Beast, but could not stop it, the Great Emperors began to make arrangements, and sent out the Stones of Life.","The so-called Stone of Life was a rock in the depths of the Cave of Life. Because it had always been nurtured by the essence of Life, it naturally possessed the mighty power of Life. Furthermore, it had also been placed in the Cave of Creation and the Cave of Destruction for a very long time, and now possessed a sliver of power of Creation and Destruction.","This rock had been obtained by Xuan Taiyu, but he had just used it to cultivate Destructive Energy, when he encountered misfortune and was ganged up on by the Lords of Death, and finally died.","Most of the events now matched, but the question was, what role did the Lords of Death have in this matter?","\"According to our deductions, after those b@stards entered into the Primitive Abyss, they were bewitched by the old Divine Beast, and that’s why they turned themselves into half-human and half-ghost,\" the Battle Saint Emperor guessed.","\"But isn’t the old Divine Beast, battling fiercely with you guys?\" Ling Han asked.","\"Since that old Divine Beast, Ling Han, was able to create 36 Divine Beasts without our knowledge at all, then it is not impossible for him to entice those b@stards with his divine sense,\" the Battle Saint Emperor speculated.","The Great Emperors here were setting up some plans, and the old Divine Beast was not idle either. Furthermore, his plans were even more frightening.","\"Once the Living Realm develops to the extreme and begins to collapse, then the Netherworld would be expanding. The shockwave created would be enough to affect the Dao of Heaven and Earth, and even affect here...\" The Battle Saint Emperor inhaled sharply, \"That old geezer, he wants to use this method to open the Cave of Death, so he can see the secret of the essence of Death!\"","Seeing the essence of Death did not mean that one could grasp it, but for the old Divine Beast, as long as he could glimpse this kind of profound mystery, would he still be far from grasping it?","\"Those b@stards must have fallen for it. To say nothing of advancing further after achieving immortality, they would only meet a tragic end in the clash of the two Realms of Yin and Yang,\" the Battle Saint Emperor said disdainfully.","This was the collision of heaven and earth. Even a Great Emperor couldn’t withstand this."]},{"number":4815,"title":"Chapter 4815: Return","paragraphs":["\"Brat, hurry up and go back. You must stop those b@stards!\" The Battle Saint Emperor said solemnly, \"Otherwise, our efforts all these years would be wasted.\"","Yi, I have to go back just like that?","I have come to catch a glimpse of the ultimate secrets of the Primitive Abyss. Furthermore, I haven’t even seen the so-called old Divine Beast, so wouldn’t it be a bit of a pity for me to return now?","However, the situation outside was indeed precarious, and the Great Emperors in the Primitive Abyss could not leave, and would immediately die once them left. Thus, the situation now could only depend on Ling Han now.","Sigh, there was a lot of responsibility.","\"Senior, is there no Great Emperor that has grasped the essence of Life or Creation?\" Ling Han asked.","\"Do you think that just because one has grasped the essence of Life, they would be able to live forever?\" the Battle Saint Emperor said with a smile.","\"That’s not the case?\" Ling Han was surprised.","\"Of course not.\" The Battle Saint Emperor shook his head, \"Having grasped the fundamentals of Life, one would possess the ability to bestow life. However, this would not be able to stop the aging of life.\"","\"But haven’t you guys attained immortality?\" Ling Han asked curiously.","\"Theoretically, that is indeed the case,\" the Battle Saint Emperor nodded, \"However, it is only limited to this space, because even if we die, we would still be revived, but it would be different once we leave. Who would revive us?\"","Therewas a Cave of Life here, and there were even Great Emperors that had grasped the essence of Life here. Thus, even if a Great Emperor died in battle, he could still be revived by the other Great Emperors — as long as his corpse was not too damaged.","But once they left, they would all die, and no one would have the chance to revive the other.","Thus, the activity area of the Great Emperors could only be limited to the Primitive Abyss. In fact, it could only be on this one island.","However, the battle that was taking place here was incredibly important, and would decide the future of the entire universe.","\"All right. After I rest for a while, I will leave immediately.\" Ling Han nodded.","Only when he went to the outside world would he be able to come into contact with the Nine Star Regulations, and truly step onto the threshold of Pseudo-Emperor.","\"Oh, that’s right, you’re also a Pseudo-Emperor!\" It was as if the Battle Saint Emperor had just discovered this fact.","Er, Grandpa Monkey, your reaction takes a bit long, doesn’t it?","Ling Han mocked internally, and nodded, \"I am indeed a Pseudo-Emperor, Five Stars.\"","\"Then you must come here before you break through to Great Emperor Tier,\" the Battle Saint Emperor said solemnly. \"If you break through to Emperor Tier here, it is very possible that you would be able to directly grasp one of the key factors.\"","Hiss, so awesome?","Ling Han pondered for a moment, before saying, \"However, in this era, heaven and earth already allows one to become Great Emperor. I’m afraid that someone will become a Great Emperor before me.\"","After all, Ding Shu and the others were all no weaker than him in terms of comprehension ability, and on the side of the Lands of Death, the fallen Imperial Sons had long since become Pseudo-Emperors, and Little Ye was even more freakish, the greatest enemy on the path to becoming Emperor.","\"It’s fine,\" the Battle Saint Emperor said with a smile. \"Can’t you see how many Great Emperors are here?\"","Ling Han faltered, \"In this place, there is no restriction on becoming Emperor?\"","Otherwise, the existence of every Great Emperor would interfere with the heaven and earth, forming a terrifying collision, and that was why there was the saying that a Great Emperor would never meet another.","Years ago, the Lords of Death and Xuan Taiyu had a huge battle, resulting in the fortune of the entire North Heavenly Realm falling. This was the consequence of disturbing heaven and earth.","However, as early as the ancient times, the Divine Beasts had stood side by side.","Thus, as long as heaven and earth allowed it, Great Emperors could coexist.","However, heaven and earth had evolved, and the Regulations of heaven and earth had changed. Only one Great Emperor could appear in an era.","But in this place, the Regulations of heaven and earth were not all that good.","Without Regulations, how could there be any restrictions?","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel overjoyed. If Brother Monkey, Ding Shu, the empress, and the others could all become Pseudo-Emperors, then they would have the chance to become Emperors here!","How to do it was naturally a big problem. To say nothing of the fact that there were 36 Divine Beast Emperors blocking the path, even in the latter half of the journey, a Pseudo-Emperor would still be easily destroyed by the storm of heaven and earth.","As for this, he could worry about it later. There would definitely be a way.","En, this was the only good news at present.","The Battle Saint Emperor explained the situation here to him again. Then, he impatiently ran off to fight.","Ling Han stayed in the cave to recuperate. The vitality here was exuberant, and it was the source and mother of all life, allowing his condition to continuously advance towards perfection.","Half a month later, Ling Han felt that he was almost done, because he could no longer feel any improvement.","He decided to leave.","But before leaving, no matter what, he had to take a look ahead.","This was a battle on the level of Great Emperors, and furthermore, it had surpassed the previous first tier. Just how world-shaking would it be?","However, just as he walked out of the cave, he saw the Battle Saint Emperor approach him head-on.","This time, the Saint Emperor was riddled with wounds. His wounds were so severe that it was as if he were about to die.","\"Yi, why haven’t you left yet?\" This was the Battle Saint Emperor’s first words.","Ling Han was a little speechless. ’Do you really want to chase me away so badly?’","\"Senior, is this your true body?\" He was suddenly shocked.","Though this Battle Saint Emperor was extremely heavily injured, his aura was as boundless as an ocean, far stronger than the previous one.","Thus, since that was a doppelganger at the time, this should be the real one.","\"That’s right,\" the Battle Saint Emperor nodded. He then walked into the cave and said, \"I need to heal my injuries, so hurry up and return.\"","Er... why had the Battle Saint Emperor returned to heal his wounds after so many days?","It was probably because this person was too fierce, and was howling as he charged at the front. Naturally, he was the one who had suffered the most serious injuries.","As expected of the line of the Battle Saint. It was not without reason that there were so few of them!","Thankfully, there was the element of Life here. Otherwise, this old Saint Emperor would have long since been finished.","Ling Han shook his head, and stopped complaining.","Since the Battle Saint Emperor emphasized this, he looked at the pillar of light in the distance, then turned around and left.","This time, he would not go and watch the excitement, but the next time he came, it would be the time for him to break through to Great Emperor Tier. At that time, he would become the main force, and battle with that old Divine Beast.","Ling Han walked back in a daze. He carefully passed through the sea that was filled with columns of death, and after several years, he finally returned to land.","He kept a low profile all the way, and did not cause any commotion.","His luck wasn’t bad this time, and after only a few months, he found the rock golem.","When it saw Ling Han, the rock golem couldn’t be any more excited. It rushed over and continuously arched its head at him, looking very much like a puppy that was inviting a pet.","\"Haha, let’s go.\"","Ling Han still sat on the shoulder of the rock golem. In any case, this guy was also a Pseudo-Emperor, so it would not be too slow.","On the way, Ling Han still kept an extremely low profile. At this time, what he wanted most was to return to the outside world, and grasp the Nine Star Regulations, so that his battle prowess would improve further. Then, only if he went to stop the plans of the Lords of Death would he have a higher chance of success.","Trying to convince these people?","What a joke; would they believe him?","Even if they were a little suspicious, after setting up for millions and millions of years, they had to take a gamble no matter what.","With the temperament of a Great Emperor, the fact that they had been convinced then meant that they must have seen something, and found out something. That was why they were completely convinced, and made themselves half-human and half-dead, so that they could fight for the great opportunity in this era.","So, he wanted them to turn back from their plans?","Hehe.","He could only use his strength to subdue them!"]},{"number":4816,"title":"Chapter 4816: Charge out","paragraphs":["Ling Han brought the rock golem back.","He discovered that the Divine Beast Emperors still looking for him, and he would \"meet\" them from time to time.","However, because Ling Han was very low-key, and did not travel very fast, he carefully hid his tracks all the way. Thus, he was not discovered by those Divine Beast Great Emperors.","Now was not the time to come into conflict with these Great Emperors.","That was because... they were only minor characters.","Whether these Great Emperors died or not did not have much effect on the overall situation.","Of course, if Ling Han was powerful enough, he wouldn’t mind killing these Divine Beasts. After all, that would definitely be able to weaken that old Divine Beast somewhat.","Having grasped the essence of Life, could he really create life as he willed it?","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel tempted. There were also people that he wanted to revive.","For example, Old Master Ge Qianqiu.","He was definitely thinking too much about this now. He had to first break through to become a Great Emperor, and then grasp the essence of Life. En, perhaps he had to grasp the essence of Creation as well. Who knows, he may be able to revive those who had died.","This was only a thought. Whether it would work or not would have to wait until he broke through to become a Great Emperor.","Ling Han had deliberately concealed his tracks, so as long as these Divine Beast Emperors did not encounter him head-on, how could they possibly discover him?","Thus, though he spent some time on the journey, he still successfully arrived at the exit of the Primitive Abyss.","In this place, the Azure Phoenix Great Emperor was still standing guard.","The other Great Emperors were all looking for Ling Han, yet this Great Emperor was still here... could it be that he was blocking the entrance, not allowing anyone to enter?","Ling Han was naturally unafraid. He directly appeared, and charged towards the Azure Phoenix Great Emperor.","He was in no mood to tangle with the other at all. At the first instant, he used Destructive Energy, and the light of great dao wrapped around it.","Faced with this kind of attack, even the Azure Phoenix Great Emperor could only retreat, not daring to face it head-on.","Even if he didn’t die, he would be severely injured.","He had no choice but to step aside to avoid facing Ling Han’s power head-on.","\"Let’s go!\" Ling Han issued a command to the rock golem.","By now, the rock golem was completely capable of obeying his commands. The large fellow immediately leaped away, not even turning its head.","The Azure Phoenix Great Emperor didn’t pay attention to this rock golem. This didn’t affect him at all. Moreover, he didn’t think that he could take it as hostage and use it as a tactic to force Ling Han to battle him to the death.","Obviously, he didn’t understand Ling Han.","However, a Great Emperor was still a Great Emperor in the end. He was in the sixth tier, and his battle prowess far surpassed Ling Han, who was in the eighth tier. Even if he had reservations, as long as he distanced himself, under the frenzied bombardment, Ling Han was still under great pressure.","In the fierce battle, Ling Han was slowly forced back.","The Azure Phoenix Great Emperor smirked coldly. He had already sent out a message, and very soon, all the Great Emperors would be arriving. At that time, they would gang up on Ling Han. Even if Ling Han possessed deadly weapons like Destructive Energy, only a Great Emperor would have to be sacrificed to severe injury or even death to block the attack, and they would definitely be able to kill this boy.","After all, the Divine Beast Great Emperors existed to intercept and kill people like Ling Han. Thus, it was worth it even if one of them died.","They could just be created again..","Ling Han retreated step by step. He was also buying time for the rock golem, but two days later, when he discovered that another Divine Beas Great Emperor was approaching, he no longer hesitated, and began to break out of the siege.","\"You think you can come and go as you please?\" the Azure Phoenix Great Emperor said with a sneer.","\"Haha, so what? Can you stop me?\" Ling Han laughed loudly, directly using the Cold Water of Death.","At this moment, the Azure Phoenix Great Emperor had no choice but to dodge. If he blocked the attack now, Ling Han would be able to leave calmly before the Great Emperor behind him arrived.","Thus, this was meaningless.","With his move, Ling Han took advantage of the opening to charge out. He used Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, and his speed was indescribably fast.","The Azure Phoenix Great Emperor was in pursuit, but the distance between him and Ling Han was steadily widening.","He couldn’t catch up.","He sighed. If he had known that Ling Han would escape, he would have let all the Great Emperors block him here.","No way!","He couldn’t allow this brat to continue becoming stronger. Otherwise, it would really endanger \"their\" long-term plans.","He would gather all the Great Emperors, then charge out of the Primitive Abyss. They definitely had to kill that brat.","...","Ling Han’s speed was extremely fast. Merely half a day later, he had caught up to the rock golem.","At this point, he could completely ignore those glowing particles in the passageway, and directly crash into them. What damage could the might of a planet’s explosion cause to a Great Emperor?","Even the rock golem was unafraid. It was formed from this kind of particle, and it was even denser in quality. Its defense was incredibly tough.","Xiu, he and the rock golem rushed out of the Primitive Abyss, and the universe was pitch-black.","Though this place was completely empty, Ling Han felt a familiar aura that he hadn’t felt for a long time.","Additionally... he could again sense the Regulations.","In an instant, inspiration surged through him.","Thus, without any hesitation, Ling Han only travelled slightly further. Then, he sat down in a cross-legged position, and turned his appreciation into his own strength.","He was capturing Regulations.","In reality, Regulations were hidden in the heaven and earth, so it was extremely difficult to observe them.","However, Ling Han had stayed too long in the Primitive Abyss, so the moment he appeared, he naturally caused unusual movements in the heaven and earth, causing even Regulations to erupt.","In this way, it would be much easier for him to capture the Regulations.","Amidst the densely packed Regulations, Ling Han carefully searched through them, heading straight for the core.","Nine Star Regulations.","All the Regulations were manifested from the Nine Star Regulations. This was the source, and was a little like the Four Elements. However, the Nine Star Regulations served the Dao of Heaven and Earth, while the Four Elements formed the foundations of the Dao of Heaven and Earth, and there was a fundamental difference between the two.","Bit by bit, Ling Han extracted Regulations, and in this process, he discovered that his body that had experienced Silent Destruction actually had some slight fluctuations.","Realization dawned on him. The process of comprehending the Nine Star Regulations was the process of breaking through step by step of a Pseudo-Emperor.","When his body had completely awakened, he would have more or less grasped a complete Nine Star Regulation, and would be able to break through to become a Great Emperor.","However, this final step would have to depend on whether the heaven and earth had favoured him or not. Only one person could attain Dao in a single era. As for others, even if they were Pseudo-Emperors, with the existence of a Great Emperor, they would never be able to completely grasp the Nine Star Regulations, and thus would not be able to become a Great Emperor.","Ling Han continued to gain enlightenment. Unfortunately, this enlightenment alone was not enough to complete a revival of a body that had experienced Silent Destruction, advancing into the level of a six-star Pseudo Emperor.","He was not in a rush. This time, he was grasping the Nine Star Regulations. Even if it was just a sliver, it would allow his battle prowess to improve by leaps and bounds.","Weng! Right at this moment, an aura swept over, carrying a sliver of Imperial Might.","Roar!","The rock golem immediately stood up from its cross-legged position and looked into the distance, its viciousness on full display.","Ling Han sent out a thought, telling the rock golem to calm down.","In just an instant, a person appeared near Ling Han.","Zhang Yu, the son of the Sea Emperor, Pseudo-Emperor!","\"Yi!\" Zhang Yu was also slightly surprised. He had not thought that he would actually encounter Ling Han here. Furthermore, by the looks of it, he was clearly in seclusion to appreciate something.","This was a good opportunity!","A look of delight appeared on his face. Who knows, he may be able to capture Ling Han in a single stroke. To say the least, even if it was just to stop Ling Han from continuing his comprehension, that would still be a great merit.","Moreover, this was the edge of the universe, and the Galaxy Network of the Chang Clan couldn’t reach here. Even if he wanted to inform the others, he couldn’t."]},{"number":4817,"title":"Chapter 4817: Scared","paragraphs":["Zhang Yu smirked coldly, \"I really had not expected that I would encounter you here, when I could not find you anywhere! Ling Han, you have not expected it, right? You yourself are at the most crucial moment of your comprehension in seclusion, and I have actually encountered you here.\"","If one was comprehending Dao, they would definitely have to find an absolutely safe place. The higher the cultivation level, the more terrifying the backlash would be if they went mad.","Thus, he first used words to harrass Ling Han and mess with his mind.","Once one’s heart was disturbed, it would be even easier for one to go mad.","Ling Han cracked a smile, \"We should be able to eat grilled octopus today!\" He paused, then continued, \"Your original form... is an octopus, right?\"","F***!","Zhang Yu was instantly angered. You are clearly at a disadvantage, so why do you still dare to speak such arrogant words?","As expected, aside from being the strongest Saint, this guy was also a Despicable Saint. En, he was the second most despicable Saint.","He was very depressed. He clearly wanted to mess with Ling Han’s Dao Heart, but why was it that it was him that was so angry now that smoke was about to come out of his nostrils?","This guy was really despicable!","Forget it.","Zhang Yu decided not to attack verbally. After all, this was not something he was good at. Even if Ling Han was still in a state of comprehension, the destructive power of a few casual words from him was stronger than whatever he could say.","He stood up, and charged towards Ling Han.","\"Ang!\" The rock golem released a wave of divine sense, stepping out to greet Zhang Yu’s attack.","Yi... what was going on?","Zhang Yu was startled. He had not thought that a rock golem would suddenly appear out of nowhere.","Previously, though he had also seen it, he had not taken it to heart at all. He only had Ling Han in his eyes.","This was a great enemy.","However, the moment the rock golem made its move, he suddenly realized that something was off.","This guy was actually also a Pseudo-Emperor.","No, it wasn’t an ordinary Pseudo-Emperor, but at least eight stars.","Boom! The rock golem launched a strike, and the entire sky trembled.","Pseudo-Emperor!","This wasn’t the Primitive Abyss. The structure of heaven and earth in the Primitive Abyss was sturdy, and if it weren’t for the fact that this place was already the edge of the universe, the masses of stars would probably collapse.","The might of a Pseudo-Emperor was world-shaking.","Zhang Yu took this blow head-on, and was directly sent flying.","The rock golem howled in excitement as it charged forward to continue the battle.","In the Primitive Abyss, there were too many beings that were stronger than it. Whether it was the Divine Beast Great Emperors, or the storms of heaven and earth, they could cause it serious injury. In fact, they could even kill it easily.","But now? It had suddenly discovered the value of its life.","’F*ck! So I’m also this powerful!’","The more this guy fought, the more excited he became, firmly suppressing Zhang Yu.","Zhang Yu was both furious and dumbfounded.","Where had this rock golem come from?","Moreover, it was a Pseudo-Emperor!","It wasn’t like he didn’t know how difficult it was to become a Pseudo-Emperor.","If it was not for the treasure provided by the Lords of Death, he might still only be a Four-Star or Five-Star Saint by now, and would not have been able to become a Pseudo-Emperor.","Throughout the ages, just how many Pseudo-Emperors had there been?","Their numbers wouldn’t surpass the number of Great Emperors by much.","But now, a rock golem had suddenly appeared, and it was actually a Pseudo-Emperor, so how could he not be dumbfounded?","Why was anything that had the slightest relation to Ling Han all so strange?","Meanwhile, Ling Han didn’t take Zhang Yu to heart at all. When he was a Saint, he would be able to suppress him, what more when he now had battle prowess on the level of a Great Emperor. Suppressing a Pseudo-Emperor would really only be the matter of a single thought.","He was still comprehending the Nine Star Regulations, and with every second that passed, his strength would increase slightly.","This was a rare opportunity. This was the first time he had immersed himself in Regulations after becoming a Pseudo-Emperor. Thus, this state was hard to come by, and he couldn’t maintain it forever.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","Under the mad barrage of attacks from the rock golem, Zhang Yu did not have the ability to fight back at all, which made him extremely depressed.","Not only Ling Han, but even the people by Ling Han’s side outmatched him!","This was too humiliating.","He gave a loud shout, and drew the Imperial Weapon.","This was a three-pronged halberd. It instantly revived, and an endless imperial might spread out, making for an incredibly terrifying sight.","The rock golem was already engrossed in the battle, and didn’t pay any heed to it at all. It roared and continued to attack.","Peng!","It immediately suffered a head-on blow from the Imperial Weapon, and its entire body was sent flying. Bits of rock fell from its body.","This!","Zhang Yu gritted his teeth as he watched. What kind of defense was this? It was too terrifying, wasn’t it?","Oh, after being struck by the Imperial Weapon, only a few scraps fell?","What worth would an Imperial Weapon have?","The rock golem didn’t care at all, and roared as it made a comeback. In any case, its body was a suit of armor, so it didn’t matter even if it was completely destroyed.","Zhang Yu had no choice, and could only continue to attack with the Imperial Weapon.","The Imperial Weapon could be considered the weakest Great Emperor, but no matter how weak it was, it was still a Great Emperor.","The rock golem was completely outmatched, and was continuously sent backwards, bits of it continuously falling off its body.","However, judging by its size, to expose its core, it would have to fight for at least ten days to half a month, or even longer than that.","How could that be allowed!","Zhang Yu thought internally. He definitely had to stop Ling Han from comprehending. Otherwise, once Ling Han joined the battle, it would only be his turn to flee in panic.","In terms of Imperial Weapon, Ling Han also had one. However, in terms of battle prowess, he was completely outmatched by Ling Han. Moreover, now that there was a rock golem, he was even more outmatched.","He used the Imperial Weapon to push back the rock golem, then charged towards Ling Han.","Capture the ringleader before defeating the enemy, and Ling Han was his main target.","How fast was a Pseudo-Emperor’s speed?","Without the interference of the rock golem, Zhang Yu instantly charged in front of Ling Han.","However, right at this moment, Ling Han suddenly opened his eyes and stood up.","Gods!","Zhang Yu immediately stopped, and then retreated rapidly.","Ling Han’s vicious reputation was already deeply ingrained in his mind. Thus, he didn’t dare to face him head-on at all.","\"Yi, what are you doing?\" Ling Han stretched lazily, then sat back down.","\"You, what’s wrong with you!\" Zhang Yu flew into a humiliated rage.","\"Oh, I’m tired from sitting, so I stretched and changed my posture,\" Ling Han said casually.","Change your posture your sister.","You are only sitting, and not having s** with a woman, so switch positions my a*s.","Zhang Yu’s heart was filled with complaints, but ultimately, it was still because he was too wary of Ling Han, and that was why he had been shocked by Ling Han’s slightest move.","Boom!","Beside him, the rock golem made a comeback.","\"Scram!\" With a casual strike from Zhang Yu, the Imperial Weapon unleashed its might, sending the rock golem flying again.","On one hand, this proved just how powerful the Imperial Weapon was. Even a Nine Stars Pseudo-Emperor could not withstand a single blow, and on the other, it also proved just how strong the defense of the rock golem was. It would not be damaged even by the barrage of attacks from the Imperial Weapon.","Terrifying!","This time, Zhang Yu strengthened his resolve. With a loud shout, he charged towards Ling Han again.","Furthermore, after such a pause, the Imperial Weapon could once again unleash its might.","He was going to kill Ling Han with a single strike.","He controlled the three-pronged halberd and ruthlessly stabbed it at Ling Han. Endless imperial might spread out, capable of easily destroying an entire galaxy.","Close, close, close.","Die!","The three-pronged halberd stabbed down, and Zhang Yu smirked coldly. At such a close distance, it was impossible for Ling Han to dodge. Thus, this young man that even the Lords of Death was wary of was finally going to die.","Right at this moment, Ling Han stretched out a hand."]},{"number":4818,"title":"Chapter 4818: Driving to despair","paragraphs":["Haha, you still want to catch the Imperial Weapon with your bare hands?","Who do you think you are?","A Great Emperor?","What a joke!","Zhang Yu smirked coldly. Had he overestimated his own abilities, or was he feeling too good about himself?","’Die... F*ck!’","Zhang Yu’s eyes almost popped out of her head. His mouth was half-gaping, and even his tongue seemed to be tied in a knot.","’Holy f*ck!’","What had he seen?","The Imperial Weapon, the Sea Divine Halberd, was actually grasped by Ling Han.","Was this an illusion?","Right, right, right. It must be.","Before his death, Ling Han had used an illusion to confuse him. Thus, after a while, this guy would die, and the illusion would disappear.","Yi, why was it like this?","The corner of Zhang Yu’s mouth twitched. The aura of a Pseudo-Emperor was majestic, and he suddenly came back to his senses.","This wasn’t a f*cking illusion. It was a nightmare!","\"You, you, how is this possible!\" His voice was trembling.","How could it not be terrifying? To catch an Imperial Weapon with one’s bare hands, this was something that only a Great Emperor could do.","Ling Han cracked a smile, \"Everything is possible.\"","What kind of answer was that?","Zhang Yu’s eyes darted around, and he resolutely abandoned the Imperial Weapon. He then turned around to flee.","It was fine. Without a corresponding control technique, no one would be able to control the Imperial Weapon, and he only had to summon it, and the Imperial Weapon would automatically return.","However, he had just moved, when he saw that another person had appeared in front of him.","Ling Han!","Hiss, how could your speed be so fast?","\"Impossible! Absolutely impossible!\" Zhang Yu refused to believe it, \"This must be an illusion. I must still be hallucinating.\"","To be able to make a Pseudo-Emperor doubt reality so much, this merit alone was enough to make Ling Han proud.","Ling Han chuckled, \"Actually, you already know the answer. You just don’t want to believe it.\"","Zhang Yu calmed down. After all, he was a Pseudo-Emperor, and the son of a Great Emperor. He had experienced countless eras, so how could he possibly not have the slightest bit of composure?","\"You’ve become a Great Emperor!\"","He gritted his teeth, filled with envy and jealousy.","Ling Han smiled and said, \"If a new Great Emperor were to appear in the world, strange phenomena would appear in the universe. Do you think that’s possible?\"","Zhang Yu also knew this fact, and that was why he was unwilling to believe it.","That’s right. There were no strange phenomena appearing in the universe, and as a Pseudo-Emperor, he could clearly know that the Dao of Heaven and Earth could prove it.","Then, Ling Han definitely had not become a Great Emperor.","But if you didn’t become Emperor, how could you be so awesome?","\"I just broke through to the level of Pseudo-Emperor,\" Ling Han said with a smile, kindly solving the mystery for Zhang Yu.","Yet Zhang Yu still looked like he had been frightened.","He knew that Ling Han was freakish. When he was a Saint, he already possessed battle prowess that could match a Pseudo-Emperor.","However, Pseudo-Emperor was still Pseudo-Emperor, after all, couldn’t be compared to a real Great Emperor.","Thus, he firmly believed that even if Ling Han became a Pseudo-Emperor, he could only be categorized among the ranks of Pseudo-Emperors, and would still be far from an actual Great Emperor.","But now, he knew that he was wrong.","This incredibly freakish guy, even if he had advanced into the level of Pseudo-Emperor, still maintained his freakish nature.","A Pseudo-Emperor, yet possessed battle prowess on the level of Great Emperor.","This was proof enough of the fact that he was parrying the Imperial Weapon with his bare hands.","Heavens!","This kind of opponent was really enough to drive one to despair.","\"Alright, do you have any last words to say?\" Ling Han asked considerately.","Zhang Yu gritted his teeth. He did not beg for mercy. Their positions were different, and there was absolutely no possibility of reconciliation.","\"Don’t be so smug. Even if you possess the battle prowess of a Great Emperor, there is still no way that you would be a match for the Great Emperors!\"","\"I’ll wait for you in the Netherworld!\"","Ling Han sighed, and said, \"It’s a shame that the Great Emperors would not enter the Netherworld after death. Otherwise, I could have sent you off to reunite.\"","He activated his power. Boom, under the terrifying impact, Zhang Yu was immediately killed.","’Hmm?’","Ling Han discovered that after Zhang Yu’s death, there was no fluctuation in the Dao of Heaven and Earth.","Theoretically speaking, a Pseudo-Emperor had also grasped a sliver of Nine Star Regulations, so when a Pseudo-Emperor died, it should have caused a certain extent of disturbance to the Regulations of heaven and earth.","\"Unless, like those Pseudo-Emperors pf tje Pseudo-Emperor, they have not grasped the Nine Star Regulations.\"","\"The difference lies in the fact that the fallen Imperial Sons still possess Imperial Source, but as for those in the Primitive Abyss, hehe, they are extremely weak.\"","Ling Han casually tossed Zhang Yu’s corpse to one side. Under the impact of his great power, even someone as strong as a Pseudo-Emperor was unable to leave behind a complete corpse. With this toss, it immediately turned into bits that scattered into the universe.","The rock golem was curious, and chased after these particles.","Ling Han ignored him as he started to search for Four Origin Planet.","’Huh? It’s not nearby?’","Ling Han was astounded. Just how powerful was his divine sense now? With a single thought, he could enclose and control the vast space around him.","However, Four Origin Planet was nowhere to be found.","Could it be?","Zhang Yu and the others were definitely not here to play. Instead, they were searching for the empress and the others. Thus, Ding Shu and the others put away the Four Origin Planet and ran elsewhere.","He frowned. It was easy to locate a planet, but to find a specific person in such a colossal universe?","That was really too difficult. Even he could not possibly accomplish that.","Moreover, it was possible that the whereabouts of the masters of the Genesis World could not be deduced, which would make it even more difficult.","Thus, Ling Han could only wait. As long as the Four Origin Planet was released from the body, Ling Han would be able to immediately sense it, because there was a mark that he had left on the Four Origin Planet.","Ling Han sat down cross-legged, and continued to comprehend Regulations.","In his mind, there was a gossamer-like line.","This was the Nine Stars Regulations.","Though it was pitifully thin, but because of the existence of this thing, Ling Han’s present battle prowess had improved by leaps and bounds.","Seventh tier!","Now, if a Pseudo-Emperor used the Imperial Weapon to attack him, he would be able to easily suppress him. That was because he had already leaped out of the eighth tier, and possessed the strength to crush the Imperial Weapon.","In other words, even against the Lords of Death, Ling Han wouldn’t be at a disadvantage at all. In fact, if he unleashed Destructive Energy and light of great dao, even the Lords of Death wouldn’t dare to face him head-on.","Of course, the Lords of Death may forcibly recover to their prime condition, and Ling Han would still be outmatched.","However, firstly, these fallen Great Emperors had not had many chances to revive their battle prowess in the first place, and secondly, every time they revived, they would have to devour a great amount of life essence, but now, the whole universe had basically been transformed into Netherworld, so how much life essence would there be left for them to devour?","Ling Han wanted nothing more than for them to revive. That way, he would be able to exhaust these Lords of Death to death with a few times.","Three years later, he suddenly stood up.","Four Origin Planet appeared.","Ling Han grabbed the rock golem, and a golden path appeared beneath his feet, pointing at an endless distance.","Xiu, it was only a step, and Ling Han appeared in the skies above Four Origin Planet.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","Three incredibly powerful auras assaulted him, and the three Pseudo-Emperors, Buddha Doga, Qian Yanghao, and Xia Houping had already arrived.","When the rock golem saw this, it immediately cried out. Haha, it could fight again!","Shua, when Ling Han saw this, he hurriedly stretched out a hand, and grabbed the rock golem, tossing it into space.","This was the Four Origin Planet. If this guy came to blows, the entire planet would immediately collapse.","\"Ling Han!\" Buddha Doga and the others exclaimed in astonishment.","Only so many years had passed, and Ling Han had already returned?"]},{"number":4819,"title":"Chapter 4819: Arriving at the Chang Clan","paragraphs":["Ling Han smiled and said, \"I’m back.\"","In an instant, Brother Monkey, the empress and the others also rushed over, all of them very excited.","\"That was—\" Qian Yanghao asked.","That rock golem actually gave him an incredibly strong pressure.","\"Oh, I brought it back from the Primitive Abyss,\" Ling Han said. Then, with a wave of his hand, the rock golem appeared in the skies above the Four Origin Planet.","He did not dare to let it come to the Four Origin Planet, because this guy was too heavy.","In the Primitive Abyss, it didn’t matter. In any case, the heaven and earth structure there was extremely sturdy. However, it was different here. The weight of the entire Four Origin Planet added together couldn’t compare to the weight of a grain of sand on its body.","Then, with this big guy standing on the Four Origin Planet, would the Four Origin Planet immediately shatter?","\"Pseudo-Emperor?\" Xia Houping asked. He already had an answer.","\"En.\" Ling Han nodded.","Hiss.","Everyone clicked their tongues in amazement. They had not thought that Ling Han would go out on a trip and actually manage to kidnap a Pseudo-Emperor to bring home.","\"What about you?\" Everyone was more concerned about Ling Han’s strength.","\"I have not disappointed your expectations!\" Ling Han said with a smile.","Everyone instantly exploded with excitement. Ling Han had finally become a Pseudo-Emperor. This meant that they had finally gained the qualifications to face the Lands of Death head-on.","\"Can you rival a Great Emperor?\" Buddha Doga asked. Even he was slightly nervous.","After all, the higher one’s expectations, the more one would fear disappointment.","Ling Han smiled, \"Let’s go back first, and talk slowly. The situation is a little complicated.\"","He had the rock golem stay in space and definitely couldn’t come down. Then, he and the others arrived at the Four Origin Planet.","He began to talk about his experiences over the years.","As everyone listened, they couldn’t help but feel nervous. As it turned out, Ling Han had actually experienced so many dangers.","When Ling Han said that he had seen the Battle Saint Emperor, Brother Monkey couldn’t help but feel extremely excited, and somersaulted a dozen over somersaults in the air.","Although Brother Monkey had always guessed that his ancestor hadn’t died, it was ultimately just a guess. Now that Ling Han had personally confirmed it, he finally felt at ease.","When he talked about that old Divine Beast from the Ancient Age, everyone was surprised, and made various guesses.","Just what kind of existence was this old Divine Beast?","The Divine Beasts from the ancient times had all died, but why had he survived?","\"Say, in the Primitive Abyss, we still have the chance to become Emperor?\" Buddha Doga and the other Pseudo-Emperors were all excited.","They had already contended for the throne once. Logically speaking, even if they lived a second life, they would have lost the right to contend for the throne.","However, who didn’t want to become Emperor?","Thus, after learning that there was still a chance to become Emperor in the Primitive Abyss, these Pseudo-Emperors were naturally excited.","Ling Han nodded earnestly, \"However, we have to go to that island in the core area, but it is fraught with danger.\"","Even he, who possessed Emperor-level battle prowess, almost died.","\"It’s worth a try,\" the three Pseudo-Emperors said.","They would rather die on the path of breaking through to Great Emperor Tier than live \"mediocrely\".","Similarly, Ding Shu and the others were also overjoyed, because compared to Ling Han, there was absolutely no way they could surpass him. The highest accomplishment in this lifetime would only be Pseudo-Emperor.","However, they all had the chance to become Emperors now, and it was not ordinary Great Emperors either. In fact, they could even advance into the fourth tier, third tier, or even higher.","Ling Han decided that after the problem of the Lands of Death was resolved, he would bring the Pseudo-Emperors by his side, and they would charge into the Primitive Abyss and attempt to break through to become Emperors.","Of course, if one hadn’t become a Pseudo-Emperor, they wouldn’t need to take risks.","After all, it was too difficult to obtain the cultivation resources in the Primitive Abyss. It could easily kill a Great Emperor.","\"Little Han, are we going to a Land of Death to show off next?\" the large black dog asked in excitement.","Because Zhang Yu was already dead, the side of the Lands of Death did not know that Ling Han had already advanced into the level of Pseudo-Emperor, and possessed battle prowess on the level of Great Emperor Tier.","Thus, wasn’t this the best chance to show off?","Ling Han was speechless, \"Can’t you use better words?\"","A dignified Great Emperor was someone who had ruled his own era, so how could it be that his power was used to show off?","\"Swaggering around?\" Sure enough, the large black dog changed his words.","\"And you are a dog who uses the power of others to bully!\" Ling Han mocked.","This was a derogatory term, but the large black dog didn’t mind at all.","Wasn’t it a dog?","Ling Han sighed, but then smiled and said, \"Aren’t these guys looking for us? Fine, we’ll deliver ourselves to their doorstep.\"","All these years, those like Zhang Yu and the other fallen Imperial Sons had all been searching for Four Origin Planet. Even if they couldn’t find Ling Han, they would still find the empress and the others to use to threaten Ling Han.","Thankfully, with Ding Shu and the others here, they could bring the planets along with them and escape, and with the presence of Buddha Doga and the others, it was not difficult for them to protect themselves.","After all, they were Pseudo-Emperors, and if they were intent on fleeing, even a Great Emperor would have to make some prior arrangements before they could detain them.","Going to a Land of Death now, that would definitely be showing off. Thus, those like the empress and Chi Menghan and the others definitely could not be bothered to go. Those who went were all show-offs.","For example, the large black dog and the little azure dragon. Brother Monkey didn’t want to join in on the excitement. He was going to cultivate in seclusion, cultivating to the level of a nine-star Saint as soon as possible, breaking through to the level of Pseudo-Emperor, and then, be able to go to the Primitive Abyss to see his ancestor.","Thus, Ling Han brought the large black dog and little azure dragon with him, and added with the rock golem, the four of them entered the great universe that had transformed into the Netherworld.","Right now, he had battle prowess on the level of a Great Emperor. With the golden path unfurled, and with Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, he arrived at the core area of the universe in just half a day’s time.","This place was filled with extinguished stars, and it was filled with an air of death.","Ling Han nodded. This corresponded to the essence of Death. However, this was only a branch of the essence of Death, and could not possibly be used to grasp the essence of Death.","If he had to be honest, this was a manifestation of the Regulations of Death. It would be better to call it the Regulations of Death.","What corresponded to the Living Realm was the Regulations of Life.","It was very difficult to locate a specific star in such a colossal universe. However, it was simple to just locate those stars that had life.","The Chang Clan.","The descendants of the Four Directions Great Emperor, and they had control of the Galaxy Network. They were the wealthiest force in the entire universe, and there was no other that could match them.","Ling Han’s first target was the Chang Clan, and it was naturally because of Galaxy Network.","He was going to retrieve the Galaxy Network.","An earthen-yellow star appeared in front of the three of them. Only this star was still exuding the aura of life, and appeared unique among the dead silent stars in the surroundings.","\"Let’s go!\" the large black dog said excitedly. He couldn’t wait to show off.","They set out, and the rock golem also wanted to follow, but was stopped by Ling Han.","\"Big Rock, wait for a while.\"","If the rock golem also fell at the same time, then the Chang Clan’s star would be equivalent to being struck by hundreds of billions of stars at the same time. It was guaranteed that it would be instantly turned into nothing.","En, the biggest use of the rock golem was to smash people, right?","Xiu, xiu, xiu! The three of them broke through the outer defenses of the planet, and landed on the ground.","This place... was filled with song and dance, and was completely unaffected by the Netherworld.","Ling Han’s eyes sharpened. When he thought of the people who had died in vain in the entire universe, he felt an urge to shatter the skies here, so that the aura of the Netherworld would surge in, turning this place into a dead star as well."]},{"number":4820,"title":"Chapter 4820: Acting around","paragraphs":["\"Come with Grandpa Dog!\" The large black dog crossed its front paws behind its back as it walked at the forefront. This was a perfect example of how a dog would use the power of others to bully.","Er, this idiom could be said to be very appropriate.","If one looked again at the shining iron underwear, then the word ’sleazy’ would have to be added, making Ling Han and the little azure dragon unable to bear looking at it directly.","It was too blinding.","The three of them swaggered onwards just like that, heading straight for the ancestral grounds of the Chang Clan.","How fast were their speed? In just half a day, they had already arrived at their destination.","This was still because the large black dog deliberately walked slowly, paving the way for him to show off.","Originally, the ancestral grounds of the Imperial Clan were all protected by the imperial formation, but now, the imperial formation of the Chang Clan was not channelled.","Usually, no one would dare barge into the Imperial Clan, what more now. There were not many living people in the galaxy.","Moreover, the Chang Clan’s Great Emperor was still alive, so what need was there for an imperial formation?","However, without the protection of the imperial formation, it did not mean that anyone could enter into the ancestral grounds.","There were guards here, and normal people would have to undergo strict inspection when entering and exiting. However, if it was a core member of the Chang Clan, they could come and go as they liked, and no guards would step up to question them.","The large black dog pretended to walk over.","A large black dog walked on its hind legs. This was already very strange. After all, a Demonic Beast would take human form after cultivating to the Celestial Path. This was more in line with the Dao of heaven and earth.","However, this large black dog was actually wearing a pair of shiny iron underwear, so he was naturally even more eye-catching.","All of a sudden, everyone’s eyes were focused on the large black dog.","Faced with these strange gazes, not only did the large black dog not feel the slightest discomfort, he instead became excited, and said, \"Open your stupid eyes, and admire your gods!\"","\"Hehe, a wild dog actually dares to speak conceited nonsense. Capture him, and we’ll have dog meat for dinner.\" A person immediately walked out with a smile, and grabbed out at the large black dog.","The large black dog was enraged. ’Can’t you see that I’m showing off?’","He actually dared to undermine Grandpa Dog!","\"Eat dog meat your head!\" It shot out a kick. Xiu, that person instantly flew into the skies, as if he had turned into a star.","This!","\"How dare you! You actually dare to commit violence!\" The people in the surroundings were all enraged.","This was the ancestral grounds of the Chang Clan. The people here were basically all members of the Chang Clan, and a small number of them were servants, as well as the descendants of their servants through the generations.","Thus, they naturally worked together, and were completely unanimous.","\"Be careful, this demonic dog’s abilities are extraordinary,\" an old man said darkly.","\"Hiss, even you do not have the confidence to apprehend him?\" When the people in the surroundings heard this, they all inhaled sharply.","This old man’s name was Chang Jianyun, and he was a Spiritual Transformation True Lord. Among them, his cultivation level was the highest.","Thus, even Chang Jianyun had reminded them that the large black dog was not weak, which naturally stunned everyone.","\"Let me give it a try.\" A man in a tight-fitting black suit walked out.","Chang Ruohe, a True Self Tier.","Chang Jianyun nodded, \"Ruohe, you go and test out its strength. You cannot be careless.\"","\"Understood.\" Chang Ruohe nodded, then walked towards the large black dog.","Boom, he unhesitatingly released the power in his body. He was going all out in this attack.","The large black dog acted as if he was facing a great enemy, then said, \"You guys actually sent a True Self Tier to deal with Grandpa Dog. You guys are really cautious, and know how powerful Grandpa Dog is.\"","Seeing the large black dog’s expression, Chang Ruohe instantly breathed a sigh of relief.","By the looks of it, the other was also at the True Self Tier. It was because of this that he was so cautious and nervous.","\"Come!\" he shouted loudly, and charged towards the large black dog.","\"Do you think I’m afraid of you?\" The large black dog also roared, and charged towards Chang Ruohe.","Peng, peng, peng! The man and dog began fighting, and the scene was incredibly intense.","\"Humph, I really don’t know where this wild dog came from. A mere True Self Tier cultivator dares to be impudent!\" Seeing this, everyone was relieved.","As it turned out, the large black dog was only so-so. He had almost been scared off by it.","\"Despicable dog, hurry up and give up resistance. Perhaps we can spare your wretched <anno data-annotation-id=\"4507a2de-2b3f-45c4-bbea-0ad1ecf9e9b2\" data-title=\"life.\">life. 1 </anno>\" Chang Ruohe was also relieved, and showed an expression of pride.","\"Pu!\"","\"This really is a dog’s life.\"","\"Haha, that’s too vivid.\"","Everyone burst into laughter. Even Chang Ruohe couldn’t help but smile. He had not thought that his casual remark would actually become a golden line.","The large black dog bawled loudly, \"Grandpa Dog is about to die from fury. Looks like Grandpa Dog will have to flip out!\"","\"Humph, so what if you flip out?\" Chang Ruohe asked calmly.","\"Look at Grandpa Dog’s amazing Overlord Technique, Three Lives Invincible Divine Claw!\" The large black dog put on an act, then delivered a palm strike.","Peng, with just a single strike, Chang Ruohe was sent flying, turning into a small star in the skies.","Meanwhile, the large black dog plopped down, panting heavily, and said, \"You actually forced me to use an amazing technique, causing Grandpa Dog’s vitality to be greatly damaged, and losing a dozen over years of my lifespan!\"","The members of the Chang Clan looked at each other in confusion.","Logically speaking, they did not believe the large black dog’s words. What kind of amazing technique could have such explosive power? However, the large black dog was also an excellent actor, acting to the point that they could not help but suspect that there was such a possibility.","What exactly was it?","Chang Jianyun had no choice but to step out. Among the people present, his cultivation level was the highest. If he did not make a move, could it be that he would allow others to become cannon fodder?","Moreover, this was the ancestral grounds of the Chang Clan. A despicable dog actually dared to strut around here?","It wouldn’t be long before elites came over and suppressed him.","Thus, he only needed to hold up the fort and buy some time.","\"Who exactly are you?\" Chang Jianyun shouted at the large black dog.","\"You don’t even know Grandpa Dog?\" The large black dog pointed at himself, and said, \"I’m the most powerful Ancestral King in history... Black Emperor!\"","Chang Jianyun couldn’t help but look furious. This was clearly playing around with him.","Who would show off like this?","Great Emperor, ptui!","\"So you’re just a pretentious dog!\" he said <anno data-annotation-id=\"9c580223-b86b-4dec-8895-f6f5b628cfe2\" data-title=\"disdainfully\">disdainfully 1 </anno>.","P-pretentious dog!","The large black dog clutched his chest. Unfortunately, his heart had taken another blow.","As a dog, could it be a cardinal sin?","\"Foolish human, you actually created so many malicious words. Grandpa Dog truly detests you deeply!\" The large black dog bared his fangs and brandished his claws.","\"Pretentious dog, surrender your life!\" When Chang Jianyun saw this, he immediately charged out.","At this moment, the large black dog’s emotions were fluctuating. If he made a move now, it was almost certain that he would succeed.","Boom, his palm arrived. A Spirit Transformation True Lord’s full strength burst forth, and Regulations appeared.","\"So powerful, you are forcing Grandpa Dog to use another amazing move.\" The large black dog let out a strange cry, \"Look at Grandpa Dog’s Ten Lives Dominating Heaven Kick!\"","Peng!","The large black dog unleashed a sneaky kick at Chang Jianyun’s crotch.","That sound caused everyone to feel a phantom pain.","Chang Jianyun’s face instantly became incredibly pale. His hands couldn’t help but cover his crotch, and his legs were also clamped tightly together. After trembling a few times, peng, he collapsed onto the ground. His forehead was covered with cold sweat, and only low moans could be heard from his throat.","It wasn’t that it didn’t hurt, but that it hurt so much that he couldn’t even cry out in pain.","Everyone looked at the large black dog. Hiss, this guy was really ruthless.","<annotations style=\"display: none;\">Actually, ’wretched life’ can also be literally translated to ’dog’s life’.Someone who likes to show off might be referred to as a pretentious dog, but does not literally mean that they are a dog.</annotations>"]},{"number":4821,"title":"Chapter 4821: Number one in all eternity","paragraphs":["Everyone had only seen the large black dog’s despicable side, yet had overlooked it because of this. What qualified him to cripple a Spirit Transformation True Lord with a single kick?","\"What a despicable dog!\"","Everyone rebuked. This dog was really too mean. He actually kicked someone’s b@lls, and had even shattered them.","Meanwhile, the large black dog snickered. He was the type to disgust others.","\"Humph, who dares to be impudent here?\" A cold voice rang out, and a young man strode over from the sky.","He looked to be only in his twenties, yet he was shockingly already at the level of Sect Master. As he stood there, his aura surged, like a vast ocean.","Everyone hurriedly paid their respects, \"Greetings, Young Master Qi!\"","This person’s name was Ma Jianqi, and he was not a member of the Chang Clan. Instead, he was the descendant of a servant of the Chang Clan.","But why did a servant have such a high status?","That was because that ancestor of Ma Jianqi’s was too extraordinary. Though he had come from the background of servants, his natural talent in cultivation was astonishing. He had actually broken through all the way to become a Saint.","Saints would be treated with high standards no matter which Imperial Clan they went to.","Thus, this ancestor of the Ma Clan had also changed from a servant to a guest official of the Chang Clan, and the line of the Ma Clan had also changed from servants to guards, and their status had risen <anno data-annotation-id=\"a9b3d8d1-20f3-4bb8-873e-0b6b85f48bfa\" data-title=\"greatly\">greatly 1 </anno>.","Though Ma Jianqi’s status could not be compared to the Imperial Son, but compared to an ordinary member of the Chang Clan, his status was not just a little bit higher.","And now, Ma Jianqi had arrived. This was a Sect Master, so how could it be that he could not deal with a despicable dog?","Ma Jianqi was extremely arrogant, and merely humphed. Then, he turned to look at the large black dog, and said calmly, \"Kneel.\"","\"Onionhead, your mouth is really despicable!\" The large black dog picked his nose.","This caused everyone to scoff. Just how despicable was your own mouth? Don’t you have any idea?","And he still dared to say that another person was despicable!","\"At first, I wanted to take you in as a demon pet, but you are seeking your own death!\" Ma Jianqi declared coldly.","He had never been a good-tempered person.","For those Imperial Sons, Imperial Sons in reserve, and so on of Imperial Clans, though they were incredibly proud, and looked down on everyone in the world, when dealing with others, they would give off an amiable feeling.","This was self-restraint.","However, Ma Jianqi didn’t have such self-restraint, because he felt that it was hypocritical.","He was that noble, so why did he have to treat such a lowly person warmly?","\"Die!\" Ma Jianqi roared as he lashed out at the large black dog.","\"Goodness, even a Sect Master is here. Then Grandpa Dog has to use my trump card.\" The large black dog called out strangely, \"Look at Grandpa Dog’s Hundred Lives Glorious Kick.\"","Peng!","With a kick, Ma Jianqi was also covering his crotch. His face was as white as a sheet, and he collapsed weakly onto the ground, bowing like a cooked shrimp.","His b@lls were shattered, and it was extremely painful.","F***!","Everyone grimaced upon seeing this. Just how many ultimate techniques did this large black dog have?","If a Venerate Tier came, would you still use the Thousand Lives Claws or whatnot?","It was very clear that this despicable dog’s true cultivation level was definitely above the Sect Master-level. Otherwise, how could he have kicked the other party’s b@lls so easily?","\"Show-off dog!\"","\"You really are a show-off dog!\"","\"You’re too good at pretending!\"","\"However, it’s at least Venerate Tier-level. Is there any need to show off to minor characters like us?\"","\"The taste is too poor.\"","Everyone discussed spiritedly, all of them seeing through to the large black dog’s true colours.","The large black dog naturally heard this, yet he was completely unconcerned.","What it enjoyed was the process of showing off. It was fine as long as it was satisfied, so it didn’t care what others said.","\"Sigh, what’s the point?\" He patted Ma Jianqi’s head, \"Grandpa Dog has already told you. Grandpa Dog is the strongest Great Emperor of all eternity, and you still dare to make a move on Grandpa Dog. Isn’t that just your own doing?\"","Right now, Ma Jianqi’s b@lls were hurting like crazy. Cold sweat was pouring down his forehead, and he couldn’t speak at all. He could only listen to the large black dog ramble on and on.","This was too much of a bully.","Didn’t you see that his b@lls had already been shattered? Furthermore, they had been shattered by your kick, and you actually want to use words to attack him further.","As he talked, there was finally movement in the ancestral grounds of the Chang Clan.","Xiu, xiu, xiu! This time, a considerable number of figures directly flew out.","When they saw the large black dog, they all inhaled sharply.","\"Despicable Saint!\"","’Holy f*ck!’","The large black dog was immediately displeased, \"What Despicable Saint? Do you guys know how to talk?\"","\"Grandpa Dog is the greatest Despicable Saint of all eternity!\"","Pu!","The members of the Chang Clan almost vomited blood and fainted in unison. At first, they had thought that the large black dog was displeased with the words \"Despicable Saint\", but they had never imagined that he thought that the words \"Despicable Saint\" were not enough to show how despicable he was!","Hiss, to be as despicable as this, was this something that had never happened before in history?","However, this large black dog was actually a Saint?","Heavens, how could there be such a despicable Saint?","Everyone found this to be inconceivable. Such a despicable character could actually become a Saint? The heaven and earth must be blind!","The large black dog looked askance at them. Among the seven people who had come, there was indeed a Saint among them, and that was why he had recognized him.","However, this Saint was only a Three Star Saint, and what about the large black dog?","Five Stars!","The gap was too wide, so it naturally did not take it to heart at all.","\"Old brat, tell me your name,\" the large black dog boldly said.","\"My title is Seven Origin,\" the Saint from the Chang Clan said.","\"Go, call out that old geezer from your clan, the Great Emperor. Grandpa Dog has something to say to him,\" the large black dog said in an incredibly show-off manner.","A Great Emperor, ruling his own era, just how powerful was he?","To the Imperial Clan, the Great Emperor that had appeared before was their supreme pride. That was deeply engraved into their bones and blood, and not the slightest bit of blasphemy could be tolerated.","And to the Chang Clan, the Four Directions Great Emperor had not died at all. He had existed for eternity, which naturally made them even prouder, viewing him as a god.","How could gods... be blasphemed?","All of a sudden, furious expressions spread across everyone’s faces, killing intent blazing. They were going to fight the large black dog to the death.","Meanwhile, the Seven Origin Saint didn’t look at the large black dog again. Instead, he started to search around.","According to the information he knew, though the large black dog had a bad mouth, it was afraid of death. Thus, it would definitely not come alone to seek death.","As expected!","His eyes swept over the surroundings, and very soon, he had located Ling Han.","Previously, Ling Han had been concealing his aura, appearing extremely ordinary. Thus, even the Seven Origin Saint had not been able to discover him with a single glance.","\"Ling Han!\" he called out, his voice trembling slightly.","The number one Saint of all eternity!","Unlike the large black dog’s despicableness, Ling Han’s title of number one was indeed powerful, and his reputation was unprecedented in both the past and present.","Of course, according to legends, this person was also capable of matching a Pseudo-Emperor, a fact that the Seven Origin Saint actually did not quite believe.","Hehe, how could that be possible?","He was also a Saint. How could it be that he did not know just how massive the gap was between a Saint and a Pseudo-Emperor?","Really, this was really too boastful.","\"So it is the arrival of the strongest Saint of all eternity. Please forgive our Chang Clan for not coming out to receive you,\" the Seven Origin Saint said, neither servile nor overbearing. However, he had already sent out a message, informing Chang Tingjian to come.","Ling Han was the strongest Saint in all eternity, and he was absolutely certain of this fact. Thus, there was no Saint in their clan that could possibly be a match for Ling Han.","However, Chang Tingjian, the son of the Great Emperor, a dignified Pseudo-Emperor, how could it be that he would not be able to suppress a Saint?","<annotations style=\"display: none;\">Guest official is a term in Ancient China, used to refer to a person from one feudal state serving in the court of another</annotations>"]},{"number":4822,"title":"Chapter 4822: Crushed B@lls","paragraphs":["Ling Han remained silent.","The Seven Origin Saint couldn’t help but look furious, \"Ling Han, although you are the strongest Saint of all eternity, don’t you think you are too arrogant?\"","Ling Han waved his hand dismissively, \"You are not yet qualified to speak to me.\"","The large black dog continued, \"Old brat, you are not qualified to speak with my Little Han. You are only worthy of being my dog — ptui!\" He suddenly flew into a rage, and said to Ling Han, \"Little Han, what you mean is that Grandpa Dog is inferior to you?\"","Ling Han spread his hands and said, \"You were the one who said it. It has nothing to do with me.\"","\"F***, Grandpa Dog will bite you to death!\" The large black dog pounced over.","Seeing the man and dog exchange blows, the members of the Chang Clan were all dumbfounded.","’Are you people... here to show off?’","But this was the Chang Clan!","\"You guys... have you had enough!\" the Seven Origin Saint said through gritted teeth. He felt that this kind of act as if there was no one around was the greatest humiliation to the Chang Clan.","\"Old brat, are you asking for a beating?\" The large black dog leaped out, and had already arrived in front of the Seven Origin Saint. He waved his paw in a strike.","The Seven Origin Saint was only apprehensive of Ling Han, so he naturally wasn’t afraid of the \"Despicable Saint\". He immediately launched a palm strike.","\"Watch as One Life Heavenly Pride!\" The large black dog’s giant black dog launched another sneaky kick, aimed directly between the legs of the Seven Origin Saint.","However, the Seven Origin Saint was a Saint, after all. Even if he was two minor levels lower than the large black dog, he could not possibly be so weak that he would be hit with a single strike.","The old Saint hurriedly used his palms to block this strike. Peng! This sneaky kick landed on his palm.","With a bang, the Seven Origin Saint was sent flying.","Everyone gaped in shock. That was the Seven Origin Saint! In their eyes, this was practically equivalent to being invincible!","But now?","He was sent flying with a single kick.","In an instant, the Seven Origin Saint had already stepped into the sky and returned. However, both of his hands were slightly misshapen.","Saints were hard to kill, but it could not be helped that this was a lower-level Saint clashing head-on with a higher-level Saint.","In the first place, the large black dog’s battle prowess was slightly stronger than Saints of the same cultivation level, what more when he had a lead of two minor levels over the Seven Origin Saint. Yet, the Seven Origin Saint still insisted on facing it head-on. This was actually an action of courting death.","It was already very fortunate that he had not been killed, and only had both his arms crippled.","The old Saint’s expression was extremely livid. He had actually been wounded by a despicable dog in a single move. This was a great humiliation to him.","But more importantly, this despicable dog was actually aiming for his b@lls.","This was what was even more intolerable.","If it was not for the fact that he had protected himself in time, he would probably have become the first Saint in history to have his b@lls crushed.","How could he tolerate this? How could he not be furious?","\"Despicable dog!\" he shouted loudly, his killing intent blazing.","The large black dog waved his paw and corrected, saying, \"No, no, no, it’s the number one Despicable Saint of all eternity! Don’t forget the word ’eternity’ and the words ’number one’.\"","’Holy f*ck!’","The Seven Origin Saint roared in fury, and charged towards the large black dog.","This time, he knew that his strength was inferior to the large black dog, so he did not attack from close quarters. Instead, he drew out the distance between them and began a bombardment.","The large black dog didn’t pay any heed to this, and he simply continued to exchange blows with his opponent.","\"Old brat, your abilities are not good enough.\"","\"You’re already so old, so how could it be that your cultivation has all been for nothing?\"","\"Hey, hey, hey, what are you glaring at me for? Could it be that you think that Grandpa Dog is wrong?\"","The large black dog spat as he continued to pummel his opponent.","At first, the Seven Origin Saint was still bickering with the large black dog, but after a few words, he gave up on this idea.","This was even more tiring than battle, causing him to rack his brains. In fact, even his movements were slowed down by this.","It couldn’t be helped. The large black dog’s ability to curse and battle was instinctive, and there was no need for him to use his brain at all. However, he was different. He had to respond seriously, or how could he refute the large black dog’s words? After all, he was a Saint, so how could he speak so easily?","After battling for a while, more elites from the Chang Clan appeared.","This time, it was awesome.","Chang Yu, a nine-star Saint!","Excluding the Primitive Abyss Saints, there were actually very few Saints in the great world, and nine-star Saints were even rarer. If one were to exclude those that lived in seclusion, there would probably only be as many as to be counted on the fingers of a single hand.","Thus, Chang Yu, a nine-star Saint, was naturally very impressive.","\"Stop!\" he shouted softly.","The Seven Origin Saint hurriedly stepped back in response. Before a nine-star Saint, he was nothing more than a junior.","Meanwhile, the large black dog lazily asked, \"Didn’t I tell you to summon the Great Emperor who’s old but doesn’t die?\"","\"How dare you!\" Chang Yu humphed, and immediately delivered a palm strike at the large black dog.","However, he had just raised his hand, when Ling Han moved as well. With a light wave of his hand, Chang Yu’s attack was dispersed.","\"Ling Han!\" Chang Yu looked over, his white brows raised, \"I have long heard that there is a Saint that is known as the strongest in all eternity. I was really filled with doubt.\"","As a nine-star Saint, he could be said to have a very strong say about the power level of Saints. Thus, he thought that Ling Han’s strength must have been exaggerated.","The strongest in all eternity. Hehe, did he really think that that was a title that he could simply bestow on himself?","The large black dog coughed, \"Little Han, it’s your turn to show off.\"","\"Let’s invite the Show-off King to make a grand entrance!\" The little azure dragon, who had been left hanging on the sidelines for a long time, suddenly said.","These two idiots!","Ling Han sighed, and couldn’t be bothered to pay any heed to the two of them. He turned to Chang Yu, and said, \"Come and try. I’ll torture you to the point of doubting life!\"","\"Tsk, these words are filled with dominance,\" the large black dog remarked.","\"However, the sense of showing off is even stronger,\" the little azure dragon also said.","Chang Yu’s expression changed drastically. He was a Nine-Star Saint. Before the Lords of Death and the sons of the Great Emperors appeared, he had represented the strongest. What kind of authority did he have?","And now, he was actually being mocked repeatedly, so how could he not be furious?","When one had reached a height that he had, he would kill at the slightest provocation. All life was like ants to him, and he would not take them to heart at all.","\"You’re seeking death!\" He moved again, and delivered a palm strike at the large black dog and little azure dragon.","Ling Han shook his head, and also sent out a palm strike.","\"You think you can stop me?\" Chang Yu asked with a cold chuckle. He unleashed his full strength as a nine-star Saint.","Peng!","Ling Han delivered a slap, and Chang Yu was instantly sent rolling on the ground.","What!","All of a sudden, the members of the Chang Clan were all dumbfounded.","In their eyes, though the Great Emperor was invincible, and the Imperial Son was freakish, in truth, the person they were most familiar with was still this ancestor of theirs.","For hundreds of thousands of years, this ancestor had been standing guard over the Chang Clan like a boulder.","Thus, when they saw Chang Yu being sent flying with a single slap, they were practically beginning to doubt their own lives.","How was this possible?","Then, they looked towards Ling Han.","The show-off king, this was the show-off king.","Previously, he had allowed the despicable dog to rampage around, drawing enough aggro, which led to Chang Yu making a move. At first, he had thought that he would be able to sweep aside all opposition, but what happened in the end?","He was sent flying with a single slap.","Sure enough, the show-off king had deep schemes.","Right at this moment, a black shadow streaked out at an extraordinarily fast speed.","It was... the large black dog.","Peng!","The large black dog rushed in front of Chang Yu, and shot out a kick, which landed between Chang Yu’s legs.","At first, Chang Yu had already passed out, but with this kick, he forcefully regained consciousness. He directly sat up straight, his whole head of white hair exploding.","’Holy f*ck! As expected of the Despicable Saint!’"]},{"number":4823,"title":"Chapter 4823: Second Elder is Invincible!","paragraphs":["The members of the Chang Clan were all furious.","This was too despicable. A few outsiders had come to the ancestral grounds of the Chang Clan to strut around, and had even pressed and ground their ancestor into the ground..","The pitiful old ancestor was forcefully kicked out of his coma.","Definitely, even the b@lls had been shattered.","This despicable dog was just that ruthless.","But the problem was, even their ancestor had been defeated in an instant, so what could they do?","\"Second Elder!\" they all called out.","Second Elder, Chang Tingjian, Pseudo-Emperor!","Boom! A terrifying aura swept over, and as expected, Chang Tingjian appeared.","He had no choice but to step out. Aside from himself, who else could match Ling Han?","\"Ling Han, you are really outrageously bold!\" Chang Tingjian said calmly. He was filled with confidence.","This was the ancestral grounds of the Chang Clan, where the Four Directions Great Emperor was hidden. Thus, even if Ling Han possessed Pseudo-Emperor-level battle prowess, so what? Since he had walked right to their doorstep, his only fate was death.","\"Hehe, I have indeed always been very bold,\" Ling Han admitted bluntly.","\"However, you’re seeking death this time!\" Chang Tingjian immediately added.","\"Oh?\" Ling Han shook his head, then looked towards the large black dog, \"At this time, how should I answer to be able to show off fully?\"","\"Hiss!\" The large black dog sucked in a sharp breath, appearing extremely stunned, \"As a great show-off, you actually have to ask Grandpa Dog for guidance on how to show off?\"","\"This is too much of a show-off!\" The little azure dragon also nodded.","Sigh, these two guys!","Chang Tingjian’s expression was filled with fury, and he shouted, \"Ling Han, have you forgotten? This is the ancestral grounds of our Chang Clan, and my father... is still alive!\"","\"Yi, do you have the hobby of acknowledging a ghost as your father?\" Ling Han asked curiously, \"Or do you not know? Your old man has long since died, and now he is neither human nor ghost. If he went out in the middle of the night, he would definitely scare someone to death.\"","Chang Tingjian couldn’t hold himself back any longer. With a battle cry, he charged towards Ling Han.","The authority of a Great Emperor could not be sullied.","He charged over, and delivered a palm strike, as if it was a divine saber.","Ling Han couldn’t help but chuckle, saying, \"You’re truly bold. Aren’t you afraid that your planet will be obliterated if you battle here?\"","Only then did Chang Tingjian’s heart shudder, and he hurriedly withdrew his hand.","However, forcibly stopping under such conditions also caused a considerable impact on him, causing his chest to boil, and he almost spat out a mouthful of blood.","\"Despicable!\"","\"Shameless!\"","\"How filthy!\"","The members of the Chang Clan were all enraged. They could naturally see how much impact Chang Tingjian’s forceful withdrawal of his attack had on him.","As expected of Despicable Saints, both of them were.","Chang Tingjian forcefully suppressed his urge to attack, and said balefully, \"Let’s battle in the sky!\"","\"Why should I listen to you?\" Ling Han said with a smile. \"What a joke. I’m here to crash the party. Once I’m in the sky, how am I supposed to crash the party?\"","This... was very logical.","Just like if he went to the Four Origin Planet to fight Ling Han, would he have any scruples?","He would not, so how could he possibly ask Ling Han to do the same?","However, a Pseudo-Emperor was too strong. Even if Great Emperors moved, it was impossible that they could force a Pseudo-Emperor to the point of not being able to unleash the slightest move. In that case, if only the slightest sliver of a shockwave seeped out, it could not be too easy for them to destroy a planet.","This!","’Are you aware of this fact? Is that why you’ve come so boldly, so that the Four Directions Great Emperor could be forced to hold back?’","\"Ling Han, I’ve always thought that you were an upright person. I never thought that you would be so despicable! Humph, what do you mean by the strongest Saint of all eternity? You only have an empty reputation!\" Chang Tingjian tried to goad him into action.","Ling Han cracked a smile, \"You are absolutely right. I am not some strongest Saint in all eternity.\"","Yi!","Everyone was rendered speechless. ’You’re already so shameless? That’s truly despicable to the point of being invincible. There’s no angle that others could attack.’","However, Ling Han continued, \"I am the strongest Great Emperor of all eternity!\"","’Holy f*ck!’","Everyone couldn’t help but grimace. Was he made from the same mold as the large black dog?","It was all because he had f****** displayed his shamelessness to the extreme.","Just look, everyone had thought that he was self-centred and not the strongest Saint of all eternity, but in the end? His skin was so thick that he was already claiming to be the strongest Great Emperor.","Faced with this kind of person, would verbal attacks be effective?","Others would be the ones who would be dying from fury!","Chang Tingjian was also at his wit’s end. Though his cultivation level had improved, he did not have the slightest confidence that he could defeat Ling Han. Once the battle began, it was very likely that the two of them would be locked in a stalemate.","In this way, would this star still exist?","Even if it had been reinforced by the power of a Great Emperor, it could only withstand the attacks of Saints. Pseudo-Emperors were completely different concepts.","At this moment, Chang Tingjian didn’t know how to respond.","But how could it be that it would allow the three of them to act arrogant and insolent here?","What face would the Imperial Clan have left? What face would he, a Pseudo-Emperor, have? What face would the Four Directions Great Emperor have left?","\"Alright, since you want to fight me so much, then come fight me.\" Ling Han leaped out, and had already arrived in space.","Although Chang Tingjian didn’t know why Ling Han was yielding, this was something he wanted more than anything else. He naturally couldn’t refuse, and he hurriedly rose into the sky as well.","\"For the sake of this, I’ll try my best to leave your corpse intact,\" he said calmly.","\"You think you can?\" Ling Han asked with a smile.","These words were filled with contempt, but Chang Tingjian was unable to refute them.","He indeed did not have the confidence to defeat Ling Han, what more kill him.","\"Don’t forget, there’s also a Great Emperor here!\" Chang Tingjian said proudly.","\"Er, aren’t we going to use quotation marks on that?\" Ling Han’s expression was filled with confusion.","F***!","Chang Tingjian shouted loudly, and charged towards Ling Han. He could not tolerate Ling Han insulting his father.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","A Pseudo-Emperor unleashed his might, boundlessly terrifying.","A terrifying power surged, and the surrounding stars exploded one after another. Thankfully, they were far enough away from where the Chang Clan was located. Otherwise, even if they were battling in space, so what? They would still be unable to escape the fate of shattering.","\"Yo, your abilities have improved quite a bit,\" Ling Han remarked as he casually parried.","Though this was a compliment, Chang Tingjian wasn’t happy at all. Instead, he was furious.","What kind of tone was that?","’Do you think you’re my senior?’","\"Do you think I’ve wasted all these years?\" Chang Tingjian said with a cold chuckle. His attacks became even more rapid.","He had already advanced into Three Star Pseudo-Emperor. After reviving his body three times, his grasp of Nine Star Regulations had improved greatly, and his battle prowess was astonishing.","He aggressively charged forward, beating down on Ling Han.","\"Second Elder is mighty!\"","\"Second Elder is so domineering!\"","Below, the members of the Chang Clan could see clearly through the Galaxy Network, and they were all incredibly excited, shouting in excitement.","This was a Pseudo-Emperor-level battle; how many times could they see a battle like this in a lifetime?","Moreover, their Second Elder was at an absolute advantage.","This naturally made them numb with excitement.","\"Second Elder is invincible!\"","\"Second Elder has hemorrhoids!\"","Right at this moment, a calm voice rang out. It was clearly not loud, but it was incredibly clear, as if it could penetrate one’s brain.","F***, who was causing trouble here?","Everyone turned to look, only to see the large black dog had his back to them, and one of his paws was scratching at his iron underwear.","\"I’ve been a little constipated recently. Is it because of hemorrhoids?\"","D-d*mn dog!"]},{"number":4824,"title":"Chapter 4824: Pseudo-Emperor as Servant","paragraphs":["Now, Chang Tingjian was suppressing Ling Han. He was mighty and domineering, and everyone was excited. However, a despicable dog had spoken rudely, completely ruining the atmosphere.","Who could tolerate this?","Yet, this despicable dog was actually a Saint!","The heavens must be blind.","Most people only dared to feel furious, and did not dare to speak. Even the Seven Origin Saint felt lingering fear in his heart. This despicable dog specialized in kicking people in their cr*tch. Just look, his ancestor was still covering his cr*tch now. He had no wish to repeat the same mistake.","He had to endure it first!","As long as Ling Han was killed, they would be able to deal with this despicable dog as they pleased.","\"Old Black, if looks could kill, you’d have died a few hundred times already,\" the little azure dragon said sarcastically.","\"Pei!\" The large black dog spat, \"They are worshipping me. You are just a child, so you don’t understand!\"","Seeing how shameless the large black dog was, the members of the Chang Clan felt an urge to go all out again.","This was too despicable.","In space, Chang Tingjian was still battling fiercely with Ling Han.","Of course, the so-called fierce battle was only his own wishful thinking.","He was very pleased now. He was completely on the upper hand here, beating down on Ling Han and rebuilding the invincible confidence as the son of a Great Emperor.","After all, they were all mortals!","After so many years, he was walking further and further on the path of Pseudo-Emperor. He had already cultivated a sliver of Nine Star Regulations, and finally possessed the might of Pseudo-Emperor. He was no longer that person who only had Pseudo-Emperor power.","Thus, Ling Han was no match for him.","\"Ling Han, I have to admit that I am impressed by your courage!\" he said calmly, \"Unfortunately, you have come to the wrong place. This is the Chang Clan!\"","These words were broadcasted live on the Galaxy Network, and were heard by every member of the Chang Clan. They were all numb with excitement.","The Chang Clan was invincible!","At the very top, there was an invincible Great Emperor standing guard, while below, there was a Pseudo-Emperor. As long as the heaven and earth allowed it, a second Great Emperor could appear at any time.","To have two Great Emperors in one clan, this was something that had never happened before in history!","Their pride as members of the Chang Clan rose up, causing their faces to flush red, and they felt an indescribable madness.","At this moment, they were willing to go through fire and water for the sake of their clan!","\"Yi, look, what is that!\" Someone suddenly exclaimed in shock.","Through the Galaxy Network, they saw that there was a small black dot rapidly approaching the battle between Ling Han and Chang Tingjian.","The Seven Origin Saint hurriedly adjusted the angle of the \"Heaven’s Eye\" in space, aiming directly at the small black dot.","In an instant, the little black dot instantly enlarged, turning into a massive... rock golem.","Everyone was astonished. Why had a rock golem suddenly appeared out of nowhere?","\"Ao, ao, ao!\" The rock golem had already arrived, and as it released a wave of divine sense-level fluctuation, it launched an attack in excitement.","It had sensed the commotion caused by the battle here, and when it saw that Ling Han was presently engaged in an intense battle, how could it tolerate it any longer!","—It was not the type to care about the strength of its opponent. If even Ling Han was no match for it, then what was the point of it charging in?","For this big guy, there was no need for a reason to fight.","Boom!","It threw a punch, and just like that, it directly smashed towards Chang Tingjian.","’Holy f*ck!’","Chang Tingjian’s hair instantly stood on end. What kind of f*cking monster was this? Why was his battle prowess so explosive?","He hurriedly leaped aside to dodge. In his eyes, the might of this attack had reached the level of an eight-star Pseudo-Emperor. If he took it head-on, he definitely wouldn’t die, but he might be injured, or even severely wounded.","\"Ao!\" The rock golem was so excited that it couldn’t even stop itself, and charged towards Chang Tingjian again.","This time, Chang Tingjian felt gloomy.","’F*ck! Can’t you see that Ling Han is closer to you? Why don’t you fight those who are closer to you? Why do you insist on chasing me?’","’By the way, where did you pop out from?’","A Pseudo-Emperor wasn’t something that could be found anywhere!","He was filled with confusion and shock.","Ling Han was also taken aback, and said with a smile, \"Big Rock, how am I supposed to show off if you do this?\"","The rock golem immediately stopped, then rubbed its massive head with its massive hand, looking silly.","However, its weight was too terrifying. Even if it was only friction between its own limbs, it still created a powerful shockwave, disturbing the surrounding space.","’F*ck!’","Chang Tingjian’s mouth instantly gaped open, as if he had seen a ghost.","What, this rock golem, a Pseudo-Emperor, was actually in the same group as Ling Han?","Furthermore, he seemed to be very obedient to Ling Han’s words.","F***, f***!","How could he believe this?","A Saint had actually subdued a Pseudo-Emperor-level rock creature?","Wasn’t this a fantasy story?","All of a sudden, his mind was in a mess.","Ling Han pondered for a moment, then said with a smile, \"Alright, since you’re already here, then just continue the fight.\"","The rock golem immediately howled again, and charged towards Chang Tingjian.","This rendered Chang Tingjian extremely speechless.","Are you a f****** dog? Why are you so obedient?","As a dignified Pseudo-Emperor, you actually still have to obey the commands of others. Don’t you have the slightest bit of pride?","However, he soon did not have the spare energy to think about these problems.","The rock golem charged over, every move fierce. The might of a nine-star Pseudo-Emperor was fully displayed, making it difficult for Chang Tingjian to parry, so how could he dare to be distracted?","Ling Han felt bored after watching for a while. He now had Great Emperor-level battle prowess. In his eyes, a Pseudo-Emperor-level battle was actually not much different from children playing around.","However, in the distance, the members of the Chang Clan all looked like they had lost both their parents.","Just now, their Second Elder had still been mighty and domineering, beating down on Ling Han, but now?","He was actually unable to fight back against a rock monster, and was in such a sorry state.","This, this, this, Ling Han actually had such a helper?","\"Let me introduce. That’s called Big Rock, the servant of our Little Han.\" The large black dog was most skilled in psychological attacks, and began to show off for Ling Han.","W-what!","Among the members of the Chang Clan, though there were pitifully few Saints, it did not stop them from confirming the fact that the rock golem was a Pseudo-Emperor.","—Didn’t they see that even Second Elder was being beaten down on?","However, a great Pseudo-Emperor, who had the word \"Emperor\" in his name, had actually become someone else’s servant and obeyed his every command. How could they accept this?","However, the truth was right in front of their eyes. They had no choice but to believe it even if they didn’t want to.","Heavens, someone could actually subdue a Pseudo-Emperor. Could even a Great Emperor do the same?","Yet it just so happened that Ling Han was still a Saint.","Could it be that it was his destiny?","All of a sudden, the morale of the Chang Clan was very low.","It could not be helped. Second Elder was presently being beaten, and Ling Han’s freakish talent had actually surpassed a Great Emperor.","\"Damn it!\" Chang Tingjian finally unleashed his trump card.","Imperial Weapon, Eternal Dragon Hammer.","Weng! He activated the Imperial Weapon, unleashing a boundless burst of light from the Eternal Dragon Hammer. The might of the Imperial Weapon permeated into the surroundings. This was genuinely Great Emperor-level.","Peng, it was only a short while, and the rock golem was sent flying with a strike.","However, its physique was too tough. Even after being hammered head-on by the Imperial Weapon, it was still unscathed, and only some scraps fell.","This time, even Chang Tingjian was stunned by what he saw.","’W-what kind of body is this?’","This was too freakish."]},{"number":4825,"title":"Chapter 4825: You have become a Great Emperor?","paragraphs":["Peng! Peng! Peng!","The rock golem continued to attack Chang Tingjian, yet Chang Tingjian kept pushing it back.","If a Pseudo-Emperor was facing an Imperial Weapon head-on, how could he possibly win?","If it was not for the fact that the rock golem’s physique was unbelievably tough, it would have long since been blasted into smithereens.","However, the rock golem’s physique was actually even tougher than the Skeleton Saint Tool, and even the Imperial Weapon could only block it. To kill it with just an Imperial Weapon, the difficulty level was really too high.","Chang Tingjian was extremely speechless.","He was also a Pseudo-Emperor, and he also had the Imperial Weapon in his hands. Yet, he was actually unable to do anything against another Pseudo-Emperor!","It should be known that the rock golem was fighting him head-on, and not delivering guerilla strikes.","Thus, this dealt a huge blow to Chang Tingjian’s confidence.","So there was actually such a freakish existence in this world.","However, he was the son of a Great Emperor, after all, so his temperament was naturally outstanding. After being dispirited for a while, he immediately pulled himself together.","He couldn’t kill the rock golem, but what about Ling Han?","’It can’t be that your physique is also this freakish, right?’","Even if Ling Han had an Imperial Weapon, could a measly Saint keep an Imperial Weapon in a constant state of revival? Even if he could, in a clash of Imperial Weapon against Imperial Weapon, he would still be able to suppress Ling Han.","As long as he could capture Ling Han, there would be no problem.","\"Die!\" He had already made up his mind, and without any further hesitation, he immediately charged towards Ling Han.","The Imperial Weapon cleared the way, and was invincible in all aspects.","\"Second Elder!\" Below them, the members of the Chang Clan were all excited as they watched.","As long as he killed Ling Han, then no matter how strong the rock golem was, it would still be an ownerless existence. Would it still fight to the death with the Chang Clan?","Moreover, if the Chang Clan was really angered, they still had a Great Emperor.","\"Kill Ling Han!\"","\"Die!\"","The large black dog and little azure dragon looked at each other, revealing a mocking smile.","’You people are far too young and naive.’","Boom! Chang Tingjian charged over, swinging his hammer at Ling Han.","Pseudo-Emperor and Imperial Weapon, just how terrifying was their might?","Peng!","Ling Han waved his hand, and Chang Tingjian was sent flying along with his hammer.","’F*ck!’","All of a sudden, the heads of the members of the Chang Clan were all muddled.","What, what was going on?","’Hmm?’","That’s not right!","That was Second Elder! Previously, he had beaten Ling Han to the point that he could not even fight back. How could it be that in the blink of an eye, the Imperial Weapon that he had used was sent flying with a wave of Ling Han’s hand?","Were they dreaming? Or was there something wrong with their eyes?","That’s right, it must be an illusion.","But when they looked again, it was still the same. Chang Tingjian flew all the way here. Peng, peng, peng!. He shattered one star after another, and actually did not stop.","They could see wrongly, but Galaxy Network’s Heaven’s Eye couldn’t!","This was broadcasted live on Galaxy Network, so how could it possibly be affected by illusions?","Heavens!","The members of the Chang Clan all wanted to grab their heads and exclaim in shock. This was f*******....","A mere Saint was actually capable of sending a Pseudo-Emperor and Imperial Weapon flying with a slap. What justice was there left in this world? What law was there left in this world?","\"Gagaga, are you shocked?\" The large black dog cackled, \"This is Grandpa Dog’s underling. Even his underling is so powerful. You guys can imagine just how powerful Grandpa Dog is, right?\"","This was a rare opportunity, so he naturally had to show off to his heart’s content.","No one paid any attention to it. The impact on the members of the Chang Clan was too strong.","How was this possible?","How was this possible!","In space, Ling Han didn’t continue to attack, but the rock golem chased after him.","At this moment, Chang Tingjian was already in a semi-unconscious state.","—The Imperial Weapon was only in the eighth tier, but Ling Han’s strength was already in the seventh tier. If an existence in the eighth tier faced someone in the seventh tier head-on, it would already be very impressive if you didn’t die.","Under the observation of the Galaxy Network, the rock golem raised its foot and ruthlessly kicked Chang Tingjian’s crotch.","Even though they were so far away, everyone involuntarily clamped their legs together.","That was a Pseudo-Emperor, so how terrifying was the force of this kick?","Even the sun could be easily destroyed with a single kick.","\"Ah!\" Chang Tingjian was forcefully awoken by the pain, and they could see that both of his eyes were bulging out of their sockets, which showed how hard this kick had been.","His b@lls had been shattered.","He, a dignified Pseudo-Emperor, the son of a Great Emperor, actually had his b@lls crushed with a kick?","Chang Tingjian had gone crazy. Brandishing the Eternal Dragon Hammer, he launched a mad barrage of attacks at the rock golem.","Meanwhile, the large black dog murmured, \"Yi, when did this Big Rock secretly learn Grandpa Dog’s ultimate move?\"","It was filled with envy. Though it had kicked a nine-star Saint’s b@lls, and it was very possible that it had created a record, in the blink of an eye, the rock golem had kicked the b@lls of a Pseudo-Emperor, and the record had been broken.","Sigh, he really wanted to become stronger. He wanted to wear the Origin Gold underwear and kick a Great Emperor’s b@lls.","Meanwhile, the little azure dragon grimaced. ’You’ve been wearing iron underwear all this while, and it’s actually to prevent your b@lls from being kicked, right?’","Just what kind of enmity do you have with b@lls? Is that really necessary?","Once Chang Tingjian woke up, the situation would be completely different.","Even if his b@lls had been kicked, and he had suffered some minor injuries, he still possessed the Imperial Weapon, after all. Thus, he was still able to immediately turn the tables and suppress the rock golem.","With a single step, he had already returned to a spot 500km away from Ling Han.","\"Y-you’ve become a Great Emperor!\" he said in a terrified voice.","Otherwise, how could he have sent him and the Imperial Weapon flying with a single strike?","A Great Emperor was invincible!","What!","Upon hearing this, the members of the Chang Clan were all astounded. They felt a cold chill run down their spines.","Previously, though they had seen Second Elder being sent flying, none of them were willing to face this reality.","Hehe, how could that be possible? A new Great Emperor had suddenly appeared in the heaven and earth.","However, even Second Elder had said so, so how could it be false?","Ling Han shook his head, and said, \"If I became a Great Emperor, I would’ve already smashed your father into smithereens.\"","\"Pseudo, Pseudo-Emperor!\" Chang Tingjian said with a bitter expression. He actually didn’t reprimand Ling Han for disrespecting his father.","He was too shocked.","Ling Han was the same as him. He was also a Pseudo-Emperor, but just how awesome was this Pseudo-Emperor?","This slap sent him and the Imperial Weapon flying. This was a genuine Emperor-level battle prowess.","They were both Pseudo-Emperors, but why are you so outstanding?","\"That’s right.\" Ling Han nodded.","After receiving an affirmative answer from Ling Han, Chang Tingjian’s expression became even uglier.","Really, Ling Han was only a Pseudo-Emperor.","There was actually such a powerful Pseudo-Emperor in this world.","He suddenly recalled that Ling Han had previously said that he was the strongest Great Emperor of all eternity.","This... if Ling Han became a Great Emperor, it was really possible that he would be bestowed this title.","In this instant, his killing intent blazed. He definitely could not allow Ling Han to take that last step. Otherwise, who would be able to be a match for Ling Han?","He released his divine sense, and began to awaken his father.","The Four Directions Great Emperor slumbered all year round, and this was to maintain his strength. Otherwise, with every step he took in the world, his strength would decrease slightly.","But now, in order to kill Ling Han, he had no choice but to awaken the Four Directions Great Emperor.","Boom, instantly, a frightening aura surged out, endless Imperial Might.","A Great Emperor had appeared!","\"It’s the Great Emperor!\"","\"Imperial Ancestor!\"","All of a sudden, the members of the Chang Clan were incredibly excited, and instantly regained their confidence.","No matter how strong you, Ling Han, are, so what? Could you be a match for a Great Emperor?","The Chang Clan was an Imperial Clan!"]},{"number":4826,"title":"Chapter 4826: Great Emperor in his strongest state","paragraphs":["The Four Directions Great Emperor appeared.","However, his whole body was enshrouded in a gray mist, and his appearance could not be seen clearly at all.","Ling Han didn’t need to see clearly. He knew that the other party was a dried corpse.","No matter how extraordinarily handsome you were when you were alive, no matter how mighty and majestic you were, once you became a dried corpse, who would still have the appetite to take another look?","\"As expected, you have become our greatest problem!\" The Four Directions Great Emperor said. His voice boomed like thunder.","Ling Han stood with his hands clasped behind his back, and said calmly, \"If I told you that the millions and millions of years that you Great Emperors have been waiting for was all for naught, and all of you have been played like monkeys, I don’t know if you would believe me or not.\"","\"Heh, do you think I’ll believe you?\" the Four Directions Great Emperor asked calmly.","As expected.","Ling Han immediately knew. Previously, it was very, very difficult to convince these Great Emperors to believe that when the Living Realm was transformed into the Netherworld, they could then pluck the chestnut from the fire, and not only could it allow one to live forever, it could also allow one’s cultivation level to advance further.","But once these Great Emperors believed it, and after millions and millions of years of scheming, wanting them to change their minds was even harder than ascending the heavens.","How could a Great Emperor not have his own opinions?","Not only did he have it, he was also incredibly stubborn.","Thus, once they were certain, even nine True Dragons wouldn’t be able to drag them back.","Ling Han cracked a smile, \"I was just saying casually, and did not have the determination to make you believe me. Hehe, I really have some conflicts. On one hand, I very much want to see your disappointed expressions, but on the other, I cannot allow you to destroy this world.\"","\"With just you?\" the Four Directions Great Emperor said. Though his tone was normal, it was exuding a powerful disdain.","’With just you? Are you even qualified?’","He was a Great Emperor, and in their case, he was one of twelve Great Emperors.","Ling Han nodded, \"Just me!\"","His words were also powerful and resonating, his majesty soaring to the heavens.","Though the members of the Chang Clan were displeased with Ling Han, faced with such lofty aspirations, they had no choice but to write the word ’admiration’ in their hearts.","Unfortunately, they were destined to become enemies, so Ling Han’s only fate would be death.","\"Since you’ve delivered yourself to my doorstep, I’ll send you on your way!\" The Four Directions Great Emperor moved. A colossal hand stretched out from within the gray mist, grabbing out at Ling Han.","\"Scram!\" Ling Han rebuked. Peng, this large hand immediately crumbled.","What!","The members of the Chang Clan were all numb with shock. A good few of them directly passed out, their limbs icy cold.","The attack of the Great Emperor was actually unsuccessful as well?","This!","You are only a Pseudo-Emperor, are you really going to defy the heavens?","The Four Directions Great Emperor also hadn’t expected this. Which person who could become a Great Emperor wasn’t a supreme prodigy?","But when he was still a Pseudo-Emperor, how could he have such battle prowess?","Thus, he couldn’t help but feel stunned, and a little disbelieving.","The might of a Pseudo-Emperor was actually extremely powerful to this extent!","Then what if Ling Han became a Great Emperor? Even if they, the twelve Emperors, advanced further, and obtained true immortality, and could go all out, would they be able to suppress this freak?","At this moment, the Four Directions Great Emperor could not make a judgement either.","After all, he had absolutely no idea how strong the fourth tier was.","The Four Directions Great Emperor attacked again. Being able to become a Great Emperor, he was naturally incomparably resilient.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","One after another, colossal hands descended from the skies, but Ling Han merely clasped his hands behind his back, and did not take them to heart at all. He only had to open his mouth and shout, and those giant hands would automatically crumble.","Upon seeing this, everyone had no choice but to admit that Ling Han truly possessed the battle prowess of a Great Emperor.","\"Don’t worry, the Imperial Ancestor hasn’t gone all out yet,\" someone consoled.","\"That’s right. This is not the true strength of a Great Emperor at all.\" Everyone nodded.","Ling Han released a battle cry, and began his counterattack.","\"Four Directions, do you only have this little bit of battle prowess?\" Ling Han asked with a smile. He charged over aggressively, and as he threw a punch, 99 eight-star Regulations appeared at the same time, and were then fused together by a sliver of nine-star Regulations.","Originally, no matter how many eight-star Regulations there were, they would not be able to match a Great Emperor, but with this sliver of nine-star Regulations fused together, the effects were completely different.","Peng!","Ling Han exchanged a blow with the Four Directions Great Emperor... they were evenly matched!","In a head-on confrontation, the Pseudo-Emperor was not inferior to the Great Emperor at all.","Heavens!","Everyone was grabbing their heads. Even if they knew that this was not the Four Directions Great Emperor’s strongest state, they were still dumbfounded with shock.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","The two parties with Emperor-level battle prowess clashed, not using any Imperial Technique at all. That was because they were both Emperors, and every move and style was filled with Great Emperor Tier power.","In such a battle, even a Pseudo-Emperor was not qualified to approach. Even the Heaven’s Eye could only retreat to a very far place, fearing that it would be implicated by the battle. If that happened, it would definitely explode.","Everyone naturally could not see clearly. In fact, they could not even catch sight of the figures. They could only deduce that the battle was still continuing from the number of stars that had been destroyed.","\"You’re truly extraordinary!\" the Four Directions Great Emperor said sincerely. He had to admit that this young man was truly freakish. He was only a Pseudo-Emperor, yet he was already capable of matching a Great Emperor.","—Though he was not in his strongest state at present.","This was unprecedented, and it was also possible that it would never happen again.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and increased his battle prowess again.","Destructive Energy, light of great dao!","Boom! After unleashing these two trump cards, even a Great Emperor didn’t dare to face them head-on.","If he did, he would be severely wounded, or even killed directly!","The Four Directions Great Emperor retreated, while Ling Han continued to close in. With Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, he was even slightly faster than the Great Emperor.","Even if it was just a sliver, it was enough. This meant that the Four Directions Great Emperor couldn’t possibly escape.","W-what?","Because the chase had begun, the Heaven’s Eye could once again capture relatively clear images, and though the Great Emperor was fast, there were the Chang Clan’s Heaven’s Eyes everywhere in the universe, and he would always be able to capture one or two images from time to time.","When news of this spread to the Chang Clan, every member of the Chang Clan looked gloomy.","Their Imperial Ancestor was actually no match for Ling Han!","Heavens!","In truth, the Four Directions Great Emperor was only temporarily dodging the attacks, and had not lost. However, a Great Emperor was being chased around by a Pseudo-Emperor. Wasn’t this enough to shock the entire universe?","Hong! Hong! Hong!","Ling Han controlled the Destructive Energy, and as he threw a punch, a shockwave of darkness surged out, forcing the Four Directions Great Emperor to have no choice but to veer in another direction.","With this turn, Ling Han naturally caught up with him. The two of them immediately started to fight.","The Four Directions Great Emperor forcefully broke free from Ling Han’s grasp, drawing out the distance between them and unleashing a barrage of attacks.","However, his present battle prowess was only equal to Ling Han’s, and added with the fact that he still had to be wary of Destructive Energy and light of great dao, how could he possibly be a match for Ling Han?","He was battered and exhausted from dodging.","This was a Great Emperor!","The Four Directions Great Emperor finally flew into a rage.","Imperial Might could not be violated!","Boom, the fog that wrapped around his body suddenly disappeared, revealing a shriveled body. However, in the next instant, this body seemed to have been pumped full of energy and filled with water, becoming sturdy and moist.","A middle-aged man with unparalleled grace appeared in front of Ling Han. He had an indescribable domineering aura, as if he only had to raise a brow, and a whole galaxy would collapse in half.","This was the true Four Directions Great Emperor.","Boom!","The Four Directions Great Emperor unleashed a punch, and it was as if all the stars of the entire universe were concentrated in this punch. It was indescribably terrifying.","Fifth tier!"]},{"number":4827,"title":"Chapter 4827: The Great Emperor fled","paragraphs":["Setting aside the Great Emperors in the Primitive Abyss, the fifth tier was the strongest level of power.","In the outside world, a Great Emperor would only be able to cultivate the Nine Star Regulations to the consummate level. This was the limit of heaven and earth.","If he wanted to break through to the fourth tier, he could only enter into the Primitive Abyss and grasp one of the four elements—Life, Death, Creation, and Destruction.","However, the Great Emperors in the Primitive Abyss had all long since exceeded the limit of their lifespans, and could only continue to live by depending on the essence of Life there. It was impossible for them to leave the Primitive Abyss.","Thus, the strongest battle prowess in the outside world was the fifth tier.","Boom! This punch was incredibly domineering.","Without the slightest hesitation, Ling Han turned around and left.","Xiu, he arrived at the Chang Clan’s ancestral planet in a single step. He grabbed the large black dog, the little azure dragon, and the stone golem in space. Then, a golden path spread out beneath his feet, and he left quickly.","’I’m done fighting.’","The Four Directions Great Emperor was enraged. He had returned to his prime condition, yet Ling Han had actually fled?","How could that be allowed!","He instantly understood Ling Han’s strategy—Ling Han was purposefully forcing him to enter his strongest state, and then exhaust himself for nothing.","One had to realize that the whole Living Realm was already close to transforming into Netherworld. Moreover, he couldn’t absorb any more life essence. Once he exited this state, just how far would his battle prowess fall?","Even if he could still hold on for a while longer, entering his strongest state a few times in a row, there was ultimately a limit to the number of times he could do so.","Once he used up all the times that he could \"transform\", then what would he, a Great Emperor, be worth?","The Four Directions Great Emperor let out a furious roar as he chased after Ling Han.","He had already paid a heavy price, so he definitely had to kill Ling Han.","However, though he had entered into his strongest state, and his speed had increased, it was only just a sliver. Compared to Ling Han... it was more or less the same.","He couldn’t catch up to Ling Han, and Ling Han couldn’t shake him off either.","The two great Emperor-level battle prowess were shuttling through the galaxy, and the colossal galaxy became tiny in their extreme speed.","From the edge of one side to the other, it actually only took half a day’s time!","With such speed, it was impossible for the Four Directions Great Emperor to notify the other Great Emperors to attack together.","There was no way to say the exact location, all right?","And just like that, the Four Directions Great Emperor had no choice but to give up after pursuing for three days.","—He was about to reach his limit, and could no longer maintain this state.","Ling Han didn’t turn around to chase after him. Instead, he found a star to sit down and recover his energy.","After all, he was being hunted by a Great Emperor, and they would definitely exchange a few blows in the process, which caused him to suffer a great impact.","After resting, Ling Han once again headed to the Chang Clan’s ancestral planet.","Yi?","He discovered that this place had actually become a land of death.","There were dried corpses everywhere. They had all had their life essence sucked dry.","However, he didn’t see the corpses of Chang Tingjian, Chang Yu and the others.","He understood.","After the Four Directions Great Emperor returned, in order to maintain his vitality, he had no choice but to devour the life on this planet. Of course, the most important members of the Chang Clan were all spared.","After recovering for a short while, the Four Directions Great Emperor left with his clansmen, resolutely abandoning this ancestral planet.","It could not be helped. He feared that Ling Han would make a comeback.","He only had to be forced into his strongest state by Ling Han a few times, and what awaited him would be death.","Those who could become Great Emperors were naturally resolute.","Ling Han was slightly disappointed. He had indeed planned to exhaust the Four Directions Great Emperor to death, but he wouldn’t fall for his trick.","\"Little Han, you have already forced a Great Emperor to flee. This battle merit is practically enough to surpass the past and dazzle the present. So, don’t look so distressed anymore. Otherwise, even Grandpa Dog would think that you have been showing off too much,\" the large black dog said from the sidelines.","Er... alright.","Ling Han perked up his spirit, and said, \"Let’s loot the place!\"","Upon hearing this, the large black dog and little azure dragon were both excited.","The Chang Clan possessed the Galaxy Network, and just how much wealth had they accumulated over millions and millions of years?","The wealthiest in the universe definitely was the Chang Clan.","The three of them excitedly ransacked the Chang Clan Residence. Because there was too little time, the Chang Clan did not manage to move too many things, and still left Ling Han and the others with a huge amount of wealth.","There were innumerable Celestial medicines and precious materials.","The large black dog couldn’t help but sigh at this. If they had come earlier, and prevented the Chang Clan from taking away even the slightest bit of treasure, just how great would their gains be?","Ling Han couldn’t be bothered to examine it slowly, and directly stored the Chang Clan’s ancestral planet into his body. Then, he returned to the Four Origin Planet.","He naturally did not release the Chang Clan’s ancestral planet on the Four Origin Planet. Instead, he kept a considerable distance between them, to prevent the two stars from colliding and causing great casualties.","The empress and the others came out to receive him. When they found out about Ling Han’s battle merits, they were all excited.","This was a Great Emperor, someone who had been invincible for an entire era, and now? He had actually been forced by Ling Han to the point that he could only bring his whole family with him, pack up, and flee.","Of course, this was also because the Four Directions Great Emperor wasn’t an ordinary Great Emperor. Otherwise, if he could maintain his power at the fifth tier, Ling Han wouldn’t be able to rival him at all.","Ling Han started to search for his next target.","It was very simple. Find the ancestral planet of a fallen Great Emperor, and force him to appear for a battle, so that he would enter his strongest state. After a few times, this Great Emperor would be crippled even if he did not die. How would he be able to endanger the world then?","\"It can’t be helped. Right now, I’m only a five-star Pseudo-Emperor, so I can only do this.\" Ling Han sighed.","This caused everyone to roll their eyes at him. He had really gone too far in showing off.","However, when Ling Han attacked and began to search around, he only found one abandoned Imperial Clan and ancestral planet after another.","—The ancestral planets of the Lands of Death that could be discovered had all been abandoned.","This time, even Ling Han couldn’t do anything.","It was simple for him to find a living star in the vast universe. After all, the Living Realm had transformed into the Netherworld, and living stars were as dazzling as the sun.","However, it was almost impossible to find a specific living being in such a large universe.","A Great Emperor was a Great Emperor, after all, so he immediately found a solution.","I’ll ignore you. I’ll just wait until the Living Realm begins to collapse. Then, Great Emperors like them would snatch that sliver of fated opportunity. Not only would they obtain eternal life, but their abilities would also advance further.","At that time, what would Ling Han be worth?","Being able to become a Great Emperor, how could it be that they did not even have this little bit of patience?","Since that was the case, Ling Han simply gave up the idea of continuing to search for the Lords of Death.","If a Great Emperor was completely focused on concealing himself, how could he possibly be found?","Since he had nothing to do, he began to do what he could.","Resuscitate the Living Realm.","Wherever he went, the Yin souls would naturally disperse, and one after another star would be easily revived, and the sun would reignite.","However, it was not something that could be done overnight if one wanted to restore vitality to a planet.","After all, destruction was easy, but creation was difficult.","There was a way.","Including Ding Shu and the others, they had also extracted Genesis World from their bodies, so just how many lives were contained within?","As long as these beings cultivated until Meridian Opening Tier, they could completely walk out of these dimensions and start a new life on these planets.","Thus, there was absolutely no shortage of people.","In a situation when the world was at peace, it was estimated that in just a few tens of thousands of years, the whole universe would recover its vitality.","More importantly, did they have so much time?"]},{"number":4828,"title":"Chapter 4828: Discussion","paragraphs":["Chapter 4828: Discussion","With the present state of heaven and earth, it was possible that a new Emperor would emerge at any time. Thus, the plot of the Lords of Death was also imminent. It was possible that they would reveal their true intentions at any time, and launch the final and strongest wave of attack.","In his prime condition, Ling Han was no match for a Lord of Death, what more when there were 12 of them.","What Ling Han could do now was firstly, to search for the whereabouts of the Lords of Death, and secondly, to revive planets as much as possible, and strengthen the power of the Living Realm to resist the Netherworld.","In this way, even if time was really not on his side, it would definitely be of some help in stopping the plans of the Lords of Death.","Most importantly, the plot of the Lords of Death was completely useless. They had been tricked.","What was the background of that old Divine Beast?","Ling Han had never seen it before, but all the Great Emperors were standing on opposing sides of him, which showed just how evil this guy was, that there was not a single Great Emperor that supported him.","Multiple stars revived, and multiple suns lit up again, illuminating the ground and embellishing the dark universe.","However, in the end, Ling Han was only one person. Even with the help of Buddha Doga and the other Pseudo-Emperors, progress wasn’t very fast.","As for the rock golem?","Hehe, it would already be good enough if it didn’t help and instead made things worse.","During the migration process, the great Imperial Clans also voiced their strong objections.","Their advantage lay in their agility. Even if a Lord of Death charged over personally, Ding Shu and the others would still be able to wrap them up and take them away easily.","However, once the number of stars increased, even if Ling Han was here now, how could all these stars be absorbed into their bodies?","This pertained to their safety. Thus, even though they were facing Ling Han, they still raised their objections.","“Er, has no one told them that Little Han has already become a Pseudo-Emperor?” The large black dog smiled, “If these guys knew, they probably wouldn’t be so worried.”","“Not necessarily.” The little azure dragon shook its head. “In their hearts, the Great Emperor is invincible. Thus, even if they knew that Little Han has become a Pseudo-Emperor, they would only think that Little Han is the strongest Pseudo-Emperor, but definitely wouldn’t be able to match a Great Emperor.”","“Makes sense,” the pervert pig added, yet everyone rolled their eyes at him.","Just look at your ancestor, who is still battling hard in the Primitive Abyss. And what about you?","He was a glutton and a lazy bum; he was practically ruining the family’s reputation.","Those descendants of Great Emperors like Brother Monkey and the little azure dragon were all Saints by now, and the perverted pig was actually only a Venerate Tier. The slowness of his advancement was practically chilling.","Faced with everyone’s gazes, the pervert pig smiled awkwardly, and did not say another word.","—Uncle Pig only wanted to roll around in a pile of beauties. Why did you guys have such high expectations of Uncle Pig, b@stards?","“All right, then we will have a meeting, and discuss democratically,” Ling Han said with a smile.","They sent out a message, and all the Imperial Clans sent people over.","There was still a considerable number of surviving Imperial Clans, and they all sent two representatives. Most of them were the son of a Great Emperor and an old Saint. However, for some Imperial Clans, the son of the Great Emperor had already died, so they could only send an Imperial Son instead.","All of a sudden, the Four Origin Planet shone brilliantly.","The discussion was held on a plaza, and there were no seats. In any case, there was only one matter. Ling Han thought that it would be resolved very quickly. He had to settle the matter quickly. Should he still sit down and brew a pot of tea, and slowly discuss the matter?","After everyone had arrived, Ling Han crossed his arms behind his back and walked into the middle of the crowd. He said with a smile, “I heard that you guys have different opinions about my immigration plan. Today, I’ll beat you guys into submission, oh, no, convince you guys.”","Hearing these words, everyone couldn’t help but look at each other.","You f****** must have said it on purpose.","This was a show of strength. His threat could not be more obvious.","However, it had to be said that everyone felt a chill in their hearts.","Who was Ling Han?","The strongest Saint in all eternity, and furthermore, he had the backing of three Pseudo-Emperors.","Thus, without the appearance of the Pseudo-Emperor, the Imperial Clan was naturally wary of Ling Han. They could only rely on the support of the Imperial Weapon.","“I object!” However, this was ultimately a matter that concerned the lives of their entire clan, so no matter what, they could not possibly yield. There were still people who stood up.","“My clan also objects,” another Saint said as he stood up.","“My clan agrees.” That was the Donglin Imperial Clan. As Chi Menghan’s maternal family, they naturally had to support Ling Han as he was their son-in-law.","However, even more Imperial Clans expressed their disagreement.","The Donglin Imperial Clan’s Chi Taiming and Chi Feihong were both extremely worried. Previously, there was already a strong wave of objections, and they still had to hold such a discussion. Wasn’t it clear that they were seeking their own humiliation?","‘Ling Han, what on earth are you trying to do?’","Ding Shu, Jing Haoran, Shui Qingchang, and the other Genesis World rulers didn’t say anything. Although they also thought that Ling Han’s actions were dangerous, they believed that Ling Han wouldn’t do anything stupid. There was definitely a reason for this. Thus, they wanted to hear Ling Han’s explanation.","Ling Han waited until all the Imperial Clans expressed their stand. He then smiled, and said, “Since everyone is against this, this matter is approved.”","‘H-hm?’","Everyone was just nodding, but they immediately gritted their teeth.","‘You f*cking... do you want to become a dictator?’","Since everyone was against it, then your plan should have been scrapped.","Do you think that you have become a Great Emperor, so you can rule your era?","“Ling Han, though you have outstanding merit points, you cannot use this as a threat, and tie us up so we can die together!” An Imperial Clan elite declared angrily.","The present Ling Han was practically like a maniac.","Following a maniac, then wouldn’t they all go crazy together?","“That’s right, we have no reason to die with you!”","“Ling Han, have you ever considered that our advantage is in agility? However, you’re currently conducting a large-scale migration of people, forcing us to have no choice but to fight on the front lines. If the Lands of Death attack, how will we block it?”","Everyone shouted one after another.","Ling Han shook his head, and said, “I understand what you’re saying. However, the current situation is terrible, so let me explain it to you.”","“Firstly, do you guys know why the Lords of Death guided the invasion of the Netherworld?”","He first threw out a question, causing everyone to ponder.","That’s right, why?","Those Lords of Death... were all former Great Emperors!","Ling Han smiled, and continued, “Their purpose is to cause a collision between the Netherword and Living Realm, and from there, create some kind of Source Power, allowing them to grasp it, so that they could obtain the fated opportunity of immortality, and break through the current barrier of cultivation level.”","Hiss, a Great Emperor could break through again? What was that? A Transcendent Emperor?","Everyone exchanged looks. This was information that they had never known before.","Yet Ling Han immediately shook his head, “However, this is bullsh*t.”","Yi?","Everyone was surprised. This turn of events was really too fast.","“In truth, the expansion of the universe is about to reach its end, and the next step would be to collapse. Furthermore, the transformation of the Netherworld would cause a hedging effect on the collapse, and the result would be... the destruction of the two Realms!”","Ling Han said seriously, “Everyone, once this day comes, this universe will no longer exist.”","“The only place that can survive is the Primitive Abyss.”","“But I can enter into the Primitive Abyss. Can you guys do it?”"]},{"number":4829,"title":"Chapter 4829: Persuasion","paragraphs":["Chapter 4829: Persuasion","Ling Han’s words caused everyone to go numb with shock.","According to him, wasn’t the universe about to be destroyed?","Thus, Ling Han wanted to revive the Living Realm. This was the only way to resolve the conflict between the two Realms.","That’s right. The Primitive Abyss was where heaven and earth originated. It was incredibly mysterious, and definitely couldn’t be destroyed by the collision of two realms. At most, it would only cause some impact.","Moreover, everyone knew that Ling Han had already entered the Primitive Abyss several times. He wasn’t exaggerating.","The problem was, how could the threat of the Lands of Death be ignored?","If a Great Emperor unleashed his might, who in the world could stop him?","“Ling Han, even if you’re telling the truth,” the Ancient Prosperity Saint from the Ten Thousand Thunder Imperial Clan said. “However, we’ve appeared with such great fanfare, so it’s equivalent to exposing ourselves to the public. What if the Lands of Death arrive? How will we block it?”","“That’s right!” Liu Xinhe, the son of the Great Emperor of the Seven Luminaries Clan, also nodded. “To say nothing of the Great Emperor, just in terms of the number of Pseudo-Emperors, we are also far inferior.”","“Your plan is to build a castle on the sand. It’s completely impossible,” the Ancient Prosperity Saint said resolutely. “At that time, we’ll all be dead before the two realms even collide.”","Thus, he would rather choose to flee. At least, he would be able to live a few more days.","Ling Han sighed, and walked up to the Ancient Prosperity Saint. “Are you opposing me?”","“I just don’t want your madness to kill everyone!” the Ancient Prosperity Saint said.","Though Ling Han was the strongest Saint in all of history, there were so many people now, so he was unafraid.","Ling Han stretched out a hand, and grabbed out at the Ancient Prosperity Saint.","Hiss, this guy really dared to make a move?","The son of the Great Emperor of the Ten Thousand Thunder Imperial Clan, Hang Shushan, immediately moved, and delivered a palm strike at Ling Han, “Brother Ling, you have gone too far!”","Peng!","Ling Han did not dodge or evade at all, and allowed Hang Shushan’s palm strike to land. However, a frightening force rebounded, and peng, Hang Shushan was sent flying, and the Ancient Prosperity Saint also fell into Ling Han’s hands.","“I’ll give you another chance to speak again,” Ling Han said with a smile. He placed the Clear Bamboo Sword on the neck of the Ancient Prosperity Saint.","This was an Imperial Weapon, and killing a Saint would be as easy as the turn of a palm.","How could the Ancient Prosperity Saint dare to be stubborn? He hurriedly said, “I agree! I agree!”","Seeing this scene, everyone grimaced.","‘Are you planning to become a tyrant?’","With how you have “persuaded” others, aren’t you afraid of betrayal and isolation?","Meanwhile, the empress, the large black dog, and the others all smiled. They naturally knew that Ling Han was only here to perform.","“This guy, he’s showing off even in front of his own people!” The large black dog shook his head, then raised a paw, “He has the bearing of Grandpa Dog!”","Hang Shushan immediately stepped into the sky and returned. By now, he was already a Seven Star Saint. Boom, his saintly might was completely unleashed. He roared in fury, “Ling Han, have you really gone mad?”","Ling Han reached over and grabbed him, then smashed him onto the ground.","Peng, peng, peng! In just a few moments, Hang Shushan had been forcefully knocked unconscious.","He smiled slightly, “Another person has no objections, what about you guys?”","All the Imperial Clans were cursing in their minds. They had never imagined that Ling Han would suddenly become so unreliable.","You are only the strongest Saint, so why are you so arrogant?","“All right, stop playing around.” Buddha Doga stepped out. He couldn’t just stand by and watch as Ling Han played them all to death.","Seeing that Buddha Doga had stepped out, all the Imperial Clans felt their hearts jolt. This was a Pseudo-Emperor, and he was Ah Han’s Junior Brother. He was overwhelmingly awesome.","“Ling Han is right. This time, we have to persist.” However, when Buddha Doga spoke, everyone’s hearts sank.","‘F*ck! Why did you also go crazy?’","Buddha Doga knew what everyone was thinking, and immediately said, “However, it’s not like we don’t have a sliver of a chance of winning on our side. Ling Han didn’t tell you that he has actually broken through to the level of Pseudo-Emperor.”","What!","Everyone was shocked. Ling Han had broken through to the level of Pseudo-Emperor?","No wonder he could casually trample on the son of a Great Emperor; this was a Pseudo-Emperor.","Furthermore, Ling Han was the strongest Saint of all eternity among Saints. Then, after becoming a Pseudo-Emperor, wouldn’t he be the strongest Pseudo-Emperor of all eternity?","“But, Buddhist Race, and there are Great Emperors standing guard in the Lands of Death,” a member of the Imperial Clan voiced his worries.","No matter how awesome your Pseudo-Emperor is, can you compare to a Great Emperor?","Buddha Doga smiled, and said, “I forgot to tell everyone. Not too long ago, Ling Han forced the Chang Clan to give up on the ancestral planet.”","That couldn’t be, right?","Everyone’s minds were in complete chaos. The Chang Clan must be the Chang Clan of the Four Directions Imperial Clan, and had a Lord of Death on standby.","“That’s right.” Buddha Doga nodded, and said, “Ling Han and the Four Directions Great Emperor exchanged blows, and neither side won!”","When these words fell, the masses erupted.","Ling Han... had become Emperor?","Yi, that’s not right. Just now, didn’t Buddha Doga say that he had become a Pseudo-Emperor?","Could it be that this freak was capable of matching a Great Emperor when he himself was only a Pseudo-Emperor?","This!","He was a monster!","The other Imperial Clan elites were all stunned. Meanwhile, the two Saints from the Donglin Imperial Clan were all smiles, extremely pleased with themselves.","This son-in-law was really too right.","It was not every Imperial Clan that had the son of a Great Emperor sealed away. For example, the Donglin Imperial Clan was like this. Furthermore, their most outstanding descendant was Chi Menghan, and now, she had also married out of the clan, and could no longer be considered a member of the Chi Clan.","However, in terms of which Imperial Clan had a higher status, the Donglin Imperial Clan was definitely not inferior to any Imperial Clan that had a son of a Great Emperor keeping watch.","They had Ling Han as a son-in-law.","A Pseudo-Emperor that could match a Great Emperor, then what about when he became a Great Emperor?","The strongest Great Emperor in history?","Buddha Doga described the battle situation in detail, and there was no add or subtract anything.","This convinced everyone, and while they felt slightly at ease, they were still a little worried.","That was because... Ling Han was still no match for an awakened Great Emperor. Furthermore, there were 12 of them.","“We have no option but to revive the Living Realm!” Buddha Doga said. “Otherwise, heaven and earth will definitely be destroyed.”","He once again emphasized, and the Imperial Clans finally took it to heart.","However, the reality was very grim. If the Lords of Death came together, then how would Ling Han be able to block them!","“Cough, I’ve always liked to convince others with virtue,” Ling Han said. “If anyone doesn’t yield, I’ll personally ‘speak’ to convince them. Come, come, come. If anyone has any objections, raise your hand for me to see.”","When these words fell, everyone instantly fell silent.","Right now, Buddha Doga was still very amicable. However, Ling Han’s expression was as if he were saying, “If you don’t yield, I’ll beat you into submission!” How could they reason with him?","This Ling Han was playing bad cop, and Buddha Doga was playing bad cop, forcing all the members of the Imperial Clans to have no objections.","It wasn’t that they didn’t have any. In fact, they didn’t dare to express them. They were truly exasperated.","It could not be helped. Who asked Ling Han to be too strong?","The Imperial Clan elites left in displeasure.","Ling Han didn’t think that there was anything wrong with this. The current situation was special, and these people couldn’t have any malicious thoughts.","It was possible that the whole world would be destroyed, so who could keep themselves out of trouble?","Thus, no matter what method he used, Ling Han was determined to unite these powers around him.","After this, everyone worked together to revive the Living Realm as quickly as possible.","The resources that Ling Han had confiscated from the Chang Clan were of great use, causing the people of Genesis World to rapidly increase their cultivation level, reaching the extent that they could walk out of the dimensions.","All of a sudden, the entire universe quietly glowed with vitality."]},{"number":4830,"title":"Chapter 4830: Deal","paragraphs":["Chapter 4830: Deal","With Ling Han doing this, it was impossible that there would be no reaction from the Lands of Death.","The Lords of Death did not move out, but the fallen Imperial Sons did move out, causing trouble everywhere.","These Imperial Sons were all Pseudo-Emperors, and they would leave after a single strike, without the slightest hesitation.","In a short few days, Ling Han’s side had already lost a considerable number of planets.","Fortunately, this was the outermost area. Although the planets had been revived, no one had relocated to them yet. Thus, the casualties were negligible, and there were pitifully few.","Previously, it had been Ling Han’s guerilla warfare, attacking the territories that the Lands of Death had occupied from all directions. Now, the situation was reversed. The fallen Imperial Sons were attacking from all directions, attacking Ling Han’s revived planets.","Ling Han had been concocting alchemical pills at first, but now that such a thing had happened, he naturally could no longer sit still.","Buddha Son, Qian Yanghao and Xia Houping, the three Pseudo-Emperors all moved out, and they would intercept them at the first instance. Ling Han also released his divine sense and paid attention to the surroundings.","The fact that they would be targeted meant that this move had indeed stung them.","Ling Han waited for the Lords of Death to appear. Then, he only had to store all the stars into his body, turn around and flee.","No matter what, he had to exhaust these fallen Great Emperors.","‘Here they come!’","Ling Han raised a brow. With a single step, he had appeared above a star.","“Come out!” He stretched out a hand to grab it. Boom, the Void was torn apart, and a youth fell out.","“Hehe, you even discovered that!” Of course, this was Little Ye. However, he was unafraid, and was still as cheeky as before.","Ling Han looked at Little Ye and asked, “Who exactly are you?”","“You guess!” Little Ye giggled, but immediately turned around and left.","He exerted time acceleration effects on himself, and instantly exploded with a terrifying speed.","It was comparable to a Great Emperor!","However, Ling Han’s speed was even slightly faster than the Great Emperor. If the True Phoenix didn’t appear, who could compete with him?","The great golden path spread out, and with a flash of the wings of fire, Ling Han had already stood in front of him.","Little Ye suddenly stopped, and her small face finally wrinkled into a frown, “Having obtained the inheritance of the True Phoenix, you are really troublesome!”","“You’re the trouble!” Ling Han said. Just Little Ye alone could pose a huge threat to everyone except him.","Little Ye continued to break out of the siege, but no matter how he dodged left and right, he would always be blocked by Ling Han. The gap in strength between the two sides was already very obvious.","This mysterious young man was indeed very freakish, but compared to Ling Han... he was still no match.","“Ling Han, why don’t we make a deal?” Little Ye suddenly said.","“Go ahead.” Ling Han was in no rush to make a move.","“Don’t interfere in the matters here. Correspondingly, I can bestow you with eternal life. In fact, I can even help you grasp the four elements, and become the true ruler of heaven and earth,” Little Ye said.","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel surprised.","How did Little Ye know about the four elements?","To say nothing of him, logically speaking, even the Lords of Death wouldn’t know.","Otherwise, they should have gone to the Primitive Abyss. That island at the end similarly could grant immortality to a Great Emperor, or even allow them to surpass the normal level of Great Emperors.","“You came from the Primitive Abyss?” Ling Han asked.","“That’s right.” Little Ye nodded.","“Have you been to that island at the core?” Ling Han asked again.","Little Ye smiled and said, “Don’t you think you’re asking too many questions? As long as you obediently go to the Primitive Abyss, I can guarantee that no one will make a move on you again. In fact, you can also become a city lord, and when the time is ripe, you’ll be able to grasp the four key elements.”","Ling Han was even more confused. The Lords of Death didn’t even know about the 36 Divine Beasts, but Little Ye was very familiar with them.","Moreover, from his tone, it was as if he could command the Divine Beast Great Emperors.","Hold on, the birth of the Divine Beast Great Emperors should be inextricably linked to that mysterious old Divine Beast, and now there was an incredibly young, yet powerful and mysterious Little Ye. The two obviously had a close relationship.","Ling Han raised a brow, “What relation do you have with that old Divine Beast in the Primitive Abyss?”","“Hehe, old Divine Beast?” Little Ye smiled. “Since he has obtained immortality, why should he be called ‘old’?”","He did not deny it!","Ling Han felt like the Lords of Death had really been screwed over very badly. Not only had that old Divine Beast bewitched them, but after millions and millions of years, it had also planted a traitor by their side.","More importantly, those who could become Great Emperors could not possibly be idiots. On the other hand, they were all prodigies of their eras, so how could they possibly be played so badly?","There must be some hidden story that he did not know.","“Ling Han, what do you think?” Little Ye said with a smile.","Ling Han shook his head, “I don’t think so.”","Little Ye finally stopped smiling, “Killing me won’t do you any good at all! Moreover, I can guarantee that if I die, the so-called Lords of Death will spare no expense to kill you.”","“Oh?” Ling Han smiled, completely unconcerned.","“I have the Mark of Destiny on me,” Little Ye said. “As long as I become a Great Emperor when the heaven and earth collapses, I can expose the essence of the heaven and earth, allowing the Great Emperors to glimpse the great dao and take another step forward.”","“Pu!” Ling Han laughed in spite of himself, “Your words can only deceive those Lords of Death. You have already said just now that only the Primitive Abyss possesses four fundamental elements, and now you are talking to me about the essence of heaven and earth. Isn’t that a joke?”","Little Ye slanted his head to one side, “It is precisely because the Lords of Death believe it that you cannot kill me.”","“Don’t you think that killing you would be a good opportunity to cut off the plans of the Lords of Death?” Ling Han asked calmly.","“Wrong, wrong, wrong.” Little Ye shook a finger. “The mark of destiny can’t be erased, and can only be transferred. So, if I die, the greatest possibility is that it will be transferred to you.”","“And it is very obvious that the Lords of Death could not possibly allow you to become Emperor. Thus... they could only use all means at their disposal to kill you, so that the mark of destiny would once again be transferred.”","Ling Han didn’t believe Little Ye’s words at all. However, the Lords of Death didn’t doubt it at all, because they had only obtained the path of “immortality” after enduring hundreds of millions of years of hardships and dangers. Naturally, they would continue this path resolutely.","Thus, Little Ye’s threat was very real.","At present, the Lords of Death were unwilling to make a move because they feared that they would be overly exhausted. However, once Little Ye died, they would definitely kill Ling Han at all costs.","No matter what, Ling Han couldn’t be allowed to become Emperor.","“So how about it?” Little Ye asked with a smile. He believed that Ling Han would make the “right” choice.","Boom!","His iron fist moved, and struck out at him.","Little Ye yelped in surprise and hurriedly stepped back.","He was a Pseudo-Emperor, and belonged to the category of freaks, so his reaction speed could not be said to be slow.","However, Ling Han’s battle prowess was on the level of a Great Emperor.","When a Pseudo-Emperor encountered a Great Emperor, the former could only flee at the first instant. Only then would he have the slightest chance of escaping. In a situation when the two were so close, how could he possibly do that?","Peng, with just one punch, Little Ye was sent flying.","“I don’t think so.” Ling Han shook his head, his killing intent blazing."]},{"number":4831,"title":"Chapter 4831: Bestowing life","paragraphs":["Chapter 4831: Bestowing life","Little Ye covered his chest, and with a ‘wa’, he spat out blood madly.","He had only been scraped by the aftermath, but just how terrifying was the might of a Great Emperor?","Actually, this was still because it was him. If it was any other Pseudo-Emperor, he would have been insta-killed.","“Damn guy!” Little Ye revealed a twisted expression, “Ling Han, do you think you can stop me? After I obtain the essence of Death, killing trash like you will only take one move!”","Ling Han couldn’t help but be startled, “F***, you are that old Divine Beast!”","No, he should be called a doppelganger of the old Divine Beast.","Sure enough, that old geezer didn’t just set things up in the Primitive Abyss, but also stretched out his hand to the outside world.","“There will definitely not be a day when you become Emperor!” Little Ye said balefully, almost as if he was speaking a curse.","“Hehe.” Ling Han didn’t say anything, and simply threw a punch.","Little Ye blocked, but how could he block Ling Han’s Emperor Tier-level battle prowess?","After several punches, he was beaten to burst.","Yi?","Ling Han suddenly discovered that after Little Ye died, an indescribable power had actually fused into his body.","No, it shouldn’t be called power, nor Regulations. It was very strange.","The Stone of Life!","Ling Han suddenly recalled that he, Ding Shu and the others had all originated from the Genesis World. Meanwhile, the Genesis World had been split from the Stone of Life.","Origin, Heaven Crushing and the other Genesis World overlords were all killed. Then, Little Ye appeared, possessing Destructive Energy.","This meant... that he had stolen the Genesis Worlds or some other substance from the bodies of Origin and the others.","In short, Little Ye could also be considered a Genesis World master, and was the replacement for Origin and the others.","Now, Little Ye died, and this portion of power of the Stone of Life was absorbed by Ling Han.","“Element of Life!”","“Not only that, but the Battle Saint Emperor also said that this is a stone that was found in the Cave of Life. It’s also been placed in the Cave of Destruction and the Cave of Creation for a long time. Thus, only us Genesis World Masters can easily grasp Destructive Energy.”","Ling Han ignored this for the moment, and merely absorbed this kind of “energy”.","Half a day later, he suddenly opened his eyes.","His figure descended, and arrived on a planet. He stretched out a hand and placed it on a rock.","A miracle happened, and the rock actually jumped up. Pa, pa, pa! Like the rock golem from the Primitive Abyss, the nearby rocks were all absorbed by it, and it turned into a rock golem that was as tall as three people.","“Master!” This rock golem sent out a wave of divine sense, and stood respectfully beside Ling Han.","Giving life!","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel excited. He had grasped an astonishing ability.","This rock golem’s strength couldn’t compare to that of the rock golem from the Primitive Abyss, as it was only in Mystery Realm Tier. However, this was life that Ling Han had only casually bestowed.","As long as he was willing to spend a little more effort, he was completely capable of bestowing a stronger life force.","Did this mean that he had grasped the essence of Life?","He had not.","Ling Han shook his head. He could use this ability, but it seemed to be instinctive, and he did not know why it could be used.","This was because he had been nurtured by the Stone of Life, so he had grasped the ability to bestow life.","“Inside the Primitive Abyss, the 36 Divine Beast Great Emperors should have been created and bestowed with life by that old Divine Beast,” Ling Han murmured. With this comparison, it was clear what his shortcomings were.","He could only bestow life, and not only could the old Divine Beast Beast bestow life, the abilities of the life it bestowed would also be stronger, and could even reach the level of Great Emperor. Furthermore, the old Divine Beast could also create things.","If Ling Han faced the old Divine Beast now, he would definitely be insta-killed with a single move.","Wasn’t it courting death to have a seventh tier and a second tier clash head-on?","“What is my limit?”","Ling Hanb bestowed life on a second rock. With his full effort, he bestowed the strength of Core Formation Tier on the rock.","However, this also made Ling Han feel as if his body had been hollowed out.","“The gap is so wide!” Ling Han frowned. The old Divine Beast could create Divine Beast Great Emperors.","“If I borrow the power of the Genesis World from Ding Shu and the others, how much would it increase?”","Ling Han immediately rushed back to find Ding Shu and the others.","After discussing for a while, Ding Shu and the others all agreed to “lend” the power of the Genesis World to Ling Han.","—In the future, when they entered into the Primitive Abyss, they would go to the island and cultivate some life essence, which could replenish their loss.","However, while Ding Shu and the others agreed, extracting this power was another matter altogether.","Ling Han kept trying, but he was completely unsuccessful.","Could it be that he could only absorb it after Ding Shu and the others had died?","Although Ling Han yearned to become stronger, he had never thought of using this method.","Thus, he gave up on trying.","Right at this moment, the Lands of Death charged over.","Sure enough, Little Ye was right. For the sake of the Mark of Destiny, the Lords of Death would kill him at all costs and transfer the mark to another.","Even if it had to be the sons of Great Emperors like Liu Xinhe and Shi Tianlu that became Emperor, it could not be Ling Han.","Ling Han was far too freakish. If he became Emperor, perhaps even the Lords of Death would be no match for him.","Ling Han did not hesitate in the slightest, and immediately drew all the stars into his body.","At present, he had the strength of a Great Emperor, so it was completely no problem for him to store more than a hundred stars.","“Die!”","The Lords of Death had all arrived, and they all attacked Ling Han. The blood sea boiled, and the Yin River pierced through the skies. Demonic mist swirled around them, but none of them had awakened to their strongest state.","Ling Han released a battle cry, and moved. Then, he replied with a punch of his own. Destructive Energy shot out, turning into an incredibly dark ball of light that was filled with destructive power.","Even the Lords of Death didn’t dare to face such an attack head-on, and they could only step aside one after another.","Ling Han possessed speed that surpassed the Lords of Death. Thus, even though there were many of them, he had the initiative.","Are you guys going to revive or not?","‘If you people don’t revive, then I’ll exhaust the time. These Lords of Death have disobeyed the Dao of heaven and earth, so their existence is unreasonable. It’s impossible for them to attack for a long time.’","As expected, after a long battle, even the Lords of Death were powerless to continue.","They were no longer living beings, and they were unable to replenish their power from the Living Realm. Thus, they could only rely on absorbing life essence to forcefully resonate with heaven and earth, thereby restoring their power.","But now?","How could there be life for them to absorb?","Hence, the choice that was laid out in front of the Lords of Death was very simple. They could either retreat, or revive their bodies and fight with all their might.","The Lords of Death chose... the latter!","They definitely had to kill Ling Han. Otherwise, if Ling Han became Emperor, there would be no need to mention anything else.","They had endured for so long, and they would really rather die in battle than accept defeat.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","Immediately, one of the Lords of Death revived and entered his prime condition.","The twelve of them did not “transform” together; that was obviously a very stupid move.","When Ling Han saw this, he immediately turned around and fled.","He was no match for a Great Emperor in his prime condition.","“Humph!” With a cold laugh, the other eleven Lords of Death had already activated the Pouch Formation, surrounding Ling Han.","“Hehe.” Ling Han summoned the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower."]},{"number":4832,"title":"Chapter 4832: Pincer Strike","paragraphs":["Chapter 4832: Pincer Strike","Seeing Ling Han summon the Imperial Weapon, the Lords of Death sneered.","Although the Imperial Weapon possessed Emperor Tier-level battle prowess, it was the weakest existence.","Who were they?","Even if they didn’t awaken to their strongest state, they would still be able to suppress the Imperial Weapon.","Thus, if you want to rely on the Imperial Weapon to break out of the siege, you are really thinking too much.","“Die!” The 12 Lords of Death attacked from all corners, blasting towards Ling Han.","One strike, a fatal strike!","Ling Han smiled, and the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower suddenly unfurled. Shua, a mist spread out, spraying towards the Lords of Death.","What the heck was this?","The Lords of Death didn’t even know what the Cold Water of Death was. However, as Great Emperors, how sensitive were their senses?","Not good, there was a great danger!","They all began to dodge at the first instant. If they were touched, it was guaranteed that even they would be in big trouble.","In this way, Ling Han naturally found an opening and escaped.","He was secretly thanking his luck. Although the Cold Water of Death was terrifying, it could still be blocked by the Imperial Weapon.","However, these Great Emperors had personally come, and each of their battle prowess had surpassed the Imperial Weapon. Thus, they naturally didn’t need to rely on external items.","As a result, when faced with the Cold Water of Death, they could only be forced to dodge. Otherwise, if they blocked it with an Imperial Weapon, they would be able to penetrate deeply.","For a Great Emperor that possessed an Imperial Weapon, the Cold Water of Death could only catch him off guard. It couldn’t possibly succeed in striking him.","“Don’t even think about running!” The Lords of Death immediately set off in pursuit. Xiu, xiu, xiu! Light flashed in the skies, and one after another, Imperial Weapons flew through the Void and landed in the hands of these Great Emperors.","Which person who could become a Great Emperor was not extraordinarily intelligent?","Thus, they immediately made their judgement. The Imperial Weapon should be able to block this lifeless liquid, because the Imperial Weapon had no life, and could face it head-on.","However, Ling Han had already charged out of the siege. With the speed of Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, which powerful enemy could catch up to him?","Even that revived Great Emperor could only manage to hang onto Ling Han and not be thrown off his tail.","“Everyone, we’ll meet again!” Ling Han let out a battle cry. There was something he didn’t say, and that was the next time they met would be when he killed these Lords of Death.","However, who knew if he would have the strength of the sixth tier or even the fifth tier the next time they met? Thus, it was best not to be too certain, to avoid slapping himself in the face.","Boom!","A terrifying aura suddenly surged over from ahead, causing Ling Han to involuntarily feel shocked.","Emperor Tier aura.","What was going on here? Another, no, a group of Great Emperors had come?","But it should be known that there were only twelve Great Emperors in this world, and they were existences that had transformed into Yin souls on their own volition. Strictly speaking, they could no longer be called Great Emperors.","However, a group of Emperor Tier auras had suddenly appeared. What the hell was going on?","That was definitely not Pseudo-Emperor!","In an instant, Ling Han discovered that the source of this Emperor Tier aura was... the 36 Divine Beasts.","They were all mobilized. The True Dragon, True Phoenix, Black Tortoise, White Tiger, Qiong Qi and so on. The 36 Divine Beasts rode the great path of golden light over, exuding endless dominance.","Though they were all in the sixth tier, there were still thirty-six of them.","F***, why did the forces inside the Primitive Abyss also charge over?","That’s right. They must be looking for him, but they had not been able to find him previously. It was only when the battle between Emperors broke out that they “smelled” the smell, and rushed over.","Ling Han naturally couldn’t face that head-on. In a one-on-one battle, he was no match for a Divine Beast Great Emperor, what more when it was one against 36.","Let’s go.","He changed direction, and continued to run madly.","“Ling Han, die!” the 36 Divine Beast Great Emperors roared in fury, their voices shaking the heavens.","At this time, the members of the two great Emperor Tier forces finally met.","The Lords of Death were also very shocked. They already knew that such a force existed, but one was in the Primitive Abyss, while the other was outside. There was no conflict of interest between the two, so they each minded their own business.","And now... the Great Emperors from the Primitive Abyss had appeared.","Their target was also Ling Han?","Then there would be no problem.","The Lords of Death knew themselves well. Although their explosive power was strong, they couldn’t battle for long, but the Divine Beast Great Emperors didn’t have such scruples. If they hunted Ling Han, the effects would definitely be even better.","Thus, they deliberately slowed down, allowing the Divine Beast Great Emperors to catch up and pursue ahead of them. Meanwhile, they hung back.","However, they definitely had to witness Ling Han’s death with their own eyes — if the Divine Beast Great Emperors were unable to kill Ling Han, then they would take their place. No matter what, they could not possibly allow Ling Han to continue living.","All of a sudden, there were actually forty-eight Great Emperors that were hunting down Ling Han at the same time.","This!","Throughout history, Ling Han was definitely the first person to be hunted down by so many Great Emperors at the same time.","Aside from when the heaven and earth first formed, only one Great Emperor would be allowed to appear in the heaven and earth at the same time. Thus, there was no need to even think about this kind of scene, and in the Primitive Age, how could it be so lively?","Merely from this aspect, Ling Han had set a new record.","More importantly, with so many Great Emperors attacking, they were actually still unable to kill him.","A mere Pseudo-Emperor!","However, among the army of 36 Divine Beasts, there was the True Phoenix!","Xiu, the True Phoenix flapped its wings, and stood out from the thirty-six Divine Beasts, as it rapidly set off in pursuit of Ling Han.","So fast!","However, Ling Han discovered that though the True Phoenix was fast, there was a limit to how fast it was compared to him. It was far from the legendary extreme speed of the True Phoenix.","He knew, because this True Phoenix was the creation of that mysterious old Divine Beast. Even if it had similarly reached the pinnacle level of Emperor Tier, how could it compare to the creations of heaven and earth?","The True Phoenix chased after him. He was presently slowly approaching Ling Han.","Ling Han was not stingy at all. With a toss of his hand, the Cold Water of Death once again spilled out.","The True Phoenix had no choice but to stop and dodge this deadly weapon.","Ling Han took advantage of the opening to rapidly soar, greatly increasing the distance between himself and the True Phoenix.","The other Divine Beasts, or the Lords of Death, were already falling behind quite a bit. Only the True Phoenix and the awakened Lord of Death were still following behind.","Ling Han wasn’t worried about the Lord of Death. After awakening, he would only be able to last three to four days, at most. He definitely wouldn’t be able to hold on any longer.","This was the limitation of the Lord of Death.","Thus, the only thing that could truly threaten Ling Han was the True Phoenix.","Chase, flee, flee, chase.","Three days later, as expected, the Lord of Death couldn’t hold on any longer, and stopped.","Right now, only the True Phoenix was still pursuing Ling Han.","Ling Han didn’t let his guard down. As long as he was caught up by the True Phoenix, it wouldn’t be long before the army of Divine Beasts would appear and surround him.","He fought a battle of wits and courage with the True Phoenix Great Emperor. He held the Cold Water of Death in his hand. This was something that posed a great threat to the Divine Beast Great Emperors. If he used it well, he would be able to use it to escape.","The pursuit continued. Ling Han tried his best, but since the True Phoenix had locked down on him, he was always a hair’s breadth away. He was unable to throw him off his tail.","What were they to do now?","With the other party chasing him like this, would he still have the time to comprehend the great dao, revive his body, and increase his cultivation level?"]},{"number":4833,"title":"Chapter 4833: Returning to the Imperial Island","paragraphs":["Chapter 4833: Returning to the Imperial Island","Since he couldn’t throw the True Phoenix Great Emperor off his tail, he would take the risk.","Ling Han adjusted his course, and headed towards the Primitive Abyss.","There were storms of heaven and earth there, and even the Great Emperor would have to be wary. In fact, he would have to dodge them, or he would be blasted into smithereens.","Thus, in the Primitive Abyss, it became possible to throw off the True Phoenix Great Emperor.","However, Ling Han did not make his thoughts so obvious, because he was worried that after he revealed his intentions, he would be pincered by the other Divine Beast Great Emperors.","This could not possibly kill him, but what need was there for him to deliberately take risks?","After circling around, Ling Han finally arrived near the Primitive Abyss. Then, with a leap, he entered the passage.","The True Phoenix Great Emperor chased after him without any hesitation. Although the passageway was filled with starlight particles, and the might of each explosion could pose a huge threat to a Nine-Star Saint, this was naturally no big deal for a Great Emperor.","As he gave chase, he also sent out a message, informing the other Divine Beast Great Emperors to gather here and form an encirclement.","Otherwise, if Ling Han was completely focused on fleeing, it would really be very difficult for him to kill him.","After all, they both had battle prowess on the level of Great Emperors.","Ahead of them, the Dragon Head City was already within sight.","Ling Han charged over in a straight line. Though there were guards there, how could they possibly block Emperor Tier battle prowess?","Boom! The True Phoenix Great Emperor also swept past, its fiery wings flapping through the air. In an instant, the city beneath them was burned to ashes, and all life was exterminated.","Ling Han turned around to take a look, and couldn’t help but reveal a murderous expression.","So ruthless!","These people were clearly their own, yet in the eyes of the True Phoenix Great Emperor, they were worth no more than a piece of grass. They were no different from ants, and he didn’t hesitate at all. In fact, he didn’t even slow down in the slightest. Otherwise, as long as he controlled his speed slightly, he wouldn’t have caused such a massacre at all.","“What is it? Have you become soft-hearted?” The True Phoenix Great Emperor’s voice reverberated through Ling Han’s divine sense, and he said, “Then blame it on yourself. Who asked you to implicate them?”","Ling Han’s killing intent became even more intense. Although most elites didn’t care about life, being so cruel to their own people still made him feel that he had gone too far.","It was no wonder that the Great Emperors that had entered this space throughout the generations had all stood against the old Divine Beast without the slightest hesitation.","The whole could be divined from a part.","Ling Han wasn’t a rash person, that couldn’t help but turn around and start a fight after suffering such provocation.","He continued to charge madly, completely unaffected.","“Those who can become Emperor only have the Dao of Heaven and Earth in their hearts, so what need is there for them to take mere ants to heart?” The True Phoenix Great Emperor switched tactics, “You are so wishy-washy, so how can you still wholeheartedly pursue Dao?”","Ling Han still didn’t speak. He simply roamed this vast heaven and earth, hoping to encounter a storm of heaven and earth.","It would be best if it was a sandstorm. Not only could it not pose a life-threatening threat to the Great Emperor, it could also form a visual and divine sense deception on the Great Emperor.","However, unfortunately, after close to three months, there was actually not the slightest bit of storm of heaven and earth here.","F***!","Ling Han mocked internally. Was there any need to make things so difficult for him?","Their journey was surprisingly smooth.","There were some small twists and turns that were enough to block Ling Han when he had battle prowess on the level of a Pseudo-Emperor. However, for the current him, this was no big deal.","Thus, Ling Han continued to advance, yet he couldn’t find any storms of heaven and earth that could help him break free from the True Phoenix Emperor.","Right until a very, very long time later, that sea of death appeared in front of them.","This was a place where even Great Emperors could possibly be buried!","Ling Han did not hesitate in the slightest, and directly charged over.","The True Phoenix also set off in pursuit. However, columns of water would occasionally soar into the sky from the sea, and they were incredibly quick. Even though the two of them were at the level of Great Emperors, they still had to be extremely careful, not daring to be careless in the slightest.","This was too dangerous, forcing the two of them to focus more of their energy on guarding against the water pillars below them.","There was no rhythm to the rise of the pillars of water. Thus, as they ran, Ling Han and the True Phoenix Great Emperor were getting further and further away from each other.","After running for a while longer, Ling Han turned around to look, and could no longer see the True Phoenix Great Emperor.","He thought for a moment, then decided to continue onwards.","Buddha Doga, Qian Yanghao and Xia Houping, the three Pseudo-Emperors would be suppressed by heaven and earth outside, and could not fathom the Nine Star Regulations and take another step, but if they cultivated on the island at the core area, there were endless possibilities.","With their natural talent, they all had hopes of becoming Emperors. In the past, it could only be said that they were unlucky, and had not received the blessing of heaven and earth.","But it was different here. There was no Dao of Heaven and Earth, and there were only four main elements.","With this, he could become a Great Emperor!","Then, he would return.","His battlefield was in the outside world. Only he could stop the Lords of Death, and those like the Battle Saint Emperor were unable to leave.","...","On the other side, the True Phoenix Great Emperor also gave up his pursuit and returned to land.","A cold smile tugged at the corners of his lips, and he murmured, “Though I did not manage to kill this brat, I have successfully trapped him in this space. As long as those twelve idiots can shatter the heaven and earth, the outcome would be decided!”","Turning around, with a flap of his wings, he had already left without a trace.","...","Ling Han carefully advanced with great difficulty.","After around nine years, Ling Han finally arrived at the core island.","He went up to the island, then released the three Pseudo-Emperors, Buddha Doga, Xia Houping and Qian Yanghao. He could not release the others, as they would be instantly crushed into smithereens by the terrifying gravity fields, even if they were wearing Battle Armors.","In reality, even Pseudo-Emperors would have to wear Battle Armor. Otherwise, they would be sprawled out on the ground, unable to move.","—After achieving the battle prowess of a Great Emperor, Ling Han would be able to take in Pseudo-Emperors into his body. He could not do the same for Imperial Weapons. A sliver of divine sense from a Great Emperor lay within them, unless he had obtained the method to control them like he could control the Clear Bamboo Sword.","However, it didn’t matter which corner of the universe the Imperial Weapon was abandoned. As long as it was summoned with a secret technique, it wouldn’t take long to break through the Void and arrive.","No matter what, the Imperial Weapon could still be considered an eighth tier Emperor-level battle prowess.","Buddha Doga and the others were all extremely stunned. Even they could barely walk on this island. It could completely be called the Imperial Island.","En, this name was not bad. This place was indeed filled with Great Emperors.","Ling Han brought the three Pseudo-Emperors to the Cave of Life.","“S-Senior!” Ling Han arrived at the cave, and actually saw the Battle Saint Emperor again.","This old Saint Emperor was severely wounded, and was presently soaking in a pool of water, absorbing the Source Power of Life within.","Ling Han was extremely speechless. Why was it that every time he came, he would see the Battle Saint Emperor injured?","‘The line of the Battle Saint Emperor should change its name to the line of Easily Injured? Or the line of Pummeled?’","Sigh!","Ling Han only felt that if he stayed too long with the Battle Saint Emperor, or Brother Monkey, his urge to ridicule them would also become incredibly strong.","“Greetings, Senior Battle Saint!” Buddha Doga and the others also paid their respects.","Firstly, the Battle Saint Emperor had achieved dao long before them, and secondly, the Battle Saint Emperor was fighting in the Abyss. This was bleeding for all life in the universe, and deserved their respect.","The Battle Saint Emperor squinted his eyes at him, and said with a smile, “Brat, you’re quite good. You’ve brought three decent saplings with you, and they’ll be of some help to us in the future.”","Decent saplings?","In this world, who could pass such judgement on Buddha Doga and the other Pseudo-Emperors?","Only the Battle Saint Emperor... and the other Great Emperors could do so."]},{"number":4834,"title":"Chapter 4834: Reading Imperial Scrolls","paragraphs":["If Buddha Doga and the others were in the outside world, they would all be standing at the pinnacle of the world. Who would dare to comment on them?","But when they came here, they had all become juniors.","Even if there were those like Ancestral King Lingtian, who was from a later generation than Buddha Doga, those who could become a Great Emperor and rule over an era were absolute overlords, naturally superior to Pseudo-Emperors.","Only after becoming Emperor, would everyone be able to stand on equal footing.","After feeling stunned and rueful for a moment, Buddha Doga and the others immediately immersed themselves in cultivating.","After they became Emperors, they could both join the camp that was opposing the old Divine Beast, and could also leave the Primitive Abyss, giving Ling Han some help. Thus, their battle prowess was still quite something to look forward to.","The three Pseudo-Emperors adjusted themselves, and began to resonate with the essence of Life, attempting to directly use the essence of heaven and earth to attain Dao, and skip over the stage of Nine Star Regulations.","If they became Emperors like this, there would definitely be flaws. Compared to the Battle Saint Emperor and the others, they lacked the Nine Star Regulations.","This was something that could not be helped. The heaven and earth already did not allow figures of the older generation like them to become Emperors, and now they could go through the back door, and circle around the heaven and earth. This was already a miracle among miracles.","Moreover, their limitation would only be stopping at the second tier, and they would not be able to charge up to the first tier.","It should be known that even the old Divine Beast was only in the second tier, so it didn’t matter.","However, after observing for a while, the Battle Saint Emperor whispered to Ling Han. Among the three Pseudo-Emperors, it was only Buddha Doga that had a chance of becoming Emperor, while Xia Houping and Qian Yanghao were slightly inferior.","It could not be helped. They had not been able to cultivate to the level of Nine Star Pseudo-Emperor after such a long time, which meant that their potential was more or less exhausted, and now they still wanted to improve further?","It was practically impossible!","Ling Han sighed. Xia Houping and Qian Yanghao weren’t from this era, and they had traversed the ages to come here. Thus, their foundations of cultivation had definitely been shaken. This was their disadvantage when compared to Buddha Doga, who had directly lived a second life and started over.","Forget it. Man proposes, and God disposes.","Ling Han told the Battle Saint Emperor about Brother Monkey, making the old Saint Emperor extremely happy.","\"He is like me, like me!\" The old Saint Emperor smiled like a child.","’Holy f*ck!’","Ling Han wanted to complain again. The reason why this old Saint Emperor was overjoyed was not because he had descendants, or because his descendant was about to become Pseudo-Emperor, but rather because he also had an explosive temper, and would itch to fight whenever he saw a fight.","The number of members in the line of the Battle Saint has already decreased to this extent. Please, can you guys take it easy?","Ling Han decided that when he returned, he would quickly find a female monkey for Brother Monkey, and quickly increase the number of members in the line of the Batle saint.","He crossed the sea, and spent more than eight years, returning to the shore, and then returned.","This time, he was out of luck. The storms of heaven and earth continued, and it took him a whole twenty seven years to finally arrive at the passageway.","Goodness!","Ling Han was astonished. This was because an Inescapable Net had already been set up here.","The 36 Divine Beast Great Emperors were all standing guard here, and a massive stronghold had also been built. With the sturdy structure of the heaven and earth here, even if Ling Han attacked it with Destructive Energy, it would still take some time for it to be breached.","And with the 36 Divine Beast Great Emperors impeding him, how could Ling Han possibly break out of the siege?","They were planning to keep him trapped here.","Realization immediately dawned on Ling Han. This was because they didn’t want him to go out and ruin the plot of the Lords of Death.","Rather than calling it the scheme of the Lords of Death, it would be more accurate to call it the scheme of the old Divine Beast, which had been laid out millions and millions of years ago.","Hence, when the Lords of Death were about to collapse, the old Divine Beast stretched out a helping hand.","This was really helping oneself.","What could they do?","Ling Han didn’t want to barge in. This wouldn’t work at all.","—Without this stronghold, Ling Han could still break out of the siege with the Cold Water of Death. Now, the time gained through using that method was far from enough for him to break through the stronghold.","He turned around resolutely and started to travel around in the Primitive Abyss.","There were very few cultivation resources here, but once found, it would be a Great Herb that would be of help to Saints, at least.","And in the case of Genesis Substance, it was also beneficial for the cultivation of Pseudo-Emperors.","Thus, Ling Han searched everywhere. He wouldn’t be trapped here and be unable to improve further.","When he was further away, Ling Han released a portion of the Saints inside his body — they were all Saints that were wearing Battle Armors. There was no other Saint aside from the past Ling Han that could walk here without depending on the Battle Armor.","Although Ding Shu and the others were also the Genesis World’s leaders, they hadn’t cultivated the True Dragon Body Art yet. Thus, their physique was far from being powerful enough.","Ling Han and the little azure dragon discussed for a while, and decided to popularize the True Dragon Body Art.","The shockwaves caused all the Imperial Clan Saints to be dumbfounded.","For them, the Imperial Scroll was their foundation. If the Imperial Scrollwas taught to outsiders, it was equivalent to handing over control of the Imperial Weapon. Would this Imperial Clan still be called the Imperial Clan?","However, Ling Han boldly took out the Imperial Scroll, allowing everyone to cultivate it together.","How open-minded was he?","Was this the generosity of a Great Emperor?","Some Imperial Clans had also taken out their Imperial Scroll after a long period of discussion, allowing Ling Han to comprehend it.","—If Ling Han couldn’t cultivate to become a Great Emperor as soon as possible, then they would be trapped in this space forever. Even if heaven and earth collapsed outside, they would not be affected as long as they stayed inside the Primitive Abyss, but the old Divine Beast would soon succeed, and the whole universe would be destroyed.","So, what was the point of guarding the Imperial Scroll?","If they couldn’t pass this stage, everything would be for naught.","And in Ling Han’s case, he was already a Great Emperor-level battle prowess, so would he still care about their Imperial Weapon?","As a Great Emperor, which one of them wasn’t prouder than the heavens?","With someone taking the lead, even more Imperial Clans followed suit.","Most importantly, there were a great many sons and daughters of Great Emperors here, and they had the spirit and magnanimity that their fathers had once had. At this time, they did not keep their skills to themselves.","Thus, Ling Han had a great many Imperial Scrolls in his possession.","For Ling Han, Imperial Scroll could no longer increase his battle prowess. However, every Imperial Scroll was the Great Emperor’s appreciation of Regulations. For the present Ling Han, this was extremely valuable for reference.","What he was strong in was his battle prowess, and what he lacked was his cultivation level.","Ling Han comprehended the Imperial Scrolls while the others explored and searched in the vast Primitive Abyss.","Right now, the Divine Beast Great Emperors were all standing guard at the entrance of the passageway. They had absolutely no intention of searching for Ling Han. This caused the abyss to become relatively safe. They only had to guard against the storms of heaven and earth.","For the old Divine Beast, as long as the Lords of Death successfully followed the plan, the clash of the two Realms would affect the Imperial Island, and the element of Death would appear in front of him.","Once he cultivated the essence of Death, he would become the first Great Emperor in history to advance into the first tier. Just how great would his power be?","No one could stop him.","Thus, whether Ling Han lived or died actually didn’t have much effect, as long as he couldn’t go out.","Everyone moved separately. Meanwhile, Ling Han was comprehending the Imperial Scrolls every day.","He couldn’t help but feel rueful. Every single Great Emperor was a supreme prodigy, and their thoughts were filled with flashes of brilliance.","In terms of comprehension ability and creativity, there was no Great Emperor that was inferior to him.","The reason why Ling Han was so strong was because he had been born from the Stone of Life, and had practically grasped Destructive Energy and light of great dao without any effort.","He carefully comprehended, and his comprehensions continued."]},{"number":4835,"title":"Chapter 4835: Six Star Pseudo-Emperor","paragraphs":["In the Primitive Abyss, there was no Dao of Heaven and Earth or Regulations.","Thus, if one wanted to cultivate here, they could only depend on Celestial medicines. The best thing was naturally Genesis Substance.","However, at Ling Han’s level, there was already no need for him to touch the Regulations at all times. Instead, after seeing the Regulations once, he would be able to silently comprehend them. Of course, it would be best if he could keep touching the Regulations.","When reading the Imperial Scrolls, Ling Han felt as if he could see those Great Emperors expounding on the great dao, detailing the Regulations.","To him, the Regulations seemed to have become three-dimensional, and were incredibly vivid.","Three years later, Ling Han put down the Imperial Scrolls and entered seclusion.","Endless comprehension appeared in front of his eyes, and he could casually pluck it.","In his mind, the nine-star Regulation that was as thin as gossamer was exuding a weak light, and countless tiny spots of light approached, adhering to this thin thread, causing it to slowly become thicker.","This meant that Ling Han’s comprehension of Regulations was advancing rapidly.","There were no natural treasures. This time, it was a summary of Ling Han’s experience after reading through the Imperial Scrolls. He had fused the comprehension of the Imperial Scrolls into himself, accumulating comprehension for a breakthrough.","Seven years passed, and in the place where Ling Han was sitting cross-legged, grains of sand suddenly trembled, as if an earthquake was happening.","This was extremely terrifying.","It should be known that just how terrifying was the gravity field here?","And a grain of sand was equivalent to the weight of a planet. Ling Han did not move at all. Merely the fluctuation of his aura was enough to cause the sand around him to fly. What kind of concept was that?","Not only that, but as Ling Han exuded waves of energy, the area where the sand was \"dancing\" was also becoming larger and larger.","A radius of 30 meters, a radius of 90 meters, a radius of 150 meters!","This was too terrifying.","Hu!","An even stronger aura suddenly surged out of Ling Han’s body, causing these grains of sand to dance in the air, as if they had formed a sandstorm. They swirled around him, and also completely concealed his figure.","Boom, a powerful aura of life surged out of the sand, and then, all the grains of sand fell onto the ground in an instant.","Ling Han’s eyes suddenly snapped open. Astonishing vitality surged from his body, and he looked as if he had become a few years younger.","He revived his body once, and advanced to become a six-star Pseudo-Emperor.","Invigorating!","Ling Han casually moved his arms and legs, and felt that his power had increased greatly again.","His path of advancement was completely different from other Pseudo-Emperors.","The other Pseudo-Emperors would stimulate a resonation with the heaven and earth after reviving their bodies, and through these means, allow the Nine Star Regulations to appear so they could comprehend them.","Thus, it was very possible that even though the Pseudo-Emperor’s cultivation level had increased, the Regulations that he had grasped had not changed in the slightest.","—In that short period of time, it was too difficult to complete the process of capturing Regulations, appreciating Regulations, and grasping Regulations.","In the end, it was extremely shocking to be able to grasp even the slightest bit more.","Thus, even a nine-star Pseudo-Emperor could not possibly grasp a complete nine-star Regulation. He had to wait until he had completed the last leap.","However, Ling Han was different. He first grasped the Nine Star Regulation, and then turned around to stimulate the recovery of his body.","This meant that as long as his cultivation level increased, his grasp of Regulations would definitely improve, and it would be a very great improvement at that.","\"When I reach Nine Star Pseudo-Emperor, I should be able to grasp a complete Nine Star Regulation.\"","\"Perhaps, there is no need to become a Nine Star Pseudo-Emperor!\"","\"In this way, if I break through to Emperor Tier on the Imperial Island, it would not affect my battle prowess.\"","Otherwise, without going through the Nine Star Regulations, it would decrease the number of tiers of a Great Emperor, and that would definitely affect the limit of battle prowess in the future.","If he wanted to match the old Divine Beast, he naturally had to become the strongest.","\"Six-star Pseudo-Emperor!\"","\"However, compared to Emperor Tier, the increase in my battle prowess is limited.\"","Ling Han sighed. His starting point was too high, causing the improvement brought by an advancement in minor level to be very limited.","\"However, as long as I cultivate a complete Nine Star Regulation, I should be able to raise my battle prowess to the sixth tier.\"","In that case, once he broke through to Emperor Tier, he would be able to advance through the fifth tier in a single go, and directly reach the fourth tier.","He was presently so strong, which was equivalent to possessing some of the might of the fourth tier in advance, such as the light of great dao, Destructive Energy, and so on. These were all domains that belonged above the fifth tier.","This kind of battle prowess was still not enough to break through the blockade of the Divine Beast Great Emperors. Ling Han naturally would not act rashly. He was not from the line of the Battle Saint.","—Er, when he thought of Brother Monkey and the Battle Saint Emperor, Ling Han couldn’t help but feel an urge to complain.","He continued to comprehend the Imperial Scrolls. However, after accumulating enough experience, the Imperial Scrolls were no longer of much help to him.","The only good news was that the flow of time in the Primitive Abyss was 100 times faster. Thus, relatively speaking, Ling Han still had a lot of time to \"waste\".","As he appreciated, he roamed every corner of the Primitive Abyss, searching for Genesis Substance.","The Great Emperors had all diligently come out to search, so how could they not have gained something?","In the following 20,000 years, Ling Han gained quite a bit, obtaining three Genesis-level Great Herbs.","And after such a long time, there was basically no one that had died of old age on the stars that he had stored in his body.","It was as if once it entered his body, it would become a world of its own, just like Genesis World, where Celestial King Tier-level beings could truly be indestructible.","Was this because of the Stone of Life?","For Ling Han, this was a piece of good news. Otherwise, after as long as twenty thousand years, his parents, as well as Liu Yutong and the others would definitely die of old age.","He returned, and received a few pieces of good news.","Ding Shu, Jing Haoran and Shui Qingchang had already become Pseudo-Emperors!","In reality, it wasn’t just them. Many of the children of the Great Emperors had also improved significantly. They were either eight-star Saints or nine-star Saints.","It was as if heaven and earth had opened their eyes. Everyone’s gains were not too bad. They had found Genesis-level materials, which allowed their cultivation levels to improve greatly.","In comparison, though Ling Han’s gains weren’t too bad, compared to his strength, the gap was too wide.","Since the Divine Beast Great Emperors did not pursue him, then fine. Ling Han simply began constructing a stronghold like the Dragon Head City.","Firstly, one would have to choose a place where the gravity field was normal, or much weaker.","This was naturally the mineshaft.","In the Primitive Abyss, there were still many such mineshafts.","After finding it, it would be easy to build a base here.","At this time, living beings below the level of Saints could also walk in this space, but the stars could not be released. They were too big.","With so many people, they naturally could not be wasted. What could they do?","Mining!","Ling Han also wanted to extract the Metal of Creation and upgrade the Imperial Weapon.","If he wanted to charge out, firstly, Ling Han’s battle prowess had to be at least sixth tier, and secondly, he could forge a Transcendent Weapon. He could directly destroy the stronghold.","Everything was done in an orderly manner. However, this was the Primitive Abyss, after all, so the resources were too scarce. Although it seemed like the heavens had opened their eyes previously, it quickly returned to normal.","Every single one of them had made very little progress.","This place was truly unsuitable for cultivating—apart from taking that final step.","Ling Han once again set out on the path of training. He didn’t know what was going on outside, but he definitely had to reach Eight Star or Nine Star Pseudo-Emperor as soon as possible."]},{"number":4836,"title":"Chapter 4836: Sixth Tier!","paragraphs":["Either Ling Han’s battle prowess had advanced into the sixth tier, or he had created the Transcendent Weapon. He only had to achieve either one, and Ling Han would dare to break through the siege of the Divine Beast Great Emperors.","The creation of the Transcendent Weapon required the Metal of Creation. This could only be done through mining and see if one got lucky. Ling Han couldn’t do much about that either.","Thus, he focused on improving his own strength.","This time, he didn’t bring anyone with him. He simply roamed around in the Primitive Abyss.","Many years later, he arrived at the side of the Sea of Death.","Should he go and take a look at Buddha Doga and the others?","Had they become Emperors yet?","The Primitive Abyss was not the outside world. Even if someone became Emperor here, there were no Regulations in this world at all, so how could there possibly be various unusual phenomena?","However, after arriving here, Ling Han’s divine sense suddenly lit up. He sat by the sea and started to comprehend Dao.","Occasionally, he would use his power as a hand to touch the seawater.","There was a terrifying power of death in this sea. The moment his hand, formed out of power, touched it, it would immediately kill the sliver of Ling Han’s divine sense that had been fused into it. However, in this process, Ling Han was also continuously able to glimpse the true meaning of death.","Limited by his cultivation level, it was impossible for him to directly grasp the essence of death. Furthermore, it was also impossible to grasp the element of Death like this. Otherwise, the old Divine Beast would really be an idiot.","The power of death in the seawater was like a manifestation of the element of Death, just like Destructive Energy.","Destructive Energy definitely wasn’t the element of Destruction. It was merely a form of display of the element of Destruction.","It was the same in this space.","Ling Han was studying this power of death, trying to use it to advance his grasp of Regulations, so that he could once again awaken his body.","Regulations were the embodiment of great dao, and great dao... also originated from the four main elements.","Thus, Ling Han was standing at a higher position, trying to grasp Regulations.","This was very hurtful.","Every time he came into contact with the seawater, a sliver of his divine sense would be destroyed. One or two was fine, but once there were too many, even Ling Han was slightly unable to bear it.","However, he was firm in his belief, and would not waver in the slightest.","His divine sense continued to weaken, but his grasp of the Dao of Death was also improving step by step. In fact, his divine sense had also become more resilient.","He saw it as a kind of training.","One year, two years, three years... As time passed, when his divine sense became severely damaged, and Ling Han would stop to recover. Then, he would continue.","Genesis Substance was too rare. To cultivate in the Primitive Abyss, he could only take risks.","One hundred years, three hundred years, seven hundred years.","Ling Han wasn’t comprehending the Regulation of Death. On the other hand, the thin thread of Regulation in his mind was the Regulation of Life. This was the Regulation he used the most, and it was used to revive the rock golem and numerous stars.","He had come from the Stone of Life, and was naturally close to the Regulation of Life. Thus, even if he had not completely grasped this nine-star Regulation, he could already use an ability that surpassed the nine-star Regulation.","The essence of Death and the essence of Life were opposites. They were absolute opposites, but also served as excellent reference.","Two thousand years had passed, and Ling Han finally had a major gain.","Boom, the life force in his body surged like the tide.","Why did he prioritize the Regulation of Life?","That was because the process of cultivating Pseudo-Emperor Tier was the process of reviving the body, and to revive the body, wasn’t Regulation of Life the best?","They complemented each other.","Resuscitate!","Ling Han roared internally. Boom! A powerful aura of life suddenly surged out of his body, soaring steadily. In fact, he had even forced back a portion of the seawater around him.","A seven-star Pseudo-Emperor!","Ling Han opened his eyes, his gaze piercing the skies.","He was still a sliver away from grasping the complete Regulation of Life.","Eight stars, he had to become an eight star Pseudo-Emperor.","Ling Han thought internally, but now that things had come to this, it was already useless to use the seawater of death as a counter-reference.","He still had to depend on Genesis Substance.","Ling Han set out, continuing to search for Genesis Substance. He still had three such Celestial medicines on him, but they should not be enough to support him to advance into eight-star Pseudo-Emperor.","Thus, he still had to find a few more.","This search took another 30,000 years.","Thankfully, thankfully, the 30,000 years in the Primitive Abyss was only over 300 years in the outside world.","It should... not have caused a great calamity.","Ling Han already had seven Celestial medicines in his possession.","He started to refine them. He felt that this was more or less enough.","Weng, the pillar of light of great dao appeared. This was a manifestation of the four elements, surpassing Regulations.","Ling Han fully focused on comprehension. There was too little Genesis Substance, so he couldn’t waste even the slightest bit.","Refining the Celestial medicine didn’t need too much time. In just five days, the seven Celestial medicines were all refined by Ling Han.","This wasn’t enough to support Ling Han’s recovery. Thus, he was still a seven-star Pseudo-Emperor. However, his grasp of the Regulations of Life had improved further.","The complete Regulation of Life!","This was something that had never happened before.","It should be known that no Great Emperor could possibly grasp the complete Nine Star Regulations when they were only a Pseudo-Emperor. At most, they would only be close to grasping it, because there was heaven and earth suppressing them.","In an era, only one Great Emperor could grasp the Nine Star Regulations.","This required both the permission of heaven and earth, as well as the blessing of great fortune. Neither could be missing.","However, Ling Han broke through this restriction.","In terms of Regulations, he was already a true Great Emperor, but in terms of physique, he was still a seven-star Pseudo-Emperor. He still needed to awaken his body two more times before he could truly become Emperor.","It didn’t matter.","Cultivation level was only secondary in importance. What was important was ability.","Ling Han stood up. This time, he was determined to break through the lines of Great Emperors.","Without the obstruction of the storms of heaven and earth, only a few days later, Ling Han had returned to base.","\"Good news! Good news!\" The large black dog immediately approached, \"Little Han, guess what Grandpa Dog has found?\"","Ling Han looked at its iron underwear, and the corner of his mouth involuntarily twitched.","Such a large piece of Metal of Creation, but it was actually inlaid on this guy’s underpants.","Just how afraid are you of having your b@lls kicked?","\"Old Black, just how far can you push your bottom line?\" Ling Han sighed, and placed his hand on his forehead.","\"As long as I’m alive, Grandpa Dog will never stop trying,\" the large black dog said. It was as if he wanted to pursue this for the rest of his life.","’Fine, you win.’","However, their luck was off the charts. They had only been digging for tens of thousands of years, and they had already dug out an extremely pure, very large Metal of Creation.","However, after taking off the large black dog’s iron underwear, Ling Han’s expression was filled with disdain.","\"Old Black, can you not be so mischievous?\"","He wondered if there was something unclean on it.","The large black dog rolled his eyes, \"Grandpa Dog has a good bath every day!\"","Forget it.","Ling Han instilled the Metal of Creation into the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower. However, this was still not enough to cause a qualitative change in the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower.","Forget it, let’s break out of the siege!","Ling Han wasn’t in a rush to move, as many people were still searching for Genesis Substance outside. Of course, he had to wait for them to return.","Since he had nothing else to do, Ling Han entered the mine, planning to search for it himself.","Right now, he possessed the battle prowess of the sixth tier. In a head-on clash against even a Divine Beast Great Emperor, he wasn’t at a disadvantage. Add to that the Destructive Energy, and in terms of destructive power alone, even the Great Emperor in his prime was far inferior to him.","Thus, he was filled with confidence."]},{"number":4837,"title":"Chapter 4837: Transcendent Weapon","paragraphs":["Because multiple large pieces of the Metal of Creation had been mined here, Ling Han wondered if there would be any more gains.","He arrived at the depths of the mine, then continued to dig downwards.","Using a special miner’s hoe, he could slowly excavate. After all, the heaven and earth structure here was slightly different, but for Ling Han, once the Destructive Energy appeared, his excavation speed was ridiculously fast.","It was as if he hadn’t entered the ground layer, but rather the lake waters, with how very casually he was digging..","Vision was obstructed here, so they could only rely on their divine sense. Otherwise, they could only try their luck.","In the past, Ling Han’s divine sense wasn’t strong enough, and the area he could spread his divine sense over was limited. However, it was different now. He had Great Emperor-level divine sense, and a sixth tier at that. This was naturally terrifying.","However, even if he was a Great Emperor, he could only cover an area of around 300 meters.","Ling Han searched in the cave for seven days, and it was as if the entire underground had become a beehive. He dug out countless secret passages.","Unfortunately, there was no gain.","Ling Han was not discouraged. He set out, and left this mining area, searching for other mining areas.","With his current destructive power, he was qualified to search deeper.","After searching one mining area after another, Ling Han finally began to gain something, and it was not a small gain either.","He obtained more and more Metal of Creation, and he had integrated them all into the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower.","He had a feeling that as long as there was another small amount of Metal of Creation, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower would have a qualitative change.","Transcendent Weapon!","Once he forged the Transcendent Weapon, he would not only be able to easily break through the blockade of the Divine Beast Great Emperors, he would also be able to stand against the fully awakened Lords of Death. In fact, he would even be able to suppress them.","Most importantly, the Transcendent Weapon could elevate his battle prowess by a significant amount.","Because the Imperial Weapon was in the eighth tier, then even if it was upgraded to become a Transcendent Weapon, its improvement shouldn’t be too exaggerated, right?","He would have to forge it to find out.","But no matter what, it would definitely be better to create the Transcendent Weapon. After all, Great Emperor Wu Ya had deliberately left a message for Ling Han to forge the Transcendent Weapon.","1000 years, 2000 years, and when the time came to the 272nd year of the 3000th years, Ling Han finally dug up another extremely heavy ore, which contained abundant Metal of Creation.","He extracted it and immediately assimilated it into the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower.","It was time for a qualitative change.","When the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower absorbed this piece of Metal of Creation, a qualitative change took place!","This Imperial Weapon was exuding a brilliant light, and it was as if it could breathe. It was inhaling and exhaling an indescribable power.","The four key elements?","Ling Han nodded. It was only in the Primitive Abyss that the Imperial Weapon could complete this step.","Otherwise, the maximum limit of Regulations outside would be nine stars, at most, so how could the Imperial Weapon complete a qualitative change?","Boom!","The incomparably powerful Imperial Might seeped out of the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower. Ling Han carefully distinguished that this was still Imperial Might, but it was even more majestic, as vast as the sea.","Transcendent Weapon?","It had indeed surpassed the ordinary Imperial Weapon, which was only in the eighth tier. But now, with a thought from Ling Han, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower immediately unleashed its might, blasting out a terrifying attack.","Fifth tier!","Only comparable to a Great Emperor at his prime?","This was already very impressive, all right?","There was more!","Ling Han discovered that the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower now had an additional ability to accumulate energy. Accumulating power could completely become a burst of power, and could unleash the might of the fourth tier.","However, after one attack, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower would need to accumulate energy again. Time was... boom, Ling Han had the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower deliver this powerful attack, then observe the recovery situation.","Ten days.","He came to this conclusion.","This was really a great burst of power. He could only launch an attack once every ten days. Furthermore, unless it was a sudden attack, even with the battle prowess of the fourth tier, it was still impossible to insta-kill a fifth tier.","Whom among those that could cultivate to become Great Emperors were not prodigies among prodigies, and geniuses among geniuses?","Therefore, without battle prowess, it was absolutely impossible to insta-kill.","\"So, good steel should be used on the cutting edge. I believe that I can give the Lords of Death a surprise,\" Ling Han murmured.","It was no wonder that the Divine Beast Great Emperors wanted to take charge of mining. If the Transcendent Weapon could be forged, then it would pose an additional threat to the Great Emperor Wu Ya and the others. Of course, it was only a threat. Thus, the Divine Beast Great Emperors did not personally take part.","On the other hand, it was naturally because the Divine Beast Great Emperors hadn’t grasped the Destructive Energy at all. They weren’t as efficient as Ling Han at all.","Ling Han returned. This time, those who had gone out had all returned.","All right, let’s go.","Ling Han drew everyone into his body. Then, he set out, heading towards the passageway.","Though close to another 100,000 years had passed, the many Divine Beast Great Emperors were still standing guard here, and did not have the slightest intention of leaving.","Ling Han was astonished. As a mighty Great Emperor, how could they be so obedient?","It should be known that where could the Great Emperor not go? Why were the Divine Beast Great Emperors so completely devoted to that old Divine Beast?","Ling Han pushed this question back into his mind. He summoned the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, aiming it at the stronghold.","With his current strength, he was indeed comparable to a Divine Beast Great Emperor. After unleashing the Destructive Energy, he might even have a chance of winning.","However, the problem was that there were 36 of them!","Ling Han didn’t think that he could challenge 36 opponents at this moment.","Moreover, as long as the other party restrained him and prevented him from blasting open the stronghold, Ling Han still wouldn’t be able to leave.","Thus, the first step was naturally to destroy the stronghold. Then, Ling Han would be able to do as he pleased.","Hong, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower shot out a pillar of light towards the stronghold ahead.","At the same time, Ling Han also adjusted the angle, bringing the Divine Beast Great Emperors with him.","However, in the instant that the pillar of light shot out, all the Divine Beast Great Emperors instantly looked stunned, and then rapidly retreated.","This was instinctive, and it allowed them to avoid danger at the first instant.","Then, they roared at the same time, and moved together, greeting that pillar of light.","However, it was already too late.","Boom!","The column of light descended, sinking into that massive stronghold.","There was no movement at all.","After only a short instant, boom, the whole stronghold trembled, and then shattered loudly.","\"Everyone, long time no see!\" Ling Han also strode out.","\"Ling Han!\" The thirty-six Divine Beasts were all brimming with killing intent, and at the same time, there was also a strong sense of wariness.","Crushing a stronghold with a single strike?","This required the battle prowess of the fourth tier.","If that was really the case, then even if there were thirty-six of them, they would still be unable to stop Ling Han. It was very possible that they would be defeated one by one.","This was not the Imperial Island, where there were a great many Great Emperors that had grasped the essence of life. Worse come to worst, they could still be sent to the Cave of Life, and very soon, they would be able to come back to life.","Thus, if they died here, they could only wait to be re-created.","How was this possible?","Only tens of thousands of years had passed, and this brat actually possessed the battle prowess of the fourth tier.","Absolutely impossible!","\"You created the Transcendent Weapon!\" Qiong Qi Great Emperor said, revealing the truth with a single word.","Ling Han laughed loudly, \"You guys guess.\"","The Divine Beast Great Emperors were all suspicious. With Ling Han’s words, they were no longer so certain.","\"Come, I’ll beat you guys up!\" Ling Han roared as he charged forward."]},{"number":4838,"title":"Chapter 4838: True Slaughter of an Emperor","paragraphs":["\"How dare you!\"","The 36 Divine Beasts were all enraged. Though there was a problem with their cultivation levels, they were still Great Emperors, after all.","A Pseudo-Emperor like you actually dares to fight all of them alone?","’You’re seeking death!’","Boom, the 36 Divine Beasts all moved, launching an attack at Ling Han.","Multiple attacks streaked across the sky, incredibly dazzling.","Ling Han let out a battle cry, and forcefully barged in.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","Ling Han and the thirty-six Divine Beasts clashed head-on, instantly exchanging tens of thousands of blows.","However, his battle prowess was only at the sixth tier, after all, which was equivalent to the Divine Beast Great Emperors. In a one-on-one battle, Ling Han naturally wouldn’t be at a disadvantage, but in a one-on-thirty six battle, the gap was too obvious.","Ling Han was instantly sent flying, unable to do anything to this wall of Great Emperors.","\"A mere Pseudo-Emperor!\" the thirty-six Divine Beasts exclaimed in unison. They were surprisingly in unison.","A strange feeling instantly rose up in Ling Han’s mind. However, he couldn’t put his finger on what exactly was strange.","\"So what if I am Pseudo-Emperor? I can still ensure that you can do nothing to me and cause you to be injured and bleed. In fact...\" He looked at the True Dragon Emperor and said, \"I can kill you!\"","The True Dragon Emperor’s expression instantly became ugly.","Previously, he had been killed by Great Emperor Senluo. Though he had been created again, his cultivation level had started from Pseudo-Emperor. In the end, he just happened to encounter Ling Han, and was killed by the latter.","This was naturally a great humiliation.","—If he knew that his body was still being eaten, his expression would definitely be a dozen times worse.","\"Shameless boasting!\"","\"Today, you delivered yourself to our doorstep, so accept your death!\"","The 36 Divine Beasts had already tested Ling Han’s strength, so they naturally had no more reservations as they all charged over.","Ling Han was astonished. ’You people are all Great Emperors, so why are you so uncouth?’","This was 36 Great Emperors fighting against a Pseudo-Emperor; if word got out, would you guys still have any face?","He gave a loud shout, and confronted the Divine Beast Great Emperors head-on.","Although he was alone and weak, his physique was extremely tough. So what if he was at a disadvantage? For the moment, he didn’t have to worry about his life.","However, the 36 Divine Beasts cooperated well, and their battle prowess became more and more terrifying.","After all, there were 36 of them!","In the past, Xuan Taiyu had only been able to battle against the twelve Lords of Death alone. Now, however, there were 36 Divine Beasts, and the numbers had directly increased threefold.","Of course, after the Lords of Death revived, their battle prowess would be in the fifth tier, which was a whole lot stronger than the Divine Beast Great Emperors.","Ling Han sighed internally. He had still wanted to take advantage of this opportunity to kill one or two Divine Beasts, but from the look of things now, that should not be possible.","\"Old beasts, I’m not going to play with you guys anymore,\" he said with a smile. \"However, the next time we meet, you guys will be my food. Remember to wash yourself clean!\"","\"Humph!\" The Divine Beast Great Emperors all sneered, \"A human that only knows how to boast!\"","They increased the strength of their attacks, wanting to take down this only variable as soon as possible.","Ling Han laughed loudly, and summoned the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower.","Weng! A majestic aura surged out.","Fifth tier!","This was equivalent to a Great Emperor at his prime, so how powerful was it?","Ling Han used his own body to control his weapon. Boom, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower paved the way, and he stuck close to it.","The Divine Beast Great Emperors hurriedly tried to stop him, giving it their all.","If they were facing an ordinary Great Emperor, so what if he possessed fifth tier battle prowess? There was no way he could face thirty-six Great Emperors with battle prowess at the sixth tier head-on. After all, he would only be made of flesh and blood.","However, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower wasn’t a normal Great Emperor. It was an Imperial Weapon, and it was a Transcendent Weapon that had fused with the Metal of Creation.","Thus, did the Imperial Weapon need to be wary of the attack of the Great Emperor?","There was absolutely no need for that!","The Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower unleashed an air of Primal Chaos to protect Ling Han, forcibly carving out a path of blood.","The Divine Beast Great Emperors all set off in hot pursuit, but aside from the True Phoenix Emperor, who else could catch up to Ling Han?","The problem was that the True Phoenix Emperor didn’t dare to get too close now, because Ling Han already possessed strength that could match him. In fact, Ling Han could even kill him!","However, he was still hanging behind Ling Han. Obviously, as long as Ling Han went to deal with the Lords of Death, he would gather the other Divine Beasts to gang up on Ling Han.","Ling Han’s strength had once again advanced further. However, in terms of speed, he did not have much improvement, and was unable to throw the True Phoenix Emperor off his tail.","’I can’t get rid of him?’","Then he would just kill him.","Ling Han ran for more than nine days before suddenly stopping. Then, he counterattacked the True Phoenix Emperor.","His counterattack had turned his defensive stance into an offensive one, yet the True Phoenix Emperor didn’t dare to face this attack head-on. He hurriedly retreated.","Ling Han aggressively charged over, brandishing his fists repeatedly, completely unleashing his battle prowess of sixth tier.","The True Phoenix Great Emperor had no intention of fighting Ling Han at all. He had already sent out a message, summoning the other Divine Beasts over.","This was a Great Emperor! Just how long would it take to travel from one end of the galaxy to the other?","Ling Han knew very well that he did not have much time left.","He unleashed his full power, throwing punch after punch. Destructive Energy and light of great dao all surged, causing the True Phoenix Emperor to dodge left and right. He was in a very sorry state.","Even the Lords of Death at their prime wouldn’t dare to touch such destructive power, let alone him.","Now was the time!","Ling Han suddenly channelled the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, and instantly, a pillar of light blasted towards the True Phoenix Great Emperor.","Fourth tier!","This attack just happened to blast out after the True Phoenix Great Emperor had dodged Ling Han’s Destructive Energy and light of great dao attacks twice in a row. Even if the True Phoenix Great Emperor possessed extreme speed, he was still unable to change his course in time.","Previously, the reason why Ling Han had done so much work was to pave the way for this attack.","The True Phoenix Great Emperor couldn’t dodge, at least not completely.","Pu!","The column of light surged past, destroying half of the True Phoenix Emperor’s body.","Fourth tier versus sixth tier, that would really be a crushing advantage.","Right at this moment, Emperor Tier fluctuations traveled over from the distant galaxy.","The other Divine Beast Great Emperors were about to arrive.","How could Ling Han miss such an opportunity? With a battle cry, he charged towards the True Phoenix Emperor. No matter what, he had to deal with this greatest problem.","As long as he killed the True Phoenix Emperor, then even if he could be created again, it would be a very long time before he could regain his Emperor Tier battle prowess.","Thus, for a very long time, Ling Han wouldn’t have have to worry about anyone being able to match his speed.","’Die!’","Ling Han attacked aggressively, Emperor Tier power surging. The Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower also shot out lightning continuously, pincer attacking the True Phoenix Emperor.","It should be known that the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower was a Transcendent Weapon, and its attacks had reached the fifth tier, which was even more powerful than Ling Han himself.","If the True Phoenix Emperor hadn’t suffered such heavy injuries, with his extreme speed, he would have been able to calmly retreat even if he were no match for Ling Han.","But it was a different story now.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","He continued to sustain attacks, and more and more wounds appeared on the bloody side of his body.","Boom! One after another, colossal claws shot over. The Divine Beast Great Emperors all moved, wanting to stop Ling Han from killing the True Phoenix Great Emperor.","\"Humph!\" Ling Han used the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower to protect himself as he swung his fists repeatedly.","Today, the True Phoenix Emperor had to die!","\"Ah, brat, when I revive, I’ll definitely tear you into pieces!\" the True Phoenix Emperor released his final roar.","\"Humph, you’ll only be eaten by me once more!\" Ling Han said coldly. He punched the True Phoenix Emperor to death, then directly stowed the corpse away.","Let’s go."]},{"number":4839,"title":"Chapter 4839: Sealing the passageway of the two realms","paragraphs":["Ling Han forcefully broke through the siege.","With the protection of the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, which Divine Beast Great Emperor would be able to stop Ling Han?","They could only watch helplessly as he broke through the siege, leaving them behind in his dust as they disappeared into the universe","The 35 Divine Beasts all wore grim expressions.","The death of the True Phoenix did not cause them to feel the desolate grief of seeing one of their peers die in this manner. There was only darkness and indifference.","\"This boy has succeeded, and it would be extremely difficult to stop him again.\"","\"Damn it, we guarded the Primitive Abyss for so many years, yet still made a mistake.\"","\"The Living Realm is about to collapse. At this time, no accidents can be allowed to happen.\"","\"Come, let’s go and meet those twelve fools.\"","Multiple voices rang out, but it was as if they were the voices of a single person.","...","After Ling Han broke free from the Divine Beast Great Emperors, he released all the stars inside his body.","This had been in the Primitive Abyss for several hundred years, and he had been bearing so many stars every day. Even if Ling Han already possessed the strength of a Great Emperor, he was still under a lot of pressure.","Now that all the stars had been released, Ling Han instantly felt a strong sense of relief.","And at this time, every star welcomed a wave of breakthrough.","After being separated from this heaven and earth for a long time, once they came into contact again, it was as if the Regulations of heaven and earth had materialized, which naturally led to a widespread wave of breakthroughs.","Ling Han started to revive the stars again.","In truth, even if they killed all of the Lords of Death, it would still be impossible to stop the great conflict between the Living Realm and Netherworld. The only way was to revive the Living Realm, and push the Netherworld back to its original position.","On the other hand, as long as Ling Han was reviving stars, the Lords of Death definitely wouldn’t sit by and watch.","Moreover, he also had some kind of mark on him. This was also the reason why the Lords of Death wanted to kill him.","With Ling Han’s current strength, and added with the fact that he had grasped Regulations of Life, it was naturally a piece of cake for him to revive a planet.","As the suns burned brightly, the aura of the Netherworld was slowly dissipating.","Ling Han grasped the Regulations of heaven and earth, and continued to strengthen himself.","There were a total of nine Nine Star Regulations. Thus, the Great Emperor’s limit was grasping nine Regulations.","Ordinarily, a Great Emperor would be able to cultivate four to five Nine Star Regulations in his lifetime, and while the Lords of Death were presently neither human nor ghost, after living for so many years, they must have long since grasped nine Regulations. Once they fully awakened their battle prowess, they would be the strongest in the fifth tier.","Among those who could become Emperors, which one of them was not a prodigy of their generation?","However, he wasn’t the only one at this moment. After becoming Pseudo-Emperor, those like Ding Shu, Jing Haoran and the others could also revive stars, though their rate of efficiency was far inferior to Ling Han.","This time, Ling Han and the others only revived the suns to dispel the Yin Qi. Meanwhile, they didn’t move the planets to avoid attracting the combined attack of the Divine Beast Great Emperors and the Lords of Death.","There were a total of 47 Great Emperors, so how were they supposed to block this?","Meanwhile, Ling Han aimed at the Mountain Sea Heaven.","Though there were many connecting points between the Netherworld and Living Realm, there was no doubt that the Mountain Sea Heaven was the largest passageway.","Ling Han decided to close this passageway. If they didn’t block the source, no matter how much they did, they wouldn’t be able to eradicate the chaos caused by the Netherworld.","He had set up a formation on the planets to cut off Great Emperor Tier-level divine senses. Unless they appeared close enough, it was completely impossible to discover these planets with just a sweep of divine sense.","After doing all this, Ling Han set out towards the Mountain Sea Heaven. Ding Shu and the others continued to revive suns.","How fast was Ling Han’s current speed? The golden path spread out, and in an instant, he had arrived at the Mountain Sea Heaven Heaven.","This place was lifeless, and it was no different from the Netherworld.","The power of the Netherworld originated from this place, so the transformation into the Netherworld here was also the most complete.","\"Big Rock.\" Ling Han snapped his fingers, and the rock golem tore off the rocks that formed itself and threw them towards Mountain Sea Heaven.","To this passageway of the two realms, even a colossal creature like the rock golem was still insufficient. It was extremely insignificant.","However, the rock golem’s body was made from the rocks of the Primitive Abyss. The weight of a single grain of sand was comparable to a star, so how terrifying was a single grain? What more when there were hundreds or thousands of them.","When the rock golem was almost done throwing, Ling Han shot out a punch and detonated these rocks.","Boom!","A terrifying explosion took place, and these huge rocks were all shattered, shooting out in all directions, causing a destructive blow to the Two Realm Passageway.","Ling Han stimulated these shattered particles to expand again, turning them into multiple stars that blocked this passageway.","He grasped the Regulations of heaven and earth, and went to sew up the remaining gaps in the Two Realm Passageway.","One after another, Yin souls released sharp cries, and pounced towards him.","\"Destroy!\" Ling Han said softly, but his words were immediately effective. With him at the centre, all the Yin souls in the galaxy were instantly turned into dust.","This was Imperial Might!","After three months, Ling Han finally blocked this passageway completely.","The power of heaven and earth had self-healing abilities. Thus, as long as it did not suffer any further damage, this passageway would ultimately close forever.","After doing all this, Ling Han returned.","Right now, there were 47 Great Emperors in the universe, so how could Ling Han leave with peace of mind?","Thankfully, everything was fine when he returned to the Four Origin Planet.","Ling Han decided to rest for a while and adjust his condition. Then, he would charge towards the level of Eight Star Pseudo-Emperor.","Peaceful days had not passed many days, when a sudden change took place.","A colossal star suddenly appeared out of nowhere, right next to the Four Origin Planet.","Ling Han sensed it at the first instant, and hurriedly moved, pushing this star to the side.","Yi, had this star come by bursting through the Void?","Stars could also traverse the Void?","Weng, right at this moment, a powerful aura actually seeped out of that great star, boiling like the tide.","Imperial Might!","Ling Han was surprised. There was actually a Pseudo-Emperor on this planet.","It was only an instant, and several figures flew out from that star, descending towards Four Origin Planet.","Ling Han swept an eye over them. There were a total of nine people, and they were led by a Saint. The other eight people were all very young, and there were both men and women. All of them had soaring pride.","\"We are from the Mysterious Spirit Race. Who is in charge here? Hurry up and come out to meet me!\" That Saint spoke up.","\"Yo, what big talk!\" The little azure dragon scoffed.","\"Where did this little brat come from? He actually dares to act in front of us?\" The large black dog rubbed his paws, \"Just see Grandpa Dog subdue them.\"","Ling Han waved his hand dismissively, and said, \"Use civility before resorting to force. Lead them over.\"","\"All right.\" The large black dog volunteered to take on this task.","Ling Han was very curious about this star that had suddenly appeared. Could it be that there were even more Emperor Tier-level forces in the universe?","It wasn’t long before the large black dog led nine people over.","However, Ling Han took another look, and saw that the faces of those nine people were all livid, their breathing heavy, and their footsteps slightly light.","Looks like they were really quite angered.","\"So you’re the person in charge here?\" Upon seeing Ling Han, a young man immediately chided. He was dressed in a tight-fitting green suit, and even in such a state, he was still as arrogant as before.","\"Kneel!\" the empress commanded coldly.","To dare to be rude to her man, in the eyes of the empress, this was the greatest sin."]},{"number":4840,"title":"Chapter 4840: Mysterious Spirit Planet","paragraphs":["The man in green looked at the empress, and a hint of surprise involuntarily flashed across his eyes.","An exquisite beauty, unparalleled in the world... f***!","To his shock, he discovered that there was also an innocent-looking young girl beside the empress. She was also inconceivably beautiful.","However, the difference was that the first woman was noble in beauty, while this one was delicate and innocent, as pure as water.","He shifted his gaze again, and couldn’t help but feel shocked.","How could there be more! There was more!","There were a total of four exquisite beauties, each with their own unique traits, so he did not know which one he should stare at.","The other three women were naturally Hu Niu, Chi Menghan, and Song Lan.","Then, he came back to his senses, humphed, and said, \"How dare you, to actually make me kneel! Do you know who I am?\"","\"Who knows who you are.\" On Hu Niu’s shoulder, the little red bird said, filled with disdain.","Showing off in front of Ling Han and his family, wasn’t that just asking for death?","The show-off king was sitting right there, and he didn’t even bother to consider his actions carefully.","The man in green was furious. What was going on?","All of them did not take him seriously at all?","\"I am Pu Jingming of the Mysterious Spirit Race!\" he called out loudly.","\"Never heard of it.\" The large black dog spread out his paws.","\"What remote corner of the universe have you guys popped out from?\" The little azure dragon also waggled its tail.","Pu Jingming was in a towering rage, his hands clenched into fists. He was about to go crazy.","\"Jingming, calm down!\" That Saint from the other side spoke up, and clapped a hand on Pu Jingming’s shoulder, his expression gentle.","Though it was the Saint who had spoken, it seemed like Pu Jingming did not take that Saint seriously at all. He humphed, and turned his head away.","\"I am Gong Yeliang.\" That Saint introduced himself, then continued, \"Today, our Mysterious Spirit Race has appeared, and the whole universe will obey. As witnesses of the emergence of our Mysterious Spirit Race, we allow you to join us.\"","Yi?","The large black dog couldn’t help but sneer, and said, \"Old geezer, where do you get such confidence from?\"","Gong Yeliang looked at the large black dog, and couldn’t help but feel a surge of anger.","This was a despicable dog!","Just the time they had spent on their way here just now, he was almost angered to the point of making a move.","If it was not for the fact that this was the first appearance of the Mysterious Spirit Race, and they did not wish for blood to be spilled, he would definitely make this despicable dog shut up forever.","\"Our Mysterious Spirit Race has a Pseudo-Emperor standing guard, and he will attain Dao in this lifetime!\" Gong Yeliang declared proudly.","Pseudo-Emperor had the word ’Emperor’, and that was the strongest existence in this universe.","Only one Great Emperor could appear in each era, and in the case of Pseudo-Emperors, there similarly could not be many.","Thus, Gong Yeliang had every reason to be arrogant, and it was no wonder that this group of people was so arrogant.","However, these nine people shockingly discovered that none of Ling Han and the others looked shocked.","F***, he had already mentioned a Pseudo-Emperor, and his original intention was to scare them. Who would have thought that it would be him that was shocked instead.","’Are you... all idiots?’","That’s right. This was nothing than a tiny, remote planet. Being able to produce a Sect Master was already impressive enough, so how could they possibly know the might of Pseudo-Emperor?","Thinking of this, the nine of them became even more arrogant, and looked down on the natives here even more.","Coming out of the Void and arriving at this small place was really unlucky. This was practically lowering their own status.","Gong Yeliang waved his sleeve, and said, \"I have to go back and report to the Lord Pseudo-Emperor. I’ll leave this place to you.\"","How could he lower himself to personally deal with such desolate commoners?","\"However, you definitely have to kill that despicable dog,\" he added, and then left.","This!","The large black dog wore a gloomy expression. Why was he targeting him?","Did I offend you?","’Is it my fault that I’m handsome?’","Pu Jingming humphed, and said, \"Mortals, kneel down immediately!\"","Boom, he released his own aura, which was shockingly Venerate Tier-level.","Before Ling Han and the many children of Great Emperors had appeared, he had already become a Venerate Tier when he was only a few thousand years old. He was indeed freakishly powerful.","However, there were dozens of Great Emperors in the universe now, so what was a mere Venerate Tier cultivator worth?","Yi?","Pu Jingming was surprised. Not one of these people was affected by his aura.","How was this possible?","They were merely vulgar people!","\"Hehe, even our pet pig more powerful than you,\" Hu Niu said with a snicker, appearing very naive and innocent.","Seeing this, Pu Jingming couldn’t help but feel his heart flutter. Then, he humphed. This little girl actually compared him to a pig, and thought that he was no match for a pig!","\"What a country bumpkin. After I take you in, I will definitely teach you proper etiquette!\" he said with slight disdain.","\"Stupid pig, kill him for Niu!\" Hu Niu was furious. He actually dared to covet her? Didn’t he know that she was Ling Han’s Niu?","Shua, with a wave of her hand, she threw the perverted pig out.","The pervert pig let out an innocent scream.","What did it have to do with it? Why did it have to be thrown out, b@stard?","This was really getting shot while lying down.","Seeing a pig being tossed over, Pu Jingming instantly moved instinctively, and delivered a palm strike at the perverted pig.","He smirked coldly in his mind. ’What a poor little girl! She’s actually trying to stop me with a pig!’","But right at this moment, the pervert pig moved. Pa, a hoof smashed over.","W-what!","Pu Jingming immediately paled in shock. This was Venerate Tier-level power, and a nine-star one at that.","And as for him?","Two-star Venerable Tier.","Although they were both Venerate Tiers, just how far was the gap between two stars and nine stars?","There were a whopping seven minor levels of difference. Just how overwhelming was this?","Peng!","It was only a single strike, and Pu Jingming was sent flying.","\"If this old pig doesn’t show its might, you’ll think I’m a sick cat!\" The perverted pig howled, and chased after Pu Jingming, its hooves striking endlessly.","A nine-star Venerate Tier was beating up a two-star Venerate Tier, so it was naturally like a father beating his son. How could Pu Jingming resist? He was pressed and pummeled into the ground endlessly.","Did he think that everyone was Ling Han, someone who could battle above his cultivation level?","The eyes of the seven people from Mysterious Spirit Planet were glazed over, as if they were dead fish.","Was this really a backward small star?","Why was it that any random pig that came out had the strength of a Venerate Tier, and could easily push Pu Jingming onto the ground and pummel him?","If this was a small star, then what was their Mysterious Spirit Planet worth?","What was going on?","How was this possible?","Just what kind of iron plate had they kicked?","\"Stop!\" After a long while, someone stepped out, and said in a trembling voice, \"Young Master Pu is the most beloved grandson of Lord Pseudo-Emperor. If you hurt him, Lord Pseudo-Emperor will definitely fly into a thunderous rage!\"","\"Grandpa Pig is also the beloved grandson of the Canopy Demon King. In terms of background, would Grandpa Pig be afraid?\" the perverted pig cried out.","The people from the Mysterious Spirit Planet were all in disbelief. How was this possible? Any random pig was the descendant of the Canopy Demon Emperor, so could this four-legged snake be the descendant of the Flying Snake? Was the monkey that was running over the descendant of the Battle Saint Emperor?","Peng, peng, peng! The pervert pig pummeled Pu Jingming.","\"What’s going on?\" Brother Monkey had just arrived and asked Ling Han.","\"I’m not sure yet, but I’ll find out after asking around,\" Ling Han said with a smile.","Brother Monkey nodded, and looked towards the seven people from the Mysterious Spirit Planet. The aura of a Saint fluctuated slightly, \"Where have you all come from?\""]},{"number":4841,"title":"Chapter 4841: Who’s a country bumpkin?","paragraphs":["Pa, pa, pa, pa! Pu Jingming and the others all collapsed to the ground.","They all wore expressions of shock and disbelief.","Saint!","This monkey was actually a Saint.","Er, though they had been complaining previously, a Saint Tier monkey was really qualified to be the descendant of the Battle Saint Empero.","But this was a remote and desolate place, located at the edge of the universe. How could a Saint suddenly appear here?","It should be known that these people didn’t even know what a Pseudo-Emperor was.","Strange!","However, they immediately recalled that there was a Pseudo-Emperor standing behind them.","With the word ’Emperor’, wouldn’t that Saint be like an ant?","With this in mind, they were filled with confidence.","\"No wonder you dare to be so arrogant. As it turned out, there is a Saint standing guard here,\" Pu Jingming declared proudly. Previously, he did not have much respect for their own Saint, what more when it was other Saints.","\"However, my ancestor is a Pseudo-Emperor!\" he said loudly, \"You dare to disrespect a Pseudo-Emperor?\"","Brother Monkey couldn’t help but laugh in spite of himself. He turned to Ling Han and asked, \"How can there be such a person who doesn’t know what’s good for him?\"","Ling Han shrugged and said, \"I suspect that they’ve always been living in seclusion, so their news is already seriously out-of date.\"","Otherwise, who didn’t know that Ling Han was already able to defeat Pseudo-Emperors when he was still a Saint, and after breaking through to the level of Pseudo-Emperor, he was even able to slaughter Great Emperors at the sixth tier!","In front of this kind of battle prowess, even Pseudo-Emperor would shiver.","Seeing Brother Monkey and Ling Han talking cheerfully and without any intention of paying any attention to him, Pu Jingming couldn’t help but be enraged. He shouted, \"I was talking to you guys!\"","He was the descendant of a Pseudo-Emperor, and this Pseudo-Emperor was presently in his prime. Not only had he suppressed this area for a considerable number of years, there was even a chance that he could advance further, and remove the word \"Pseudo\" from his title, becoming a genuine Great Emperor that would rule the universe.","Thus, he naturally had a reason for his pride.","Ling Han shook his head, and said, \"At first, I wanted to spare your life. However, you spoke rudely, and your thoughts are filthy. You’re truly seeking death.\"","He stretched out a hand, and tapped lightly. Pa, Pu Jingming instantly exploded, turning into a shower of blood.","The remaining seven people were drenched in blood. Their eyes were wide with fear, and even their hands and feet were trembling.","That was a descendant of a Pseudo-Emperor, yet he was killed just like that.","’Are these people maniacs?’","Oh no! Were they going to die as well?","These seven people were all scared to death. Two of the more cowardly ones even fainted in reality.","However, there were also some braver people who secretly sent out a communication signal to summon Gong Yeliang over.","Something big had happened, something big had happened.","Pu Jingming was Lord Pseudo-Emperor’s favorite descendant, yet he was now lying dead here. Once the Pseudo-Emperor knew about this, would Lord Pseudo-Emperor kill them as well in his fury?","When a Pseudo-Empero was angered, corpses would cover 500km.","\"You’ve... gotten into big trouble!\" one of them said bitterly. \"Young Master Pu is Lord Pseudo-Emperor’s most beloved descendant. Now that he’s dead, the Pseudo-Emperor will definitely fly into a thunderous rage. Not only will you guys die, but we might even die with him.\"","The seven of them shook their heads, looking like they had nothing left to live for.","\"Hey, hey, hey. Which desolate place have you guys come from?\" The large black dog couldn’t help but ask, \"How could it be that you guys haven’t heard of Little Han’s mighty name?\"","\"You people are the country bumpkins!\" the seven people retorted. \"You have no idea how powerful a Pseudo-Emperor is, that is the strongest person besides a Great Emperor! And a single Great Emperor can only appear in a whole era, reigning supreme over the universe with strength that could not be described!\"","\"Our Lord Pseudo-Emperor is only one step away from achieving Dao!\"","Oh, then that would be a Nine Star Pseudo-Emperor.","Ling Han and the others all smiled faintly. They really didn’t care. To say nothing of that person being only a Pseudo-Emperor, even if he had broken through, he would only have sixth tier battle prowess at most. He would have to cultivate several Nine Star Regulations to be able to reach fifth tier battle prowess.","Meanwhile, Ling Han’s battle prowess was currently at the sixth tier, while the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower was at the fifth tier. Once it burst out in power... so, hoho.","The large black dog was in high spirits. He wanted to clarify with these people who were the country bumpkins here.","In the argument between the large black dog and the people from the Mysterious Spirit Planet, Ling Han and the others also found out that the Mysterious Spirit Planet had been sent into the Void by that Pseudo-Emperor from a very, very long time ago, and lived isolated from the rest of the universe.","That Pseudo-Emperor had been in a deep slumber all this while, and only appeared recently, pushing the Mysterious Spirit Planet into the great world, intending to attain Dao in the present era.","Ling Han’s interest was piqued, and he wanted to meet this Pseudo-Emperor.","Weng, a powerful saintly might spread out, and Gong Yeliang reappeared.","His eyes swept over them, and couldn’t help but look surprised, \"Where’s Pu Jingming?\"","This was Lord Pseudo-Emperor’s most beloved descendant.","\"He’s, he’s dead,\" the seven people from the Mysterious Spirit Planet hurriedly replied, as if they had found their savior.","Just kill them!","Debating with the large black dog was too maddening. It was practically enough to make one want to die. That guy’s reasoning was completely twisted. He would first pull them into the lowest level, and then use his abundant experience to defeat them.","This was a comprehensive ravaging from the body to the heart.","Thus, even if they were to be killed, they would still be happy that they could die quickly.","Gong Yeliang looked towards Ling Han and the others, his eyes cold, as if these people were already dead.","\"Do you all know just how great a crime you have committed?\"","\"Oh, what crime?\" the large black dog asked with a smile. He was naturally unconcerned.","\"Death penalty!\" Gong Ye Liang raised his voice, and boom, it was instantly like the rumble of thunder.","Boom, the soundwave swept past, visible to the naked eye, like a tsunami wave.","He was truly enraged. When this soundwave surged out, it would at least cause half of the living beings on Four Origin Planet to be killed.","This was the might of a Saint!","With a casual swipe of Ling Han’s hand, a terrifying scene appeared. These sound waves actually stopped.","My, my goodness!","Gong Yeliang’s eyes almost popped out of his head in shock. Even though he had only said this casually, just how powerful was a Saint? The might of his shout was earth-shattering.","And what about the other?","With a light press of his palm, his attack was frozen in place.","Note that it was freezing and not dispersing. The two were completely different. The former was undoubtedly ten times more difficult than the latter, or even a hundred times more difficult.","Heavens! This was also a Saint? Moreover, it was a high-level Saint?","\"Old geezer, didn’t you say you wanted to kill Grandpa Dog?\" The large black dog jumped out, \"Come, Grandpa Dog will play with you!\"","Boom!","The large black dog attacked without any reservations, unleashing his full battle prowess.","Have you f****** gone mad?","The eight people of Mysterious Spirit Planet, including Gong Yeliang, all felt that this was extremely strange.","He was so crazy even on his own planet?","’Aren’t you afraid that you’ll obliterate the planet?’","Gong Yeliang had not finished his complaints, when the large black dog had already arrived in front of him, so he had no choice but to parry.","Boom!","The moment they exchanged blows, he was stunned.","Heavens, this despicable dog... was actually also a Saint.","At this moment, he was truly rendered speechless.","Being able to become a Saint even though he was so despicable, and being on equal footing with him, how could he accept this?","Since when had Saints become so cheap? Even a mere despicable dog could attain that level?","Boom!","Meanwhile, the large black dog’s attacks became more and more ferocious.","Saint-level battle prowess turned into waves that rolled out in all directions."]},{"number":4842,"title":"Chapter 4842: Pseudo-Emperor Pu Jingtian","paragraphs":["After fighting for a while, Gong Yeliang couldn’t help but find it strange.","When Saints battled, the shockwaves would be able to easily destroy a star.","But he had already exchanged close to a hundred moves with that Despicable Saint, so why had this star still not exploded?","Amidst his busy schedule, he took the time to take a look.","The large black dog was exerting far too much pressure on him, so he didn’t have any spare time at all. However, he was still extremely curious at this moment.","What he saw almost scared him out of his wits.","That was because he had seen that Ling Han had only raised his hand and pressed down, and the shockwaves created by his exchange with the large black dog had been limited to a single area, and could not spread out at all.","This... this was too strong, wasn’t it?","F***!","He was about to go crazy. The Mysterious Spirit Planet had been in seclusion for millions and millions of years, and had just appeared today. It was just about to prove its Dao in the world, and become the strongest force in the world. Why had they encountered such a group of monsters?","He was panicking.","\"Old geezer, didn’t you want to kill Grandpa Dog? Come on, come on!\" the large black dog said despicably. Then, he turned around and faced Gong Yeliang with his behind, \"Look at Grandpa Dog’s ultimate move, I’ll blind you!\"","A ray of light immediately shot out from Iron underwear, indescribably dazzling.","It should be known that this was a Saintly Material, and the large black dog was a Saint, so it naturally could forge a Saint Tool.","In the first place, Saintly Material possessed powerful defenses. Thus, the large black dog only needed to forge its offensive attributes.","And because of the despicable nature of the large black dog, the only function of this Saint Tool was to emit light.","Ordinary light naturally would not have much effect on a Saint. However, it was completely different if this function was forged from Saintly Material, and forged into a Saint Tool.","Even Saints would be dazzled by such brilliance!","\"Ah!\" Gong Yeliang released a cry, and then rapidly retreated.","’Motherf*cker!’","Tears were streaming down his face. It wasn’t because he was in pain or grief, but simply because he felt terrible from being illuminated by the light.","—To be able to illuminate a Saint to the point of tears, it was clear just how blinding this light was.","Gong Yeliang was both angered and speechless. Such a good Saintly Material was actually used to forge such a function in your hands!","Just how wasteful was this?","Just how bored are you?","That’s right. He had indeed shed tears, but it did not have much effect on his battle prowess.","Have you ever seen a Saint’s battle prowess drop drastically just because he was crying?","There was none!","Thus, the fact that this Saint Tool had been deliberately forged, illuminating others to the point of tearing up, was completely aiming to disgust others.","\"Despicable, despicable dog!\" Gong Yeliang trembled in fury. Such a Saint? Pei!","The large black dog laughed loudly, \"As expected of Grandpa Dog, forging the strongest Saint Tool in the world!\"","It continued to sway its behind. Xiu, xiu, xiu! Multiple streaks of blinding light shot out.","Could there be a second person in this world that had such a battle style?","Even Ling Han and the others couldn’t bear to look at it. They felt as if their worldview had been dragged down another level.","Ling Han couldn’t help but think. Previously, he had asked the large black dog about how far it could lower its bottom line.","This was Old Black’s answer!","Ling Han placed a hand on his forehead. On the path of despicableness, the large black dog had already left them in the dust. No one could catch up to him, and there was no sign of him turning back at all.","On the other side, Gong Yeliang was also about to throw up blood.","Though he was a Three Star Saint, he was still considerably inferior to the large black dog. Furthermore, he was now so infuriated that he had lost his sense of propriety. His battle prowess had naturally been weakened further, and it was even more impossible that he would be a match for the large black dog.","\"Despicable, despicable dog, this Saint is going to kill you, kill you!\" His fury surged, and finally, he could no longer bear it. Pu, he spluttered out a mouthful of blood, and directly collapsed to the ground, facing upwards.","The large black dog stopped attacking, and he raised his head to look at the sky. His head was at a 45-degree angle, and his paws were clasped behind his back. There was a desolate expression on his face, and he said, \"Who else could infuriate a Saint to the point of vomiting blood and passing out? Counting the heroes of the past and present, who else could it be but Grandpa Dog?\"","This... was too shameless!","However, upon further thought, only the large black dog had managed to incite a Saint to the point of vomiting blood and fainting.","\"You’re despicable enough!\" Ling Han said sincerely.","He was almost omnipotent, but in this aspect, he was indeed admitting defeat.","\"Despicable Saint, true to his name.\" The little azure dragon also sighed in admiration.","\"Ang.\" The pervert pig also nodded.","\"In future, you should stay away from Old Sun.\" The corners of Brother Monkey’s mouth also twitched, as if he was very wary of the large black dog.","Being able to make the fearless line of the Battle Saint shiver in fear, Old Black really had not lived this life for nothing.","The large black dog shook his head sheepishly. Why did everyone in the world not understand him?","It should be known that it was easy to be despicable for one moment, but difficult to be despicable for a whole lifetime.","Was it easy?","The seven people from Mysterious Spirit Planet all felt their hands and feet go cold. They could not believe their eyes at all.","Their Saint... had actually been killed!","No, no, no, no, he hadn’t died. However, if the large black dog followed up with another strike, it was guaranteed that Gong Yeliang would immediately die.","Thus, the large black dog was completely capable of killing Gong Yeliang.","It should be known that that monkey was also a Saint.","There were actually two Saints standing guard on a small planet in a remote and desolate place.","This, this, this, this, if it wasn’t for the fact that they still had Lord Pseudo-Emperor, they would really be country bumpkins.","Weng, right at this moment, a terrifying aura swept out.","Instantly, Gong Yeliang was startled awake.","\"Lord!\" He half-knelt, feeling ashamed and unable to show his face.","\"It is not your fault. You may rise.\" A voice filled with authority rang out.","\"Thank you, Lord!\" Gong Yeliang’s expression was filled with gratitude.","\"Lord!\" The other seven people from Mysterious Spirit Planet also wore fanatical expressions.","It didn’t matter. Even if you have ten Saints, so what? They have a Pseudo-Emperor.","With the word ’Emperor’, he could insta-kill all Saints.","A golden pathway stretched over from the planet in the distance. Then, a man in a golden embroidered robes stood proudly, appearing in front of everyone.","He looked to be in his thirties, tall and sturdy, exuding an indescribably majestic aura.","Pseudo-Emperor, Pu Jingtian.","He stood, arms crossed behind his back. As his eyes swept over them, it was as if he could look directly into the hearts of others. There was no secret that could be concealed.","\"Who killed my descendant?\" he asked calmly. It was clearly a very casual question, yet it seemed like a supreme decree, making one want to kneel down and answer.","However, who were the people on the Four Origin Planet?","How many Pseudo-Emperors have they seen?","Moreover, Ling Han possessed the battle prowess of a Great Emperor.","Thus, none of them showed any reaction to Pu Jingtian’s aura, and had no interest to pay him any attention.","This!","A Pseudo-Emperor had spoken, and was actually completely ignored?","The seven people from the Mysterious Spirit Planet were all furious, \"How dare you all, to actually dare show disrespect to our Lord!\"","\"You should be executed!\"","\"Being torn into ten thousand pieces, and having your whole clan executed would not be enough to offset your crime!\"","Meanwhile, Pu Jingtian raised his hand, and instantly, those seven people fell silent.","His eyes focused on Ling Han. Instinct told him that this was everyone’s center.","\"Who are you?\" he asked.","Ling Han shook his head, and said with a smile, \"This is the best era, and also the worst era.\"","’F*ck! You are not answering my question!’","Pu Jingtian stared at Ling Han, and after a long while, he finally asked solemnly, \"A Pseudo-Emperor?\"","F***, even with his calm temperament, he couldn’t help but complain."]},{"number":4843,"title":"Chapter 4843: Shaking hands and making peace","paragraphs":["Pseudo-Emperors were rare, and definitely would not outnumber Great Emperors by much.","Only one Great Emperor could appear in each era, but how many Pseudo-Emperors could appear in each era?","However, the moment Pu Jingtian appeared in this universe, he actually encountered another Pseudo-Emperor. How could he not be shocked?","Ling Han smiled faintly, \"That’s right.\"","At his current height, was there any need for him to hide his cultivation level?","En, aside from when he was showing off.","What!","The seven people from Mysterious Spirit Planet were all numb with shock, and there was a strong sense of disbelief in them.","They had just appeared in this universe, and on the first planet they saw, they actually encountered a Pseudo-Emperor?","Yi, when did Pseudo-Emperors become so common?","Pu Jingtian took a deep breath, \"Battle?\"","\"Sure,\" Ling Han said with a smile. Those who could become Pseudo-Emperors were definitely proud people. Hence, he first had to beat the other into submission.","It was just a matter of spending a little effort.","Xiu, xiu! The two of them stepped out at the same time, and stepped into space.","The large black dog and the others hurriedly followed. If it was a Pseudo-Emperor-level battle, they naturally wanted to watch, though it was definite that it would be Pu Jingtian one-sidedly being pummelled.","Gong Yeliang hurriedly followed behind. Meanwhile, he was filled with confidence in Pu Jingtian. Even if Ling Han was a Pseudo-Emperor, the victor would definitely be Pu Jingtian.","In the distant galaxy, Ling Han and Pu Jingtian stood 50 kilometers away from each other.","For elites like them, a distance of 50km was actually just a matter of lifting a foot.","\"Only one Great Emperor is allowed to emerge in an era,\" Pu Jingtian stated calmly, \"Thus, allowing me to meet you here is also the arrangement of the heaven and earth, to see which of us would be more qualified to become Emperor.\"","\"Come on.\" Ling Han crooked a finger at him.","There was something that he did not say. If he went through the normal channels, there would indeed only be one Great Emperor in an era, but he could go through the unusual channels, and go to the Primitive Abyss to prove his Dao.","Thus... there was actually no conflict between them, so they could not be considered competitors.","However, only Ling Han and Ling Han could travel to the Imperial Island as Pseudo-Emperor, and even bring others with him. Otherwise, even the Great Emperor could not accomplish this!","Only Ling Han could open this back door.","—If it was Ding Shu and the others, they could indeed bring others to the Imperial Island, but the prerequisite was that they had to become Emperors first.","Hence, it was back to square one.","Pu Jingtian showed a hint of displeasure. He was a Pseudo-Emperor, and even against a real Great Emperor, there was no need for him to be humble.","’You’re playing it down so easily?’","’Fine, I’ll show you my strength first, and you’ll know what kind of attitude you should use to deal with me.’","He moved, and delivered a palm strike at Ling Han.","Boom, this palm was earth-shattering, as if it had covered half the galaxy.","Ling Han casually snapped his fingers. Pa! His palm shattered into pieces.","Sixth tier battle prowess wasn’t just empty boasting!","However, Pu Jingtian wasn’t shocked. After all, the first strike was only a probe. If Ling Han had to use his full strength to block even this strike, his battle prowess would truly be as weak as could be.","He delivered another strike. This time was different. Power condensed, turning into a God Tool that was entwined with eight-star Regulations, but there was a thin line of nine-star Regulations that linked the eight-star Regulations together.","This formed a qualitative change.","It could crush all Saints!","Ling Han nodded. One only had to see the level of Nine Stars Regulations that he had grasped to know whether a Pseudo-Emperor was strong or not.","This person was a Nine Star Pseudo-Emperor, and the Nine Star Regulations that he had grasped... had practically reached the complete state.","Thus, this person was truly only a single step away from becoming a Great Emperor.","As long as the heaven and earth blessed him, and allowed him to come into contact with the Nine Star Regulations a few more times, he would be able to cross over the final threshold, and attain Dao in the present era!","However, in front of Ling Han, this was completely inadequate.","Ling Han casually waved his hand, and the God Tool that slashed over was easily shattered.","\"How is this possible!\" In the distance, Gong Yeliang was so shocked that his scalp was numb.","He naturally knew how powerful Pu Jingtian was, but such a powerful existence was actually unable to suppress Ling Han.","Hiss, could it be that this could also be a Pseudo-Emperor that was about to attain Dao?","Meanwhile, the large black dog shook his head, \"Sigh, Little Han is showing off again.\"","\"A dog can’t change its habit of eating sh*t!\" The little azure dragon was also disdainful.","Otherwise, Ling Han would have been able to suppress Pu Jingtian with a single move.","\"Four-Legged Snake, who are you insulting!\" The large black dog was displeased. What did he mean by a dog can’t change its habit of eating sh*t?","Have you seen Grandpa Dog eat sh*t before?","\"The insult is for whoever answers.\" The little azure dragon wasn’t afraid either.","The two of them immediately looked at each other with bloodshot eyes.","In the distance, Pu Jingtian continuously channelled powerful moves, pouring out a storm of attacks towards Ling Han.","Yet Ling Han only casually flicked his hand and waved his palm, as if he was not facing a Pseudo-Emperor, but was just some random person who could not be anymore ordinary, and there was absolutely no need for him to go all out.","As a Pseudo-Emperor, Pu Jingtian’s willpower was naturally tenacious, and definitely could not shake his fighting spirit. However, faced with an opponent like Ling Han, he felt an indescribable chill rise up in him.","How could he be so powerful?","They were both Pseudo-Emperors, and he was a Nine Star Pseudo-Emperor at that. He had walked to the end of the level of Pseudo-Emperor, so why was he still unable to suppress Ling Han?","The feeling that Ling Han gave him was only one word: unfathomable.","After several hundred more exchanges, Pu Jingtian finally stopped in disappointment.","\"Yi, why have you stopped fighting?\" Ling Han asked in surprise.","’You did it on purpose, didn’t you?’","Pu Jingtian sighed, \"I cannot defeat you.\"","However, as a Pseudo-Emperor, he was also incredibly proud.","’I can’t defeat you, but I won’t lose either.’","Ling Han smiled, not bothering to argue with him at all.","He was a mighty sixth tier battle prowess elite, so what need was there for him to lower himself to the level of a Pseudo-Emperor?","This was demeaning!","\"Come, let’s exchange information,\" Ling Han said.","Pu Jingtian thought for a moment, \"All right.\"","His story was relatively simple.","Several hundred million years ago, he had already advanced into the level of Pseudo-Emperor. In fact, he had even charged all the way to nine stars, and was invincible in this world!","However, the Great Emperor of that era had just died, and the heaven and earth still did not allow the birth of a new Great Emperor.","Pu Jingtian was dissatisfied. He had travelled the world, and had coincidentally obtained the Primordial Source Clay and a mysterious stone slab. He had foreseen a little bit of the future.","Thus, he pushed the entire Mysterious Spirit Planet into the Void, and used the power of a Pseudo-Emperor to protect it. Then, he used the Primordial Source Clay to seal himself, and only appeared not too long ago.","Ling Han wanted to take a look at this stone slab, but was told by Pu Jingtian that the stone slab had already turned into dust.","He could only give up.","And when Pu Jingtian found out about the present situation from Ling Han, he was also stunned for a moment.","What was going on here? There were actually 47 Great Emperors in the current era?","Furthermore, it was highly possible that it would very soon become forty-eight.","Since when did Great Emperors appear by the batches?","However, a Pseudo-Emperor was a Pseudo-Emperor, and after a slight shock, he immediately strengthened his resolve.","If he became Emperor, he would definitely sweep aside all evil and restore order.","Ling Han nodded internally. As expected, those who could become Pseudo-Emperors had no lack of intelligence and decisiveness.","The two Pseudo-Emperors had already shook hands and made peace, so the others naturally dared not have any objections. However, the people of the Mysterious Spirit Planet still had some resentment about Four Origin Planet.","After all, Pu Jingming had died in Ling Han’s hands."]},{"number":4844,"title":"Chapter 4844: Taking the initiative to attack","paragraphs":["Pu Jingming had been killed by a Pseudo-Emperor. Hence, even Pu Jingtian had not sought Ling Han out for an accounting, so naturally, no one dared to say anything.","However, in their daily interactions, the people of the Mysterious Spirit Planet all clearly revealed animosity, and deliberately distanced themselves from the people of Four Origin Planet.","It was inevitable that both sides would be boasting.","The people of Mysterious Spirit Planet said that in Pu Jingtian’s era, he was invincible in the world. If it was not for the fact that he was born at the wrong time, he would have long since become a Great Emperor that had suppressed an era.","And those from the Four Origin Planet scoffed. Their Lord Ling Han was still a Pseudo-Emperor, yet he could already match a Great Emperor. Even if your Pseudo-Emperor had really attained Dao, it would only be a tie.","This was naturally mocked by the people of the Mysterious Spirit Planet. What kind of joke was this? A Pseudo-Emperor could match a Great Emperor?","You’ve read too many novels.","The people of Mysterious Spirit Planet had a very good reason to be proud, because the heaven and earth was about to allow a Great Emperor to attain Dao, and Pu Jingtian had long since cultivated to become a nine-star Pseudo-Emperor. Thus, he undoubtedly grasped the initiative, and stood at the forefront.","As long as the heaven and earth allowed it, Pu Jingtian would be able to attain Dao and become a Great Emperor. Then, all the other mediocre cultivators, such as Pseudo-Emperors, would only be able to bow down in front of him.","\"Little Han, are we really going to just let them be?\" The large black dog pointed at the galaxy from afar, and that was where the Mysterious Spirit Planet was located, \"That Jingtian or whatever is clearly just temporarily holding back. Once he becomes Emperor, I’m afraid that the first one to be dealt with would be you.\"","This was an Imperial Might, so who dared to provoke it?","Thus, now that Pu Jingtian’s most beloved descendant had died, how could it be that he would sit by and watch the murderer jump around in front of him?","He had not turned hostile now, because he had no chance of winning.","Moreover, they were both Pseudo-Emperors. If one was determined to flee, how coudl the other stop him?","Thus, even if Pu Jingtian was filled with killing intent towards Ling Han, he could only endure it for now.","When he became a Great Emperor, he would be able to sweep aside all opposition in the world. What enemy could he not kill?","Ling Han smiled faintly, and said, \"Those who can become Emperor should know which should be the priority between personal enmity and the calamity of the world. Thus, if he discovers that he’s no match for me, he’ll still obediently target the external enemy.\"","Otherwise, even though he had become a Great Emperor, there was already no one in this world that he could rule over. In that case, what difference did it make whether he was the strongest or the weakest?","The lofty status of a Great Emperor was only proven when the weak existed.","\"Little Han, you’re still too soft-hearted. Otherwise, if it were Grandpa Dog, I’d kill him first. In any case, this kind of person won’t be of much help in the end,\" the large black dog said with pursed lips.","Becoming Emperor was difficult, and if one wanted to grow to the level of opposing the old Divine Beast, that would be even more difficult.","There was already not much time left. Thus, if he wanted to wait until Pu Jingtian had succeeded Dao and become Emperor, and further advanced into the third tier, the battle prowess of the second tier was even further out of reach. In fact, it was something that he would never be able to realize.","Just look at the Battle Saint Emperor and the others. Just how long had they stayed in the Primitive Abyss? However, the strongest had only advanced into the fourth tier, and there was no hope for them to even advance into the third tier. Thus, with so many Great Emperors joining forces, they would only be suppressed and beaten by the old Divine Beast.","The only thing that the Great Emperors could do was delay the old Divine Beast for a while.","Thus, even if Pu Jingtian could become Emperor, the help he could bring would still be limited.","After all, he wasn’t such a freakish being, also having the ability to challenge those above his cultivation level even among Great Emperor.","Ling Han smiled. Standing at his current height, he would no longer fuss over such trivial matters. Most importantly, he had not lost out on this matter, and his abilities were completely superior. Thus, he was naturally detached from the rest.","The danger of destruction could arrive at any time, so everyone made the most of their time to cultivate.","Perhaps, just a little bit stronger, and he would be able to survive this most dangerous tribulation.","The people on the Mysterious Spirit Planet were still relatively polite toward the cultivators from the Four Origin Planet. However, they appeared extremely proud before the other Imperial Clans.","My family has a Pseudo-Emperor, whereas you guys are merely depending on the fact that you have an Imperial Weapon. This was a completely different concept.","—In the past, when the Buddha Doga appeared, which member of the Imperial Clan would not shiver in fear? Even if a Saint died, would they dare to make a peep at the Buddha Doga?","Thus, even if the Pseudo-Emperor couldn’t face the Imperial Weapon head-on, he was still superior to the Imperial Clans.","This rendered those Imperial Clans speechless. They had been tyrannical for so long, and now, they were actually being bullied!","They brought up Ling Han, and said that Ling Han had long since possessed the battle prowess of a Great Emperor. Pu Jingtian was nothing at all.","In the eyes of the people from the Mysterious Spirit Planet, this was naturally nonsense.","If a Pseudo-Emperor had the battle prowess of a Great Emperor, then what would be left of the order of martial arts?","Even if they were bragging, they couldn’t be so extravagant.","Why are you all like this?","With this kind of concept, no matter who later boasted about Ling Han’s battle merits, the people of Mysterious Spirit Planet all thought that they were boasting, and scoffed even more.","Ling Han didn’t spend his energy on such trivial matters. He left the rock golem behind to keep watch while he continued to revive suns.","With the rock golem standing guard, he was not afraid that Pu Jingtian would suddenly become hostile.","However, Pu Jingtian also had self-awareness. At present, there was a 99% chance that he was no match for Ling Han. Thus, he focused all his energy on cultivating in seclusion. Once the great fortune of heaven and earth was revealed, he would take that final step.","After waiting for hundreds of millions of years, he was extremely eager to become Emperor.","The Great Emperor ruled his own era.","In these few years, Ding Shu Jing Haoran and Shui Qingchang were all attacked several times. However, Ling Han also passed on the Phoenix Wings Divine Flight to them, and added with the fact that they still had the Imperial Weapon, with their intelligence, they immediately broke out of the siege. Naturally, they couldn’t be detained by the Great Emperors.","Ling Han, on the other hand, kept wanting to encounter the Lords of Death, but he never had the chance.","In the blink of an eye, seventy years had passed.","Ling Han walked around the world as usual, continuously reviving suns.","Under the full sunlight, the aura of the Netherworld would quickly dissipate. On the other hand, if one wanted to kill an entire galaxy, they couldn’t simply obliterate the stars. Instead, they had to fill the entire galaxy with the aura of the Netherworld. Only then would they be able to transform the Living Realm into the Netherworld.","Why was there so much of a difference in the difficulty level between the positive and the negative?","It was very simple, because this was the Living Realm in the first place, and with the Regulations of the Living Realm as support, it was naturally easier to recover than to convert.","Ling Han walked alone. Behind him, the dark galaxy was illuminated by the blazing sun, as if it was paying respects to him.","’Hmm?’","Ling Han suddenly paused. He could sense a powerful aura approaching.","Boom!","Behind him, a sun exploded, and a powerful shockwave swept over at a terrifying speed.","Ling Han couldn’t help but raise a brow, turning to look.","A Great Emperor had arrived.","Whether it was the Lord of Death or the Divine Beast Great Emperor, he was unafraid. Thus, Ling Han took the initiative to greet them.","Ahead of him, a black mist appeared, even larger than the galaxy itself.","Wherever the black mist passed, the sun would be instantly extinguished, and innumerable Yin souls would also fly out of the black mist, spewing out the air of death. Not only did they stop the Living Realm from recovering, it was also transforming the Living Realm into the environment of the Netherworld.","\"Humph!\" Ling Han dashed over in a single stride, then threw a punch.","Boom, a terrifying power surged. This was sixth tier battle prowess!","The Great Emperor in the black mist didn’t dare to face this attack head-on, and he hurriedly retreated.","However, the Great Emperor managed to dodge this strike, so how could Yin souls possibly do so?","The Imperial Might swept over, and all the Yin souls were turned into ashes.","\"Tell me your name, and I’ll send you on your way!\" Ling Han said calmly. So what if this was a Great Emperor? He had killed more than one of them."]},{"number":4845,"title":"Chapter 4845: Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperor","paragraphs":["The black mist billowed, and it was as if it were expressing the fury of that Great Emperor.","What Great Emperor had not ruled an era on their own?","Now that someone was actually provoking him like this, he was naturally furious.","Boom, a large hand swatted out of the black mist, pressing down on Ling Han.","\"Scram!\" Ling Han roared. He swung his iron fist. Peng! Not only did he shatter the large hand, but his power didn’t decrease either. It continued to attack the black mist.","The Void vibrated, and that Lord of Death’s body was actually blasted back more than 30,000 miles. As it swept by, stars shattered one after another.","Why was it that after the Primitive Age, no Emperor would see another Emperor?","This was because the Great Emperor was far too powerful!","Once they started fighting, they could obliterate stars at any moment.","Hence, from now onwards, a Great Emperor would never see another Great Emperor. Naturally, there was no longer any battle between Great Emperors, and peace returned to the world.","Now, the two great Emperor Tier-level battle prowess clashed, instantly causing massive damage.","Thankfully, these stars were all dead stars now, so there was absolutely no need to worry about causing any casualties.","Ling Han let out a battle cry, and had already caught up to him. He threw another punch.","\"Brat!\" The Lord of Death seemed to have been angered, but what use was that? His present battle prowess was only in the seventh tier, while Ling Han was in the sixth tier. Even if Ling Han could not crush him, he could at least suppress him in all aspects.","Thus, no matter how furious this Lord of Death was, it was useless. He could only be sent flying left and right by Ling Han’s attacks.","\"Yi, so this is the Great Emperor?\"","\"So-so!\"","Pa, pa, pa! Ling Han continued to throw punches, treating the Lord of Death like a punching bag.","There was a gap of a level, and the gap in battle prowess was really irreparable.","\"You guys made yourselves become neither human nor ghost, just to be thrashed by me?\"","\"Too weak! Really too weak!\"","As Ling Han fought, he continued to mock and ridicule him.","It should be known that his verbal prowess had been taught personally by the large black dog. Just how terrifying was this might?","Which Great Emperor could withstand this?","Boom!","This Lord of Death finally went all out. With a loud roar, a large amount of black mist was absorbed into his body, revealing a dried corpse.","It was completely impossible to tell which Great Emperor in history could match him.","However, an instant later, this Great Emperor’s body exuded an aura of life. His body became plump, his skin became smooth and plump, and his black hair billowed in the wind.","Very quickly, a captivating middle-aged man appeared in front of Ling Han.","An indescribable might. It was as if he only had to raise a brow, and even the heavens would collapse.","This was the true Imperial Might.","Ling Han’s eyes narrowed. Under his coercion and ridicule, he finally forced this Great Emperor to use his true power.","He didn’t know how many times the Lords of Death could enter their strongest state, but it was definitely limited.","Hence, he only had to mock them a few more times, and threaten them a few more times, and these Lords of Death would collapse by themselves.","Destroying a group of Great Emperors was quite fun just thinking about it.","\"I am Ten Thousand Shadows Thousand!\" the middle-aged man said calmly. However, the heavens and earth were rumbling, and it was as if they were trembling under his might.","Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperor!","Ling Han immediately matched this name with a Great Emperor in history. He shook his fists, \"Come battle!\"","At this moment, his fighting spirit finally blazed.","If he bullied the weak, it was absolutely impossible that he would be filled with fighting spirit.","\"Die!\" The Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperor moved, delivering a palm strike at Ling Han.","It was also a palm strike, but the might this time was incomparable to before.","Fifth tier!","This was the battle prowess of a peak stage fifth tier Great Emperor in his prime condition.","This was the strongest level that could be attained in the universe. The Great Emperor was the greatest prodigy of his generation. As long as one lived long enough, who could not rush to this kind of height?","Emperor Tier represented invincibility!","Boom, with this palm strike, nine Nine Star Regulations appeared.","Ling Han discovered that he was actually unable to move.","An Emperor’s words would take solid form and be realized.","Thus, after the Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperor said the word ’die’, the heaven and earth seemed to carry out this willpower, locking down on Ling Han and making it difficult for him to move.","Ling Han laughed loudly, and a terrifying power surged. Peng, the shackles of heaven and earth instantly shattered. He brandished his fists to greet the attack.","Peng!","Instantly, his body turned into a speck of light, and was instantly blasted into an endless distance.","Previously, Ling Han had used his advantage of one tier to suppress the Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperor. Now, however, the tables had turned. The Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperor had an advantage of one tier, and could similarly crush Ling Han.","Xiu, Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperor caught up to him, and delivered another palm strike.","Ling Han stopped, and with a battle cry, he exchanged blows with Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperor.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","With every exchange of blows, Ling Han would be sent flying once. The power gap between them was really too wide.","However, Ling Han’s physique was also freakish. At that time, the True Dragon was known as the leader of the Divine Beasts, and that was due to its invincible physique. Now, though Ling Han was slightly inferior, he was only inferior by a single tier to the Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperor.","Relying on the toughness of his physique, he was completely capable of taking it head-on.","On the surface, Ling Han was completely outmatched, but in truth, he didn’t suffer any injuries at all. Of course, his blood and Qi would definitely be boiling, and his chest would feel slightly uncomfortable, as if he had motion sickness.","Why was Ling Han doing this?","Simple, he was wasting time here.","Though Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperor had now burst out with fifth tier battle prowess, in essence, he was not a true Great Emperor. Thus, as long as he continued to drag things out, he was sure that the latter would very soon fall out of the level of Great Emperor Tier in terms of battle prowess.","At that time, he would be able to do as he liked.","—If he summoned the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, wouldn’t he also be able to exhaust him?","This was indeed the case. However, once he displayed the strength that could rival Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperor, would he still battle him to the death?","He would definitely choose to flee.","Thus, Ling Han could only give the other some benefits first, and give him hope that he could kill him. Only then would he be able to kill this ancient Great Emperor here.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","The Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperor unleashed his full battle prowess, unleashing his devastating Imperial Might. Wherever he passed, planets would be obliterated.","Going by his method of destruction, it would probably only take one to two months, and there would not be a single complete star in the whole galaxy.","Ling Han frowned at this. Although obliterating stars couldn’t transform the Living Realm into the Netherworld, it could slow down the recovery process.","Just like now, he only had to awaken a sun, and under the full light of the sun, he would soon be able to expel all darkness and evil, and return a bright and clear world to the universe.","They couldn’t go on like this.","Moreover, the Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperor was embroiled in a battle here. Even if he was too embarrassed to send out a signal, he was sure that the other Great Emperors would also sense that something was off, and rush over to provide reinforcements.","He had to deal with this as soon as possible.","Ling Han summoned the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, and the precious tower instantly lit up. Zi, zi, zi, lightning flashed, intertwining with blazing white.","Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperor couldn’t help but stop attacking. His eyes focused on Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, and a hint of suspicion appeared on his face.","Why did this Imperial Weapon give him a feeling of pressure?","It should be known that though the Imperial Weapon had the word ’Emperor’, just like the Imperial Formation, it belonged to the bottom tier of Emperor-level power.","But now, it actually made him, a Great Emperor, feel a sense of pressure. Just how inconceivable was this?","\"What kind of Imperial Weapon is this?\" he couldn’t help but ask."]},{"number":4846,"title":"Chapter 4846: Ten million doppelgangers","paragraphs":["\"You guess,\" Ling Han said with a smile.","Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperor humphed. After becoming a Great Emperor, who would dare to talk back to him?","However, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower hovered above Ling Han’s head, pouring down an air of Primal Chaos and lightning, making him have a premonition that it was extremely likely that he wouldn’t be able to break through the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower’s defenses and would be struck by lightning.","\"Tool, no matter how strong it is, it is still a Tool,\" this Great Emperor stated calmly, showing his invincible confidence.","No matter how strong a Tool was, it was still a Tool. It had been forged by a human, and on the level of humans, was there anyone that could match a Great Emperor?","Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperor made his move again. However, though his words sounded relaxed, he was actually not careless at all. With a single step, he actually split into two, and each figure charged towards Ling Han respectively.","Er... one of them should be a fake, right?","To block the attack of a Great Emperor, Ling Han would have to go all out. This meant that Ling Han would have to make a choice, and could only block one of the two Great Emperors.","Otherwise, if he blocked both of them, it was destined that his power would be divided, and he would definitely be defeated.","Ling Han did not experience a dilemma. He had the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower face off against a Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperor, while he chose the other.","It should be known that he was not weak either.","Peng! Peng!","There were two loud explosions, and the two Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperors were both obliterated.","Yi?","Ling Han looked into the distance, only to see another Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperor standing there.","They were fake. The two Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperors were both illusions, and this was the real deal.","The Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperor smiled faintly, and from within his body, Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperors walked out one after another. Ten, a hundred, a thousand, gods, there were thousands of them!","No wonder he was called Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperor. He really transformed into thousands of shadows.","There were so many Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperors surrounding Ling Han, and every single one of them was exuding the same aura, which could not be distinguished at all.","—If it was easy to distinguish, then the Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperor would not be worthy of the title of \"Ten Thousand Shadows\".","Every Great Emperor had been invincible for so long, so they definitely had their own unique skills.","The True Dragon’s strength was physique, the True Phoenix possessed speed, and in the case of this Great Emperor, he possessed shadow doppelgangers.","Ling Han activated his eye technique, but this time, the eye technique couldn’t help him much.","It was hard to tell, but it seemed like every single Great Emperor was real.","Xiu, right at this moment, all the Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperors charged over, launching an attack at Ling Han.","Only one was real.","Which one was it?","Ling Han let out a battle cry, and brandished his iron fists repeatedly.","Under such circumstances, he was also forced to unleash his full potential, instantly throwing countless punches.","Peng, peng, peng! Each punch landed on the Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperors. In an instant, there were 10,000 punches, and it was guaranteed that every single Great Emperor would be struck once.","However, after launching so many punches in an instant, Ling Han was also under immense pressure. His face had turned pale, and his limbs were trembling.","\"There you are!\" Ling Han said with a smile. The Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower shot out to greet a Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperor.","Peng, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower unleashed its might and sent the Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperor flying.","\"Hahaha!\" All the Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperors were laughing loudly, \"I have to admit that I am impressed with you. You have thought of a way to deal with it in such a short amount of time. However, under sucha high burden of repeatedly attacking, how many moves can you last?\"","\"A hundred moves? Or a thousand moves?\" He shook his head, \"At that time, it would be the time of your death.\"","Ling Han laughed loudly, \"No matter how many moves it has to be, I will still kill you!\"","He was filled with anticipation.","Though he had already killed Emperors before, those were created by the old Divine Beast, and could not be considered true Great Emperors.","And only if he could kill a Great Emperor in his prime, would that be considered his true accomplishment.","\"What an arrogant guy!\" The Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperor sneered. In such a situation, Ling Han still dared to speak tough?","\"Die!\" he roared. His 10,000 clones attacked Ling Han again.","However, Ling Han didn’t attack like he had before. Instead, he remained still and motionless like a hunting panther.","However, countless attacks were about to arrive, so if you didn’t move, wouldn’t that be courting death?","Shua, right at this moment, Ling Han suddenly moved.","He set his eyes on one of the Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperors, and pounced directly at him.","\"En?\" That Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperor let out a surprised exclamation, as if he was shocked.","Peng!","Ling Han and the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower combined forces to attack this Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperor. Instantly, this Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperor was forced back, and the other Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperors were unable to break through the air of Primal Chaos.","They were all fakes!","Although the doppelganger possessed Emperor Tier aura, and could suppress even Pseudo-Emperors, against the defenses of the fifth tier-level Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, it was useless no matter how many of them there were.","Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperor frowned and said, \"You actually managed to find my true self!\"","A puzzled expression appeared on his face. Had Ling Han simply guessed randomly, or had he accurately guessed it?","If he had guessed correctly, then this guy’s luck was really too good, and he was really too bold.","But if it was the latter, how would he be able to determine it?","He could guarantee that every doppelganger possessed the same aura as the real one.","Again!","Tens of thousands of doppelgangers attacked again, and he was also among them, like the most outstanding assassin in the world.","However, after Ling Han sensed for a while, he immediately threw a punch, and together with the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, they launched an attack, aimed directly at his true self.","Peng!","Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperor was once again sent backwards. A puzzled expression appeared on his face, and he asked, \"How did you discover my true self?\"","Ling Han smiled, \"My eyesight is good.\"","Good, good eyesight?","Good your sister!","Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperor wanted to curse. Was this a matter of good eyesight?","’If you don’t want to say, then don’t say. Is it very fun to tease others?’","However, he was truly curious. This shadow doppelganger skill of his was one of the best, and it was guaranteed that even other Great Emperors would not be able to see through it.","This was also one of the reasons why he dared to be so forceful with Ling Han. If he wanted to flee, there were millions of shadow doppelgangers, so which one would Ling Han chase?","Of course, this was his trump card. His greatest hope was still to kill Ling Han.","Ling Han took the initiative to attack. Though Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperor once again summoned tens of thousands of clones, he could always aim directly at the real Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperor. He was completely unaffected.","After several times, the Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperor had no choice but to admit that Ling Han had really cracked his shadow doppelganger move.","He was a Great Emperor, after all, so he quickly came to a realization. \"I understand now. Previously, you didn’t hesitate to expend a lot of energy and clashed with all my doppelgangers. You were doing some kind of appraisal.\"","Ling Han laughed loudly, \"As expected of the Great Emperor. I can’t hide it from you!\"","Previously, he had attacked all the shadow doppelgangers, not because he had acted rashly and without thought, but because he had memorized the power fluctuations of all the shadow doppelgangers.","In order to cause disturbance, the power fluctuations of these shadow doppelgangers varied greatly. Thus, it was practically impossible to find the true self in an instant. Even other Great Emperors would find it very difficult to do so.","However, Ling Han managed to do so, though it was very straining, and he also had to make a judgement before he made a move.","Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperor didn’t retract his shadow doppelgangers. Instead, he continued to expend his energy, continuing to attack Ling Han with his tens of thousands of doppelgangers.","How could he not tell? Though Ling Han could neutralize his powerful move, it was not an easy feat either.","And as long as he could seize a chance, he would be able to kill Ling Han."]},{"number":4847,"title":"Chapter 4847: Comprehension of the Netherworld","paragraphs":["Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperor was waiting for Ling Han to make a mistake, and wasn’t Ling Han the same?","The Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower could unleash the might of the fourth tier, but it was only a tier’s difference, so it was almost impossible to achieve an absolute kill.","After the attack, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower needed to recover for a whole 10 days. This was enough time for Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperor to flee, or for reinforcements to arrive.","Thus, Ling Han had to wait for an opportunity, or create an opportunity to deliver an explosive, fatal strike.","Among those who could become Emperor, which one of them was not an outstanding talent among men?","Ling Han and Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperor were both waiting for the other to make a mistake, and were also actively creating opportunities. However, both sides were cautious enough, and neither made a mistake nor fell into the other’s trap.","Ling Han couldn’t help but sigh with emotion. The Great Emperor that had reached this level through cultivation to become was completely different from a Great Emperor that was created.","The difference was really too great.","Previously, when he had killed the True Phoenix Emperor, though Ling Han had also expended some effort, it could not be considered as exhausting, but faced with Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperor, no matter what he did, he had no way to lure him into taking the bait, or create an opportunity for himself.","Of course, it was the same for the Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperor, adn the two of them could be considered to be stuck in a tie.","In a situation when battle prowess was more or less equal, an Emperor wanted to kill an Emperor?","That was impossible.","However, Ling Han still had the initiative in the end.","Firstly, he had a chance for the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower to release a burst of explosive power, and secondly, Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperor couldn’t possibly stay in this state forever.","However, after a long battle, Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperor’s reinforcements also arrived.","Three Lords of Death, as well as seven Divine Beast Great Emperors.","Faced with such a lineup, how could Ling Han possibly linger in battle?","\"Ten Thousand Shadows Old Demon, I’ll come and take your dog head next time!\" Ling Han laughed loudly. Then, without hesitation, he turned around and left quickly.","The other Great Emperors arrived, yet they were already unable to catch up to Ling Han. Ling Han possessed the Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, and even the True Phoenix Emperor could only stand on equal footing with him.","At this time, Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperor suddenly targeted the seven Divine Beast Great Emperors.","After he entered his prime condition, he needed to absorb a great amount of life essence. Otherwise, he could only expend his own life essence, and that meant that he was walking step by step towards death.","Thus, he needed to absorb the essence of life now. For this reason, he was willing to kill his \"allies\".","To him, the Divine Beast Great Emperors could not be considered allies. They could only be considered a temporary cooperation, and the goal was to get rid of Ling Han.","However, when it concerned oneself, he naturally could forget about it without the slightest hesitation.","\"There’s no need to make a move. We can provide you with some life essence,\" the seven Divine Beast Great Emperors said at the same time.","Yi?","The Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperor was slightly surprised. He had not thought that the seven Divine Beast Great Emperors would actually be so \"generous\".","However, this was something that he could not refuse. Immediately, he opened his mouth and sucked. Instantly, the life essence of the seven Divine Beast Great Emperors surged out, and was absorbed by Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperor.","After a while, the Ten Thousand Shadows Saint EMperor stopped. He had clearly absorbed a large amount of life essence, yet his body had instead become shriveled and thin. His body was once again enveloped in black mist, and it was hard to see him in the slightest.","\"Thanks,\" he said calmly.","\"Heh, we have a common goal, so there’s no need to thank us,\" Bi Fang Emperor said. \"The problem now is that brat is becoming more and more powerful. How can we eradicate him?\"","This caused the four Lords of Death to fall silent. At this time, Ling Han already possessed the power of a Great Emperor, so it would not be easy to find him, and it would be even more difficult to detain him.","Even Saints would find it difficult to kill Saints, what more when a Great Emperor wanted to kill another Great Emperor.","Furthermore, aside from the ancient times, when had there ever been two Great Emperors that were alive at the same time in this world?","So what if they were as powerful as Great Emperors? They couldn’t think of any good solution at all.","...","Ling Han circled around, and did not return to Four Origin Planet.","Right now, the safest option for the Four Origin Planet was to stay as far away as possible.","The target of the Lords of Death and the Divine Beast Great Emperors was him, so they would only spend a lot of effort to search for him. Thus, as long as he didn’t return to the Four Origin Planet, the Four Origin Planet would be safe.","He continued to revive suns, sweeping through Yin souls.","The Living Realm was slowly recovering.","After all, this was the Living Realm. With the power of heaven and earth actively expelling it, once the Yin souls were destroyed, the environment would naturally transform faster back to the Living Realm.","During this process, Ling Han continuously experienced the Regulations of Death.","The Regulations of Death should belong to the Netherworld, but Ling Han didn’t feel like he couldn’t grasp it.","That was because above the Regulations of Death was the essence of death.","Elements of heaven and earth could be grasped, so why couldn’t Regulations be grasped?","The other side of life was death. Ling Han had mastered the Regulations of Life, so it was actually the easiest to master the Regulations of Death.","The current star was in a state of death, and Ling Han revived it. This was the effect of the Regulations of Life, but at the same time, it also allowed him to see a sliver of the profoundness of the Regulations of Death.","As time passed, Ling Han revived more and more stars, and his understanding of the Regulations of Death also became deeper and deeper. However, he was still a little bit away from grasping it.","This was a Regulation that did not belong to the Living Realm, so it was naturally difficult to grasp it. In fact, it was theoretically impossible.","But who asked this universe to be shattered?","The invasion of the Netherworld caused the power of heaven and earth of the Living Realm to become weaker, and the suppression on Ling Han was also pitifully small, giving him this possibility.","The Lords of Death and the others naturally wouldn’t sit by and watch. They continously opened passageways to the Netherworld, allowing large amounts of Yin souls to enter.","Ling Han decided that he would enter the Netherworld again.","Firstly, it was to strengthen his understanding of the Regulations of Death, and secondly, if he killed all the Yin souls, where would the Lords of Death find Yin souls to assimilate the Living Realm?","Having made up his mind, he immediately found a weak point of the two realms and entered the Netherworld.","Yin souls actually came from the dead beings of the Living Realm, and now that almost all the stars of the Living Realm had died out, it naturally added countless Yin souls to the Netherworld for a short period of time. However, this was killing the goose that lays the golden egg. In the future, without the Living Realm to supply Yin souls, the number of Yin souls would decrease with each death.","Ling Han shuttled through the Netherworld. He didn’t even need to attack. Once his flaming wings soared into the sky, Yin souls of all levels would die at the slightest touch.","The Netherworld could go to the Living Realm to commit a massacre, so how could it be that he couldn’t do the same?","Originally, Yin and Yang were in order, and would not interfere with each other. Now that the Netherworld had broken the rules, there was naturally no need for him to adhere to any more rules.","However, the Netherworld was too large. Even with Ling Han’s Emperor Tier abilities, it would still take an incredibly long time for him to cover every inch of land.","After several hundred years, Ling Han’s comprehension of the Regulations of Death had deepened greatly, and the most direct reflection was that what was spread out beneath his feet was no longer the great golden path, but rather incredibly pitch-black.","The end of life was death, but the end of death was life.","Ling Han stopped in his tracks. All of a sudden, enlightenment dawned on him.","He sat down in a cross-legged position and began to cultivate.","The aura of life exuding from his body became extremely weak, as if it was dead silent.","He sat there for 900 years."]},{"number":4848,"title":"Chapter 4848: Consummate level of Pseudo-Emperor","paragraphs":["At the 969th year, Ling Han’s eyes suddenly snapped open.","Boom, a powerful vitality suddenly exploded from his body.","His body had revived once more, and he stepped into the level of EIght Star Pseudo-Emperor!","However, this was not the end. In Ling Han’s body, the Regulations of Life and Death were opposed to each other, and were breeding each other, turning into a cycle that would never stop.","Life and death, in a single thought.","Weng, inside Ling Han’s body, the last part of his body that had experienced Silent Destruction also welcomed a great explosion, filled with vitality.","Nine Star Pseudo-Emperor.","He had created a miracle, breaking through two minor levels in a single go.","This was inconceivable.","He had already reached the height of Pseudo-Emperor Tier. Advancing one step further was already extremely difficult, and required a boundless amount of time, but Ling Han actually rushed up two minor levels in one go. If this was told to others, there was definitely no one who would believe it.","\"Pseudo-Emperor consummate level!\" Ling Han smiled. He had finally come this far.","Moreover, he had also mastered two Nine Star Regulations!","The Regulations of Life and Death.","This was unfathomable!","Before this, even for those who could become Great Emperors, when they were a nine-star Pseudo-Emperor, they would only be able to grasp close to one Regulations.","It was close, and it was impossible to reach the complete level.","As for Ling Han?","There were a total of two streaks, and furthermore, there was one for life and one for death, one yang and one yin.","It should be known that these two Regulations could be traced back to the essence of heaven and earth. Once Ling Han advanced further, he would break through to the fourth tier, or even the third tier, and catch up to the old Divine Beast.","Of course, the essence of death was too hard to grasp. Even after so many years, the old Divine Beast had still not succeeded.","He could return now.","Ling Han rapidly returned, and when he arrived at the passageway of the two realms, he charged out.","The Living Realm... still had a vast area that was in the state of being transformed into the Netherworld. After all, Ling Han had only killed Yin souls in the Netherworld, but a great many Yin souls had already come to the Living Realm.","It was fine.","With a single thought from Ling Han, a large number of Yin souls instantly died completely.","Multiple suns were reignited, illuminating the world.","Not too many years later, heaven and earth would slowly recover, and this time, there were not many Yin souls left in the Netherworld. If they still wanted to transform the Living Realm into the Netherworld, that would not be an easy thing to do.","However, Ling Han’s actions immediately attracted the attention of the Lords of Death and the Divine Beast Great Emperors.","Ling Han didn’t linger in battle. Although he had reached the level of a nine-star Pseudo-Emperor, and cultivated two nine-star Regulations, his battle prowess hadn’t advanced from the sixth tier to the fifth tier—no matter what, he had to master four to five nine-star Regulations before he could be considered to possess battle prowess of the fifth tier, and he would be the weakest of the fifth tier at that.","The Great Emperors in their prime had all grasped nine supreme Regulations.","Let’s go.","Ling Han let out a battle cry and left.","The Great Emperors all set off in pursuit, but without the True Phoenix Emperor, how could they possibly catch up to Ling Han?","They could only watch helplessly as Ling Han disappeared into the galaxy.","Ling Han returned to the Four Origin Planet. He immediately started to head to the Primitive Abyss again.","Unfortunately, Ding Shu and the others had not reached the level of Nine Star Pseudo-Emperor, so there was no meaning in bringing them to Imperial Island at this time. It was impossible for them to break through to become Emperors there.","Brother Monkey and the others were the same. They hadn’t even reached the level of Pseudo-Emperor, so it was even more meaningless for them to go to Imperial Island — moreover, if they didn’t become Pseudo-Emperor, they wouldn’t be qualified to go to Imperial Island.","Thus, Ling Han decided to only bring the empress and his wives with him.","When he left, he would attain Dao on the Imperial Island. Then, when he returned, he would completely pacify the two great turmoils of the Lords of Death and the Divine Beast Great Emperors.","Finally, it was the old Divine Beast.","However, even if Ling Han possessed fourth-tier battle prowess, he could not possibly match the old Divine Beast. This was still a drawn-out battle.","Once he had made his decision, Ling Han set out.","The empress and the others were all drawn into his body. Ling Han took a step forwards, and the great path of gold and black appeared beneath his feet. In an instant, he had arrived at the entrance to the Primitive Abyss.","He entered aggressively, and there was no need for him to dodge at all.","There were no longer thirty-six Divine Beasts standing guard here, and Ling Han swept past.","He released his wives, who had reached the level of Saint, and brought them, advancing on their journey.","In this period of time, they encountered the storm of heaven and earth, so they naturally dodged as much as they could. Even if Ling Han already possessed Emperor Tier battle prowess, and even if he actually possessed the Transcendent Weapon, Ling Han still didn’t want to face the storm of heaven and earth here head-on.","—At least, it was much more difficult to deal with than a fifth tier Great Emperor.","They journeyed and stopped, and finally, they arrived at the True Phoenix City.","Ling Han used his divine sense to scan the surroundings, and he actually sensed Imperial Might.","Disciple of the Great Emperor? Or... had the True Phoenix Emperor been revived and was cultivating here?","Ling Han first drew the empress and the others into his body for protection, then charged over.","Peng!","He had absolutely no intention of hiding himself, and just barged right in.","\"How dare you!\"","One of them charged over, and delivered a palm strike at Ling Han.","Pseudo-Emperor, only a disciple of the Great Emperor.","Ling Han didn’t even look him in the eye. He simply stretched out a hand and pressed down. Then, his figure rapidly streaked away.","\"You are too arrogant—\"","Peng!","The Pseudo-Emperor wanted to sneer, but the power of Ling Han’s palm strike had already reached him, instantly shattering him.","This was sixth-tier battle prowess, so how could a Pseudo-Emperor rival it?","Boom! Right at this moment, a column of fire soared into the sky.","The True Phoenix Emperor directly tore through the air and fled.","\"Can you escape?\" Ling Han smirked coldly.","In the past, when the True Phoenix Emperor was at the level of Great Emperor, his speed was only about the same as his. Now, the True Phoenix Emperor was only at the level of Pseudo-Emperor, so how could he compete with him in speed?","Boom!","Ling Han also flapped his flaming wings. With a few flaps of his wings, he had caught up to the True Phoenix Emperor, and shot out a punch.","A humiliated and furious expression appeared on the True Phoenix Great Emperor’s face.","He had already been killed by Ling Han once, so could it be that Ling Han wanted to kill him again?","How could he accept this!","\"Yi, you actually have memories of your last life!\" Ling Han was surprised. Logically speaking, after the Divine Beast died, it would be the same as the Great Emperor. Its soul would not enter into the Netherworld, and would directly merge with the Heavenly Dao.","Thus, unless one obtained a great opportunity, and lived a second life with the treasures in the Primitive Abyss, once the Great Emperor was dead, he would completely cease to exist.","And now, the True Phoenix Great Emperor had revived, and actually still had the memory of being killed by him. The hatred in his eyes clearly could not be faked.","This was strange!","The old Divine Beast was too powerful, wasn’t it? Even memories could be \"revived\".","It should be known that the old Divine Beast had never left the Primitive Abyss before. Thus, it was naturally impossible for him to use his experiences to create memories for the True Phoenix Emperor.","A look of shock appeared on the True Phoenix Great Emperor’s face. He had not thought that his unconscious reaction would actually cause Ling Han to make such a connection.","\"Brat, you won’t be able to escape death!\" he said through gritted teeth.","Boom!","Ling Han had already arrived. How could a mere Pseudo-Emperor withstand his iron fists?","With just a single punch, the True Phoenix was killed.","With a thought from Ling Han, he took out another True Phoenix corpse from within his body.","Apart from the difference in cultivation level, the other aspects were completely the same.","If one had grasped the essence of creation, they would be able to create things out of thin air, and if they had grasped the essence of life, they would be able to bestow life on all beings. The combination of the two gave the old Divine Beast the ability to revive the True Phoenix.","However, rather than calling it a resurrection, it would be better to call it a reincarnation.","What Ling Han couldn’t figure out was that his body and even cultivation level could be recreated, but where did his memories come from?","Could this be the key?"]},{"number":4849,"title":"Chapter 4849: Attaining Dao","paragraphs":["It was not that Ling Han had not seen the other creations of the old Divine Beast, such as those disciples of the True Dragon Emperor. They had all been killed by him once.","However, when they \"revived\", they completely didn’t recognize Ling Han, and treated him as a stranger.","Thus, it was strange. Why did the True Phoenix Emperor possess memories after being recreated?","Logically speaking, it was even more impossible for the soul of a Great Emperor to be preserved.","\"There’s definitely something strange about this!\" Ling Han murmured.","However, now was not the time to consider this. He needed to go to the Imperial Island and complete the final leap.","Ling Han put away the corpse of the True Phoenix. Not bad, not bad. More of this kind of nutritious bird could be delivered to him, and give it to the empress and the others.","After walking for a few years, they arrived at the Sea of Death.","Ling Han stopped and made some adjustments.","He began to cook the True Phoenix for the women to consume.","He didn’t need it. With his current height as a nine-star Pseudo-Emperor, he couldn’t make up for it no matter what he ate. In the future, he could only walk on his own.","Whatever Celestial medicine would not have any effect on him.","At the beach, the women ate for a total of four months, and only then did they finish eating the two True Phoenixes.","It was mainly the Great Emperor-level one. It was in the sixth tier, and the energy it contained was incredibly astonishing. Even Saints like them would have to digest it for a very long time.","Afterward, the women all went into seclusion. Afterward, their cultivation level greatly increased.","Just ask, who in the world could use the Great Emperor as a cultivation resource?","There was definitely none!","That was the Great Emperor, who had ruled his own era, and grasped the highest Regulations.","Eating the meat of a Great Emperor?","What kind of joke was this!","Thus, it could be imagined that the women were improving rapidly. After all, this kind of great fortune was like a dream.","Unfortunately, the threshold of Pseudo-Emperor was too hard to breach, so Ling Han took all the women back into his body.","This was very amazing. Once they were taken into his body, no matter how many years had passed, the state would remain just like the moment they entered into his body, as if they were still in the Genesis World.","Otherwise, Ling Han wouldn’t have brought the women in. At present, no one could attain immortality. If he went into seclusion, the women would have all died of old age.","He began to cross the sea.","This was extremely dangerous. The slightest move could cause the death of a Great Emperor. Even Ling Han had to be very careful. After spending more than eight years, he came to the Imperial Island for the third time.","He first came to the Cave of Life... he wasn’t familiar with other places either.","\"Senior Battle Saint!\" Ling Han sighed. He saw the Battle Saint Emperor again.","The old Saint Emperor was bathing in the Pool of Life, an expression of satisfaction on his face.","’Can’t you suffer a little less?’","\"Yi, you’ve reached Nine Star Pseudo-Emperor?\" The Battle Saint Emperor glanced at Ling Han. With the Fiery Golden Eyes, Ling Han’s cultivation level was completely exposed.","Of course, this was also because he hadn’t channeled the Soul Forming Technique.","\"Yes.\" Ling Han nodded, \"I have come this time to attempt breaking through to the imperial throne.\"","\"All right!\" The Battle Saint Emperor nodded, revealing a satisfied expression. \"How’s the situation outside?\"","Ling Han gave a brief explanation, causing the Battle Saint Emperor to frown again.","\"Though the present situation is slightly better, the Lords of Death themselves can also be considered Yin souls. If there is no other choice, they would definitely step out personally,\" the old Saint Emperor said.","That made sense.","Though Ling Han had eliminated most of the low-level Yin souls, the Lords of Death could also step forward personally and continue to transform the Living Realm into the Netherworld.","However, this would definitely require them to pay a very heavy price. It would also be very troublesome and time-consuming.","\"Then I will break through to Emperor Tier as soon as possible, and make another trip outside.\" Ling Han nodded.","\"Yes,\" the Battle Saint Emperor nodded.","\"Oh, that’s right. Senior, Buddha Doga and the other seniors, how’s the situation now?\" Ling Han asked.","\"They are cultivating in seclusion in different caves,\" the Battle Saint Emperor said as he pointed. \"There will always be people healing their wounds here, so it’s inevitable that they will be disturbed.\"","It had already been so long, and they were still in seclusion?","Although restrictions had been lifted here, and Pseudo-Emperors all had chances of attaining Dao, the completion of this final step was still as difficult as ascending the heavens.","After all, there weren’t any Nine Star Regulations here, allowing Pseudo-Emperors to go the normal route to ascend to the next level, but directly transitioned to the elements of heaven and earth, so the difficulty was naturally astonishing.","In the outside world, it was already difficult to become Emperor but here, it was naturally even more difficult.","Ling Han didn’t greet Buddha Doga and the others. Instead, he found a cave and entered seclusion.","There were no Nine Star Regulations here. However, there were vital signs of life here, and they filled the entire cave.","Ling Han continued to extract the essence of life, resonating with the Regulations of Life that he had grasped, so that he could complete a qualitative leap and become a Great Emperor.","He had grasped the complete Nine Star Regulations, and there were two of them at that. Thus, he could completely walk the normal path and advance into Great Emperor Tier first, and then calmly grasp the essence of life, raising to fourth tier in a single stroke.","In the fourth tier, he was no weaker than the Battle Saint Emperor, and could become the main force of resistance against the old Divine Beast — though the battle prowess of the fourth tier was still not enough in front of the old Divine Beast and he could only be beaten.","Ling Han sat quietly, experiencing Regulations and the key elements.","Without the Dao of Heaven and Earth in this world, it was equivalent to having no Regulations. Without the help of external forces, it was extremely difficult to advance another step.","However, there was nothing that could be done. If Ling Han became Emperor in the outside world, he would expend the chance of proving Dao of this era, but if he became Emperor here, a Pseudo-Emperor could still be allowed to prove Dao in the outside world.","At that time, it would be relatively easy for the two Great Emperors to suppress the darkness together. In future, there would also have one more reinforcement force to resist the old Divine Beast.","Of course, more importantly, if one became Emperor here, they would have a chance of breaking through two minor levels in one go. Furthermore, time passed quickly here, so even if they needed to spend more time on comprehension, that was completely acceptable.","Ten thousand years, thirty thousand years, a hundred thousand years!","This was slightly beyond Ling Han’s expectations. The path of breaking through was extraordinarily difficult.","Even if he was a nine-star Pseudo-Emperor, and had astonishingly high comprehension ability, his progress was still very slow, and he was unable to take that last step for a long time.","It was no wonder that Buddha Doga and the others had entered \"more than 100,000 years\" before him and still hadn’t broken through. This was truly difficult.","One needed to comprehend the Nine Star Regulations to become a Great Emperor, but there was no Nine Star Regulations here at all. Theoretically speaking, this was a paradox. Thankfully, there were still the four elements.","However, the four main elements were really too difficult to grasp. Even prodigious figures like Buddha Doga, Xia Houping and Qian Yanghao improved slowly.","300,000 years, 500,000 years!","Even in the outside world, five thousand years had already passed, causing Ling Han to frown slightly.","Previously, he had already made his calculations. There was still about 10,000 years left for the Living Realm, and the heaven and earth would begin to collapse. If the Living Realm was further transformed into the Netherworld, then once it began, the great world would definitely be destroyed by the massive collision of heaven and earth.","And this would also affect the Imperial Island, where the old Divine Beast would use it to open the Cave of Death, allowing him to clearly understand the essence of death, and become the first existence in history to grasp all four essences at the same time.","At that time, it would be too late.","Fast, he had to hurry up!","600,000 years, 800,000 years!","Finally, Ling Han grasped the trigger for his breakthrough.","He began to attain Dao.","To walk one’s own path, and from then on, the great dao would be in the skies, and he would walk his own path."]},{"number":4850,"title":"Chapter 4850: Great Emperor Ling Han","paragraphs":["Humans lived under the Dao of Heaven and Earth.","Thus, only if the heaven and earth allowed it, would a Pseudo-Emperor be able to prove his Dao. This was the fundamental reason why only one Great Emperor could appear in an era.","But in the Primitive Abyss, the great dao did not exist. Thus, it was theoretically possible that ten, a hundred or even more Great Emperors could appear.","Ling Han had been comprehending the essence of life all this while.","For him, this should be the simplest and fastest way to become Emperor, because he had already grasped the Regulations of Life, and he had also been born from the Stone of Life, so he had a natural affinity with the essence of life.","Even so, this still took him 800,000 years.","From this, it could be seen how difficult it was to achieve dao in the Primitive Abyss!","Ling Han believed that if he were in the outside world, he definitely wouldn’t need such a long time. In fact, he wouldn’t even need a fraction of this time.","Of course, spending a few thousand years in the outside world would be several hundred thousand years in the Primitive Abyss. Thus, there was actually not much difference between the two.","Boom!","Ling Han’s body continued to exude a terrifying aura, yet it was also brimming with vitality. Countless golden lotuses bloomed around him. Upon closer look, these weren’t illusions, but rather rocks that seemed to have gained life.","Giving life, Regulations of Life.","No.","Previously, when Ling Han had bestowed life, he could only bestow one life at a time. Furthermore, there was a limit to his abilities. Even if he tried his best, he would only be able to bestow Core Formation Tier-level life, but now, he could bestow hundreds or even thousands of lives at the same time.","And these golden lotuses were all Five Star Celestial medicines!","However, in this place, there was absolutely no possibility for Five Star Celestial medicines to survive. Once they broke away from the protection of Ling Han’s power, these Celestial medicines would immediately wilt.","Too bad.","However, it was only five-star level, after all, so it didn’t matter.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","The aura exuding from his body became more and more majestic, and there were more and more golden lotuses surging around him. There were thousands, tens of thousands of them. In fact, the grade of the golden lotuses were also improving, reaching six stars, and were even advancing towards seven stars.","What, a Seven Star Celestial medicine could actually be created out of thin air?","Even a Great Emperor couldn’t possibly possess such might!","If the Battle Saint Emperor was here, he would definitely nod in delight. This was because Ling Han had already made a breakthrough in grasping the fundamentals of life.","Success was at hand!","Even so, another 90,000 years later, Ling Han finally obtained a qualitative breakthrough.","Around him, the rippling golden lotuses had long since reached Saint-level, but when it had reached nine hundred thousand years, there were no golden lotuses rippling around him. Instead, it was incredibly calm. In fact, he had even become a black hole, endlessly devouring energy.","The aura exuding from his body was extremely unstable, as if it could explode at any moment, and with the amount of energy he was accumulating now, once it exploded, it would definitely be boundlessly terrifying.","Thankfully, though he had always been walking on the verge of collapse, he had always maintained a fragile balance.","Now was the most crucial moment. Breaking through in the Primitive Abyss, although without the suppression of the Heavenly Dao, any Pseudo-Emperor could possibly attain Dao, but without the Heavenly Dao, it would also be extremely dangerous.","In a moment of carelessness, all his previous efforts would be wasted, and he would be consigned to eternal damnation.","Ling Han was neither sad nor happy, and merely played out the changes of life in his mind. This had already crossed over the level of Regulations of Life, and reached the height of \"Dao\".","Any one of the four elements could be considered Dao, though it was not complete.","Ling Han was forming his own great dao. Once the great dao formed, he would become his own existence.","As an Emperor.","Boom!","His whole person was exuding endless golden light, indescribably bright, and after reaching the pinnacle level, the golden light turned into black and white, evolving into the yin and yang of Taiji.","In the end, the black and white colors turned back into four streaks of divine light, which then suddenly disappeared without a trace.","Xiu, Ling Han’s eyes suddenly snapped open. Twin streaks of light shot out, and even the thick cave walls of the Primitive Abyss couldn’t hide them, as they shot into the sky.","An indescribable feeling rose up in Ling Han’s heart, making him realize just how powerful he was now.","This was Emperor Tier.","He had become a Great Emperor.","Yi, why was there no multicolored light that filled the skies? Why was there no resonance between heaven and earth?","Because this was the Primitive Abyss, without the existence of the great dao, how could it resonate?","Sigh!","Ling Han sighed. This was a little like wearing embroidered clothes at night.","’I’ve clearly become the most powerful being, yet not a single person knows about this. This is simply unbelievable!’","Forget it, he could still show off when he got out.","So be it if it was on the Imperial Island. What this place lacked the least was Great Emperors.","Ling Han walked out, only to discover... that the Battle Saint Emperor was immersed in the Pool of Life again.","F***, just how many times had he done this?","\"Senior—\" Ling Han spoke up, revealing a strong feeling of helplessness.","The Battle Saint Emperor glanced at him before nodding and saying, \"Since you’ve already become an Emperor, we’re all on the same path. There’s no need to address me as senior anymore.\"","Are you serious?","Ling Han wore a strange expression as he gazed at the old Saint Emperor.","—He addressed the old Saint Emperor as brother. If he treated the old Saint Emperor as an equal, then when Brother Monkey saw the old Saint Emperor in future, how should he address him?","Should he address him as Ancestor, or as Old Brother?","\"Hehe, you have an objection?\" The Battle Saint Emperor bared his teeth, slightly displeased.","\"Alright, as long as you’re happy.\"","Ling Han nodded and said, \"Friend, how are Buddha Doga and the others?\"","Only then did the Battle Saint Emperor smile and say, \"That old brat, Doga, has already attained Dao. His aptitude is quite good. Unfortunately, he was unable to grasp a complete nine-star Regulations before attaining Dao. In future, even if he went to the outside world, the four elements would still repel the Regulations, and there would be no chance for him to make up for it.\"","Though Ling Han also felt that it was a pity, he did not feel that it would become a regret.","That was because if Buddha Doga did not attain Dao here, he would only be able to stay on the level of Pseudo-Emperor forever. Though there was only one additional word of \"Pseudo\", it was a world of difference compared to an actual Great Emperor.","\"What about the other two?\" Ling Han asked again.","\"Those two old brats are still a bit lacking.\" The Battle Saint Emperor shook his head. \"It should be impossible for them to attain Dao. Furthermore, they are only Pseudo-Emperors. They can’t truly absorb the essence of life. At most, they can only live a few more years, but would still die.\"","Ling Han couldn’t help but frown. As it turned out, on the Imperial Island, only Great Emperors could truly attain immortality. Pseudo-Emperors would only be able to live a few more years.","However, he couldn’t help with this kind of matter. They could only rely on themselves to attain Dao.","However, when Ling Han thought about it again, to Qian Yanghao and Xia Houping, their greatest wish and regret was to become a Great Emperor. Now that they had another chance, they would definitely rather die than regret it.","Each person had their own fortune, and could not be forced.","Ling Han asked calmly, \"Then has Buddha Doga already gone to battle the old Divine Beast?\"","\"En.\" The Battle Saint Emperor nodded, \"However, the old brat has just attained Dao, so his power isn’t strong either. Right now, he’s mainly here to watch the battle.\"","After skipping over the nine-star Regulations, even if Buddha Doga had grasped the essence of life, he could only be ranked in the fifth tier. However, among the fifth tier, he belonged to the strongest level.","In the outside world, he could suppress all Great Emperors in their prime, but against the old Divine Beast, that was really not enough."]},{"number":4851,"title":"Chapter 4851: The old Divine Beast","paragraphs":["Though the situation in the outside world was unclear, there was a very wide gap in the flow of time between the two sides. Ling Han decided to first go and see that old Divine Beast.","Ling Han had long heard of its viciousness, but had never seen it before. Ling Han was still slightly expectant.","—Even if they were enemies.","Meanwhile, the Battle Saint Emperor told him to wait, and they would go together.","Fine then.","Ling Han could use the chance to to stabilize his cultivation level. Thirteen days later, the Battle Saint Emperor came out, his wounds recovered.","\"Let’s go.\" The old Saint Emperor picked up his staff and headed towards the cave entrance.","Ling Han followed behind him. After walking out of the Cave of Life, the two of them walked side by side.","They weren’t heading toward the pillar of light at the center of the island. Instead, they were heading towards a considerably veered off angle.","The speed of a Great Emperor was too fast. Not too long after, images of an intense battle appeared ahead of them.","Roughly speaking, it was a group of people ganging up on a single person.","Yi, was this the old Divine Beast?","Ling Han was surprised. The 36 Divine Beasts had all appeared in the form of beasts, but the old Divine Beast had actually taken human form?","If it was not for the fact that he was already certain that it was definitely the old Divine Beast that was being ganged up on, he would definitely have guessed that the old Divine Beast had a human assistant.","However, though they were being ganged up on, it was actually the old Divine Beast that was beating up the others.","He was too strong.","He threw a punch, and all the Great Emperors were sent flying. They were no match for him at all.","Fourth tier Great Emperors were completely no match for a second tier Great Emperor.","But the old Divine Beast did not give chase. His focus was on excavating an enclosed cave. He had already dug out a very deep section, but had not reached the bottom yet.","Ling Han knew that this was the Cave of Death. Once the old Divine Beast dug through the cave, the old Divine Beast would be able to see the key to death. After mastering it, he would truly be invincible in the world.","—Even if one possessed the element of Life, he could still kill any Great Emperor that he wanted, and there would be no way to save him.","\"Old Sun is here!\" The moment the Battle Saint Emperor arrived, he couldn’t help but roar in excitement. Brandishing his metal staff, he charged forward.","Peng!","The old Divine Beast Beast its hand again, and instantly, the Battle Saint Emperor and the others were sent flying.","However, the other Great Emperors all went with the flow to disperse the momentum, but the Battle Saint Emperor forcibly dispersed it. He was the first to charge back, and brandished his staff to attack again.","However, how could a measly Great Emperor possibly block the old Divine Beast?","Peng, the old Divine Beast sent out another palm strike. This time, it was the Battle Saint Emperor facing it head-on alone. One strike was enough to make him throw up blood endlessly.","Ling Han placed his hand on his forehead. This was the line of the Battle Saint Emperor, so how could he stop his progress on the path of complaining?","\"Ling Han!\" Buddha Doga’s voice rang out. This veteran Pseudo-Emperor, and now Great Emperor, also appeared in front of Ling Han.","\"Senior.\" Ling Han nodded.","\"Haha, since you’ve already proven your Dao, there’s no need for you to address me as Senior.\" Buddha Doga smiled. He looked at Ling Han with emotion and gratitude in his eyes.","He was able to attain Dao because of his comprehension ability and talent, but most importantly, it was Ling Han who had brought him to this place.","Otherwise, there was no need to mention anything else.","Ling Han thought for a moment, then smiled naturally.","Since these seniors were so open-minded, what need was there for him to be so rigid?","\"Then let’s go too,\" Ling Han said with a smile.","\"All right!\" Buddha Doga nodded.","The two of them also soared into the skies, and charged towards the old Divine Beast.","This... was very different from the final great battle that Ling Han had imagined.","This was a group of Great Emperors. They had been fighting to the death for billions of years, and all of this was for the sake of a coal mine.","Who would believe this?","This level was really too low.","Just look, just how great was the scheme of the Lords of Death? They would destroy the universe at the drop of a hat.","Here... er, for the sake of a mine?","This was practically incomparable!","However, it just so happened that the battle here would decide the fate of the whole universe.","Ling Han sighed. Was the path of his complaining a path of no return?","\"You!\" The old Divine Beast suddenly set its eyes on Ling Han. Boom, it delivered a palm strike.","’What? Do you have some kind of grudge against me?’","This palm strike was indescribably fast.","Ling Han could only take it head-on. Peng, he was instantly sent flying, feeling as if all his organs had shifted.","Peng! He crashed into the ground, and it was as if his entire body had turned into mud. He couldn’t move at all.","\"Brat, you have a shred of my bearing.\" The Battle Saint Emperor leaped over and grabbed Ling Han, saying, \"I’ll help you heal your injuries.\"","Ling Han gritted his teeth. It had only been a single strike, and he was already severely injured?","Was the gap really that wide?","However, upon further thought, he had only cultivated two Nine Star Regulations, and in terms of the element of Life, he had only just begun. Thus, on the surface, he looked to be in the fourth tier, but in truth, he should be in the fifth tier, and could only be ranked very, very far ahead in the fifth tier.","It was nothing strange that he would be severely wounded by the old Divine Beast with this strike.","\"You’ll get used to it. Fighting with that old beast, who hasn’t been heavily injured, or evendied before?\" the Battle Saint Emperor said casually.","By the looks of it, the Great Emperors were already accustomed to being pummeled.","Ling Han could also tell that the Great Emperors were all at the fourth tier. Compared to the old Divine Beast, they were two tiers weaker. Even if they teamed up, they were still no match.","Thus, the Great Emperors could only detain the old Divine Beast. They were still at a disadvantage.","After returning to the Pool of Life, Ling Han began to heal his injuries. On the other side, he was also comprehending the secrets of life, deepening his grasp of the essence of life.","Seventeen days later, he recovered from his injuries.","He decided to leave. He would first deal with the Lords of Death and the 36 Divine Beasts in the outside world.","He would first eliminate the external problem, and then deal with his internal worries.","Buddha Doga didn’t follow him. Since Ling Han had succeeded Dao, he was completely capable of sweeping aside all opposition with his strength. Thus, Buddha Doga wanted to stay here and continue fighting to buy as much time as possible.","Ling Han returned. This time, when he crossed the Sea of Death again, he had shortened the time to seven years.","That was because he was now a true Great Emperor.","Furthermore, he was already using Destructive Energy to temper himself, and would also welcome a burst of power from his physique and Body Art, and added with the fact that he could continue to comprehend the other nine-star Regulations in the outside world, it could be imagined just how massively his battle prowess would be boosted","After crossing the great sea, Ling Han did not stop in the slightest. He passed by the Divine Beast cities, and arrived at the entrance of the passageway of the two realms.","’Hmm?’","He shockingly discovered that the 36 Divine Beasts had actually joined forces to block him again.","True Phoenix Emperor had indeed come back to life.","The Lords of Death weren’t among them. Their alliance with the Divine Beasts was extremely fragile.","The problem was, when had these Divine Beast Great Emperors come here?","If they had been standing guard here all this while, that would be understandable, but if they had suddenly come here, that would be strange.","Could it be that the old Divine Beast had informed them?","But the old Divine Beast was clearly on Imperial Island, so how had he sent out the news?","\"Ling Han, you had best stay here obediently,\" Qiong Qi Emperor said calmly.","\"As long as you stay here, we won’t make a move on you either,\" Ying Yu Emperor continued.","Their goal was very simple, and that was to have the Lords of Death destroy the wider world, and then the destructive power created by the collision of heaven and earth could even affect the Imperial Island, and from there, open the Cave of Death.","Under such conditions, killing Ling Han or not also became secondary."]},{"number":4852,"title":"Chapter 4852: Emperors dying like rain","paragraphs":["Ling Han smiled, \"You guys came just in time, just in time to fill my stomach!\"","\"How dare you!\" the Divine Beast Great Emperors rebuked.","There were as many as thirty-six of them!","\"No matter how many chickens there are, they’re still trash!\" Ling Han said with a smile. Xiu! He took the initiative to attack, throwing a punch at the True Phoenix Great Emperor.","This Great Emperor was the fastest, so he had to be the first to dealt with.","\"Humph!\" The True Phoenix Emperor flapped his wings, and countless flaming arrows shot towards Ling Han.","Ling Han summoned the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower and used it as a shield. He didn’t even stop his punches.","Peng, peng, peng! The flaming feather arrows shot over. To say nothing of breaking through the defenses of the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, it couldn’t even slow it down slightly.","It should be known that the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower was in the fifth tier, and its battle prowess was even superior to the True Phoenix Great Emperor.","Boom! Ling Han threw a punch. This was also the might of the fifth tier, which was infinitesimally close to the fourth tier.","This might was too strong.","Peng!","The True Phoenix Great Emperor received only a single strike, and his colossal body was sent flying. He was no match for Ling Han at all.","This was just like how Ling Han was completely no match for the old Divine Beast, and the True Phoenix Great Emperor was completely no match for him either.","However, it was as if the Divine Beasts had gone mad, pouncing forward one after another.","Yi, do you all know that you can be revived, so you are fighting with your lives on the line, and actually want to die together?","The Great Emperor was originally invincible in the world, and now, the 36 Divine Beast Great Emperors were fighting Ling Han with their lives on the line. This pressure was naturally terrifying.","Thankfully, in terms of battle prowess, Ling Han had surpassed the Divine Beast Great Emperors by more than a tier, and added with his astonishing physique, Ling Han still had the upper hand.","The 36 Divine Beast Great Emperors charged forward bravely, yet Ling Han sent them flying back like they were mere straws. The scene was very similar to how the Great Emperors ganged up on the old Divine Beast.","However, while there was the element of Life on the Imperial Island, there was none here.","Thus, when the Divine Beast Great Emperor was injured, it could not immediately recover, and if it was severely injured, it would be even more impossible to heal.","But these Great Emperors had already gone mad. Whether they had suffered light injuries or severe injuries, they did not care at all. They were just endlessly attacking Ling Han, looking like they were determined to make Ling Han stay no matter what price they had to pay.","Ling Han was astounded. Even if the old Divine Beast could revive these Divine Beast Great Emperors, was there any need to work so hard?","’You’ve already become Emperors, so don’t you have any opinions?’","Why did they have to keep hanging themselves on the same tree?","He could not tell at all what benefits the old Divine Beast would bring to these Divine Beast Great Emperors once he became the strongest.","Heaven and earth no longer existed, so what could you do even if you were strong enough to insta-kill heaven and earth?","However, he immediately cast this doubt aside. It was up to the Divine Beast Great Emperors to make their own choices.","Since they had already chosen their side, the only thing left was to battle.","Ling Han released a battle cry, and unleashed his full battle prowess, holding nothing back.","Logically speaking, as long as the Great Emperors wanted to flee, it was practically impossible for them to be killed, what more when these were 36 Great Emperors.","However, they couldn’t hold up to the fact that they were all putting their lives on the line, only wanting to delay Ling Han, and not caring about their own lives at all.","The battle situation was tragic. Very soon, some Divine Beasts were severely injured, and were forced to retreat to the side, recovering their injuries first. Otherwise, it would be meaningless to force their way in.","Ling Han wanted to follow up with another strike, but was stopped by the other Great Emperors.","How could that be allowed?","He used the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower as protection, forcibly carving out a path of blood.","Peng, peng, peng! Countless attacks shot over, and the other Divine Beasts all tried to stop Ling Han.","However, Ling Han was also determined. Severing one finger was better than merely injuring five.","’Die!’","He aggressively charged in front of that Divine Beast, and shot out a punch.","Peng!","That Divine Beast was instantly destroyed by him, but Ling Han was also hit by a great many attacks, causing him to throw up a mouthful of blood.","How could one kill his enemy in the midst of this \"army\" without paying any price?","Those were 35 Divine Beasts, and not just any random person.","Ling Han withdrew his fist, and his fighting spirit solidified, soaring sky-high.","Now, his killing intent had also completely burst forth.","\"Die!\" he roared as he continued to charge forward. With his battle prowess at the peak stage of the fifth tier, which Divine Beast could block him?","At the cost of having a bloody hole blasted into his left shoulder, he killed another Divine Beast.","Bai Ze Emperor.","This did not have the slightest effect of making an example of him. The remaining 34 Divine Beast Great Emperors ignored his death completely, and continued to charge forwards.","Hiss, even if they were completely annihilated, they would still kill him here, or severely injure him?","Ling Han’s battle prowess was indeed superior, but his opponents were thirty-six Divine Beast Great Emperors, which was enough to erase his advantage in battle prowess. Otherwise, he would not have paid such a heavy price just to kill two of them.","For Ling Han, the best strategy was to retreat. He could recover from his injuries first, and then start all over again. In a battle of one against thirty-four, the situation would definitely be better than now.","This was called defeating them one by one.","However, Ling Han felt that the fact that the Divine Beast Great Emperors were attacking so madly meant that the situation outside had also reached a critical moment. Thus, they were willing to die to detain Ling Han.","The time now was indescribably precious.","Since you are prepared to put your lives on the line, how could I not be?","Ling Han’s fighting spirit soared. He channelled the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower. Both were fifth-tier battle prowess, and when the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower exploded, it could even deliver a fourth-tier ultimate attack.","He aggressively pounced. The Destructive Energy and light of great dao channelled, and he had transformed into a god of death. So what if they were Great Emperors?","Anyone who stood in his way would be killed without mercy!","There were more and more injuries on his body, and they were getting heavier and heavier. However, the number of Divine Beast Great Emperors was also decreasing, from double digits to single digits.","This was a battle that was destined to be recorded in history. Emperors died like rain!","Finally, there were only the three Great Emperors that were still standing in front of Ling Han.","True Dragon, Black Tortoise, White Tiger.","Meanwhile, Ling Han was on the verge of collapse. There was practically no part of his body that was not bleeding. His life force was already very bleak, and he could die at any moment.","He had killed 33 Divine Beast Great Emperors with his own power. What kind of battle merit was this?","However, he could not collapse yet, and could not rest.","There were still three Great Emperors that he had yet to kill. In fact, it was possible that the situation outside would be even worse, and he would have to rush to pacify it.","—If he had known this earlier, he would have asked Buddha Doga to come with him.","Ling Han thought to himself, but immediately strengthened his resolve.","He could deal with it, he definitely could.","He channeled the element of Life, and his body was brimming with life and vitality, but how could it be so easy to heal his injuries?","These were all blasted out by Great Emperors, leaving behind the martial intent of every Divine Beast Great Emperor.","\"Ling Han, today will be the day of your death!\" The True Dragon Emperor and the other Divine Beasts all pounced over.","Ling Han was already severely wounded, so this was the best time to kill him.","\"I won’t die, nor can I die!\" Ling Han mustered up his remaining strength, and clashed head-on with the True Dragon Emperor and the others.","Boom!","In this tough battle, Ling Han had expended too much of his power. Under this attack, he actually only managed to tie with the three Divine Beasts.","However, with a wave of Ling Han’s hand, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower was summoned and charged towards the three Divine Beasts.","He had completely given up on defense.","In the matter of being prepared to face death, how could it be that he did not have that?"]},{"number":4853,"title":"Chapter 4853: Exterminated","paragraphs":["Ling Han and the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower teamed up, completely abandoning their defenses as they unleashed their full power.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","This was really exchanging blood for blood, using one’s life to exchange for another’s.","Great Emperors were hard to kill, but if a Great Emperor went all out, the battle could also be decided instantly, and the victor or loser, life or death would be determined.","After a few strikes, one of Ling Han’s arms was completely smashed into smithereens. However, the True Dragon Emperor was also smashed to bits.","Ling Han looked up at the sky and roared, his fighting spirit solidifying. Bathing in the blood of the Divine Beast, it was as if he had transformed into a God of Slaughter.","Only the Black Tortoise and White Tiger Emperors remained.","\"Ang!\" The two Great Emperors both released a deafening roar. Then, they controlled their Emperor Tier power, and attacked Ling Han together.","They were completely unconcerned about their own lives, and only hoped that they could kill Ling Han.","Thankfully, the battlefield was here. Otherwise, it was probable that half the galaxy would have been destroyed.","Ling Han and the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower each faced off against a Divine Beast. Destructive Energy surged, and the light of great dao shone. Not long after, the White Tiger Great Emperor also released a terrible scream, and was killed.","However, Ling Han had also paid an exorbitant price. Both his legs had been forcefully destroyed, and only half of his body was left.","It was fine. As long as there was enough time, regrowing a severed limb was no big deal.","The Black Tortoise Great Emperor wanted to charge over and follow up with another attack at Ling Han, but it was blocked by the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower.","It should be known that the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower was fifth tier!","Of course, the battle was too long, and the intensity was too great. The Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower had also expended a lot of energy, and now, it was only capable of matching the Black Tortoise Great Emperor, and had completely lost its advantage.","However, if it was just blocking the Black Tortoise Great Emperor’s attack, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower could still do it. After all, it was the Black Tortoise Great Emperor’s defense that was truly unsolvable. Taking the Black Tortoise Great Emperor’s attack head-on was completely fine.","Ling Han didn’t attack again. Instead, he stopped to make adjustments.","His injuries were too severe.","He channeled the Ten Cultivation Technique. His purpose wasn’t to heal his injuries, but to stabilize them.","The Black Tortoise Great Emperor wanted to break out of the siege time and time again, aiming to give Ling Han another blow. However, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower channelled dutifully, blocking the Black Tortoise Great Emperor every time.","Slightly less than half a day later, Ling Han delivered a palm strike with one hand, and his body borrowed the momentum to rise. He descended towards the Black Tortoise Great Emperor. He threw a punch, and his fist shone, condensing endless divine light.","Although the Black Tortoise Great Emperor was known for his powerful defense, he wasn’t the first generation Black Tortoise Great Emperor. Moreover, Ling Han’s destructive power far surpassed that of ordinary Great Emperors.","He didn’t dare to face it head-on.","His only option was to retreat.","Though Ling Han had lost both his legs, he could still fly with the wings of fire spread out on his back. Soaring and shifting positions couldn’t be too easy.","He joined forces with the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower to attack the Black Tortoise together.","In a one-on-one battle, even the Black Tortoise Great Emperor might not be able to block it, what more in a one-on-two battle.","He was continuously hit, and was bleeding profusely.","\"Ah!\" He released a terrible scream. The Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower and Ling Han each pierced through his chest and head one after the other, and he immediately died.","However, the fatal strike before his death also left a massive wound on Ling Han’s lower abdomen. Blood gushed out like a fountain, and it couldn’t be stopped at all.","Ling Han’s body swayed, and he flopped onto the ground. In an instant, he had lost all his strength.","This was an incredibly intense battle, but Ling Han felt as if these Great Emperors had all gone crazy.","Otherwise, if any one of them wanted to flee, he would have to expend an extremely great amount of effort to be able to kill them.","What kind of Demonic Power did the old Divine Beast possess that could make the Divine Beast Great Emperors put their lives on the line like this?","It should be known that the True Dragon Emperor and True Phoenix Emperor had died more than once!","When had the grade of Great Emperors become so low? They had actually become hired thugs, death warriors?","This was practically an insult to the words ’Great Emperor’!","Ling Han sat down cross-leggedly, and began to heal his injuries.","If he were to leave just like that, there would be absolutely no way for him to stop the Lords of Death.","His injuries were too severe. Even if Ling Han had grasped the essence of life, it was still difficult for him to recover.","—If he was in the Cave of Life, it would be great. He was sure that he would be able to recover in ten days, at most.","However, with his present damaged battle prowess, it was absolutely impossible for him to cross the Sea of Death. He would only die on the way.","Thus, there was no need to consider this.","Ling Han started his long period of recovery.","Ten years, a hundred years, a thousand years, his legs and arm slowly regrew, mainly because they had been wounded by Great Emperors. His body was filled with the martial intents of the various Great Emperors. If he wanted to heal his injuries, he would first have to expel these martial intents.","To Ling Han, it was equivalent to him having another battle with the 36 Divine Beasts. However, this time, the battlefield had become the inside of his body, so it was even more dangerous. The slightest move could take his life.","The good news was that it was precisely his body that was the battlefield. He had the absolute initiative, and the martial intent of the Divine Beasts were like duckweed without roots, unable to continue.","Thus, after battling for three thousand years, Ling Han finally expelled all the foreign martial intents in his body.","He stood up. The newly grown legs were bare, and only the ends of his legs had torn fabric. At first glance, he was no different from a beggar.","\"Is there any Great Emperor in history that has a worse image than me?\" He laughed at himself. Then, he took a step, and the great path of black and white spread out. His speed was extraordinarily fast.","He exited the Primitive Abyss, and instantly, the Dao of Heaven and Earth that he had missed reappeared.","Boom! The great dao instantly suppressed Ling Han, exerting a powerful pressure on him.","This was the land of Regulations, which included the channelling of heaven and earth, and cultivation of martial arts. They were all controlled by the Dao of Heaven and Earth.","However, Ling Han had cultivated to the level of Great Emperor, and was self-contained. He had transcended beyond the Dao of Heaven and Earth, and was no longer under control.","This naturally would incite the fury of heaven and earth, which would bombard Ling Han.","In other words, this was the Great Emperor Tribulation.","After enduring this heaven’s calamity, Ling Han would gain the approval of the heaven and earth, and thought that he was qualified to stay in this world.","Ling Han laughed, and greeted the heaven’s calamity.","Come, let’s see how he would settle it easily.","However, thunderclouds rolled out, blasting out bolts of lightning, but not one of them was aimed directly at him.","What was he doing?","Ling Han soon found out why. That was because the lightning had taken form, and turned into multiple cultivators. Every single one of them was exuding an endless imperial might.","Great Emperor!","Nine Great Emperors!","This was practically a lineup that would drive anyone to despair. He had just become a Great Emperor, and nine Great Emperors were summoned by heaven and earth to snipe him, so how was one supposed to survive?","Yet Ling Han merely smiled.","What a joke. Previously, he had already killed thirty-six Divine Beast Great Emperors, so what did he care about these mere nine?","Moreover, he had just become Emperor, so even if heaven and earth sent down a test, how could these Great Emperors formed of lightning be fifth tier?","At most, it would only be in the eighth and seventh tiers. Otherwise, it would be deliberate murder.","The heaven and earth was merciless, but it would definitely leave behind a sliver of hope.","Ling Han didn’t even use the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, and simply charged over.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","He threw a punch, and as the Destructive Energy surged, so what if they were Great Emperors formed of lightning? They would be severely injured after taking a single blow.","Ling Han destroyed everything in his way, and the nine Great Emperors of lightning were all blasted off their feet, unable to form any decent attacks at all.","After experiencing the battle of the 36 Divine Beasts, Ling Han’s battle prowess had been proven, and his confidence was even higher.","He was truly powerful!"]},{"number":4854,"title":"Chapter 4854: New Emperor","paragraphs":["In less than half a day’s time, the lightning Great Emperors’ energy had all been exhausted by Ling Han, and they no longer had any might.","They couldn’t be killed, because they weren’t living beings in the first place. However, their energy had been annihilated by the Destructive Energy, so they naturally were not a threat anymore.","Ling Han didn’t immediately move. Instead, he sat down in a cross-legged position and floated in the galaxy.","He had survived the heaven’s calamity, and the Dao of Heaven and Earth had already acknowledged him. Thus, Ling Han was able to come into contact with the Nine Star Regulations.","Originally, when he had become a Great Emperor, he should have comprehended the Nine Star Regulations, and when he reached the pinnacle, that would be the strongest level of fifth tier.","Thus, it was very normal for him to be able to comprehend Nine Star Regulations.","And his situation was special.","After he had cultivated two Nine Star Regulations, he skipped over the fifth tier, and directly advanced into the fourth tier.","Thus, theoretically speaking, Ling Han had already surpassed the level of Regulations.","Standing at a higher position, it would naturally be easy for him to grasp the \"low level\" Regulations.","All of a sudden, enlightenment dawned on Ling Han.","In his mind, eight thin threads quietly appeared.","These were the other eight Nine Star Regulations — the Regulations of Death did not belong to this heaven and earth.","As Ling Han’s comprehension of the Nine Star Regulations continued to deepen, these eight thin threads also became thicker and thicker. However, it was also impossible to grasp all eight Nine Star Regulations in a short period of time.","Seven days later, Ling Han finally stopped.","A faint smile appeared at the corners of his lips. Without too much time, he would be able to grasp all the Nine Star Regulations.","In fact, he had even grasped an additional Regulation, which belonged to the Netherworld.","Thus, even if he did not take into account the element of Life that he had grasped, he would definitely still be slightly stronger than any ordinary Great Emperor.","It was time to leave.","Ling Han searched for the location of the Four Origin Planet. Then, he took a step, and the great path of black and white spread out. In an instant, he had arrived on the Four Origin Planet.","He released the empress and the others, and the large black dog and the others also came upon hearing the news. They were all excited and happy.","\"Little Han, have you attained Dao?\" they all asked.","Ling Han nodded earnestly, \"That’s right.\"","Everyone breathed a sigh of relief upon hearing this. Ling Han was far too powerful. Once he became Emperor, he would definitely be able to crush all of the current Great Emperors. He would undoubtedly become the most powerful being.","Ling Han also found out about the current situation, but it was not optimistic.","The Yin souls of the Netherworld had mostly been destroyed by Ling Han. However, the Lords of Death were Yin souls in the first place, and at this time, they had no choice but to step forward personally, inhaling and exhaling large amounts of Yin Qi, continuing to corrode the Living Realm.","By now, about half of the universe was still in a state of transforming into the Netherworld, and the Lords of Death seemed to have limited power. They did not take another step further, and merely defended this area of land.","In this way, when heaven and earth collapsed, the two Realms would still clash greatly, but the might would defintiely be much weaker.","Would it affect the Primitive Abyss’s side?","Ling Han didn’t know. If the effects weren’t so great, he wouldn’t even be in a hurry to make a move, because though the collision of heaven and earth would cause great damage, there were no longer any living beings in the center of the universe. If it was destroyed, so be it.","However, if this could still affect the Imperial Island’s side, Ling Han would have to make a move to prevent this from happening.","He wasn’t confident at all, so for safety’s sake, it was best to make a move as soon as possible.","Just as he was about to move out, he suddenly discovered that a strange phenomenon had appeared in the sky.","Endless golden lotuses appeared in the Void, and a celestial voice rang out from the heaven and earth. Everyone was filled with joy, as well as endless reverence.","It was as if a supreme existence had been born in the heaven and earth. Thus, the heaven and earth had bestowed this blessing, and everyone was filled with admiration.","Ling Han and the others paused for a moment before exclaiming, \"New Emperor!\"","At this point in time, there was actually a new Emperor that had succeeded Dao!","Who was it?","An Imperial Son from the Lands of Death? Or the son of a Great Emperor from some Imperial Clan?","Not many days later, the news spread out.","The one who became Emperor was... Pu Jingtian.","Great Emperor Jingtian!","Ling Han faltered for a moment before shaking his head with a smile.","At first, he had thought that in this era, the \"curse\" that the Imperial Clans would never produce a second Great Emperor would be broken, because Ling Han had deliberately gone to the Primitive Abyss to prove his Dao, so that another Great Emperor would appear in the great world.","But what was the result?","There were so many descendants of Great Emperors, yet none of them could compete with Pu Jingtian.","He wasn’t a member of the Imperial Clans, but someone that had cultivated to become a Pseudo-Emperor hundreds of millions of years ago.","It could only be said that the blessing of heaven and earth allowed Pu Jingtian to witness the Nine Star Regulations, and complete this step.","’That’s good.’","Ling Han nodded in understanding. In any case, it was fine as long as the new Emperor did not appear from the Lands of Death.","To say the least, even if it really was a fallen Imperial Son that had succeeded Dao, Ling Han would not mind. It was just killing one more Emperor.","Right now, he was already the most powerful battle prowess of the fifth tier, so how could the new Emperor compare to him? Moreover, how long could the Lords of Death maintain their battle prowess at the peak stage of the fifth tier?","Now, if he joined forces with the new Emperor, it would definitely be even easier to sweep through the Lords of Death.","Ling Han was just about to contact Pu Jingtian when he suddenly received an invitation from the Mysterious Spirit Planet.","—Pu Jingtian had become a Great Emperor himself, so it was natural that the whole world would be celebrating.","Having proven his status as a Great Emperor, he was equivalent to ruling over this era. If he did not celebrate and show off a little, wouldn’t that be wearing embroidered clothes at night?","Fine, then let’s host the ceremony.","Logically speaking, he had become a Great Emperor, so it was indeed worth celebrating.","\"All right, I will be there on time.\" Ling Han accepted the invitation.","\"Then we shall respectfully await your arrival, Lord,\" the envoy said. Then, he turned around and left, his arrogance apparent in his words.","Right now, he was a genuine member of an Imperial Clan. Moreover, their Great Emperor was still alive. What kind of concept was this?","The whole world revered them, and they were the strongest clan, and there was no other that could match them!","Thus, even if Ling Han was a Pseudo-Emperor, he could only swallow his pride and obediently bow his head.","This was what it meant to use one’s powerful connections as an intimidation tactic.","\"A dog uses its master’s power,\" the little azure dragon scoffed.","\"Four-Legged Snake, I’ll give you a chance to rephrase your words!\" the large black dog said coldly.","\"What is it? Grandpa Dragon is afraid of you?\" The little azure dragon naturally wouldn’t cower.","\"Looks like this Great Emperor Jingtian wants to establish his might,\" Chi Menghan said. \"Husband, you’ll definitely bear the brunt.\"","When a new Emperor achieved dao, they would definitely establish their might and establish a symbol of invincibility. Thus, a Pseudo-Emperor like Ling Han was the best target for the Great Emperor Jingtian to make an example of.","\"Definitely. Little Han, you won’t be able to escape.\" The large black dog patted Ling Han’s shoulder.","Ling Han stroked his chin. Was his halo of hatred really that strong?","\"Sigh! I’m too outstanding,\" he said.","Everyone rolled their eyes. Though you are very outstanding, aren’t you a little too shameless to say it out loud yourself?","Though the universe was still the same size, and had not shrunk, there were only a few planets that had life now. Aside from the Four Origin Planet, it was the ancestral stars where the Imperial Clans were located.","Hence, when a new Emperor had attained Dao, they all rushed over to offer their congratulations. It really did not need too much time.","Merely seven days later, a great celebration to celebrate the new Emperor having attained Dao began on Mysterious Spirit Planet.","Ling Han brought the empress, Brother Monkey and the others with him, and arrived at the Mysterious Spirit Planet a day earlier.","That night, the old Saint from Donglin Planet found him."]},{"number":4855,"title":"Chapter 4855: The world is cruel and cold","paragraphs":["Chi Taiming’s expression didn’t look too good.","As he saw it, Ling Han should be the person who had the highest chance of becoming Emperor.","And along the way, Ling Han’s journey was also smooth sailing, crushing all the prodigies of the past and present. The Golden Generation, the sons of the Great Emperors, and so on could only become his stepping stones.","When Ling Han became a Pseudo-Emperor Chi Taiming was even more certain that Ling Han could become Emperor.","Furthermore, when Ling Han was a Pseudo-Emperor, he was already capable of matching a Great Emperor. If he became a Great Emperor, just how strong would his battle prowess be?","This should also be the common thought of all the Imperial Clans. Precisely because of this, these Imperial Clans were also very envious and jealous of the Donglin Imperial Clan. This was because the son-in-law of the Donglin Imperial Clan would clearly become the most powerful Great Emperor in history.","But... f***!","Even this old Saint couldn’t help but spew vulgarities. Midway, a Pu Jingtian actually charged out.","The one who had become Emperor was actually not Ling Han!","It should be known that only one Great Emperor could appear in an era. Even if Pu Jingtian and the Lords of Death would soon die together, it was still impossible for a new Great Emperor to emerge in this era. They would have to wait for millions more years.","Then, unless Ling Han sealed himself in the Primordial Source Clay, he would only die of old age, and would not be able to cross traverse as many as ten million years.","It should be known that ten million years was only the most conservative estimate. Sometimes, it was not uncommon for two Emperors to be separated by tens of millions of years.","Thus, Donglin Imperial Clan’s attempt to borrow Ling Han’s power was naturally an empty dream.","When the news that Pu Jingtian had become Emperor spread out, the members of the Imperial Clans all felt slight regret. A new Emperor had finally appeared, but it was a pity that it was not their own Imperial Son. However, they were more of delighting at the misfortune of others.","After all, in the past, the most popular person to become Emperor was Ling Han.","Now, Ling Han’s hopes of achieving Dao had come to nothing, and the Donglin Imperial Clan had also become a joke. Wasn’t this amusing?","\"Son-in-law, your current situation is not too optimistic,\" the old Saint said. \"You attract too much attention. Furthermore, you have once offended Great Emperor Jingtian. In the celebration that will begin tomorrow, it is possible that you would be targeted.\"","Chi Taiming’s eyes were still very sharp. With a single word, he had revealed Ling Han’s situation.","\"Thus, you had best leave quickly.\"","\"You are a Pseudo-Emperor, and have the strength to match a Great Emperor, so you are completely capable of leaving.\"","\"Avoid this era of Great Emperor Jingtian, and choose another opportunity!\"","He persuaded Ling Han to give up this era and return in the next era, just like Pu Jingtian. He wasn’t from this era, yet he had attained Dao in this era.","Ling Han smiled, \"It’s fine.\"","Chi Taiming couldn’t help but grimace. He had said so much, and it was all in exchange for these words?","\"Son-in-law, you are indeed freakish, but you have to know that the true Great Emperor is indescribably strong,\" the old Saint advised again. Though the Lords of Death were awesome, they were Great Emperors that had passed their prime, after all. Even if they recovered to their prime condition, the time that their could maintain this state was still limited.","\"That’s why we have to battle,\" Ling Han said with a smile.","Chi Taiming grimaced upon hearing this. If it weren’t for the fact that he was no match for Ling Han, he would definitely have slapped him already.","See if I won’t be able to wake you up with a beating!","No matter how Chi Taiming tried to persuade him, Ling Han completely ignored him. This angered the old Saint so much that he finally left angrily.","\"Little Han, why didn’t you tell him that you have already become Emperor?\" The large black dog walked out.","\"If I tell him, do you think he’ll believe me?\" Ling Han countered.","\"That’s true.\" The large black dog nodded. These old Saints came from the Imperial Clans, so they knew very well just how strong a Great Emperor would be, but on the other hand, their outlook was even more conservative, making them believe that it was possible for two or even more Great Emperors to prove their Dao in a single era, so how could it be possible?","\"Then we can show off again tomorrow?\" The large black dog was in high spirits.","F***, everyone thought that Pu Jingtian was a Great Emperor, while Ling Han was only a Pseudo-Emperor. Then, just when Pu Jingtian thought so highly of himself, planning to humiliate Ling Han, Ling Han turned the tables on him. Just how astonished would everyone be?","\"Ao, ao, ao!\" The large black dog couldn’t help but howl at the sky. He was too excited, and filled with anticipation.","\"Tomorrow is the day the Show-off King proves his Dao,\" the little azure dragon said from the sidelines.","Stepping on the face of a Great Emperor to show off, this was undoubtedly the king of show-offs.","\"Haha, others use martial arts to prove their Dao, but out Little Han, use posturing to prove his Dao!\" The large black dog laughed loudly. It was filled with anticipation. It was definitely going to be fun.","Ling Han pursed his lips, and said, \"I truly have no intention of showing off.\"","\"We believe you!\" The large black dog and little azure dragon both nodded.","\"Motherf*cker, can’t you guys be a little more serious when you say you believe me?\" Ling Han was almost rendered speechless. They clearly didn’t believe him.","\"Heehee!\"","...","The night passed very quickly.","Starting from the morning of the second day, the entire Mysterious Spirit Planet was bustling with activity.","The Great Emperor had proven his Dao and invited the whole world for a celebration. This was the most glorious moment for Mysterious Spirit Planet, and it would become the most powerful force in the world.","Hence, while he had the abilities, he also had to have enough momentum.","The number one in the world, the Great Emperor, naturally had to be matched with the greatest extravagance in the world.","Ling Han and the others were all invited to the ceremony area. Among them, there were Pseudo-Emperors, as well as a large number of Saints. They were naturally VIPs among VIPs.","The grandstand was 300 meters tall, and for elites like them, this couldn’t be considered tall. However, underneath the grandstand, there was a vast and boundless plaza that surrounded the grandstand, highlighting its unique status.","It was as if they were saying that the Great Emperor was the center of the world, and others could only guard and serve him.","Ling Han and the others were arranged in the first row closest to the grandstand. Even so, they were still 300 meters away from the grandstand.","This was done on purpose, so as to highlight the status of Great Emperor Jingtian.","They could only kneel from afar.","\"What arrogance!\" Ling Han said calmly.","\"The higher you’re raised, the harder you fall,\" the large black dog said in a strange voice.","There were still a lot of seats in the first row. Ling Han and the others took some, and the rest were arranged for Ding Shu, Jing Haoran, Shui Qingchang, the three other Pseudo-Emperors. This was the strongest level below Great Emperor. Naturally, they would occupy the seats of the first row.","As for the second row, it was allocated to the Saints of the Imperial Clans.","And from the third row onwards, it would be very casual. There were people from the Imperial Clans, and there were also people from Mysterious Spirit Planet. They were just there to make up the numbers.","He was sure that Pu Jingtian would also be very depressed. The living beings of this era were wilting, so he could not show off his extravagance.","However, four Pseudo-Emperors had come to attent, and this had surpassed any other era.","Overall, the status of guests was still very high.","Most importantly, there was a true Great Emperor among the guests. This was something that had never happened in all of history.","Very soon, guests arrived, one after another, and sat down according to the rules.","Pu Jingtian didn’t appear. It was unknown whether he had been delayed by something or was deliberately putting on airs.","Because the main banquet had not begun for a long time, it was inevitable that everyone would start chatting.","All the Imperial Clans pointed fingers at Ling Han. Some felt that it was a pity that Ling Han, who had such strong talent, had not become Emperor. If they only relied on Pu Jingtian, it would be too difficult to pacify the darkness.","Some of them were rejoicing in Ling Han’s misfortune, thinking that Ling Han had done too many \"bad deeds\". He had been abandoned by the heaven and earth, and that was why he had not been able to take that last step.","Because Ling Han was destined to only be a Pseudo-Emperor, some people did not even bother to hide their words, and were not afraid that Ling Han would hear them at all.","How could it be that on the Mysterious Spirit Planet, Ling Han actually dared to use force?"]},{"number":4856,"title":"Chapter 4856: The might of a tiger still exists","paragraphs":["Pu Jingtian was different from the Lords of Death and the Divine Beast Great Emperors.","The Lands of Death and the Primitive Abyss were all standing on the opposing side of living beings. However, Pu Jingtian was a newly promoted Great Emperor, and had gained the approval of heaven and earth.","Thus, he definitely had to fight to maintain the balance of heaven and earth.","Thus, Pu Jingtian represented the benefits of heaven and earth, and was on the same side as all life in the world.","A Great Emperor was present, and others were all mediocre. They could only adhere to his wishes, which was very logical.","In the territory of this Great Emperor, you, Ling Han, dare to mess around?","Was he seeking death!","These Imperial Clans let themselves loose, and mocked him to their heart’s content.","There was no lack of people trying to curry favor with the new Emperor. Who didn’t know that Pu Jingtian had once had a conflict with Ling Han? Now that Pu Jingtian had attained Dao, would he not settle the score?","Even if he didn’t kill him, Ling Han would definitely suffer greatly.","Thus, now that they were clearly expressing that they were siding with Great Emperor, that naturally could add a lot of points to them.","Ling Han sighed. Why was there always someone who was asking to be beaten?","He stood up, and looked towards those Imperial Clans that had mocked him.","There were not many clans, and they were all Imperial Clans that did not have any child of the Great Emperor. That was why they had lost the demeanor that Imperial Clans should have, and actually began to curry the favour of a new Emperor.","Just look, as long as they had the son of a Great Emperor, which Imperial Clan wasn’t calm and composed?","That’s right. At present, the Mysterious Spirit Planet had indeed produced a Great Emperor that was invincible in the current era, but that was only for this era.","Since they were Imperial Clans, which one of them had not been invincible before?","Thus, under the wheel of history, any kind of glory would wilt.","After another ten million years, twenty million years, you see, wouldn’t the Pu Clan be no different from the other Imperial Clans?","Thus, Imperial Clans didn’t need to flatter anyone at all. They were transcendent in the first place.","\"What is it? Ling Han, do you have any objections?\" the Imperial Son of the Thousand Spirit Clan asked.","\"Heh, how can you be so rude to a Pseudo-Emperor?\" The old Saint beside him rebuked, but his tone was even, without the slightest intent of rebuke.","They... had the support of a Great Emperor!","Ling Han stared at the two of them, and asked calmly, \"Who moved your ancestral star here?\"","The old Saint and Imperial Son were both rendered speechless upon hearing this.","Of course, it was Ling Han.","Otherwise, they might have already been exterminated by now. Even if they hadn’t, they would still be fleeing in panic, like stray dogs.","\"What I hate the most are people who don’t know how to be grateful.\" Ling Han continued, \"However, if it is only being ungrateful and not doing evil, then I can also ignore it.\"","\"However, repaying kindness with ingratitude... hoho.\"","Ling Han flicked his finger, and said, \"If I see one person like that, I will kill one. If there are two people, then I’ll kill a pair!\"","His last words were bone-chilling.","The two Saints from the Thousand Spirit Imperial Clan were both trembling. It should be known that they were facing a Pseudo-Emperor!","With the word \"Emperor\", it had already surpassed the range of Saints. Even the Imperial Weapon and the Imperial Formation couldn’t protect them forever.","Moreover, Ling Han was freakishly talented, and his battle prowess far surpassed an ordinary Pseudo-Emperor.","In a head-on confrontation, would they dare to speak tough even if they were given ten thousand guts?","At this time, someone stepped out to play mediator.","\"Lord Ling Han, today is a celebratory day for the Great Emperor. Please appease your anger, and do not come to blows,\" Gong Yeliang said.","He was clearly trying to smooth things over, but his tone was incredibly arrogant.","’Lord, Ling Han!’","He had placed himself on the same level as Ling Han.","However, how could a mere Saint be qualified to be on equal footing with a Pseudo-Emperor?","Additionally, he was clearly warning them — this was the celebration of the Great Emperor’s attaining Dao. If they dared to act recklessly, and angered the Great Emperor, they would naturally be punished.","As everyone listened, they all sighed internally.","He had become Emperor, and was indeed very awesome. Even a Saint dared to threaten a Pseudo-Emperor.","However, there was nothing that could be done. Ling Han still had to swallow this humiliation.","Could it be that he... was going to clash head-on with the Great Emperor?","Gong Yeliang was different from the two members of the Thousand Spirit Clan. He had a Great Emperor behind him!","\"You dare to stop me?\" Ling Han smiled faintly, and moved directly, pressing down on the two Saints form the Thousand Spirit Imperial Clan.","Hiss!","All the Imperial Clans inhaled sharply upon seeing this. F***, he really dared.","\"Who is Ling Han?\"","This guy seemed to have never been afraid of anyone. When he was very weak, he dared to be forceful with the Imperial Clans, and afterwards, he was forceful with the Lords of Death and Divine Beasts from the Primitive Abyss.","Pa! Pa!","Emperor Tier power descended, and the two Saints from the Thousand Spirit Clan didn’t even have the chance to unleash their Imperial Weapon before being crushed to death.","Ling Han smiled, and clapped his hands, as if he had swatted two flies to death, \"Anyone else has any complaints about me?\"","There was dead silence.","He had killed Saints just like that, so who would dare to have any objections?","\"You, you, you—\" Gong Yeliang pointed at Ling Han, his body trembling slightly.","He was not afraid, but rather furious.","This was the Mysterious Spirit Planet, and Pu Jingtian was the Great Emperor!","A new Emperor had attained Dao, and you actually still dare to make a move?","Did he even take the new Emperor seriously?","This was a blatant provocation.","Ling Han showed a hint of displeasure, \"I very much dislike being pointed at. If you don’t want to die, you had best withdraw your hand quickly!\"","This was what a threat was like!","Gong Yeliang’s heart shuddered, and he hurriedly lowered his hand, taking three steps back.","He had threatened Ling Han using his powerful connections as an intimidation tactic, but Ling Han’s threat was completely based on his own abilities.","It would be a piece of cake for a Pseudo-Emperor to kill a Saint.","Now that a new Emperor had appeared, he could also bask in the glory. He could be called the second strongest in this universe. But if things continued, he might die before he could even show off his might.","That would really not be worth it.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and sat back down.","This time, no one dared to point at him anymore.","Even though a new Emperor had appeared, the only person who could suppress Ling Han was the new Emperor.","As for the others?","They didn’t even have the right to speak as equals in front of Ling Han.","However, those dissatisfied Imperial Clans were all sneering internally. ’You may be awesome now, but when Pu Jingtian appears, let’s see if you’ll kneel or not!’","Moreover, Ling Han had already offended Pu Jingtian before, so how could Pu Jingtian tolerate Ling Han killing someone at his celebration?","So what if he was a Pseudo-Emperor? Pei!","These Imperial Clans all hoped that Ling Han would be humiliated, or even killed, but the majority of Imperial Clans were still on Ling Han’s side. When they saw this, they were all slightly anxious.","’How can you still remain calm?’","Only Ling Han and the others remained seated, neither happy nor sad.","Time passed slowly, and everyone had their own thoughts, waiting for the situation to develop further.","However, right at this moment, all kinds of strange phenomena suddenly appeared in the skies.","The Yin River poured down, the sea of blood was boiling, and fog was thick... the Lords of Death finally arrived.","What!","The Lords of Death would actually arrive at such an important time?","Hiss, what were they trying to do?","How the Lords of Death had found their way here was no longer a problem. That was because the new Emperor had attained Dao, and the commotion caused was known to the entire universe.","Xiu, xiu, xiu! One after another, figures descended. They were all Imperial Sons of the Lands of Death, and one was the Natural-born Gold Spirit, exuding the might of a Pseudo-Emperor.","\"How dare you come uninvited!\" Gong Yeliang hurriedly stepped out.","He was the supervisor of the Mysterious Spirit Planet. As long as a Great Emperor did not appear, he would be the representative.","\"Mere Saint, scram aside!\" The Imperial Sons of the Lands of Death all swept a cold glance over Gong Yeliang.","A Saint actually dared to ask about the Pseudo-Emperor’s personal matters? Humph!"]},{"number":4857,"title":"Chapter 4857: Pseudo-Emperors Battle","paragraphs":["When a new Emperor had succeeded Dao, and the whole world was celebrating, the Lords of Death had all arrived. What was the reason for this?","However, the Lords of Death were notorious for their viciousness, and they were also Great Emperors who had ruled over an era in the ancient times. They had come together, so which Imperial Clan wouldn’t feel uneasy?","—How could it be that there were not many members of the Imperial Clasns that had been killed at the hands of the Lands of Death?","Gong Yeliang’s aura couldn’t help but weaken. Those standing in front of him were all Pseudo-Emperors.","Though a Saint was already close to the peak stage of cultivation, compared with the Pseudo-Emperor, he was still trash among trash.","However, he still had a true Great Emperor behind him, so he definitely could not cower.","Otherwise, it was not just him that would be losing face, but also Pu Jingtian.","\"A new Emperor has appeared, and you people dare to be impudent?\" he shouted loudly.","\"Hehe.\" Yang Yihuan and the others all sneered.","A new emperor?","Putting aside the issue of age, when a new Emperor attained dao, he would only be able to grasp a nine-star Regulation, at most. Could he compare to the Lords of Death?","Moreover, how many Lords of Death were there?","\"Get lost!\" Li Dangping shouted coldly. \"Go and invite the Great Emperor Jingtian out. Our fathers have some matters to discuss with the Great Emperor Jingtian.\"","He fully expressed his contempt for Gong Yeliang, but at the same time, he also appropriately expressed his respect for the Great Emperor Jingtian.","It could not be helped. Even if the other had only been a Pseudo-Emperor a few days ago, which was a status equal to his, now that he had already achieved Dao, he had become the \"only\" Great Emperor, and was about to rule over an era.","Towards a Great Emperor, everyone had to show the respect that they deserved.","Gong Yeliang’s aura was completely stolen, and he did not dare to say anything at all.","—If the new Emperor was Ling Han, it would be completely different when he encountered this kind of situation.","As long as the rock golem was summoned, would Li Dangping and the others dare to be so arrogant?","It could not be helped. This was called background.","However, the Mysterious Spirit Planet didn’t have a Great Emperor previously, so wouldn’t having a Pseudo-Emperor and Saints in their ranks be astonishing enough?","It could only be said that the side of the Lands of Death was too strong, with twelve Great Emperors gathered. What force could compare to that?","Seeing how the people of the Lands of Death were so arrogant, all the Imperial Clans were furious, and there was actually not a single person on the side of Mysterious Spirit Planet that could resist, which caused everyone’s hearts to be filled with anger.","The Lands of Death had already forced them to leave their homes, and now, they were acting as if there was no one else around them. They were incredibly arrogant, so how could they not be furious?","But the problem was, faced with so many Pseudo-Emperors, who could stand against them?","\"Are you guys done yet?\" Shui Qingchang asked calmly.","She stood up, and a gentle breeze blew over, outlining her shapely and enchanting figure. She was indescribably perfect.","However, everyone was more intimidated by the aura she displayed.","To dare to step out at this moment, how could they not be impressed?","No woman was inferior to a man!","\"When the Lands of Death are executing business, those who are unrelated should not interrupt,\" Feng Miaoling interrupted.","Shui Qingchang took a step and entered the galaxy. \"Do you dare battle me?\"","\"Do you think I’m afraid of you!\" Feng Miaoling immediately entered the galaxy as well, and began a fierce battle with Shui Qingchang.","This was a Pseudo-Emperor battle, and could only be carried out in the distant galaxy. Otherwise, it would be able to crush the Mysterious Spirit Planet in a matter of minutes.","\"Haha, my hands are also itching. Who wants to fight me?\" Ding Shu laughed loudly, and similarly stepped into the galaxy.","Lin Dong stepped out to meet him, and another Pseudo-Emperor battle was begun.","\"Hehe, everyone’s already made a move, so I can’t stay idle either.\" Jing Haoran winked at Wu Xingtong in a showy manner, and said, \"Beauty, are you interested in sparring with me in bed?\"","Wu Xingtong was furious. \"I’ll chop off your dog’s head!\"","Boom!","The two of them stepped into the galaxy at the same time, and began a fierce battle. From this aspect, the side of the Lands of Death still used civility before resorting to force. They did not start a battle on the Mysterious Spirit Planet, which was very much giving face to Great Emperor Jingtian.","Meanwhile, the large black dog was puzzled. \"Grandpa Dog didn’t steal that woman’s undergarment, so why does she want to behead Grandpa Dog?\"","\"It means that your notoriety has spread all over the world, and everyone has the right to kill you,\" the little azure dragon said happily.","The three Pseudo-Emperor battles began, but even at such a far distance, those Saints could still clearly see that Jing Haoran, Shui Qingchang, and Ding Shu all had the upper hand, and their advantage was very obvious.","That’s right. These three people weren’t as lucky as Ling Han and obtained great fortune from the Primitive Abyss. However, as the Genesis World’s Masters, they naturally weren’t ordinary either.","To say nothing else, merely grasping the Destructive Energy allowed them to possess battle prowess that was superior to ordinary Pseudo-Emperors.","Moreover, Ling Han didn’t keep secrets, and he even passed on the True Dragon Body Art, which naturally raised Ding Shu and the others’ battle prowess to another level.","Hence, this was a one-sided thrashing.","He Luo, Yang Yihuan and the others couldn’t sit still any longer, and hurriedly went to provide reinforcements.","But even if it was a battle of two against one, they did not have the slightest advantage, and were still being suppressed.","The might of Genesis World’s Masters were fully unleashed.","Li Dangping didn’t attack. Instead, his eyes were locked on Ling Han.","This was the key person. With Ling Han’s battle prowess, he could suppress all the Pseudo-Emperors with a single hand.","However, this was the era of the Great Emperor, so no matter how strong a Pseudo-Emperor was, he was still only a Pseudo-Emperor.","Weng!","Right at this moment, the Natural-born Gold Spirit moved, and joined the battle.","The effects were immediately apparent.","From birth, the Natural-born Gold Spirit had already stood at the peak stage of Pseudo-Emperor Tier, and added with the divine sense of the Lords of Death, its battle prowess could sweep aside all Pseudo-Emperor Tier opponents.","—Of course, aside from Ling Han, because Ling Han’s strength had long since surpassed the level of Pseudo-Emperor.","Although Ding Shu and the others were strong, they were only Five Stars and Six Stars Pseudo-Emperors, after all. They were suppressed in terms of minor level, and added with the Natural-born Gold Spirit being extremely powerful in attack, they were outnumbered, and their advantageous situation was instantly turned into a disadvantageous situation.","After battling for a few more rounds, Ding Shu and the others retreated from the battle and returned to the Mysterious Spirit Planet.","\"Ling Han, it will still have to depend on you,\" the three of them said.","The Natural-born Gold Spirit was too strong.","Everyone gritted their teeth. The side of the Lands of Death was really too strong. The Lords of Death hadn’t even made a move, and their trump card was already close to being forced out.","—Fortunately, a new Emperor had attained Dao.","Ling Han smiled, \"No need.\"","He waved his hand, and in the distant galaxy, the rock golem immediately cried out and charged towards the Natural-born Gold Spirit.","Boom!","Instantly, an intense battle broke out in the galaxy.","The rock golem was a nine-star Pseudo-Emperor. Though it was not on the level of a Natural Spirit, it was nurtured by heaven and earth, so it could be said that there was not much difference.","One of them had invincible defense, while the other had heaven-defying attack power. This was the battle between the strongest spear and shield.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","At this moment, the battle was incredibly intense, yet it was difficult to determine who was stronger.","What!","Everyone was numb with shock. Ling Han actually summoned a Pseudo-Emperor-level Natural-born Stone Spirit with a wave of his hand?","What kind of great fortune was this? He was really too blessed by heaven and earth, wasn’t he?","However, it was a shame that he hadn’t become the Emperor.","Thinking of this, everyone shook their heads slightly. In front of a Great Emperor, so what if it was a Pseudo-Emperor-level Natural-born Stone Spirit? It was no different from a toy, and would only be the matter of a minor skirmish.","\"I am honored by your presence. I have not come out to receive you, so please forgive my lack of manners!\" Right at this moment, a voice filled with authority rang out, as if it could shake the heavens and earth."]},{"number":4858,"title":"Chapter 4858: Request of the Lords of Death","paragraphs":["The new Emperor, Pu Jingtian.","Boundless might surged, and a man was slowly walking over from the distance.","His steps were clearly light, yet gave off an incredibly heavy feeling. It was as if even the heavens would not be able to hold up under his foot, and would be forcefully crushed.","Great Emperor Jingtian!","\"Greetings, Great Emperor!\" Li Dangping and the other Imperial Sons bowed, paying their respects to the Great Emperor Jingtian.","Seeing the rebellious Imperial Sons from the Lands of Death pay their respects to the Great Emperor Jingtian, everyone felt a sense of pride and confidence rise up from the bottom of their hearts.","Having or not having a Great Emperor was a completely different matter.","Though Ling Han looked freakish, no matter how strong his battle prowess was, he was still only a Pseudo-Emperor.","With the word ’Pseudo’, how could it compare to the Great Emperor?","Thus, every battle with the Lords of Death would end with Ling Han fleeing.","But now? The battle had not even begun, and the Imperial Sons of the Lands of Death were already so respectful. This was proof of the might of the Great Emperor.","This was the weight of the Great Emperor.","The Great Emperor Jingtian was unmoved. He merely looked at the various Lands of Death in the sky, a murderous aura in his eyes, \"I haven’t even gone to look for you guys, and you guys have already delivered yourselves to my doorstep?\"","To dare cause trouble at his celebration of attaining Dao, this naturally enraged him.","\"Jingtian, we have only come to offer our congratulations.\" A female voice rang out from within the sea of blood. She was clearly incredibly cold, yet gave off a wonderful feeling of beauty, which was incredibly contradicting.","\"Tell me your name!\" the Great Emperor Jingtian said in a domineering voice.","All the Imperial Clans felt their blood boil with excitement upon seeing this. They finally had a pillar of support.","This boosted their morale too much!","\"I am the Ancestor Blood Demon,\" the Master of the Blood Sea said.","\"I am the Sea Emperor.\"","\"I am Void.\"","\"Ah Han.\"","\"Four Directions Great Emperor.\"","\"Wolf Tribe, Di Shitian.\"","\"Ancestral King Fire Clouds.\"","\"Golden Crow Emperor.\"","\"The Three Purity Great Emperor.\"","\"Great Emperor Senluo.\"","\"Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperor.\"","\"Dark Sunflower Demon Emperor.\"","The leaders of the Twelve Lands of Death reported their titles one after another. These were all overlords who had ruled over an era all those years ago. Some of them were familiar, but there were also some rumored Great Emperors whose records had been lost in the long passage of history.","Even in the face of twelve Great Emperors, Pu Jingtian was still incredibly calm, \"If you have only come to offer congratulations, it is not that I have no tolerance for others. Please take a seat.\"","\"Hehe, it’s fine for us to observe the ceremony here,\" the Four Directions Great Emperor said. \"Jingtian, we’ve come here firstly to offer our congratulations, as we’ve gained another member in the ranks of Great Emperors. Secondly, we also want to ask for a favor from you, friend.\"","\"What favor?\" the Great Emperor Jingtian asked calmly.","\"Please do not move for the next thousand years, friend!\" the Golden Crow Emperor continued.","\"Hahahaha!\" The Great Emperor Jingtian laughed loudly, and said, \"I’m the Great Emperor Jingtian, and I’ve grasped the willpower of heaven and earth. I can come and go as I please, yet you people actually want to restrict my movements?\"","When he said the last words, his fighting spirit was already soaring.","Which Emperor was not incredibly proud?","Who would dare to restrict the Great Emperor?","Ancestral King Ancestral Fire Clouds spoke up, and said calmly, \"Friend, bear with it for a while, and only then will you be able to live forever.\"","\"More than ten million years ago, there was also a new Emperor who had succeeded Dao, but he did not appreciate our kindness. In the end, he died not long after becoming Emperor,\" the Sea Emperor said.","Of course, he was talking about Xuan Taiyu.","The Sea Emperor’s tone was very calm, but when everyone heard it, they couldn’t help but feel a cold chill rise up in their hearts.","A new Emperor... had been killed by these Great Emperors.","Similarly, you, Pu Jingtian, are also a new Emperor. Of course, you could also be killed, and there would be no accidents.","These words were filled with threat, and also fully displayed the pride of the Great Emperor.","’I’m not trying to persuade you. Instead, I’m blatantly threatening you.’","Those who did not heed his advice would be directly killed!","The Great Emperor Jingtian scoffed, and said, \"You people should have disappeared in the passage of time long ago. Acting against the will of heaven will only lead to your own destruction!\"","\"What a joke!\" the Great Emperor Senluo said. \"Cultivating is something that defies the heavens to begin with. If we don’t defy the heavens, how can we open up a new world?\"","\"Jingtian, you’ve just achieved dao, so it’s understandable that you’re full of vigor,\" Ah Han said. \"However, since ancient times, among those who can become Emperors, who would be inferior to another?\"","\"Firstly, you have just entered into Great Emperor Tier, and have also grasped a nine-star Regulation, and we are all consummate level beings that have grasped nine Regulations!\"","\"Secondly, there are a total of 12 Great Emperors here, and if we join forces against you, as long as your dao foundations are damaged, you would naturally die very quickly.\"","\"Thirdly, our request is also very simple, and that is you do not enter into our territory within a thousand years.\"","\"This request is not too much, is it? We are also Great Emperors, and charging into our territory can be considered a challenge to us!\"","This made a lot of sense. How could the territory of a Great Emperor be allowed to be invaded? That would be equivalent to causing trouble!","However, a Great Emperor ruled over an era, yet now the rule of this era had to be shared among thirteen of them. With the pride of a Great Emperor, who could tolerate this?","However, the Great Emperor Jingtian fell into deep thought.","He had the pride of a Great Emperor, but he was no fool either.","Just like what the Lords of Death said, in terms of battle prowess alone, he was now the weakest Great Emperor.","—In the past, when Xuan Taiyu had died, though he had not heard or witnessed it, when he had been cultivating to attain Dao, he had caught bits and pieces of it from the flow of time, and knew that the words of the Lords of Death were not false.","Who would be weaker than the other among those who could become Emperor?","He had just advanced into Emperor Tier, and there was only one of him. If he went head-on with the Lords of Death, then Xuan Taiyu’s fate was a clear example for him.","Thus, he definitely could not make the same mistake.","Then... he quickly made his judgement.","As long as he stabilized his cultivation level, and possessed the strength to face the Lords of Death head-on, then even if he was still all alone, the Lords of Death weren’t the complete form of Great Emperors, and he could completely exhaust them to death.","This was the correct course of action.","With this in mind, the Great Emperor Jingtian finally came to a decision.","\"A thousand years.\" He nodded, \"I will give you a thousand years’ time.\"","He was clearly the one who wanted to hide for a thousand years, yet he spoke as if he was letting the Lords of Death off the hook.","It could not be helped. Did the Great Emperor not care about his pride?","The Lords of Death didn’t refute this. They were already on the upper hand, so they would let Pu Jingtian save some face.","And once they had dealt with the hidden danger, and even improved further in fact, wouldn’t it be a piece of cake for them to destroy Pu Jingtian?","\"Since we’ve come to an agreement, you can all leave now!\" the Great Emperor Jingtian said calmly. This was his celebration of proving Dao, so if there were still 12 Great Emperors beside him, where would he get his sense of superiority from?","Hearing this, the Imperial Clans all felt a strong sense of disappointment.","Was he going to cower just like that? Compromise?","Though they all knew that logically speaking, this was the best choice that the Great Emperor Jingtian had made. If he was to clash head-on with the Lords of Death now, he may be able to kill one or two of them, but the Great Emperor Jingtian would definitely die as well.","However, they had waited for so long, anticipating the emergence of a new Emperor. Wasn’t it all for the sake of suppressing the Lords of Death and eradicating the darkness?","However... Pu Jingtian’s performance was far too disappointing.","They couldn’t help but think that if it was Ling Han who had attained Dao, then this guy’s performance would definitely be different.","Why wasn’t it Ling Han who was attaining Dao?","He would definitely not compromise. His battle prowess was incredibly freakish, and at this time, he would just simply charge full speed ahead. Who knows, he may even be able to completely defeat the Lords of Death, and make them flee in a sorry state.","All of a sudden, everyone felt rueful."]},{"number":4859,"title":"Chapter 4859: You disappoint me","paragraphs":["However, why was Ling Han keeping such a low profile today?","Was he afraid now?","How was this possible!","Previously, he was also a Pseudo-Emperor, but hadn’t he still fought fiercely with the Lords of Death?","Could it be that he was giving face to the Great Emperor Jingtian?","Yes, that must be the case.","You see, even the Great Emperor had cowered, but Ling Han, a Pseudo-Emperor was charging, wasn’t that equivalent to mocking the Great Emperor Jingtian?","Since Pu Jingtian had already succeeded Dao, there would not be a second Great Emperor in this era. Thus, in order to pacify the unrest, Ling Han had to cooperate with Pu Jingtian. The relations between the two of them naturally could not become strained.","After all, the Great Emperor was the main force, and no matter how freakish Ling Han was, he could only be a support.","Everyone nodded internally. Ling Han had really changed his personality, choosing to endure for the sake of the greater picture.","Thus, the gazes directed at Ling Han were filled with admiration.","Yi?","Ling Han was baffled. He was only showing off as per usual, so how had he suddenly gained the admiration of others for no reason?","En... could it be that the halo above his head had changed its attributes?","The Wolf Tribe Demon Emperor, Di Shitian opened his mouth and said, \"We still have to take another person away.\"","Finally, his eyes landed on Ling Han.","Though a new Emperor had appeared now, and it was impossible for Ling Han to attain Dao, this guy still posed a considerable threat. Additionally, the Mark of Destiny was still in Ling Han’s body, and he had to be killed to release it.","This was supposed to be used in conjunction when Little Ye attained Dao, but Little Ye was already dead, and a new Emperor had also appeared, so the significance was much smaller. However, they had to try again no matter what. It wouldn’t hurt to make more preparations.","\"Ling Han!\" The Lords of Death looked at Ling Han at the same time, their killing intent blazing like the waves.","These were all Great Emperors, and the killing intent that they exuded at the same time was too terrifying. A great many Saints were directly suffocated, their faces as pale as paper.","The Great Emperor Jingtian frowned, and said, \"Haven’t you guys gone too far?\"","This was his Dao Ceremony, and if they came over to threaten him, he could still find a reason to convince himself, that this was for the sake of the greater picture, and he could temporarily endure.","But you guys still want to take away one of his guests. That would be going too far.","Did he not care about his pride?","\"This boy must die!\" the Black Sunflower Demon Emperor declared balefully. His son had died by Ling Han’s hand, and this was a great enmity.","The Lords of Death all exuded killing intent, their attitudes incredibly resolute.","The Great Emperor Jingtian sighed internally. Great Emperors naturally understood Great Emperors. He knew that the Lords of Death had already made up their minds, and it was impossible for him to change their minds.","Or he could choose the course of battle.","However, the consequences of this battle was something that he could not bear. Furthermore, a delay was beneficial to him. He had just attained Dao, so how could it be that he was willing to die with the Lords of Death just like that?","Sacrificing Ling Han alone could save all life in the world, so it was not a loss in terms of the overall situation!","The Great Emperor Jingtian had already taken a step back. Now that he had already started, it would be much easier for him to make any further concessions.","\"You can only take one person,\" he said, his eyes cold.","They actually dared to threaten him? Humph! When he reached the consummate level of the Emperor Tier, he would definitely make these Lords of Death pay a bloody price.","\"It’s just one person!\" The Lords of Death all nodded. They too had their own plans.","The Great Emperor Jingtian nodded, looked at Ling Han, and said, \"For the sake of all life in the world, you can only suffer.\"","His words implied that he should sacrifice himself first. This was for the sake of all life in the world, to buy time for him. At that time, he would definitely avenge you.","Sigh, after talking for so long, it was finally his turn to take the field.","\"Tsk, why are you sacrificing Little Han?\" the large black dog immediately shouted.","Yi, are you trying to steal the show?","Ling Han rubbed his nose. Since the large black dog had replied, he would just wait for now.","The Great Emperor Jingtian wore an expression of displeasure. He had just spoken, so how could he allow others to interrupt?","\"Why don’t you make some sacrifices?\" the large black dog said. \"You’ve already lived for so long, and Little Han is still in his prime. It’s clear that you’re the one who should make sacrifices for the sake of the world!\"","\"You see, my Little Han is so strong. As long as you die bravely, you would definitely be able to severely injure those Lords of Death. At that time, my Little Han would be able to clean up the mess and calm the darkness.\"","\"Don’t worry, your merits will definitely be recorded in history.\"","\"Go on!\"","The large black dog waved his paws, looking like he was chasing someone away.","This!","The Great Emperor Jingtian’s mouth twitched slightly. ’This despicable dog, are you even speaking human language?’","However, he naturally would not argue with a Saint, or a despicable dog. That would be too demeaning.","Ignorant pest.","\"Ling Han, you killed my descendant, so you need to give me an explanation!\" he said calmly.","Previously, he had already wanted to kill Ling Han, but because he was no match for him, he could only stop. But now, he had already attained Dao as a Great Emperor, so was there still a Pseudo-Emperor that he could not suppress?","Since Ling Han was unwilling to submit, he would find an excuse to suppress Ling Han.","Ling Han smiled calmly, \"Pu Jingtian, you have disappointed me.\"","What? He actually dared to speak to the Great Emperor in this manner?","Everyone shook their heads. Looks like Ling Han knew that he would not be able to escape, so he threw caution to the wind as well.","However, they didn’t know that Ling Han’s words were truly filled with emotion.","He deliberately went to the Primitive Abyss to prove his Dao, all for the sake of having another Great Emperor.","But what was the result?","Such a person had appeared.","However, his words could not be understood by outsiders.","\"If you had known, you might as well have shot it at the wall,\" the large black dog said from the sidelines.","\"Sigh, what an unfilial son!\" The little azure dragon also shook its head.","Without Ling Han’s concession, there would have been no way for Pu Jingtian to attain Dao. Thus, from this aspect, Pu Jingtian was completely repaying kindness with ingratitude.","However, Pu Jingtian didn’t know, and the others didn’t know either.","As they saw it, Ling Han, and the others were completely spouting nonsense.","The Great Emperor Jingtian couldn’t help but sneer, saying, \"Ling Han, are you worthy of speaking to me like this?\"","He was a Great Emperor!","Ling Han shook his head, and stood up, \"After watching the show for so long, it’s time to end it.\"","\"That’s right, with your death!\" Wu Xingtong interrupted.","Ling Han cracked a smile, \"I’m afraid I’ll have to disappoint all of you.\"","He looked at the Great Emperor Jingtian and said, \"A man knows when to yield and when not to yield. However, in the face of right and wrong, you need to have a bottom line. Unfortunately, you don’t.\"","The Great Emperor Jingtian couldn’t help but laugh. \"Are you even worthy of teaching me a lesson?\"","\"Of course, he is, just like how a father can beat his own son,\" the large black dog interrupted.","The Great Emperor Jingtian’s mouth twitched again, and he couldn’t help but turn to look at the large black dog. This despicable dog!","When a Great Emperor moved, what need was there for him to have any reservations?","His killing intent rose, and he stretched out a hand to swat at the large black dog.","\"Little Han, save me!\" the large black dog hurriedly shouted. Even at this moment, he didn’t forget to show off.","Ling Han naturally wouldn’t sit by and watch. He raised a hand to parry, and the Great Emperor Jingtian’s attack was instantly dispersed..","Boom! Even though the Great Emperor Jingtian had held back, the Emperor Tier power still swept over them, causing the Saints to stumble.","The Great Emperor Jingtian and people of the Mysterious Spirit Planet were both astonished.","Ling Han... was actually capable of contending against Emperor Tier power?","How was this possible?","Could it be that the legends were true?"]},{"number":4860,"title":"Chapter 4860: Attack!","paragraphs":["According to legends, Ling Han was able to stand against the Lords of Death and the Divine Beast Great Emperors.","However, this had always been regarded as a joke by the people of the Mysterious Spirit Planet.","How was this possible? A Pseudo-Emperor could match Great Emperors, do you think the Great Emperor being capable of ruling over his era was just a joke?","However, after this attack, no one thought that this was a joke.","There really was such a freakish person in this world!","The Great Emperor Jingtian also raised a brow. He knew that Ling Han was very strong. In the previous battle, Ling Han gave him a feeling of unfathomable depths, and he had not used up all his power. However, no matter how strong a Pseudo-Emperor was, could he compare to a Great Emperor?","He hadn’t used his full power at all—how much power did he need to use to kill a Saint? Moreover, this was the Mysterious Spirit Planet, so he also had reservations.","\"You do have some abilities. No wonder you’re so arrogant!\" the Great Emperor Jingtian said calmly.","Ling Han smiled, and his eyes swept over the Lords of Death. \"Just in time. Since you’ve all come today, there’s no need for me to make an extra trip. I’ll deal with you all together.\"","These words were very domineering!","All of a sudden, it was as if everyone’s emotions had been ignited, filled with excitement.","This was the tone of the strongest person in the world. Who cares if you are the Lords of Death or the Divine Beast Great Emperors? You are all past your prime. I am the true ruler of this era!","However, everyone immediately sighed. Too bad, Ling Han didn’t attain Dao.","Even if Ling Han was freakishly powerful, and could just barely match a Great Emperor, there was absolutely no way he could suppress him. At most, he could only defend himself.","\"Even if we’re on different sides, killing you still feels like burning a qin to boil a crane,\" Ah Han said1[. This is a Chinese proverb that means ’this is a waste of valuable resources’.].","This time, they had already set up the Inescapable Net, and would definitely not give Ling Han another chance to escape.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and slowly stepped into the galaxy, \"Then let us battle!\"","\"Ling Han!\" the Great Emperor Jingtian roared. He also stepped into the galaxy, and said, \"You killed my descendant first, and you disrespected me later. Moreover, you’re also unwilling to sacrifice yourself for the sake of all life in the world. I can’t tolerate this!\"","Boom!","He immediately lashed out, grabbing at Ling Han.","The elites were all stunned.","Great enemies were in front of them, yet the Great Emperor Jingtian was actually still concerned about an internal conflict?","He was really too petty, wasn’t he?","Meanwhile, the Lords of Death and the others smirked coldly. In terms of conventional battle prowess, they were no longer a match for Ling Han. If they wanted to suppress Ling Han, they had to return to their strongest state. Now that someone was taking the vanguard for them, they were naturally happy to save some energy.","Ling Han casually swung his fists, blocking the Great Emperor Jingtian’s attacks with ease.","So... powerful!","All the Imperial Clans were watching dumbfounded. They knew that Ling Han was strong, but they had never imagined that a Pseudo-Emperor could actually be strong to this extent, and be on equal footing with a Great Emperor that had just attained Dao.","In fact, in fact, Ling Han appeared to be too relaxed, as if he still had energy left.","Gods, there was actually such a Pseudo-Emperor!","Meanwhile, the Mysterious Spirit Planet cultivators all gaped in shock, unable to believe their eyes.","Had their Great Emperor been born in the wrong era?","Throughout history, which Great Emperor hadn’t suppressed heaven and earth and become invincible as soon as they achieved dao?","But now?","Not only did the older generation of Great Emperors climb out of their graves, but even a Pseudo-Emperor was overwhelmingly powerful, possessing the might to match a Great Emperor.","Just what kind of great luck was this!","If Ling Han could become Emperor... hiss!","No one dared to imagine how strong that would be.","All of a sudden, the Great Emperor Jingtian felt extremely complicated.","He had become the strongest in the world, yet his battle prowess was actually not the strongest. How could he accept this?","If it was the Lords of Death, that was still fine. After all, these were the Great Emperors of past eras, and they were all on the same level, but Ling Han... f***, this was a Pseudo-Emperor!","How could a Pseudo-Emperor be so powerful?","He gave a loud shout, and the Nine Star Regulations channelled.","Previously, he had only grasped a portion of the Nine Star Regulations, which allowed his battle prowess to overwhelm all Saints, and be called Pseudo-Emperor. Now, he had finally grasped a complete Nine Star Regulation, and his battle prowess had increased by who knew how many times.","Without the word ’Pseudo’, it was a completely different story.","Boom! His palm pressed down on the sky, and the true Imperial Might blazed. Even at such a far distance, the Saints on Mysterious Spirit Planet couldn’t help but tremble uncontrollably, almost passing out.","Ling Han shook his head, and also sent out a palm strike.","Peng!","The Great Emperor Jingtian was instantly sent flying.","W-what!","Seeing this scene, whether it was the Lords of Death, the various Imperial Clans, or the people of the Mysterious Spirit Planet, they all showed expressions of disbelief.","The Great Emperor... was sent flying with a single slap?","Heavens!","This, this, this, what Pseudo-Emperor could accomplish this in history?","F***! F***! F***!","Previously, those Imperial Clans that had deliberately curried the favour of Pu Jingtian, and made cynical remarks about Ling Han, were really numb with shock now.","Ling Han was actually this strong!","How could a Pseudo-Emperor be so strong?","What justice was there left in this world?","Was there any law?","All of a sudden, the entire Mysterious Spirit Planet was dead silent. No one could say a single word.","Except—","\"You have attained Dao and become Emperor!\" the Blood Demon Ancestor said, her killing intent surging.","Ling Han smiled faintly, \"I said that I would slaughter you all, and pacify the world. Did you think I was showing off?\"","Everyone was in deep agreement. This was really too much of a show-off.","He had shown off by stepping on the face of the Great Emperor!","Xiu, the great golden path spread out. The Great Emperor Jingtian had already appeared in front of Ling Han. He roared loudly, and endless Imperial Might surged out. His fighting spirit and killing intent had already been ignited to the extreme.","Was he the most tragic Great Emperor in history?","He had just attained Dao, when he was sent flying with a slap.","He would definitely go down in history, but in the most humiliating way.","\"Ling, Han!\" he called out word by word, wanting nothing more than to grind his teeth into pieces.","Ling Han looked at him calmly, and said calmly, \"Cowardice and fear of trouble does not affect others. However, one must have a bottom line. Unfortunately, you do not!\"","\"What do you know!\" The Great Emperor Jingtian charged over, \"What I need is only time. As long as I cultivate to the consummate level of Emperor Tier, I will definitely be able to quell the turmoil! Who do you think you are? The heaven and earth no longer allows you to attain Dao. This era belongs to me!\"","Peng!","Ling Han didn’t say anything, and the response he received was an iron fist.","This punch was earth-shattering.","So what if he was the Great Emperor? After sustaining such a blow, the Great Emperor Jingtian was once again sent flying, blood gushing from all over his body.","It should be known that his present battle prowess was only in the sixth tier, and furthermore, did not belong to the strongest category. He was slightly inferior to the Divine Beast Great Emperors.","And what about Ling Han?","He alone could match 36 of them, and he had killed all the Divine Beast Great Emperors.","Moreover, Ling Han’s current strength had improved further than before.","How could the Great Emperor Jingtian be a match for him?","If he put his life on the line, he naturally wouldn’t be able to withstand a single blow.","Ling Han caught up to him, throwing punch after punch.","Peng, peng, peng! The dignified Great Emperor was being beaten like a punching bag by Ling Han.","Everyone’s mouths were wide open, but they could not make the slightest bit of sound.","Was this the most tragic Great Emperor in history?","He must be.","He should have suppressed the world and been invincible for an era, but what happened in the end?","Being thrashed in front of everyone in the universe!","Crap, he was really in such a sorry state."]},{"number":4861,"title":"Chapter 4861: Courting Death","paragraphs":["The Great Emperor Jingtian released a furious roar. The soundwaves were like a tidal wave, and solidified. Peng, peng, peng! The waves crashed over, and even space was forcibly torn apart.","If they hadn’t been battling in the depths of the universe, this roar alone would have been enough to obliterate all of the nearby planets.","The strength of a Great Emperor was not something that could be imagined by ordinary people.","However, such a powerful Great Emperor was being pummeled by Ling Han!","Heavens!","Everyone was dumbfounded, feeling their scalps go numb, while their bodies continued to feel cold.","They... had witnessed a miracle.","The strongest Pseudo-Emperor in history!","A Pseudo-Emperor was beating down on a Great Emperor. Though it was only a Great Emperor that had just proved his Dao, this had still broken the records thoughout the passage of history.","Hold on, someone seemed to have just said that Ling Han had already attained Dao?","That was impossible.","A new Emperor had just attained Dao, so it was definitely impossible for another Great Emperor to emerge.","And if it was claimed that Ling Han had attained Dao long before the Great Emperor Jingtian, it was even more impossible.","Only one Great Emperor could appear in an era. Furthermore, there had been no phenomenon of heaven and earth previously.","But whether it was the Pseudo-Emperor beating up the Great Emperor, or the birth of two Great Emperors in the same era, this had broken the iron rule of heaven and earth.","What kind of crazy era was this?","Boom! The Great Emperor Jingtian mustered up his remaining strength and forcibly charged forward.","He was covered with injuries, and one of his eyes was swollen. He looked as disheveled as could be.","He stared fixedly at Ling Han, his eyes filled with killing intent.","This was too humiliating.","He was a Great Emperor, a Great Emperor!","\"You are definitely not a Pseudo-Emperor!\" The Great Emperor Jingtian said through gritted teeth. There was no such powerful Pseudo-Emperor in this world, but to say that Ling Han had become a Grand Emperor... he too could not accept it.","Ling Han smiled faintly, his eyes sweeping over the Lords of Death, \"That’s right. I have already attained Dao, and that is before you at that.\"","What!","Everyone gritted their teeth. Even the Saints from the Imperial Clans were shaking their heads.","This was an impossible feat. A Great Emperor would never see another Great Emperor. This was an iron-clad rule of heaven and earth. Throughout these countless years, this iron-clad rule had also been enforced, and there had never been an exception.","For example, the Lords of Death were buried in the passage of time. Furthermore, they could no longer be considered true Great Emperors.","Ling Han... on what basis was he different from the rest?","\"Impossible! Impossible!\" the Great Emperor Jingtian roared.","He was the true Great Emperor, the only Great Emperor!","Ling Han shook his head, \"Frog at the bottom of a well!\"","A Great Emperor that had never even gone to the Primitive Abyss still dared to boast shamelessly that it was impossible?","Anything was possible.","However, the Great Emperor Jingtian didn’t dare to attack again. He had just succeeded Dao, so he didn’t even have the Imperial Weapon. It could be said that he had no trump cards.","Faced with a powerful and unfathomable guy like Ling Han, he really didn’t have the slightest bit of confidence.","However, his heart was filled with great hatred.","He was a Great Emperor, and he had actually been trampled on in public. He had completely lost all face. He naturally wanted to crush Ling Han’s bones and scatter his ashes.","\"Friend, how about we work together to capture this brat?\" the Three Purity Great Emperor asked calmly.","The Great Emperor Jingtian couldn’t help but be tempted.","In a one-on-one battle, even if he was proud and arrogant, he had to admit that he was inferior to Ling Han. In fact, he wasn’t even qualified to make Ling Han go all out.","However, if he teamed up with the Lords of Death... there were 12 of them, and they could even unleash the strength of the consummate level of Great Emperors. Just like tens of millions of years ago, they had even killed an actual Great Emperor.","Furthermore!","Killing intent flashed through his mind. There was a limit to the explosive power of the Lords of Death. If they used their full strength to kill Ling Han, it was possible that they would also be in danger. Then, he only had to exert a little more strength, and he would be able to completely destroy the Lords of Death.","At that time, he would be the only one to end the turmoil of the ages, and his reputation would definitely last forever.","Very good, very good!","\"All right!\" The Great Emperor Jingtian nodded. As a Great Emperor, his willpower was definitely resolute.","Instantly, the thirteen Emperors, both new and old, joined forces.","It could be said that no one could have foreseen that things would develop in this manner.","The Great Emperor Jingtian, who should have been the hope of the new era, had actually joined forces with the culprits behind the darkness, fighting against the side of light.","This... was ridiculous.","At the same time, it was also very tragic.","Ling Han shook his head, and said, \"Jingtian, I can understand that you’re jealous. However, as a Great Emperor, you don’t even have this bit of tolerance. This truly disappoints me!\"","\"What do you know!\" the Great Emperor Jingtian said calmly. He had already made up his mind. This was called enduring humiliation.","Ling Han sneered, \"Don’t think that I don’t know what you’re planning, but to make a deal with a tiger, you will ultimately suffer the consequences of your own actions!\"","\"You speak too much nonsense!\" the Great Emperor Jingtian shouted. He was afraid that Ling Han would expose his scheme.","However, which one of them wasn’t an old fox?","Those who could become Great Emperors were all extraordinarily smart.","They knew, but did not point it out.","\"Die!\" The Blood Demon Ancestor walked out of the sea of blood. Her shrivelled body did not have the sligthest bit of beauty, and no one could tell that she had once been a supreme Empress.","The price of such longevity was too great.","And precisely because they had already sacrificed so many years, every Lord of Death was yearning to obtain the true art of immortality. For this, they were willing to destroy this universe.","A black Demonic Sunflower suddenly bloomed in the galaxy. One petal was even larger than the galaxy itself, and it was indescribably majestic.","Inside the Demonic Sunflower stood a Great Emperor.","The Black Sunflower Demon Emperor also stepped forward.","The Sea Emperor, Golden Crow Emperor, Void Emperor and so on all entered into battle mode.","The thirteen Emperors battled Ling Han.","Ling Han was extremely calm. With a casual wave of his hand, nine-star Regulations appeared. One, two, three, four... nine, ten!","Though only two were complete, the number had reached ten.","\"What?!\" The Lords of Death were all stunned. Ling Han had actually grasped 10 Nine Star Regulations!","How was this possible?","The Regulation of Death belonged to the Netherworld. Even for them, they could only grasp and use it after transforming into Yin souls. However, as a price, they had also lost the ability to use the Regulation of Life.","It could not be helped. To them, the Regulation of Life was like poison, and to allow it to enter their bodies was an action of courting death.","But Ling Han... he was clearly a living being, so how could he possibly absorb the Regulation of Death?","This was practically, practically...!","All the Great Emperors wanted to curse. How could such a monster appear?","The Great Emperor Jingtian felt even more inferior. He had only grasped a nine-star Regulation, but what about Ling Han?","Ten flashes!","—Though there were only two that were complete.","No wonder he had been suppressed. This was because he was overwhelmed in terms of the number of Regulations.","But it was all right. As long as he was given enough time, he would similarly be able to grasp all the Nine Star Regulations. Even if he was still inferior to Ling Han, the gap would be very, very small.","\"Charge!\" he roared loudly, and was the first to charge out.","—The new Emperor was actually playing the role of the vanguard in killing Ling Han. This was really an incomparably ironic matter.","Ling Han’s eyes finally lit up with killing intent.","He was quite tolerant of Great Emperor Jingtian. Although Pu Jingtian definitely wouldn’t admit this, Ling Han believed that this was a Great Emperor that he had nurtured. Thus, he treasured his talent.","Unfortunately, Pu Jingtian had courted death."]},{"number":4862,"title":"Chapter 4862: War of Great Emperors","paragraphs":["Ling Han dashed toward the Great Emperor Jingtian.","This time, he didn’t hold back anymore. As he threw a punch, a terrifying power surged, and his killing intent was already surging.","\"Humph!\" The Lords of Death naturally wouldn’t sit by and watch. They all moved to intercept Ling Han.","\"Scram!\" Ling Han shouted lightly, his other hand throwing heavy punches. Peng, peng, peng! The Lords of Death instantly turned into straws, scattering madly in the galaxy.","With his present battle prowess that was infinitesimally close to the fourth tier, how could mere seventh tier Emperor Tier battle prowess match him?","One-on-one wasn’t enough, and even if the 12 of them teamed up, it wouldn’t be enough either.","The gap was really too wide.","Just like in the Primitive Abyss, the Great Emperors had joined forces, but could only detain the old Divine Beast, and were not qualified to stop him at all.","Wasn’t there only a difference of two tiers as well?","Ling Han was practically unaffected. He had already rushed right in front of the Great Emperor Jingtian, and his iron fists continued to pummel him.","Peng!","The Great Emperor Jingtian blocked the attack, yet he was instantly sent flying by the devastating power of the attack.","My gods!","Seeing this scene, everyone was numb with shock.","This, this, this, one against thirteen, they were all Great Emperors.","Just how powerful was Ling Han?","Everyone looked towards the Great Emperor Jingtian again, their eyes filled with sympathy.","If, if Great Emperor Jingtian had decided to be slightly more forceful, and if he hadn’t chosen to compromise, then he should have teamed up with Ling Han to fight against the Lords of Death.","With how powerful Ling Han was, perhaps they could pacify the darkness with this battle.","Then, as one of the two main forces, the Great Emperor Jingtian could similarly be known for all eternity, and his name would never be destroyed!","Now, however... er, it was extremely likely that he would become a footnote, a negative example, and be nailed onto the pillar of shame in history.","This was a wrong decision made in a moment of weakness with serious consequences.","\"Brat!\" the Black Sunflower Demon Emperor roared in fury. Boom! He was the first to recover, and Demonic Qi instantly surged into the surroundings.","At this moment, he was at the peak stage of Emperor Tier.","Of course, this was the pinnacle of the outside world. In fact, this was the pinnacle of the fifth tier.","This Demon Emperor rode over with supreme might, and a massive Black Sunflower bloomed behind him, wrapping around Ling Han.","This black sunflower was too big, and \"swallowed\" Ling Han in a single move.","Hiss, a Great Emperor at his prime was so terrifying.","Everyone was dazzled.","Ling Han died just like that?","He was beaten to death the moment he flipped out?","F***!","This guy must be too proud. Previously, he had been incomparably domineering, causing him to misjudge his own strength. He thought that after recovering his battle prowess, the Lord of Death was only so-so, and that was why he had been easily killed.","All the Imperial Clans looked extremely dejected. Now that Ling Han was dead, how was the darkness going to be pacified?","Relying on the Great Emperor Jingtian?","This result was something that even the Lords of Death and the others hadn’t foreseen. They had already prepared many counterattacks, yet none of them had been used.","\"Not good!\" Right at this moment, they heard the Black Sunflower Demon Emperor exclaim in shock.","Peng!","In the galaxy, that Demonic Sunflower suddenly exploded, and endless waves of energy surged out in all directions. And in the same spot, Ling Han stood proudly in midair. He was clearly the height of an ordinary person, yet gave off the feeling of an indomitable spirit.","’He’s not dead!’","Instantly, all the Imperial Clans breathed a sigh of relief.","However, all the Lords of Death frowned.","They naturally knew just how terrifying this strike from the Black Sunflower Demon Emperor was. However, Ling Han was completely unscathed even though he had taken it head-on. This showed just how terrifying his strength was.","However, the Black Sunflower Demon Emperor was clearly at the peak stage of the Emperor Tier, so how could Ling Han remain unscathed after taking this attack head-on?","Though he had grasped ten Regulations, there were clearly only two that had reached the complete state.","Thus, they could not accept this at all.","\"Die!\" Great Emperor Senluo attacked. With a wave of his hand, endless black clouds moved, turning into a massive palm that was entwined with Nine Stars Regulations.","At this moment, he also recovered all of his battle prowess.","Peng!","However, Ling Han merely threw a punch, and this large hand was shattered.","\"Impossible! Impossible!\" All the Lords of Death murmured, completely unable to believe this.","They were all at the peak stage of the Emperor Tier. Unless they obtained the great opportunity that had arisen from the clash between the two Realms, there was no way for them to advance any further.","Then how were they supposed to suppress this freak?","Being able to become Emperors, who would be weaker than the other? Why was the gap between them so wide?","This caused these Great Emperors to start doubting their own lives. They were really unable to accept the stark difference in battle prowess.","Ling Han charged over. He suddenly took a deep breath, and his figure instantly enlarged endlessly. Then, he threw a punch. His fist was countless times larger than the sun. With this strike, the Lords of Death were completely enshrouded.","He was too powerful!","Left with no choice, all the Lords of Death were forced to enter their strongest states to disperse this terrifying attack.","Peng!","Finally, the Lords of Death joined forces and blocked Ling Han’s attack. In fact, they even had a slight advantage.","However, this result caused the Lords of Death and the others to pale in shock, and even despair.","This!","Though they did indeed have the upper hand, it was only a slight upper hand. They did not have an overwhelming advantage at all, and how long could they maintain this kind of battle prowess in front of Ling Han?","After all, they could no longer be considered true Great Emperors.","Why was it like this?","None of them could accept this.","Ling Han didn’t care. This was a path that they themselves had chosen, and since the Lords of Death had embarked on this path, there was no turning back. They could only go all the way to the end.","’Die!’","Ling Han unleashed his full battle prowess, Destructive Energy and light of great dao channeled at the same time. This was a terrifying destructive power that surpassed fifth tier.","The Lords of Death and the others couldn’t resist at all, and they all dodged.","\"It’s this energy again!\" Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperor exclaimed through gritted teeth.","Fire Clouds nodded, and said, \"Xuan Taiyu also mastered this energy in the past, causing great trouble for us!\"","Otherwise, Xuan Taiyu hadn’t actually ascended Dao for too long. At most, he had only grasped five to six nine-star Regulations. However, because of Destructive Energy, they were forced to unleash their full power, and just barely managed to destroy his dao foundations.","And in Ling Han’s hands, this kind of energy was even more terrifying.","Meanwhile, the Great Emperor Jingtian’s expression was ashen.","As it turned out, the gap between him and Ling Han was actually as wide as this.","Was this really a Great Emperor that had just attained Dao, and had not come from the Timestream?","Even if he had reached peak stage Emperor Tier, what right did he have to resist?","There was none!","An Emperor was invincible in the world and filled with confidence, but now, the Great Emperor Jingtian’s Dao Heart was unstable, and he had lost his confidence in being invincible.","\"Ah!\" The Four Directions Great Emperor let out a roar, and charged over with the Eternal Dragon Hammer.","\"A contest of Imperial Weapon?\" Ling Han smiled faintly, and unleashed the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower.","Peng!","The Transcendent Weapon unleashed its might, and without even needing Ling Han to command it, it easily blocked the Eternal Dragon Hammer.","This stunned the Lords of Death and the others again. Because there was no Great Emperor channeling the Imperial Weapon, that was the weakest level of power in Emperor Tier.","And now, the weakest Emperor Tier power had actually withstood an attack from the Four Directions Great Emperor?","Heavens, why was everything that had any relation to Ling Han so illogically powerful?"]},{"number":4863,"title":"Chapter 4863: Heavenly Emperor Han","paragraphs":["Ling Han held the Transcendent Weapon in his hand, and he used it like a heavy weapon as he swung it at the Lords of Death.","It should be known that the Great Emperor wielding the Imperial Weapon, could allow the Imperial Weapon to burst out with battle prowess that surpassed its own abilities. Then, how terrifying would the combination of Ling Han and the Transcendent Weapon be?","Peng!","With a single strike, the Lords of Death couldn’t block it even if they joined forces, and were forced to retreat.","—Ling Han possessed battle prowess that was infinitesimally close to fourth tier, and the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower was the same. In fact, it itself could unleash the might of fourth tier, but it could only be once every ten days.","This kind of powerful alliance could really be called fourth tier battle prowess.","Ling Han was like a tiger that had entered a flock of sheep. The Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower was brandished, unleashing a barrage of blazing white lightning. Coupled with the Destructive Energy, no one could resist Ling Han at all. The Lords of Death could only be blasted here and there.","This caused the Lords of Death and the others to feel despair. They were no match for him!","They couldn’t even defeat Ling Han now, so when they exited their strongest state, how would they resist Ling Han?","Let’s go!","The Great Emperors exchanged a glance before turning around to flee at the same time.","Saints were difficult to kill, because as long as the Saint wanted to flee, it would be very difficult for the other Saint, or even a group of Saints to catch up to him, what more surround him.","Even Saints were like this, what more Great Emperors. Only one could appear in each era.","The Lords of Death fled in different directions, not fighting at all.","Heavens!","On the Mysterious Spirit Planet, when they saw this scene, all the members of the Imperial Clans were so excited that they were on the verge of tears.","The Lords of Death had been chased off!","After teaming up and recovering to their strongest state, they were still chased off.","This was an undisputed great victory!","Though the Lords of Death hadn’t died yet, everyone knew that pacifying the darkness was not just empty words. It was about to be realized.","\"Ling Han!\"","\"Great Emperor Ling Han!\"","\"He has surpassed all previous Great Emperors, and can be called Heavenly Emperor!\"","\"That’s right, Heavenly Emperor Han!\"","\"Heavenly Emperor Han! Heavenly Emperor Han!\"","Everyone raised their arms and cheered loudly, cheering Ling Han on.","Lin Dong and Li Dangping also wanted to flee. However, Ding Shu, Shui Qingchang, and Jing Haoran all walked over and surrounded them.","\"Why are you in such a rush to leave?\"","Ling Han did not pursue, but rather stared at Pu Jingtian.","The Lords of Death were no longer a problem. Their power decreased with each use. Of course, on the other hand, it was also because these Lords of Death ran fast enough and went in separate directions. At most, he would only be able to stop one of them.","In comparison, Ling Han felt that Pu Jingtian was even more detestable.","The Lords of Death were already on the opposite side to begin with, so it was only natural that they were hostile. However, Pu Jingtian was far too disappointing.","Pu Jingtian felt as if he was being watched by a Primordial Beast, and he didn’t dare to make any sudden movements. Otherwise, he would definitely be struck at the speed and power of lightning.","This kind of understanding made him feel very sullen.","He was the Great Emperor, an existence that was unparalleled in this era.","Why?","Why had the heavens allowed him to attain Dao in this era? In the end, he encountered a freak like Ling Han, which caused him to lose all his confidence, and be completely battered.","\"Commit suicide,\" Ling Han said calmly. \"To save your last bit of face.\"","\"Haha!\" Pu Jingtian chuckled coldly, and said, \"I’m the Great Emperor, approved by heaven and earth. You dare to make me commit suicide?\"","\"Then you can only die with shame!\" Ling Han didn’t waste any words, and shot forwards like an arrow, brandishing his fists in a punch.","Peng!","Pu Jingtian parried, but he couldn’t block it at all. He was sent flying by Ling Han’s punch, and bounced through the galaxy, hundreds of times faster than even a streak of light.","However, Ling Han merely flapped his flaming wings, and he caught up to him, throwing another punch.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","Pu Jingtian became a punching bag again, and was thrashed by Ling Han.","However, this time, Ling Han continued to push Pu Jingtian farther and farther away. No one could see him anymore.","Chase after them to watch?","What a joke. Even if it was a Pseudo-Emperor, how could they possibly catch up to Great Emperors?","After a while, everyone suddenly discovered that a rain of blood had begun to fall from the skies. An indescribable grief overflowed their bodies, causing everyone to involuntarily shed tears.","There was no need for anyone to tell them. Everyone knew that the Great Emperor had died.","The Emperor had died, and the heavens grieved.","In just a short while, Ling Han had killed a Great Emperor!","Powerful, this was truly unreasonably powerful.","Meanwhile, it was as if doomsday had arrived for the people of Mysterious Spirit Planet. This was originally a celebration for their Great Emperor, yet what had happened?","On the day of the celebration, the Great Emperor died.","Such a strange thing had never happened before, and it was definitely impossible that it would happen again in the future.","Shua, the great path of black and white spread out, and Ling Han had already advanced towards them in a single step.","\"Greetings, Heavenly Emperor Han!\" Everyone half-knelt, including the Saints from the Imperial Clans.","In front of the Great Emperor, even the Saints of the Imperial Clans were mere ants, what more when Ling Han was still an existence that could kill a Great Emperor.","Ling Han raised his hand, indicating for everyone to stand up.","What he disliked the most was this kind of red tape.","Though Wu Xingtong, Yang Yihuan and the others were all Pseudo-Emperors, they were all trembling at this moment.","This young man that they had once looked down on had now grown to a level that even they could only look up to. With his own strength, he had sent their fathers fleeing, so strong that words could not describe him.","Why were they born in this era?","Couldn’t they simply avoid this freak?","Ling Han smiled faintly and said, \"We’re on different sides, so there’s nothing much to say. You guys can commit suicide.\"","’Commit suicide?’","Yang Yihuan and the others were all defiant. They were the sons of Great Emperors, and now that they had cultivated to the level of Pseudo-Emperor, they were to commit suicide?","They still wanted to follow their fathers and create greater glory together, so how could they be willing?","Ling Han shook his head, and swiped with his hand.","Pa, pa, pa, pa! Yang Yihuan and the others exploded, turning into a rain of blood.","This was the might of a Great Emperor. In front of him, Pseudo-Emperor was practically trash.","Everyone couldn’t help but feel even more reverence, and lowered their heads even further.","Ling Han tapped a finger at the galaxy again. Pa, the Natural-born Gold Spirit that was still fighting intensely with the rock golem immediately exploded. So what if it was so far away?","Right now, Ling Han wanted to kill, so even if there was a galaxy separating them, he could still kill a Pseudo-Emperor with a single thought.","The rock golem rubbed its head with a dumbfounded expression. \"...\"","\"Let us proclaim ’Invincible’ three times for the sake of the new Heavenly Emperor!\" someone boot-licked loudly.","\"Invincible!\"","\"Invincible!\"","\"Invincible!\"","No one shouted ’long live’. Wasn’t this cursing that Ling Han could only live for 10,000 <anno data-annotation-id=\"6f83ce25-bbc0-4856-a27b-86d7b169f4a5\" data-title=\"years\">years 1 </anno>?","The people of Mysterious Spirit Planet wanted to cry but had no tears. This was the celebration of their new Emperor, so why had Ling Han become the main lead instead?","They had worked so hard, yet it was all for the benefit of another?","However, how could they dare to say no? They had to pretend to be elated.","\"This guy, he’s obviously so powerful, yet he still wants to hide it from me. He really doesn’t let me rest easy!\" Chi Taiming scolded jokingly. Although he was scolding, the expression on his face was really extremely proud.","That’s right. They had not managed to become a clan with two Emperors either, yet had taken in an invincible Great Emperor as their son-in-law. Merely this fact was impressive enough.","See, he was deliberately scolding, as if he was reminding the surrounding Imperial Clans that he was Ling Han’s in-law!","Do you all dare to scold?","<annotations style=\"display: none;\">In Chinese, ’Long live’ is literally ’10,000 years’.</annotations>"]},{"number":4864,"title":"Chapter 4864: Start of Collapse","paragraphs":["Ling Han was completely uninterested.","In the past, he had been filled with anticipation for the Great Emperor Jingtian. He had promised him that they would fight side by side, but in the end, the latter had betrayed him without the slightest hesitation.","He was very displeased.","Ling Han nodded at the empress and the others. They set out and left, returning to Four Origin Planet.","Ling Han made some arrangements, then began to search for the Lords of Death.","However, after searching for a very, very long time, he still couldn’t find the whereabouts of the Lords of Death. It was as if they had disappeared from the face of the universe.","Unless!","With a thought, Ling Han arrived at the Primitive Abyss.","He entered, searching for any clues, and then confirmed it.","The Lords of Death had entered this place.","Previously, the Lords of Death were definitely curious about the changes in the Primitive Abyss. At least, they would have felt it was strange that the thirty-six Divine Beasts had appeared for no reason. However, because they still had their own goals, they did not have the time to come here to take a look.","However, things were different now.","They definitely couldn’t stay outside; how could Ling Han spare them?","Moreover, with Ling Han around, their plan definitely wouldn’t succeed.","Thus, they chose to enter the Primitive Abyss.","With how smart a Great Emperor was, how could it be that they wouldn’t be able to guess that the reason why Ling Han was so powerful was because it had something to do with the Primitive Abyss?","Since ancient times, among Great Emperors, who would lose to the other?","Thus, the Lords of Death placed their hopes on the Primitive Abyss, wanting to become even stronger.","Of course, they weren’t confident at all. This was a gamble. If they failed, their life force would be exhausted, and they would die in the abyss.","After all, the Primitive Abyss was full of dangers, and even if they entered at their peak, it was still possible that they would die.","The advantage now was that there were 12 of them.","A team of 12 Great Emperors charging into the Primitive Abyss was something that had never happened before.","Ling Han wasn’t in a hurry to give chase. He had to first deal with the hidden dangers outside.","He entered into the territory ruled by the Lords of Death, and began to recover the lost territory, star by star.","This time, there were no more Lords of Death making a comeback.","Ling Han, Ding Shu, Jing Haoran and Shui Qingchang all attacked, reviving the Living Realm and expelling evil.","More than a hundred years later, the entire Living Realm had already returned to how it had once been. Of course, the number of living creatures was still too far from what had once been.","It didn’t matter. Ling Han and the others were all Genesis World’s rulers, and there were a large number of living beings in the dimensions that could fill in the empty spaces, rapidly replenishing this world.","It was as if there was an invisible hand controlling the heaven and earth, maintaining the balance of this world.","Ling Han arrived at the edge of the Primitive Abyss. He observed the nine-star Regulations outside, and then comprehended them in the Primitive Abyss, saving as much time as he could.","He wanted to cultivate the Nine Star Regulations to consummate level outside, and once his cultivation level was complete, he would go to the Imperial Island to further improve his cultivation level.","On the other hand, he was also standing guard here to prevent the Lords of Death from suddenly coming out and causing trouble.","Of course, this possibility was very small.","More than a hundred years had passed in the outside world, and over ten thousand years had passed in the Primitive Abyss. He was sure that those Lords of Death would have already arrived at the Imperial Island — if they hadn’t, they would definitely have died on their way there.","It was best if they had died on their jouney there, to avoid any side issues.","Everyone was making the best use of their time to cultivate, because after Ling Han entered the Primitive Abyss again, he would be staying inside for a very, very long time.","Thus, everyone wanted to become a Pseudo-Emperor, and take that last step on the Imperial Island.","As it turned out, everyone could become Emperor, and the majestic scene of the many Divine Beasts of the ancient era would reappear.","In theory, that was indeed the case, but in truth... how could it be so easy to become a Pseudo-Emperor?","Difficult, as difficult as ascending the heavens.","For example, the empress, Hu Niu, and the others. After arriving at the level of Nine-Star Saint, their cultivation level had stagnated. No matter what, they were unable to awaken their bodies, and step into Pseudo-Emperor Tier.","Not only them, but even the large black dog, the little azure dragon, and Brother Monkey were the same.","For more than a hundred years, only Ding Shu and the other Genesis World’s rulers were Pseudo-Emperors. Furthermore, they improved very quickly. They would occasionally enter into the Primitive Abyss to comprehend, and were getting closer and closer to the level of Nine Star Pseudo-Emperor.","Ling Han also frowned. Was it so difficult to become a Pseudo-Emperor?","However, Lu Xun, Yang Yihuan, and the others were only the sons of Great Emperors, so how could they all become Pseudo-Emperors?","Had they obtained some kind of treasure?","While Ling Han was cultivating, he also began to ponder.","On the Imperial Island, one’s lifespan was unlimited. Thus, Ling Han had to think of a way. Otherwise, in at most a million years, the empress and the others would die from having their lifespans exhausted.","This was something that he could not accept.","As a Great Emperor, could it be that he was destined to endure loneliness and solitude?","Another 600 years later, a boom suddenly rang out in the galaxy, and the whole firmament was trembling.","Ling Han was sitting at the entrance to the Primitive Abyss. He immediately stood up and looked into the distance.","The Primitive Abyss was indeed at the edge of the universe. However, this wasn’t the absolute end; it was a bit further ahead.","That was because the universe was constantly expanding outwards, and the Primitive Abyss was also slowly moving outwards.","However, at this moment, this expansion suddenly stopped.","The collapse of the universe was about to begin.","Ling Han could clearly see that the edges of the universe were no longer extending outwards, but had rather stopped. That massive boom previously was precisely the movement that had stopped here.","For who knew how many years, the universe had been slowly expanding, as if there would never be an end to it.","But now, the expansion had ended, and the collapse was about to begin.","In just a short while, Ling Han saw that the edge of the universe was beginning to shrink back at a slow speed. Just like how this heaven and earth had spent hundreds of billions of years to reach this step, even if it ultimately had to retreat to a point, it would still need a long time.","’Hmm?’","Ling Han was astonished. He saw that as heaven and earth shrank, the Regulations were also being compressed.","These Regulations were preventing the heaven and earth from shrinking, but Regulations were only manifestations of heaven and earth, so how could they possibly resist this kind of great power?","Peng! Peng! Peng!","The Regulations had shattered, and were incredibly fragile.","However, after the Regulations shattered, they reformed and continued to resist, repeating the same cycle.","The Regulations existed to balance the heaven and earth, and stabilize the heaven and earth. Thus, now that the heaven and earth was shrinking, the Regulations would bear the brunt.","Ling Han was pleasantly surprised to discover that the Regulations were destroying and condensing in front of him like this. It was like they were showing him the core secrets, and it was done over and over again, as if they were afraid that he would not be able to see or understand them.","In this way, the time for him to fully grasp the Nine Stars Regulations would be greatly shortened.","Unfortunately, only he could enjoy this kind of benefit. Even Pseudo-Emperors could not. They could only observe the Nine Star Regulations at the moment their bodies were reviving.","Ling Han’s strength began to rapidly increase. His grasp of Regulations improved by leaps and bounds.","Three hundred years later, Ling Han had more or less mastered the Nine Star Regulations. At most, in another ten years, he would be able to reach consummate level.","Now, his battle prowess had definitely advanced into the fourth tier.","And on the matter of the empress and the others, he had also come up with an idea, but whether it could be realized or not, he would only know after trying."]},{"number":4865,"title":"Chapter 4865: Creating Pseudo-Emperors","paragraphs":["\"Old Black, do you want to become a Pseudo-Emperor?\" Ling Han asked the large black dog.","\"Of course!\" the large black dog blurted out. However, a guarded expression immediately appeared on his face, and he said, \"Little Han, you definitely didn’t hide any good medicine!\"","Tsk!","Ling Han smiled, \"Look at what you’re saying. Am I that kind of person?\"","\"Don’t you think about how many years we’ve known each other? With a turn of your eyes, Grandpa Dog will know what you’re pulling—\"","\"Stop, stop, stop!\"","Ling Han hurriedly pressed down on the large black dog, \"I have thought of a method that may allow you to advance into the level of Pseudo-Emperor, but because you are the first, I do not have much confidence.\"","\"F***, are you treating Grandpa Dog like a lab rat?\" The large black dog immediately spat. He turned around and ran, \"Grandpa Dog will help you find an experimental subject. When you succeed, you can do it on Grandpa Dog.\"","It ran off happily, and soon found the little azure dragon.","\"Four-Legged Snake, do you want to become a Pseudo-Emperor?\" the large black dog asked with a smile.","\"Get lost!\" The little azure dragon was in seclusion, and ignored him completely.","\"Really, Grandpa Dog and Little Han have thought of a way that can help you break through to the level of Pseudo-Emperor.\" The large black dog also mentioned Ling Han, because he knew that if it was only him, the little azure dragon would definitely not believe him.","\"You’re a Saint yourself, yet you didn’t try it out. Thus, this must be a method that Little Han Han just came up with. You’re afraid of death and pain, so you’ve come to look for Grandpa Dragon.\" The little azure dragon scoffed, and said, \"How can you fool Grandpa Dragon with your little tricks?\"","F***, was it that obvious?","The large black dog rubbed his nose. The little azure dragon was too familiar with it, so it wasn’t easy to deceive it.","\"Let’s go, we’ll trick others.\"","\"All right.\"","The two depraved characters ran out side by side just like that, looking for other lab rats.","However, the two of them were too notorious, especially the large black dog. That was the number one despicable Saint in the world. Who would dare believe the words of a despicable dog?","When Ling Han found out, he shook his head and broke into laughter.","He also sent out a notice, saying that he was thinking of a way to help a Saint advance into the level of Pseudo-Emperor, and needed an experimental subject.","When the news spread out, all the Imperial Clans were in an uproar.","Becoming Emperor!","Though it was only becoming a Pseudo-Pseudo-Emperor, everyone knew that as long as one had become a Pseudo-Emperor, there was a slight chance that he could become a real Great Emperor in the Primitive Abyss.","This temptation was too great.","As long as one was a cultivator, who didn’t want to become Emperor?","Just like how a soldier that didn’t want to become a general wasn’t a good soldier, cultivators who didn’t want to become a Great Emperor also didn’t have any ambitions.","Ling Han only wanted one person.","This caused all the Imperial Clans to fight tooth and nail for it.","If Ling Han succeeded, how could it be that he would do a great deed, and help every Saint become a Pseudo-Emperor?","Impossible!","This kind of \"technique\", or \"secret technique\", was too crucial. Ling Han would only do this experiment once, at most. In future, he would definitely only use it on his own people.","Thus, if outsiders wanted to become Pseudo-Emperors, or even Great Emperors, they had to take this gamble.","The senior Saints from the various clans all ran over. Though Ling Han had asked for a nine-star Saint, there were still a considerable number of eight-star Saints and even seven-star Saints that had arrived, wanting to test their luck.","Ling Han chose the best. Not only did he have to be a nine-star Saint, but his life force had to be as vigorous as possible. Otherwise, it was extremely likely that his life force would be exhausted when he broke through to the next cultivation level, and he would directly die.","Finally, the Heavenly Sorrow Imperial Clan’s old Saint, Lian Haiyun, was chosen.","Ling Han brought him to a desolate planet in the distance. Whether it was a success or a failure, the shockwave from breaking through to Pseudo-Emperor was too great, and could easily destroy a galaxy.","Ling Han first had Lian Haiyun make proper adjustments, whether it was in terms of physical condition or psychological condition.","Ten days later, he began.","According to Ling Han’s line of thought, the cultivation of Pseudo-Emperor was a process of reviving one’s body from Silent Destruction Tier, and in Ling Han’s case, he had grasped the essence of life, so could he use it to help the Saint complete this step?","The Regulations of Life could not do so, because the Nine-Star Saint was already very close to the highest level Regulations. However, the essence of life was superior, and was the source of all life and matter. In fact, even a Great Emperor could be revived.","Thus, Ling Han was still quite confident.","However, he hadn’t tried it before, after all, so he didn’t dare to use the empress and the others as an \"experiment\".","He tapped out a finger, and pressed it on Lian Haiyun’s back. He first explored the latter’s body.","Since he wanted to revive his body, he had to first find out how Lian Haiyun had gradually experienced Silent Destruction. Otherwise, if he acted recklessly, reviving two or even in fact three regions at once, how could he possibly succeed?","After a while, Ling Han finally understood the situation. Lian Haiyun’s body had been divided into nine parts, and it was precisely these parts of Lian Haiyun’s body that experienced Silent Destruction.","The sequence of revival need not be the same as the sequence of the Silent Destruction. Thus, Ling Han did not ask Lian Haiyun how he had progressed step by step. He stimulated the essence of life, and began to revive the latter’s body.","It was naturally impossible to succeed in a single attempt. In fact, Ling Han didn’t even know if he could succeed in reality. That was why he needed to experiment.","Once, twice, thrice, ten days, a hundred days, a thousand days.","Time passed very quickly. Ling Han tried many, many times, and Lian Haiyun was endlessly baring his teeth. In the process of this kind of experiment, he was continuously being adjusted by Ling Han’s power. That was definitely not a wonderful experience.","And there was not the slightest sign of improvement even after so long, which caused him to begin to doubt.","—Are you f****** playing around with me on purpose?","Yet Ling Han’s mind seemed to be wandering. Though he was still trying time and time again, his main focus was on his comprehension of the fundamentals of life.","Using it in this manner, he discovered that his understanding of the fundamentals of life was deepening.","\"Let’s go.\"","Ling Han grabbed Lian Haiyun and entered the Primitive Abyss.","Time passed quickly here. If he wanted to appreciate something, he naturally had to come here.","Though Lian Haiyun was a Nine-Star Saint, he could not bear the gravity here at all. Thankfully, Ling Han had already put the Silver Battle Armor on him, which naturally could ensure his safety.","Ling Han continued to make attempts, summarizing his experiences in the midst of failure.","His grasp of the essence of life improved by leaps and bounds.","30,000 years later, Ling Han breathed a long sigh of relief. He had finally made a breakthrough.","Actually, he had spent more of these 30,000 years cultivating. By now, he had more or less cultivated the fourth tier to consummate level, which was comparable to the Battle Saint Emperor and other Great Emperors of the past eras.","But on the sidelines, Lian Haiyun was about to cry.","He was an old Saint, and he was truly very old. His remaining lifespan was only around 50,000 years, and he had wasted 30,000 years here. He really wanted to cry himself to death.","However, in front of Ling Han, would he dare to complain?","Complain to the Great Emperor?","Hehe.","Right at this moment, Ling Han pointed at him again, saying, \"Concentrate and calm your mind. Follow my will!\"","Boom, an indescribably powerful vitality surged into his body. Lian Haiyun was shocked to discover that his body that had experienced Silent Destruction was also exuding slivers of vitality.","Heavens! Heavens! Heavens!"]},{"number":4866,"title":"Chapter 4866: The Last Battlefield","paragraphs":["Aside from a freak like Ling Han, whether it was breaking through or improving on the level of Pseudo-Emperor, it was the recovery of the body that would take place first, and then a response from the heaven and earth would be stimulated, so that Pseudo-Emperor could glimpse the Nine Star Regulations, and take advantage of this chance to study it a bit.","Thus, while both may be Five Star Pseudo-Emperors, some could grasp one third of a Nine Star Regulation, but others could not even grasp a sliver. Thus, the gap in battle prowess would naturally be huge.","It was also because of this that Ling Han was confident that he could help a Saint become a Pseudo-Emperor.","It was not difficult to revive one’s body with the essence of Life.","Of course, this was something that could only be done by a fourth tier Great Emperor. Furthermore, all the Great Emperors that have reached this level since ancient times had all entered into the Primitive Abyss. They had long since exhausted all their lifespans, so it was absolutely impossible for them to leave. If they left, they would definitely die.","On the other side, Saints were completely unqualified to reach the Imperial Island.","Hence, this became a problem that could not be solved.","Right until Ling Han appeared.","Hong, he turned the element of Life into the most fundamental life force, to revive Lian Haiyun’s body.","This was truly heaven-defying. It was extremely difficult to do so.","Even if Ling Han was a fourth tier Great Emperor, he could only focus his \"firepower\" to revive a portion of Lian Haiyun’s body at a time.","Lian Haiyun finally saw some hope. He hurriedly cooperated, and it was inevitable that he would feel excited and emotional.","\"Calm down!\" Ling Han shouted using the Six Characters Bright King Curse.","If he couldn’t control his emotions at this moment, he would eventually go mad.","Lian Haiyun shuddered, and hurriedly composed himself. Being able to become a Saint, he was naturally not one without self-control. It was just that he had been stuck at the Saint Tier for too long, and now that there was finally hope of breaking through to the level of Pseudo-Emperor, it was inevitable that his heart would be in turmoil.","The two of them continued. Though Ling Han still took the wrong path because of his lack of experience, and it only caused Lian Haiyun to scream repeatedly in pain, but in terms of overall progress, he was steadily advancing.","10 years, 50 years!","Weng, Lian Haiyun’s body began to glow with vitality. Even if Ling Han withdrew his fingers, this vitality was still exuberant, and showed no signs of weakening or disappearing.","Ling Han nodded. Lian Haiyun had already walked on the right path. At most, he would be able to successfully break through in a month’s time.","He watched from the sidelines. If anything happened to Lian Haiyun, he would be able to interfere in time.","Thankfully, Lian Haiyun’s vitality was only becoming more and more vigorous.","More than twenty days later, Lian Haiyun’s vitality had reached the pinnacle. Boom, all of a sudden, a shocking might burst out from his body, as if he was a Great Emperor.","He had broken through.","Pseudo-Emperor!","Lian Haiyun couldn’t help but feel extremely excited. He had finally broken through. He had been trapped in the Saint Tier for close to a million years, and he had finally broken through to Pseudo-Emperor Tier.","Not only did this allow him to possess the strength to look down on all Saints, but it also allowed his lifespan to soar to five million years.","In other words, he still had a long lifespan of four million years.","\"Thank you, Heavenly Emperor Han!\" He stood up and bowed respectfully.","Though Ling Han was only using him as an experiment, he had indeed broken through to Pseudo-Emperor. This was a kindness that he would never be able to repay in this lifetime.","Ling Han nodded, \"Let’s go back.\"","He grabbed Lian Haiyun and returned to Four Origin Planet.","Strictly speaking, Lian Haiyun was not a complete Pseudo-Emperor. He had only awakened his body once, and had not grasped the slightest bit of the Nine Star Regulations — in the Primitive Abyss, there was no Nine Star Regulations for him to comprehend.","It was fine. He could still continue to awaken his body, and there was still a chance that he could see the Nine Star Regulations.","When the news of Lian Haiyun breaking through to Pseudo-Emperor broke out, the whole world was in an uproar.","Gods, Ling Han could actually help a Saint break through to Pseudo-Emperor Tier!","This was something that had never happened before.","No wonder he was qualified to be called the Heavenly Emperor. Indeed, this was an ability that no Great Emperor was equipped with.","All of a sudden, the veteran Saints were all trying their best to get close to Ling Han.","If he couldn’t get a connection with Ling Han, then he would first get a connection with the large black dog, the little azure dragon, and the others who were close to Ling Han. In short, everyone wanted to become Pseudo-Emperor, and advance further into Great Emperor Tier.","However, how could Ling Han have the time?","Just how many people were by his side?","The empress, Hu Niu, the large black dog, and the others slowly cultivated to Nine Star Saint Tier. Ling Han began to revive their bodies, so that they could break through to Pseudo-Emperor Tier.","With the experience of succeeding once, Ling Han naturally became more and more proficient.","Furthermore, because they were people close to him, Ling Han helped them to break through to Pseudo-Emperor in the outside world. They could have one more chance to observe the Nine Star Regulations, and lay the foundations for becoming an Emperor in future.","Those like the empress and the others were definitely lucky people.","Because at this time, the Regulations were resisting the collapse of heaven and earth, continuously shattering and recovering. They could glimpse the essence, and it would be ten times or even a hundred times easier to grasp.","And after a while, the universe would also adapt to this kind of change. If one wanted to see Regulations clash head-on with the collapse again, that would be a completely impossible thing.","Thus, Ling Han was also racing against time, trying as much as possible to push everyone to Pseudo-Emperor Tier in the shortest time possible.","The empress, the large black dog, Brother Monkey, and so on all became Pseudo-Emperors. Furthermore, with Ling Han’s continuous assistance, they soared high all the way, and very soon, they broke through once more into the level of Two Stars and Three Stars Pseudo-Emperor Tier.","Ling Han was very pleased. When he reached the Imperial Island again, he should be able to bring a bunch of nine-star Pseudo-Emperors with him.","When time had come to the 9400th year after the beginning of the collapse, Regulations finally stopped forcibly collapsing.","The period of benefits had ended.","Thankfully, whether it was the large black dog, the empress and the others, they had all reached the level of Nine Star Pseudo-Emperor. However, they were not freaks like Ling Han, after all. Even if the Nine Star Regulations were so clearly displayed in front of their eyes, and were still continuously playing out their essence, there was still no one that could successfully grasp a whole Nine Star Regulation.","Ding Shu, Shui Qingchang, and Jing Haoran were the exceptions. They had all grasped a complete Nine Star Regulation, and possessed the battle prowess of a Great Emperor. However, they could only be ranked in the eighth tier.","Compared to Ling Han, they were still far inferior, but compared with other Pseudo-Emperors, they had surpassed the latter countless times over.","Being nurtured from the Stone of Life, they were indeed extraordinary.","It was too bad that Origin and the others had died. Otherwise, if the seven Genesis World’s Masters joined forces, they would definitely be able to pose a huge threat to the old Divine Beast.","It was about time. It was time to leave.","Ling Han examined this universe. The Yin souls had been completely swept clean, and the passageway of the two realms had also been closed up. The greatest hidden danger, the Lords of Death, had entered into the Primitive Abyss, and had either reached the Imperial Island or died.","And as for the 36 Divine Beasts, even if they were reborn and revived, they would still be in the Primitive Abyss. Ling Han was constantly standing guard nearby, and it was impossible for anyone to escape.","All right, the external worries were settled. It was time to resolve the internal strife.","Ling Han brought all the Pseudo-Emperors and entered into the Primitive Abyss.","It could be imagined that this would be a very long journey. Without dealing with the old Divine Beast, it would be impossible for Ling Han to come out again.","—What was the point of coming out? The outside world was no longer of the slightest help to his cultivation.","Fine, let’s go!"]},{"number":4867,"title":"Chapter 4867: Bad News","paragraphs":["Ling Han began his final journey.","He entered the Primitive Abyss and took the lead. Behind him was the empress, the large black dog, Ding Shu and so on. All of them were Pseudo-Emperors, and there was no shortage of Great Emperor-level battle prowess among them.","This kind of lineup could no longer be described as luxurious. It was practically extravagant.","As they journeyed, they naturally passed by the Dragon Head City and the like.","However, there was no sign of the Divine Beast Great Emperors.","Were they all hiding somewhere, or had they not been revived?","Ling Han was unconcerned. His cultivation level was already close to the peak stage of the fourth tier. The Divine Beast Great Emperor might not be like an ant in front of him, but they really could not be considered a match for him.","They continued to advance, and there was no need for them to hide their tracks at all. They travelled openly and aboveboard.","With Ling Han’s current strength, even if he encountered certain storms of heaven and earth, he would still be able to face them head-on, fully demonstrating what it meant to be heaven-defyingly strong.","Eleven years later, they arrived at the sea of death.","The moment he arrived, Ling Han felt a sliver of enlightenment.","He had grasped the Regulations of Death, and the Sea of Death corresponded to the essence of death, so it naturally resonated with him, making him feel quite rueful.","Of course, it was impossible to comprehend the essence of Death here. Otherwise, why would the old Divine Beast abandon what was near only to seek an option that was further?","At this moment, Ling Han no longer acted arrogantly. Instead, he drew everyone into his body. Those who should wear armor would wear armor. Only Ding Shu, Jing Haoran, and Shui Qingchang were an exception, because they already had Emperor Tier battle prowess.","Ling Han headed to the Imperial Island.","After advancing into the fourth tier, his speed became slightly faster, but faced with the Sea of Death, Ling Han still did not dare to relax in the slightest.","Even if he had grasped the essence of life, the Sea of Death was capable of extinguishing this kind of vitality. If he sustained a few more blows, he would still die.","Thus, after spending seven years, he finally arrived at the Imperial Island.","After reaching the island, Ling Han let everyone out. All of a sudden, there was a sea of people.","Everyone was very curious. This was the Imperial Island, which could be considered the core of the universe.","Ling Han led them to the Cave of Life. For a Pseudo-Emperor to break through to become a Great Emperor, this was the best place. It was full of vitality, and no matter how serious one’s injuries, they could still be healed in this space.","\"Brother Monkey, you have to be mentally prepared,\" Ling Han said.","Brother Monkey was speechless. Wasn’t it just that his ancestor was often injured? Why did he sound like the latter was going to die soon?","They entered into the cave, and when they reached the end, sure enough, there was a person presently bathing in the Pool of Life.","\"Yi, Buddha Doga!\" Ling Han was startled. He had not thought that what he was seeing this time was not the Battle Saint Emperor, but rather Buddha Doga.","\"You’re here!\" Buddha Doga nodded, his face filled with shock. That was because those people by Ling Han’s side were actually all Pseudo-Emperors.","F***, when did Pseudo-Emperors become so cheap?","However, he was also filled with joy. These were all fresh troops. As long as they broke through to Emperor Tier, they would definitely be a powerful force of power.","Of course, it was too difficult to advance from Pseudo-Emperor to Great Emperor. Even if there were endless opportunities here, only half the people here, at most, or even fewer in fact, that would be able to break through to Great Emperor.","He would definitely not speak up to rebuke them, but rather give them a word of encouragement.","\"Doga, are you done yet? It’s my turn now!\" The Battle Saint Emperor’s voice rang out. This old Saint Emperor slowly walked out of a cave, his body covered with injuries.","As expected, he had overestimated this person!","Ling Han sighed. At first, he had thought that the Battle Saint Emperor hadn’t been injured this time, but in the end, he had merely not been immersed in the Pool of Life.","\"This pool is big enough to accommodate two people,\" Buddha Doga said expressionlessly.","\"Pei, I don’t like the look of you, so I’m not going with you.\" The Battle Saint Emperor refused decisively.","\"Ancestor!\" Brother Monkey called out excitedly.","\"Huh? So you’re my great-grandson?\" The Battle Saint Emperor looked at Brother Monkey with surprise and delight.","Brother Monkey was once again struck speechless. Was there anyone that spoke of their descendant like this?","But in terms of seniority, wasn’t he the other party’s grandson?","\"I... am.\" Brother Monkey nodded, his face ashen.","Pu, on the sidelines, the large black dog and little azure dragon couldn’t help but splutter with laughter.","It was really too rare to see Brother Monkey like this.","\"Don’t hold it in anymore. If you want to laugh, just laugh,\" Brother Monkey said to Ling Han. There was a kind of peace that came from the grief of one’s heart dying.","Pu!","Ling Han laughed loudly. He had really had a hard time holding back just now.","\"Little guys, don’t waste time. Hurry up and cultivate, and strive to break through to Emperor Tier as soon as possible.\" The Battle Saint Emperor walked to the side of the pool, and pulled out Buddha Doga, \"Your time is up. It’s time for my turn.\"","Buddha Doga was rendered speechless. In front of the Battle Saint Emperor, he was a junior.","It was really rare to see a Great Emperor with such a personality, with the feeling of distance being dismissed in an instant.","\"Everyone, make the most of your time.\" Ling Han nodded as well. The old Divine Beast was unstoppable, and who knew when it would be able to open the Cave of Death and witness the element of Death. Thus, if more Great Emperors appeared, they would be able to make even greater contributions to impeding the old Divine Beast.","Becoming Emperor was a huge temptation to everyone, so they all went into seclusion.","Ling Han was also cultivating by the side of the Pool of Life. He was about to reach peak stage of the fourth tier, but he was still a little bit away from grasping the essence of life, and had not reached consummate level of grasping the element of Life.","A dozen over days later, the Battle Saint Emperor and Buddha Doga both recovered from their injuries.","\"Come, let’s battle that old Divine Beast again.\" The Battle Saint Emperor carried the Imperial Weapon on his shoulders, and light shot out from his Fiery Golden Eyes.","\"All right!\" Ling Han said heroically.","Previously, he had been severely injured with a single strike from the old Divine Beast, and this had become motivation for him to advance further, and he also wanted to know how far he was now from the old Divine Beast.","\"Oh, that’s right. Those so-called Lords of Death are also here,\" the Battle Saint Emperor added.","’Hmm?’","Though Ling Han had long since expected this, he was still slightly shocked upon hearing this.","Buddha Doga continued, \"The moment they arrived, they became the target of scorn, and were targeted by us. However, that old Divine Beast moved, and saved those Great Emperors. Now, they have also been nurtured by the essence of life, and obtained a new life. A few of them have already grasped the essence of life.\"","The old Divine Beast made a move. Though it was a little unexpected, it was within reason.","The enemy of an enemy was a friend.","And those ancient Great Emperors had really lived up to their reputation. Quite a number of them had already broken through, and advanced into the fourth tier.","The ancient Great Emperors were all the strongest of their generation, so they really couldn’t be underestimated.","As long as they were given a sliver of hope, they would be able to create endless possibilities.","Ling Han’s battle prowess could be so strong, far surpassing his peers, because he had grasped some of the might of the four elements ahead of time, but if both of them had grasped the four elements, who would be weaker than the other?","His uniqueness lay in the fact that he had cultivated every cultivation level to the limit. This was an advantage that would not disappear. In a battle of equal cultivation levels, this would greatly increase his score.","\"Then this time, let them rest in complete peace!\" Ling Han clenched his fists.","The three of them walked side by side, and soon arrived at the battlefield.","Ling Han gazed into the distance, and sure enough, he saw the figures of the Lords of Death."]},{"number":4868,"title":"Chapter 4868: Dilemma","paragraphs":["Calculating the time, it had been tens of thousands of years since the Lords of Death had entered the Primitive Abyss. With the talent of a Great Emperor, coupled with the vitality of this place, they naturally became human again.","There were a total of seven Great Emperors that had appeared on the battlefield at this moment, and they had all advanced further, advancing into the fourth tier.","After advancing to the fourth tier, it was as if these Great Emperors had been reborn. Their battle prowess was not much weaker than veteran Great Emperors like the Battle Saint Emperor.","Thus, with these seven Great Emperors holding the main force back, the old Divine Beast would be able to spare even more energy to break through the Cave of Death.","\"So far, why has only the old Divine Beast grasped three elements, while the other Great Emperors only have one element?\" Ling Han asked curiously.","Theoretically speaking, the Battle Saint Emperor and the others had already been here for hundreds of billions of years, so they should have long since grasped all three of the fundamental elements.","The Battle Saint Emperor shook his head, and said, \"The four elements are one and the same, and they repel each other. It’s impossible to grasp two or more at the same time.\"","\"But how could the old Divine Beast do that?\" Ling Han asked.","\"This is also what I want to know,\" the Battle Saint Emperor said. \"Later, when we found out about you, we asked around, and thought that this was also the key to the old Divine Beast being able to create the 36 Divine Beasts.\"","The old Divine Beast was so capable, that it could suppress all the Great Emperors?","Those who could become Emperor were the most outstanding existences. Whether it was willpower, toughness, or comprehension ability, all of them were top-notch. Only one could appear in a single era.","And now, there was an old Divine Beast that had completely crushed all the other Great Emperors, leaving them in the dust.","Ling Han found this inconceivable.","What secrets were the old Divine Beast hiding?","In the past, this old Divine Beast had even barged into the Divine Beast Graveyard. After that, the corpses of the Divine Beasts had disappeared, so why did he want those corpses?","This was something that only the old Divine Beast knew, and he obviously could not possibly tell this to a wide audience.","\"Don’t worry about this. Let’s fight first,\" the Battle Saint Emperor roared, and was the first to charge into the battle.","Buddha Doga laughed loudly, and also charged over.","Ling Han’s fighting spirit was ignited. With a battle cry, he charged towards the Blood Demon Ancestor.","\"It’s you!\" When the Blood Demon Ancestor saw Ling Han, her killing intent immediately blazed.","Ling Han smiled calmly, and said, \"Now you all know that I have not deceived you. On the contrary, the one who has deceived you is that old Divine Beast!\"","The Blood Demon Ancestor did not speak. After coming to the Imperial Island, they naturally knew that they had been deceived for a long time.","However, now that things had come to this, there was no way back for them. They could only follow the old Divine Beast all the way to the end.","According to the words of the old Divine Beast, after opening the Cave of Death, the four elements would cause a great collision, and it would be easy to grasp them again.","Thus, when the time came, the Great Emperors would be able to grasp all four of the key elements, and even manifest the key elements.","What did this signify?","Every Great Emperor could transform into a universe that could accommodate all things in the world, and become a true ruler, indestructible for all eternity.","\"Ling Han, now that we have dealt with the hidden danger, and grasped the essence of life, let us battle again, and see if I will kill you!\" The Blood Demon Ancestor ignored his words, and directly charged over.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","She was now in the fourth tier, and even if she hadn’t grasped the essence of life to the extreme, her battle prowess was much stronger than before.","More importantly, she no longer had any worries, and could attack to her heart’s content.","Ling Han merely smiled. In truth, he had advanced into fourth tier earlier than the other. Furthermore, he had grasped another nine-star Regulation, so his comprehension of the element of life was even deeper.","Moreover, Ling Han had cultivated to the pinnacle level of every major tier before, so what Great Emperor could compare to him?","Who was afraid of whom?","Ling Han shot out a punch. Peng, the Blood Demon Ancestor couldn’t block it at all, and her whole body was sent flying backwards.","Right now, he already possessed the strength to crush those at the early stage of the fourth tier.","\"Ling Han!\" More Lords of Death flew over, launching attacks at him.","\"Defeated opponents!\" Ling Han said calmly. He swung his fists repeatedly. Peng, peng, peng! Even if the seven Lords of Death joined forces, so what? They could only be sent flying everywhere by his attacks.","However, this place was filled with vitality, and these Great Emperors had also grasped the foundations of this universe. They only had to extract a bit of it to heal themselves, and they would naturally recover immediately.","—Otherwise, the Battle Saint Emperor and the others would have long since been eliminated by the old Divine Beast.","There were only two ways to completely kill these Great Emperors that had grasped the essence of life.","Firstly, he had to cultivate the essence of death.","The second option was for them to leave this island.","At present, the Great Emperors could only use the essence of life, and once they left this island, without a large amount of essence of life, they would not be able to revive themselves either.","Thus, Ling Han faced the attacks of the seven Lords of Death. Though he had an advantage in terms of battle prowess, he was still unable to eliminate them.","Previously, it was the old Divine Beast’s battle prowess that was overwhelming, and the Great Emperors could only drag things out. Now, it was the other way round. Wanting to destroy the Lords of Death?","It would be difficult!","After Ling Han battled for several days, he withdrew from the battle.","A battle like this was too meaningless. Furthermore, even if he killed all the Lords of Death, so what? Would he be able to stop the old Divine Beast?","Only by grasping more key elements could he truly stand against the old Divine Beast.","Ling Han was definitely not the only one who had thought of this. However, just as the Battle Saint Emperor had said, the four fundamentals were the foundations that formed heaven and earth. No Great Emperor could cultivate two or more.","Aside from the old Divine Beast.","With Ling Han’s personality, he naturally had to give it a try.","He was still in the Cave of Life, and first raised his grasp of the essence of life to the extreme.","This took him 700,000 years, and he finally reached the consummate level of the fourth tier.","At this time, Ding Shu and the other Genesis World Masters successfully broke through to Emperor Tier.","Very good, they finally had strong reinforcements on their side.","It could be imagined that even more Great Emperors would appear in the future, joining the team that was fighting against the old Divine Beast.","Ling Han left the Cave of Life. This time, he went to the Cave of Destruction.","He had grasped Destructive Energy, so the second type of foundation stone of heaven and earth that he wanted to grasp was naturally the element of destruction.","Sitting down on his knees, Ling Han began to appreciate the element of destruction.","However, there was already one Element of Life in his body, and this was filled with repulsion towards the other three Elements. Thus, Ling Han had just come into contact with the Element of Destruction, when he was barraged by the Element of Life, and was completely unable to comprehend.","The essence of destruction was no weaker than the essence of life, but now, the power of the essence of life was endless, while the essence of destruction had to start from zero, so how could it resist the essence of life?","Thus, the Battle Saint Emperor said that any Great Emperor would only be able to grasp one key element, and could not cultivate two or more at the same time.","After hundreds of millions of years, all the Great Emperors were only in the fourth tier, and this was clear proof.","Ling Han suddenly stopped, a deep frown on his face.","Could it be that it was really impossible?","Although the old Divine Beast’s progress was slow, there would eventually come a day when he would open the Cave of Death and grasp the key element of death, achieving his goal.","Thus, even if the empress and the others had all become Emperors, that would only push back the day that this day would come slightly. It was still impossible to stop it entirely.","Ling Han was definitely unwilling to wait for death.","He possessed Destructive Energy, soâ¦ he should have a chance!"]},{"number":4869,"title":"Chapter 4869: Clash of Elements","paragraphs":["Ling Han went into seclusion as per usual.","He was comprehending the element of destruction, and would occasionally participate in battle to become more proficient in his comprehension.","All the Great Emperors saw this, but did not say anything.","Which of them hadn’t been brimming with confidence when they had come here? Hadn’t they thought that they would be able to comprehend all three elements, and become an equal of the old Divine Beast?","However, aside from the mysterious existence of the old Divine Beast, no one else could grasp two or more elements of heaven and earth.","As time passed, even with their pride, they had to admit that this was indeed an impossible mission.","Ling Han had just arrived, so it was understandable that he was so arrogant. However, after a while, he would accept the truth.","Then, what right did they have to stop the old Divine Beast?","There were many people.","In the eyes of the Great Emperors, as long as there were enough fourth tier elites, even if they could not kill the old Divine Beast, they could still suppress him, and from there, resolve the crisis of the universe.","Of course, they also wanted to solve the root of the problem, but that was impossible.","Ling Han went into seclusion more and more times, and the time he spent in seclusion every time was also longer and longer.","Another two million years passed, and the empress, Brother Monkey, the large black dog, and the others all became Emperors.","They were very fortunate. When they had been in the level of Pseudo-Emperor, they had been able to see the practical essense of the evolution of the Nine Star Regulations. This was really too helpful for them to break through to the Great Emperor Tier in future.","This was also the greatest opportunity in history, because this would only happen once in millions and millions of years, from the expansion of heaven and earth to its collapse.","However, no one would have imagined that a freak like Ling Han would actually appear, and actually be able to help so many Saints advance into Pseudo-Emperor Tier.","Now, through the accumulation of millions of years, they had welcomed a powerful burst of power.","There were actually as many as over a dozen newly advanced Great Emperors!","However, there were still some people who had not managed to break through to Great Emperor Tier, and Ling Han had taken them into his body.","As long as they were inside his body, it was like they were living beneath a different set of Regulations of heaven and earth. As long as he had reached the level of Celestial King Tier in the Genesis World, he would be able to live forever.","Of course, Ling Han couldn’t possibly absorb everyone into his body. This would damage the Regulations of heaven and earth, and birth, old age, illness, and death were also the Dao of heaven and earth.","Ling Han didn’t interfere too much, but those he valued definitely wouldn’t die in front of him.","Now, the empress, Hu Niu, the large black dog, and the others had also joined the battle. They had become Emperors, so they had definitely grasped the fundamental element of life.","Why did they all start from the fundamental element of life?","Because without grasping the essence of life, even if they stayed on the Imperial Island, they would only be able to live a few times longer, and it was still inevitable that they would die.","Thus, there was no other option.","However, Ling Han was still in seclusion. This time, he went into a long period of seclusion that lasted as long as four million years.","He had been deducing the Destructive Energy all this while. This was a branch of the element of Destruction, so he could definitely trace it back to its source.","—He could not directly comprehend the element of Destruction, because the Elements would repel each other. However, he had already grasped the Destructive Energy, and it was impossible that the Element of Life could erase this.","Thus, this gave him a loophole to exploit.","However, the element of destruction was one of the cornerstones that formed heaven and earth. It was indescribably complicated, so how could it be easy to trace it back to its source?","Thankfully, he was in the Cave of Destruction. There was the most fundamental element of destruction here, so Ling Han could use it as reference.","It could only be used for reference, and could not be directly comprehended, so it was incredibly time-consuming.","But in the Imperial Island, the least valuable thing was time. Aside from the threat posed by the old Divine Beast, time was meaningless. The Great Emperors here did not age, and their environment would never change in any way.","Although the old Divine Beast was getting closer and closer to opening the Cave of Death, he had spent hundreds of billions of years in the outside world to reach this step. If he wanted to completely open it, he might still need tens of billions of years.","Thus, Ling Han’s extravagance of these million years was really nothing.","His contribution was already enough.","—To provide so many newly advanced Great Emperors for the Imperial Island, who could compare?","Four million years passed, and a smile appeared on Ling Han’s face. He had finally reaped some rewards.","Deducing Destructive Energy in reverse and pursuit of the element; success was close at hand.","But even so, another eight million years quietly passed, and only then did Ling Han make substantial progress.","He stretched out a hand. Boom, Destructive Energy pulsated in his palm, but an instant later, Destructive Energy disappeared. It was clearly invisible, yet gave off an even more dangerous feeling.","Destructive Energy... had become the element of destruction!","Boom!","A terrifying conflict instantly formed in Ling Han’s body. That was the clash of the elements of life and destruction.","Though the four elements were the cornerstones that formed the heaven and earth, it was also precisely because they were cornerstones, pure to the extreme, that there was absolutely no possibility of merging them.","Now, these two elements were coexisting in Ling Han’s body. They both wanted to destroy each other and monopolize Ling Han’s body.","When the two Elements battled, that was a collision that was superior to all else, surpassing the level of energy and Regulations, but rather the conflict of the most fundamental force.","Ling Han felt like he was about to explode.","He had misjudged the incompatibility between the two elements. Even as a Great Emperor, he would still be tortured to death.","No, definitely not!","Ling Han’s eyes suddenly snapped open. One eye was exuberantly green, while the other was indescribably dark. It was as if with a single glance from him, any existence would be destroyed, and would no longer exist in this world.","\"Suppress!\" he shouted loudly.","However, it could not be suppressed.","The four fundamental factors were the foundation stones of heaven and earth, and were transcendent above all else. How could they be suppressed?","Since that was the case... Ling Han gritted his teeth. Then, he would transform into the embodiment of heaven and earth.","He would become the bearer of heaven and earth, and the four elements could coexist to serve him.","It was impossible for other Great Emperors to do so. Great Emperors could become self-contained, and becoming heaven and earth was a completely different matter.","However, Ling Han had already possessed the Genesis World since a very long time ago. This was a representation of heaven and earth.","He began to expand his heaven and earth, and the motivation was the two elements of life and destruction.","At present, he was still lacking a bit, but as long as Ling Han could further obtain the two elements of creation and death, his heaven and earth would become complete.","\"Ah—\" Ling Han released a roar. The process of transforming himself into heaven and earth was really too painful. Furthermore, the element of destruction was surging violently, wanting to erase him by force.","Thankfully, the essence of life had boosted his exuberant vitality, allowing him to grow endlessly.","If he had known this earlier, he would have gone to comprehend the fundamental element of creation first.","These were just empty words. In terms of the element of Creation, Ling Han couldn’t directly comprehend it, nor could he reverse-deduce it. It was impossible for him to get started.","If this were the outside world, Ling Han wouldn’t be able to construct his own heaven and earth, even if he reverse-deduced the element of destruction. After all, where would the elements of heaven and earth come from?","All the Great Emperors and the old Divine Beast could only use the main elements, but there were no main elements in their bodies.","Otherwise, they could completely walk out of the Imperial Island. As long as there was the element of Life in their bodies, they could grow endlessly, and there was no need for them to be imprisoned here.","It was only here that the four fundamental elements could be reached. He would not be afraid even of death, as the fundamenta element of life could easily revive him.","A feeling of appreciation rose up in Ling Han. If he could really construct a new heaven and earth, then the four elements would be endless. Even if his lifespan dried up, he would still be able to walk out of the Imperial Island.","That was because he had become a new heaven and earth, and possessed his own Regulations."]},{"number":4870,"title":"Chapter 4870: Third Tier!","paragraphs":["However, now was not the time to think about this.","Ling Han was still constructing his own heaven and earth. There were only two elements, and he could only construct a framework, but could not create anything.","That was because he had not grasped the fundamental element of creation.","Without the ability of creation, his heaven and earth was naturally empty. There was not even life.","—Life could not be bestowed out of thin air. It had to have a physical body first.","Thus, if he wanted to create something, he still had to grasp the key element of creation.","He constructed his own heaven and earth with great difficulty. This was not difficult, and the Genesis World was the best reference.","It was too painful. The element of destruction and the element of life clashed, wanting to tear his body apart at any moment. If it was not for the fact that Ling Han had long since toughened his willpower along the way, it was believed that he would have long since given up.","Even death would not be so unbearable.","But in this kind of agony, Ling Han managed to hold on for a whole million years.","Finally, his construction of heaven and earth was complete.","Instantly, the pain was gone.","The two elements of life and destruction obediently entrenched themselves in his body, and were even slowly accumulating.","This was too shocking.","It should be known that even a fourth tier Great Emperor could only use key elements, and could not accumulate any key elements.","But what about Ling Han?","His hypothesis was not wrong. After constructing the heaven and earth, he would be able to evolve into a new heaven and earth.","However, this heaven and earth was riddled with holes now, because it lacked the two elements of death and creation. It was not complete.","If Ling Han left the Imperial Island, then because the heaven and earth was incomplete, whether it was the element of life or the element of destruction, they would be rapidly lost, and he had lived for more than ten million years, so his lifespan had already dried up. If he left the island, he would definitely die.","Ling Han stood up, a smile at the corners of his lips.","At this moment, he was filled with confidence.","Because it was only now that he truly knew his own path.","’Fine, I’ll go and kill first!’","Xiu, Ling Han’s figure moved, and rushed towards the battlefield.","The battle here was still the same as before. All the Great Emperors were ganging up on the old Divine Beast, delaying its progress in digging out the Cave of Death, while the Lords of Death were helping the old Divine Beast. The battle between the two sides was incredibly intense, but it was all pointless effort.","No one would die here. No matter how serious their injuries were, they would be able to recover very quickly.","The Great Emperor Senluo was the first to stop, and he said coldly, \"Ling Han!\"","At this time, the Lords of Death appeared.","As expected of a Great Emperor. As long as they were given a sliver of hope, they would be able to create endless possibilities.","See, after more than ten million years, they had already advanced into the fourth tier.","Ling Han smiled calmly, \"A defeated opponent, are you here to seek your own humiliation again?\"","The Great Emperor Senluo was enraged. \"Brat, it was only that I couldn’t unleash my full abilities just then. Killing you now will be as easy as the turn of a palm!\"","The other eleven Lords of Death also stopped, surrounding Ling Han.","If there was anyone they hated the most, it would definitely be Ling Han, who had ruined the plan that they had planned for countless years.","Of course, this plan was only paving the way for another.","However, it could not be denied that Ling Han was definitely the person that the Lords of Death wanted to kill the most.","Ling Han crooked a finger at them, \"Come, this time, I will send you on your way!\"","\"Arrogant!\" The Great Emperor Senluo charged over. Right now, his battle prowess was already at the fourth tier, and he had more so reached the peak stage of the fourth tier. Just how terrifying was this battle prowess?","Boom!","He wielded supreme power and charged over, indescribably terrifying.","Fortunately, this was the Primitive Abyss. If this was not, he could even destroy a Heavenly Realm with such a strike.","Ling Han greeted him with a smile, battling intensely with the Great Emperor Senluo.","What cultivation level was he at now?","Third tier!","In a battle of third tier against fourth tier, it was naturally an all-round suppression. However, it was not as ridiculous as a battle of second tier against fourth tier, where it would be completely one-sided.","Even so, Great Emperor Senluo immediately fell into a disadvantage.","No matter how strong he was, so what? There was a gap of a level between them, and there was absolutely no way to turn the tables.","Ling Han launched a series of powerful punches, forcing the Great Emperor Senluo to continuously retreat.","This!","The Lords of Death were all speechless. They had already cultivated to the fourth tier, and had also reached the peak stage of this cultivation level. If it was not for the fact that the Great Emperor could only grasp one key element, they may already be in the third tier, or second tier.","In other words, they were once again standing at the peak of cultivation.","That was indeed the truth. They were battling with the other Great Emperors, and were not at a disadvantage at all!","For those that could become Emperor, who would be weaker than the other?","However, in front of Ling Han, why was the Great Emperor Senluo completely suppressed?","Though he did not have the incomparable battle prowess of the old Divine Beast, Ling Han was already inconceivably strong!","At this moment, not only the Lords of Death, but even the old Divine Beast and the other Great Emperors looked over in surprise.","Aside from the old Divine Beast, there was another being that could suppress fourth-tier battle prowess?","\"F***, could it be that this brat has really succeeded?\" The Battle Saint Emperor murmured. He naturally knew that Ling Han had been comprehending the essence of destruction all these years.","In his eyes, this was an impossible task. That was because he had already attempted it millions and millions of years ago, and it had also been confirmed by the other Great Emperors. It was impossible for him to succeed.","However, if that was not the case, how could Ling Han be so powerful?","The old Divine Beast also stared at Ling Han, showing a rare hint of seriousness.","Before this, no matter how much the Great Emperors struggled, he was completely unconcerned.","That was because he could not be stopped. Only he could achieve the impossible, and grasp two, or even three, fundamental elements of heaven and earth at the same time.","However, that young man also seemed to have succeeded.","This caused him to feel a strong sense of danger.","This was an emotion that he had never experienced before, and even he was stunned for a moment.","As the only second tier Great Emperor in the world, he actually felt a sense of danger?","What a big joke!","Boom!","On the other side, Ling Han and the Great Emperor Senluo were still engaged in an intense battle. Strictly speaking, however, this was a one-sided battle. Before Ling Han, the Great Emperor Senluo was almost unable to fight back. He could only take a beating.","If this were the outside world, even if the vitality of a Great Emperor was tenacious, they still wouldn’t be able to withstand such a mad barrage of attacks.","But this place was different.","The element of Life overflowed, and minor injuries would immediately heal, and even if there were severe injuries, they could be set aside. At worst, it would only take a little time, and would not take too many days to heal.","In fact, it didn’t matter even if he died. He could completely revive.","In this place, everyone had an undying body.","Thus, the Great Emperor Senluo was completely fearless. He wasn’t afraid of death, so what did he have to be afraid of?","In such a head-on clash, the outcome of the battle was naturally very easily decided.","It was only a few hundred moves, and Ling Han had already pressed the Great Emperor Senluo onto the ground.","\"Haha, you can’t kill me!\" the Great Emperor Senluo said with a cold chuckle.","\"When has the ambition of a Great Emperor become so low? Does not being killed count as a victory?\" Ling Han shook his head, his face filled with disdain, but his expression immediately darkened, \"However, who said that I could not kill you?\"","He grabbed the Great Emperor Senluo and directly sent him inside his own body.","—Inside the heaven and earth that he had constructed.","Yi?","The Lords of Death were all astonished. Where was the Great Emperor Senluo?","Why had he suddenly disappeared?","It should be known that even if there was a Spatial Tool that could store living things, it would still be unable to store a Great Emperor.","This was because a Great Emperor was far too powerful, so much so that he couldn’t be contained at all."]},{"number":4871,"title":"Chapter 4871: Slaughtering Emperor","paragraphs":["However, right in front of everyone’s eyes, the Great Emperor Senluo had disappeared.","How was this possible?","For some reason, the Lords of Death all felt a chill.","\"Where’s Senluo!\" the Sea Emperor shouted at Ling Han.","Ling Han made a silencing motion, and said, \"Don’t be noisy. I am currently killing him.\"","W-what!","The Lords of Death didn’t dare to believe this. What right do you have to kill a fourth tier Great Emperor?","As long as they were on this Imperial Island, they were immortal.","\"Shameless boasting!\"","\"Humph, you want to use this to threaten us?\"","\"Die!\"","The Golden Crow Emperor and the other Lords of Death immediately charged over. They believed that Ling Han had used a special method to temporarily imprison the Great Emperor Senluo. Thus, as long as they exerted enough pressure, Ling Han would definitely no longer be able to imprison the Great Emperor Senluo and would be forced to release him.","Eleven fourth tier Great Emperors charged over, their might truly incredibly terrifying.","Yet Ling Han merely parried carelessly, as if he was slightly distracted.","In truth, that was the case.","Ling Han placed his attention on the heaven and earth inside his body.","The Great Emperor Senluo had been taken in by him, and his soul also took human form, standing in front of the Great Emperor Senluo.","\"Where is this?\" The Great Emperor Senluo frowned. This feeling of unknownness caused him to feel a sliver of panic.","Ling Han smiled faintly, \"Welcome to my world.\"","\"Your world?\" the Great Emperor Senluo murmured. His frown became even deeper.","In this place, he could no longer sense the essence of life.","Since he could not sense it, he naturally could not use it.","There were only two ways to kill a fourth tier Great Emperor. The first was to grasp the essence of death, but now, even the old Divine Beast was unable to do so, so this option was naturally eliminated.","There was one more, and that was to leave the Imperial Island.","But in truth, including Ling Han, these people had already stayed on the Imperial Island for more than ten million years. This was the theoretically maximum lifespan of a Great Emperor. Thus, as long as he left the Imperial Island, even Ling Han would die from having exhausted his full lifespan.","Of course, because he had been nurtured by the essence of life, Ling Han’s lifespan should have exceeded ten million years, but in this place, time was too cheap. Ling Han would soon reach the true limit of his lifespan.","Thus, even if Ling Han dragged him out of the Imperial Island, the greatest possibility was that the two of them would die together.","He was sure that Ling Han definitely wouldn’t do something so stupid.","But why couldn’t he sense the essence of life?","Was this really the inside of his body?","But how was this possible?","Ling Han smiled and said, \"I’m in charge of my own world, so if I want you to die, you can only die!\"","\"Haha, in your dreams!\" the Great Emperor Senluo sneered. Even if he was unsure, how could he possibly show fear in front of Ling Han?","Ling Han ignored him. With a wave of his hand, the element of Destruction instantly transformed into arrows that shot towards the Great Emperor Senluo.","This was his world, and just like he had said, he was in charge of his world!","There was no way to dodge these arrows at all, because they were shooting out from every angle.","The Great Emperor Senluo could only parry. However, even contact with the element of destruction would cause serious injury.","\"Wu!\" He continuously released muffled groans, and then shockingly discovered that multiple wounds had appeared on his arms, thighs, and body. There was absolutely no signs of healing.","Without the essence of life, how could it heal?","Furthermore, in front of the element of Destruction, if it was not the element of Life that was its equal, how could merely depending on the recovery ability of the body have any effects?","In just a short while, the Great Emperor Senluo’s body was riddled with wounds. He was in an indescribably miserable state.","However, the Great Emperor Senluo felt even more flustered.","Without any element of Life, if he continued to be injured like this, he would really be killed.","\"How is this possible!\" He paled in shock, \"Just what kind of ability have you grasped!\"","\"The ability to kill you,\" Ling Han said calmly. \"The ability to pacify the world.\"","The Great Emperor Senluo was furious. His voice was far too calm, and it was as if he weren’t a Great Emperor at all. It was as if he were just a nobody.","\"As a Great Emperor, you should be overseeing the world and pacifying the darkness,\" Ling Han continued. \"However, you people have transformed into darkness and caused chaos in the world. Do you still have the right to be called a Great Emperor?\"","\"A mere junior dares to order us around?\" the Great Emperor Senluo roared in fury. Even if he was no match, he couldn’t lose his pride as a Great Emperor, to lower his head and beg Ling Han for mercy.","\"I don’t have that interest. I’ll just kill you,\" Ling Han said. He didn’t hold back. With a thought, the element of destruction transformed into a long sword that slashed at the Great Emperor Senluo.","With the Great Emperor Senluo’s current strength, he was already unable to block this kind of attack.","Pu! He was instantly sliced into two.","However, the Great Emperor’s vitality was incredibly tenacious, and the Great Emperor Senluo had also grasped the fundamental element of life after all. He forcefully fused the two halves of his body back together, forcefully stabilizing his injuries.","\"You can block one, but can you block two?\" Ling Han asked calmly. Multiple divine swords appeared continuously, slashing towards the Great Emperor Senluo.","This was his world, and his power was unlimited.","The Great Emperor Senluo was continuously sliced into two halves. Although he continued to reassemble his body, he couldn’t hold on for much longer. Blood continued to gush from his adhering body, and so did blood from his mouth.","He was not far from death.","The Great Emperor Senluo was filled with disbelief. After coming to the Imperial Island and grasping the fundamental element of life, he should have been an indestructible existence.","But now, he felt that he was really not far from death.","How was this possible?","He had lived for a very long time, and had even transformed into a Yin soul in fact. It could be said that he had lived through the experience of life and death, yet he had still walked with his head held high, and become a fourth tier Great Emperor.","But now, he was actually going to die in such a humiliating manner?","He was unwilling to accept this, absolutely unwilling to accept this.","But no matter how unwilling he was, so what?","Ling Han slashed down with divine swords, one after another. His injuries became more and more severe, and the life force was also severely injured, with no possibility of recovery.","Unless, of course, he could immediately return to the Imperial Island, and use the essence of Life to temper himself, so that he could come back to life.","However, would Ling Han give him a chance?","\"Brat! Brat! Brat!\" the Great Emperor Senluo roared in fury. However, he couldn’t change his fate.","Shua! The divine sword slashed down again, slicing the Great Emperor Senluo into two from top to bottom.","This time, the Great Emperor Senluo was unable to recover his body. The two halves of his body floated in Ling Han’s empty world.","He was dead.","There was no shower of blood, nor was there any grief from heaven and earth. It was completely peaceful, and there was not the slightest ripple.","Because this was Ling Han’s world, whatever rules were up to him to decide.","Weng, his mind returned, and his initially wooden movements immediately became agile. Peng, peng, peng! He threw a punch, and sent the eleven Lords of Death flying.","\"Where’s Senluo?\" the Lords of Death all shouted.","\"He’s dead,\" Ling Han said calmly.","He was dead?","Everyone was in disbelief. He was on Imperial Island, so how could he possibly die?","\"Bullsh*t!\" the Lords of Death shouted. Even the Battle Saint Emperor and the others didn’t believe this.","They wouldn’t die here. Otherwise, what basis did they have to waste so much time with the old Divine Beast?","Ling Han cracked a smile. Xiu! The Great Emperor Senluo’s two halves were tossed out.","Stowing this into his body was too disgusting.","Moreover, this was a fourth tier Great Emperor, and it would take a considerable amount of time to completely annihilate it with the element of destruction. Thus, it would be better to directly throw it out.","Heavens!"]},{"number":4872,"title":"Chapter 4872: Heaven Devouring Beast","paragraphs":["In this instant, the Lords of Death felt goosebumps all over their bodies, and an indescribable emotion rose up in them.","This was called fear, an emotion that had not arisen in them for a very, very long time.","The Great Emperor was invincible in this world, so who would he be afraid of?","However, they were really feeling fear now.","Ling Han... possessed the ability to kill a fourth tier Great Emperor.","The spiritual mark of the Great Emperor Senluo had completely disappeared. Although the corpse was still there, it could no longer be revived.","Hiss, Ling Han actually had the ability to erase the soul mark!","How was this different from the heaven and earth?","Why was it that the Great Emperor could not reincarnate in the outside world? That was because the Heavenly Dao was too strong. Once the Great Emperor died, his spiritual mark would directly fuse with the Heavenly Dao, so how could he reincarnate?","Unless he could obtain the Great Herb in the Primitive Abyss. Only in that manner, would he be able to live a second life.","However, on the Imperial Island, the Heavenly Dao did not exist, and there was also the element of Life. Thus, Great Emperors did not fear even death, as they could immediately come back to life. Even a second tier Great Emperor like the old Divine Beast could not kill a Great Emperor completely.","However, Ling Han had created a miracle.","How could this be! How could this be!","At this moment, even the battle between the Great Emperors and the old Divine Beast also came to a halt. Faced with such a miracle, their minds were all stunned. In fact, a feeling of fear even rose up in their hearts.","This was an existence that possessed the ability to completely kill a Great Emperor.","He was so awesome even without obtaining the key element of death?","\"It was a mistake not to try my best to kill you.\" The old Divine Beast strode over. He presently looked like an elegant middle-aged man, but there were multiple seals on his exposed skin, as if they had been branded onto his skin.","Looking closely, they were clearly Divine Beasts, the True Phoenix, the True Dragon, the Black Tortoise and so on.","Ling Han smiled calmly, \"Are you praising me?\"","\"You are indeed very freakish.\" The old Divine Beast nodded, \"These people have battled with me for hundreds of billions of years, yet were still unable to stop me, and I do not take them seriously either. However, you have only been here for such a short while, and I have already seen you in a new light. In fact, I have even become vigilant.\"","\"Thank you.\" Ling Han nodded, \"However, if you are willing to obediently accept your death, I will be even more grateful to you.\"","\"Hahaha!\" The old Divine Beast laughed loudly, \"Though you have grasped two elements of heaven and earth, in front of me, it is still not enough!\"","He was an existence that had grasped three key elements, and was peerless in the world.","Ling Han also smiled, \"Indeed, my present strength is inferior to yours, but you can’t kill me! And after some more time, I will be able to grasp the third key element, and be your equal. At that time, you will be trembling!\"","This was not an empty threat, but rather a very realistic threat.","Since Ling Han could grasp two key elements, it meant that he had broken through the restrictions of Great Emperors. Then, it was not impossible that he could grasp another key element.","\"So, I can’t allow you to live!\" The old Divine Beast’s eyes shone with ferocity.","\"Come!\" Ling Han crooked a finger at him. Unless he could build a new heaven and earth like he had, he would not die even if they fought on the Imperial Island and he was no match.","However, the actions of the old Divine Beast had exceeded everyone’s expectations.","He actually walked to the side of the Great Emperor Senluo’s corpse, and then stopped.","What, was he still reminiscing in memory of this fallen Great Emperor?","Crocodile’s tears?","However, what happened next stunned every single Great Emperor.","He suddenly opened his mouth, and his chin directly fell onto his feet. With a bite of his ferocious mouth, he had swallowed the two halves of the Great Emperor .","’Holy f*ck!’","Not only was Ling Han and the other Great Emperors stunned, even the Lord of Death and the others found this hard to accept.","’He’s already dead, yet he still wants to eat his corpse?’","Was there something f*cking wrong with you?","Ling Han also felt his blood run cold. A thought suddenly occurred to him, and he said, \"Those Divine Beast corpses that have disappeared... have all been eaten by you!\"","He finally knew why the Divine Beast’s corpse had mysteriously disappeared.","The old Divine Beast wasn’t going to steal it, but to eat it!","So, was it because of this that he had been able to create those Divine Beasts, the Great Emperor, and the others?","Previously, Ling Han had not been able to figure out how the old Divine Beast could create the Great Emperor’s corpse. Now, it seemed that this was definitely related to him eating the corpses of those Divine Beasts.","All the Great Emperors were also extremely shocked. The old Divine Beast had actually eaten the corpse of a Great Emperor. This practically caused their worldview to explode.","What kind of monster was this?","\"Gaga!\" The old Divine Beast’s head suddenly turned back into the form of a Divine Beast. He released a strange laugh, and said, \"I am the number one Divine Beast in the world, and my name is... Heaven Swallowing Beast!\"","No one spoke. Looks like the old Divine Beast was about to reveal some of its own secrets.","\"At the beginning, I was only an ordinary Divine Beast, but after devouring the corpses of the Divine Beasts and Divine Beasts, not only did my lifespan increase, I even obtained some of the abilities of those Divine Beasts and Divine Beasts,\" the old Divine Beast Divine Beast continued as expected.","Ling Han paused for a moment, then said, \"The thirty-six Divine Beasts from before weren’t independent beings at all. They were all your doppelgangers, right?\"","Otherwise, how could a newly created individual possibly possess the memories of his predecessor?","There was only one possibility, and that was that those were the continuation of the old Divine Beast!","\"You’re very smart!\" The old Divine Beast didn’t hide anything anymore. He had swallowed the Great Emperor Senluo’s corpse in public, so it was destined that some secrets couldn’t be hidden anymore. \"At first, I thought that I could lock the passageway and prevent outsiders from coming to this island again. I didn’t expect...\"","He had not thought that the appearance of a freak like Ling Han would cause such a massive impact on his plans. Not only had he failed to stop outsiders from arriving at the Imperial Island, even the arrangements of the Lords of Death had been ruined.","Ling Han smiled and said, \"So, your plan is destined to fail!\"","\"Wrong. Previously, I have never considered you as a rival, and that was my negligence, but now!\" The old Divine Beast turned back into a complete human form, \"Since I have my eye on you, don’t even think of creating any more waves.\"","\"Oh?\" Ling Han shook his head, \"Then I’ll wait and see.\"","Boom!","The old Divine Beast didn’t waste words, and directly charged over.","Ling Han charged forwards, and clashed with the old Divine Beast.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","This was a head-on clash between a second tier and a third tier Great Emperor, but the gap in strength was too wide. Ling Han immediately fell into a complete disadvantage.","He was like a straw, as the old Divine Beast’s attacks caused him to dance madly in the air.","However, he had already constructed his own heaven and earth, and there was the element of Life inside his body. Even if he was injured, the element of Life would immediately fill his body, allowing him to recover to a complete state.","This was a true undying body!","How was this possible?","The old Divine Beast found this hard to accept. How could Ling Han’s recovery ability be so terrifying?","Even for him, after sustaining so many heavy blows, he still had to stop the battle and absorb a large amount of element of Life to recover.","Why was Ling Han so freakish?","According to his plan, he would first severely injure Ling Han. Then, he would sacrifice some spiritual marks, and create the manifestation of a Divine Beast. He would drag Ling Han into the Sea of Death, and take him down with him.","This would greatly decrease his strength, but in order to get rid of a guy like Ling Han who would cause endless trouble in the future, this was completely worth it.","However, the progress of the matter was completely beyond his expectations."]},{"number":4873,"title":"Chapter 4873: Helpless against each other","paragraphs":["The old Divine Beast attacked repeatedly, using all kinds of powerful moves.","He was really very strong, and had grasped three fundamental elements, which was indescribably terrifying.","It should be known that Ling Han had only grasped the Destructive Energy, and at that time, it was already enough to make the Great Emperors wary, and the old Divine Beast had even grasped the essence of Destruction. The power of his strike was connected with the essence of Destruction.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","The element of destruction took the form of multiple black dragons, black phoenixes, and black tigers. They were all in the form of Divine Beasts. However, they were incredibly dark, and charged towards Ling Han.","Ling Han’s body trembled violently from the impact, and multiple black holes appeared on his body. These parts of his body directly disappeared.","However, in an instant, the element of Life in his body surged out, instantly mending these black holes.","This was a true undying body.","Though those like the Great Emperors had also grasped the essence of life, if they were injured, they would need to extract the essence of life from outside their bodies, and only then could they use it to heal their injuries. If that was not the case, if they were severely injured, they would not need to go to the Cave of Life, because the essence of life there was the densest.","Even for the old Divine Beast, he actually could only use three key elements, and was still unable to take in the key elements himself.","From this aspect, Ling Han was indeed walking at the forefront.","This kind of recovery ability caused even the old Divine Beast to feel fear.","If Ling Han was allowed to grasp the key element of creation, then this young man would be able to be his equal in terms of number of key elements, and in terms of grasp of key elements... he was obviously superior to him.","Thus, Ling Han definitely couldn’t be allowed to grasp the third key element!","The old Divine Beast roared repeatedly, and images of Divine Beasts appeared continuously from his body, boosting him with various mystical powers.","This was a godly technique that he had never used before.","This was because he didn’t need to unleash his full power against the other Great Emperors.","On the other hand, even if he went all out, so what?","In the end, they would still be revived.","Thus, he focused the majority of his energy on excavating the Cave of Death. As long as he could comprehend the essence of death, he would be able to instantly kill all the Great Emperors.","But now, he felt a tremendous pressure.","He could no longer allow Ling Han to continue growing. This brat’s freakishness was practically heaven-defying!","Ling Han was calm and unperturbed. He had long since walked out his own path. Han Fists shot out, each punch domineering.","He also unleashed the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower. This was a Transcendent Weapon, and after fusing with the Metal of Creation, it was equivalent to possessing a portion of the element of creation. Even the element of destruction couldn’t damage it.","The man and the tower worked together. Though they were still at a disadvantage, it was not that they could not put up a fight.","—It could not be helped. Ling Han’s recovery ability was too strong.","Fight, fight, fight!","The two Great Emperors that had surpassed the fourth tier unleashed their full strength. A frightening power surged out, causing the whole Imperial Island to rumble loudly.","\"Let’s go!\" All the Great Emperors exchanged looks. This was the first time in history that they had seen hope of defeating the old Divine Beast. At the very least, they could fight to a tie.","\"Don’t even think about it!\" the Lords of Death also shouted as they charged forward.","The Emperor Tier team battle began.","If an outsider came over, it was possible that they would be directly scared to death.","An Emperor Tier team battle, wasn’t this like a dream?","None of the Great Emperors would have any qualms about attacking. In this place, aside from the freakish Ling Han, the other Great Emperors were unable to kill another Great Emperor. Even the old Divine Beast was no exception. Thus, they could attack with ease.","Though this was intense, to the Great Emperors, this was only a microcosm of their millions and millions of years of battle experience. The only difference was that there were just a little more people participating.","For the first time, the old Divine Beast put aside its excavation of the Cave of Death, and focused its full effort on dealing with Ling Han, wanting to get rid of this calamity.","He hadn’t thought of a solution yet, but the first thing he had to do was to at least suppress Ling Han.","He would slowly consider how he was going to kill him.","Previously, he had not taken the Great Emperors to heart. In any case, there was a limit to how much they could impede him. It was just that the Cave of Death was too hard to dig out, so the Great Emperors mistakenly thought that their efforts were effective.","In truth, he had been digging here alone for hundreds of billions of years. It was really very boring.","However, Ling Han’s appearance caused him to feel a sense of danger.","For those like the other Great Emperors, as long as he was willing to pay some price, he could still kill them, but if it was Ling Han, he really felt that this was a problem.","It seemed like... he didn’t need time to communicate with the essence of life, nor did he need a channel, nor was there any limit to the amount. It could even be said that he was the embodiment of the essence of life!","How could such an existence be killed?","In truth, even if Ling Han was really thrown into the Sea of Death, with the element of Life accumulated in his body, he was completely capable of holding on for a while.","Thus, if the old Divine Beast dragged Ling Han into the sea, it was guaranteed that the one who would die would be the old Divine Beast and not Ling Han.","Ten years, a hundred years, a thousand years. On Imperial Island, the least valuable thing was time. This battle lasted as long as thirty thousand years, but the situation was no different from the beginning. Though the old Divine Beast was beating down on Ling Han, it was completely unable to severely injure Ling Han, what more kill him.","—If it could kill Ling Han, then the old Divine Beast would sacrifice a spiritual mark, and have it tangle with Ling Han’s spiritual mark. They would directly enter into the Sea of Death, and completely destroy this freakish being.","People were easy to kill, but the spiritual mark was hard to erase. This was the essence of the Great Emperor, and the key to his revival.","Now, it had become a stalemate.","The old Divine Beast was targeting Ling Han, so Ling Han had no time to comprehend the fundamental element of creation at all. Furthermore, he could no longer excavate the Cave of Death, and the situation had become a dead end.","In any case, time was worthless and meaningless, so they might as well fight.","In the blink of an eye, another seven million years had passed.","The Great Emperors had already been severely wounded and killed several times. However, the battle between Ling Han and the old Divine Beast continued.","This was a battle that no one could afford to lose.","If Ling Han died in battle, then he would definitely be completely killed at all costs by the old Divine Beast, and if the old Divine Beast allowed Ling Han to continue to grow stronger, there would eventually come a day when he too could possibly be killed by Ling Han.","However, after fighting for more than seven million years in one go, even the old Divine Beast was a little numb.","He was facing an opponent all this while, and there was no hope of killing him at all. This greatly affected his fighting spirit.","Finally, the old Divine Beast gave up, and with a furious roar, went back to mining.","Ling Han didn’t give chase, as this was completely meaningless.","Without becoming a second tier, there was no way he could deal with the old Divine Beast.","The other Great Emperors rushed over, wanting to delay the old Divine Beast. However, the old Divine Beast merely launched a single attack, and close to a hundred Divine Beasts appeared at the same time, instantly killing half of the Great Emperors. Those that did not die were also severely injured.","This!","Only now did the Emperors know just how strong the old Divine Beast was.","Previously, he was simply playing around with them, and had not used his full strength at all.","Ling Han moved, and protected all the dead and wounded Great Emperors, bringing them back into the Cave of Life.","They would recover with some nurturing. Those who were injured would recover, and those who were dead would come back to life.","Ling Han set his eyes on the Lords of Death.","The old Divine Beast couldn’t be killed, but for the Lords of Death... there was no problem!"]},{"number":4874,"title":"Chapter 4874: Eliminating the Lords of Death","paragraphs":["Right now, the old Divine Beast was completely focused on mining.","He had completely no intention of fighting any longer. He was just working hard on mining. With the channelling of the element of destruction, he was excavating the hard rock with great difficulty, his progress slow.","If he could be faster, he would have long since obtained all four elements, and no one would be able to stop him.","Since that was the case, Ling Han would not be reserved either.","Faced with Ling Han, the Lords of Death all felt uneasy.","This was a terrifying opponent, an existence that could kill them.","As Great Emperors, they had never feared anyone in their entire lives. However, in front of Ling Han, they were all filled with fear.","However, with the pride of Great Emperors, they could not reveal that at all.","Which one of them had not been invincible for an era?","Even if they had to die, they would die standing, and battle to the death.","\"Do you guys have any regrets?\" Ling Han asked.","\"If we did, would you let us go?\" Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperor said calmly.","\"Sorry, I won’t.\" Ling Han shook his head.","\"Even if we have regrets, we have long since destroyed them,\" the Void Emperor said.","Ling Han nodded. He had seen the memory image of the Blood Demon Ancestor in the Netherworld before, and she had wavered before, but she had forcefully severed it.","Emperors were merciless.","\"Since that’s the case, I’ll send you on your way!\" he said very calmly.","There was no mockery, nor was there any pride.","No matter what, those who could become Emperos were all worthy of respect, though these Emperors could no longer keep their integrity, and were lured by darkness.","\"Ling Han, though you are powerful, it would not be so easy for you to kill us!\" the Black Sunflower Demon Emperor declared proudly.","\"Bring it on!\" The Sea Emperor stood at the entrance of the Cave of Death. Boom, the Imperial Might was completely unleashed.","They had to defend this place, so that the old Divine Beast could fully concentrate on excavating, and release the key element of Death completely.","As long as they could hold on until then, the old Divine Beast would be able to show its might.","This was filled with unknowns, and it was not certain whether the old Divine Beast would turn hostile at that time. However, this was also the only choice they could make now.","Ling Han charged over and raised his fist to attack.","Boom!","He had battle prowess of the third tier, and because of the unique nature of his body, his battle prowess was much stronger than an ordinary third tier. Otherwise, even if he possessed the essence of life, he would not be able to clash so hard with the old Divine Beast.","With a single strike, the Sea Emperor was sent flying, crashing heavily into the cave wall behind him.","However, before Ling Han could follow up with another attack, the other Lords of Death had already surged forwards, stopping Ling Han’s pursuit.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","This was another group battle between Great Emperors. However, this time, it was an eleven-on-one battle.","Even so, Ling Han was still at an absolute advantage. In a battle of third tier against fourth tier, his advantage was indeed too great.","However, just like how the old Divine Beast was unable to kill the Great Emperors, Ling Han was also unable to defeat the Lords of Death, one after another.","Those who could become Great Emperors were all extraordinarily smart.","The 11 Great Emperors teamed up, helping each other and preventing Ling Han from killing them.","But this was only a stalemate for a month, because the other Great Emperors had either recovered from their injuries, or come back to life, and rejoined the battle.","This time was different.","With them holding them back from the sidelines, Ling Han would be able to focus on dealing with a Lord of Death.","The second person that he drew into his heaven and earth was the Three Purity Great Emperor.","The moment he entered, a look of realization appeared on the Three Purity Great Emperor’s face. \"So that’s how it is.\"","With how smart the Great Emperor was, he could immediately guess his current situation through the disappearance of the element of Life.","Without being able to use the essence of life, the moment one died, the spiritual mark would completely disappear.","The Three Purity Great Emperor smiled, and a carefree expression appeared on his face. Then, his fighting spirit blazed, and soared.","A Great Emperor naturally had the magnanimity of a Great Emperor. Even if he had fallen to become a Lord of Death, this was only a change in perspective, and would not affect his magnanimity.","\"If I die in battle, please throw my corpse into the Sea of Death,\" the Three Purity Great Emperor suddenly said.","Ling Han nodded, \"All right!\"","With the pride of Great Emperors, would they allow their corpses to be swallowed by a Divine Beast after their deaths?","Thus, he would rather bury himself in the Sea of Death.","In truth, even if he did not say, Ling Han had no plans to leave the Great Emperor’s corpse for the old Divine Beast.","Previously, he had not known that the old Divine Beast was actually capable of obtaining the corresponding Mystical Power of the Great Emperor through devouring their corpse. Now that he knew, he naturally would not make another mistake.","The two Great Emperors exchanged blows. This time, there was no doubt. In Ling Han’s heaven and earth, everything was up to him to decide.","So what if the Three Purity Great Emperor fought with his life on the line? He was killed in just a few hundred moves.","Ling Han was neither sad nor happy. Speaking of which, the Lords of Death were also pitiful people who had been bewitched by the old Divine Beast. Otherwise, they might have been companions who would fight side by side.","His soul retreated from the heaven and earth of his body, and returned to his mind. He set his eyes on another Lord of Death.","Sea Emperor, Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperor, Void Emperor, one after another, Lords of Death were killed by Ling Han. However, the old Divine Beast seemed to have made up his mind, and had no intention of making a move at all.","In just a few days, the Lords of Death were completely annihilated.","At this point, the only great villain left was the old Divine Beast.","However, this one character was 10,000 times more troublesome than all the Lords of Death combined.","For the moment, the old Divine Beast was invincible. If he wanted to fight, he could. If he didn’t want to, no one could do anything to him. Even Ling Han was unable to stop him from continuing to dig out the Cave of Death, releasing the essence of death.","Ling Han arrived at the Sea of Death and tossed out the corpses of the Lords of Death.","However, just as these corpses were about to come into contact with the ocean’s surface, a large hand suddenly stretched out of the ocean’s waters, directly capturing all the corpses of the Emperors.","What!","Ling Han was shocked. He focused his gaze, and saw that the old Divine Beast had actually flown out of the great ocean.","How was this possible!","The Sea of Death could kill all Great Emperors, and even the old Divine Beast was no exception. How could he possibly lay in ambush in the Sea of Death?","However, Ling Han immediately came to a realization, because when the old Divine Beast flew up, the sea level actually dropped a bit.","He finally understood. As it turned out, the old Divine Beast, Ling Han, had disguised himself as a great ocean, covering the Sea of Death.","This was really a bold plan, because there would be columns of water rising from the Sea of Death at any moment, soaring straight into the skies. The old Divine Beast was lying in ambush here; just how many times would he have to be attacked?","That’s right. If a fifth tier Great Emperor Tier was touched by a column of water, even if he did not die, he would be severely injured. However, the old Divine Beast was different. He was the only second tier Great Emperor Tier in the world. Even if the deathly column of water had destructive power on him, he would definitely be able to withstand it for a short period of time.","However, since the old Divine Beast was here, then what about the island?","\"Gaga, I have manifested millions of times, so how could you possibly know which one is my true self!\" the old Divine Beast said proudly.","In fact, this wasn’t his personal Mystical Power, but an ability that he had obtained after engulfing the \"Yinyang Beast\". It wasn’t as terrifying as manifesting ten million clones. He only had one yin doppelganger and another yang doppelganger.","However, he had suddenly used this Mystical Power, and he had succeeded."]},{"number":4875,"title":"Chapter 4875: Obtaining all Mystical Powers","paragraphs":["Right in front of Ling Han, the old Divine Beast swallowed the corpses of the eleven Lords of Death.","In this battle, the old Divine Beast had achieved a complete victory.","The old Divine Beast cackled, appearing extremely pleased with itself.","After engulfing the corpses of the Emperors, he would be able to obtain corresponding abilities, thereby increasing his own battle prowess. Unfortunately, he would not be able to obtain the spiritual mark, or he would be even stronger.","\"Young man, do you think that I have really allowed you to do as you please because I have no way to deal with you?\" The old Divine Beast asked with a mocking smile.","Ling Han sighed internally. This time, he had really broken what he had given his word on.","He had always been the type to keep his promises.","\"You used me to kill these Great Emperors to devour them,\" Ling Han said calmly.","\"That’s right.\" The old Divine Beast nodded, \"This kind of battle prowess is really useless to me. However, it would be different if it was swallowed by me. Combined with my battle prowess, I would be able to better display their strengths.\"","\"For example—\"","With a flash, he suddenly formed ten million clones of himself.","This was the ultimate move unique to the Ten Thousand Shadows Great Emperor!","It had been grasped so quickly by the old Divine Beast?","Heaven Devouring Beast, Heaven Devouring Beast, could it devour even the heavens?","\"Young man, thank you for killing these fools!\" The old Divine Beast mocked Ling Han to its heart’s content. In the previous battle, he had not been able to do anything to Ling Han, but in this battle, he had achieved a complete victory.","Though his abilities were stronger, he was unable to kill all the Great Emperors, and had to accomplish their deaths through Ling Han’s hand.","Ling Han looked at the old Divine Beast, and his fighting spirit began to soar.","\"What is it? Can’t swallow this anger?\" The old Divine Beast provoked, its eyes similarly filled with killing intent.","This area should be the limit of their ability to leave the island. If they went any further, they would really not be able to sense the essence of life.","They had long since exceeded the limit of their lifespans. Thus, if they went any further, they may lose their vitality in an instant, and die directly.","Perhaps, this was a good opportunity to kill Ling Han.","If the Great Emperor wanted to flee, it would really be very difficult to stop him, what more when Ling Han was only slightly weaker than him. Thus, he had to coordinate with the right time and place. Only then would he have the chance to kill Ling Han.","Now... this was really not too bad.","The old Divine Beast transformed into ten million clones that surrounded Ling Han.","\"Die!\"","This time, the old Divine Beast transformed into a middle-aged man again. Tens of thousands of them attacked at the same time, tapping out a finger at Ling Han. Instantly, tens of thousands of Demonic Sunflowers bloomed beside Ling Han.","This was the Black Sunflower Demon Emperor’s ability!","Ling Han released a battle cry, channelled the element of destruction, and attacked with all his might.","Peng, peng, peng! Images of fists interwove, and the Demonic Sunflowers fell one after another.","\"Young man, I really have to thank you,\" the old Divine Beast said with a smile. \"Though I have practically devoured all the Divine Beasts, the Divine Beasts were created by the heaven and earth, so their abilities are not strong. They are not like you Great Emperors that have cultivated, and truly have your own strengths.\"","\"And now, my ability has truly been unleashed!\"","Hong! Hong! Hong!","The old Divine Beast attacked continuously, and the ultimate moves of the Lords of Death were launched one after another. Coupled with the three key elements that he had grasped, the might was even more terrifying.","\"An... Ma... Ni... Ba... Mi... Gu...!\"","Tens of thousands of old Divine Beasts were chanting the Six Characters Bright King Curse at the same time. What kind of concept was this?","The Sea of Death was also howling, setting off waves that were as tall as 30,000 meters, that surged madly in all directions.","Ling Han had a feeling that he was not fighting with the old Divine Beast, but rather twelve Lords of Death who had obtained the strength of the old Divine Beast!","This was the true trump card that the old Divine Beast had laid out!","—If the Lords of Death successfully caused the two Realms of Yin and Yang to collide, that would be the best result. He would then be able to take advantage of the opening of the Cave of Death to comprehend the essence of death.","However, if the Lords of Death failed, then after retreating here, he would still have a chance to devour these Great Emperors and obtain their abilities.","Of course, the latter was actually very coincidental. Ling Han would have to have the ability to kill these Great Emperors.","However, starting from the fact that Ling Han was able to kill the Lords of Death, the old Divine Beast should be planning for the latter.","He had deliberately battled with Ling Han for seven million years, and then pretended to be helpless, his whole heart intent on digging out the Cave of Death. In the end, he had sold off the remaining Lords of Death, and his purpose was to devour them.","Such deliberate planning!","What an old fox.","Ling Han had to admit that he had underestimated this old Divine Beast.","He was too smooth-sailing, successfully advancing into Emperor Tier. In fact, he had even cultivated two main elements, causing even those ancient Great Emperors to blush with shame at their own inferiority. In the battle with the old Divine Beast, though he was at a disadvantage, the old Divine Beast was also exasperated.","Everything was saying that as long as he grasped another key element, he would be able to deal with the old Divine Beast, and return peace to the world.","He had never imagined that this was actually a trap laid out by the old Divine Beast.","Ling Han had already been careful enough. He had come so far to bury the Lords of Death, yet he had still fallen for the old Divine Beast’s trick.","\"You’re actually transformed from a fox, right?\" Ling Han asked. Now that things had come to this, regret was useless. He had to face reality.","After a moment of dejection, Ling Han regained his confidence.","The old Divine Beast could become stronger, so could he.","\"I am Heaven Devouring, destined to devour the heavens, and become the new heavens!\" The old Divine Beast declared proudly. Boom, with a wave of his hand, countless Yin Rivers shot out like silk, striking towards Ling Han.","Ling Han released a battle cry, the element of destruction entwined around his fists, as he charged towards the countless old Divine Beasts.","This element of destruction was much more terrifying than Destructive Energy. This was the cornerstone of heaven and earth, and could destroy anything.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","Ling Han threw punch after punch, and one after another, the old Divine Beasts were destroyed by him. However, if it was just his doppelgangers, they would not be able to block the terrifying element of destruction at all.","However, every time Ling Han killed a doppelganger, a new one would appear, and there was no end to it.","The old Divine Beast laughed proudly. Previously, his offensive methods were at a disadvantage due to the limited variety, but after obtaining the Mystical Powers that belonged to the Lords of Death, his strength was finally completely unleashed.","The power that he had cultivated was completely different from what the heaven and earth had bestowed on him.","\"Young man, die!\" The old Divine Beast laughed loudly, \"You can’t stop me. No one can stop me!\"","Ling Han said calmly, \"So what if you have grasped all four fundamental elements? Are you planning to destroy the heaven and earth?\"","\"What do you know!\" The old Divine Beast sneered, \"I was created by the heaven and earth, so I can peek into destiny! This world will eventually be destroyed, and by then, no matter how strong you are, you will be buried alongside the heaven and earth.\"","The universe was already beginning to collapse. Though it would take an incredibly long time, there would indeed come a day when this heaven and earth would return to its original state. At that time, all living beings would die.","\"Unless!\"","The old Divine Beast continued, \"Exterminate this heaven and earth, and replace it!\"","\"So, you want to obtain all four elements and grasp the foundation stones of heaven and earth?\" Ling Han shook his head, and said, \"In this way, even if you can achieve immortality, what’s the point if it would only be you alone?\"","Strength needed to be contrasted by weakness; otherwise, it would be meaningless.","It was the same for eternal life.","If he was all alone, what was the point of living?","\"You, don’t, understand!\" The old Divine Beast continued to attack, \"The path of elites is naturally to rush as far ahead as possible!\""]},{"number":4876,"title":"Chapter 4876: Backhand","paragraphs":["Ling Han shook his head, and said, \"We walk different paths, so we can’t work together!\"","He had a different idea. There was absolutely no need for him to destroy this world, and take its place. Instead, he himself would become a new world.","This was just like a willow tree. There was absolutely no need to eradicate it and plant it again. Instead, one could break off one of its branches, and it would be able to root and sprout, turning it into a new tree.","Of course, Ling Han wasn’t sure if he could withstand the terrifying power of this world that had been compressed back to its original point, even if he had formed his own heaven and earth.","However, he would rather give it a try.","This was the difference between him and the Lords of Death, and the old Divine Beast.","The two of them did not speak further, and merely continued their fierce battle.","The old Divine Beast was continuously developing the abilities that he had just obtained, and as his proficiency level increased, his battle prowess was also becoming more and more terrifying.","\"Found you!\" Ling Han shouted lightly, and charged rapidly towards an old Divine Beast, brandishing his fists repeatedly.","\"So what?\" The old Divine Beast humphed. His strength was superior to Ling Han, so even if his true self was discovered, so what?","However, in order to familiarize himself with his abilities, he immediately retracted the doppelgangers that filled the sky. As long as he manifested them again, Ling Han would again have to spend a long time to find him.","However, right at this moment, a pair of flaming wings suddenly flapped behind Ling Han’s back.","Phoenix Wings Divine Flight!","His figure suddenly sped up, and grabbed hold of the old Divine Beast in a single move.","\"Are you seeking death?\" the old Divine Beast asked disdainfully. This was not a street brawl, and you actually dare to engage in close-quarter combat. This was really embarrassing for a Great Emperor.","Ling Han smiled. Boom! His wings flapped again, and he actually dragged the old Divine Beast down into the sea.","This time, even the old Divine Beast’s expression changed drastically.","F***, Ling Han was trying to take him down with him.","However, an instant later, a baleful expression appeared on his face.","’Great!’","It should be known that he had obtained the Mystical Power of the Yinyang Beast. He could split into two bodies, and this was his Yin Body. Even if this body died, he still had his Yang Body.","That’s right. This would definitely affect his strength, but once Ling Han died, who would be able to threaten him?","Moreover, the least valuable thing on the Imperial Island was time. He could completely cultivate another Yin body, and it would only be a few hundred million years.","\"I’ll oblige you!\" The old Divine Beast also turned around to grab hold of Ling Han. At the same time, he also began to speed up, and took the initiative to fall towards the Sea of Death.","The two Great Emperors both exerted force to descend. This naturally could not be stopped.","Tong!","The two of them fell into the sea at the same time. Furthermore, in order to prevent the other from escaping, they were still holding onto each other.","The endless power of death assaulted, and the old Divine Beast immediately felt its vitality being extinguished. Even if there was still the element of Life here, they were far inferior to the power of death, and the loss of life was far greater than the replenishment.","Death... was coming!","However, he broke into a grin, because Ling Han was also about to die.","Haha, this was a worthwhile price to pay!","His hands gradually became weak, and he was no longer able to grab onto Ling Han. His body continued to sink.","But right at this moment, he suddenly saw Ling Han’s arms suddenly spread out, and he rapidly floated towards the surface of the sea.","F***, what was going on?","’He, he didn’t die?’","The old Divine Beast was stunned at this moment. His eyes widened, and he wanted to grab Ling Han. However, his vitality was about to be exterminated, so what strength did he have left? He could only watch helplessly as Ling Han continued to rise.","Why? Why!","He knew that Ling Han’s vitality was exuberant. Previously, no matter how heavy a blow he sustained, he would always be able to recover very quickly. However, this was the Sea of Death, which was filled with the power of death, and even he would be killed.","How had Ling Han managed to survive? Was he even more powerful than him?","However, he no longer had the strength to figure it out. His body had already sunk into the depths of the Sea of Death.","Peng!","Ling Han came out of the water and immediately returned to the Imperial Island.","In such a short period of time, he had already exhausted all the element of Life in his body. If the main body of the old Divine Beast charged over and forced him into the sea, he would definitely be done for.","After landing on the Imperial Island, the element of Life was immediately replenished.","Ling Han breathed a sigh of relief, a smile appearing at the corners of his lips.","The previous battle could be considered multiple turns of events.","First, he fell for a trick, and \"gifted\" the corpses of the Lords of Death to the old Divine Beast. However, he immediately counterattacked, putting an act of wanting to die together with the old Divine Beast. He dragged the old Divine Beast into the Sea of Death with him, and successfully destroyed one of his doppelgangers.","This wasn’t the type of doppelgangers that Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperor had. They were the Yin and Yang Bodies, which naturally caused severe damage to the old Divine Beast.","Lose first, then win, and successfully turn the tables.","However, the old Divine Beast was not without gains either. He had obtained all the abilities of the Lords of Death, and even if only the main body was left, it was still unbelievably strong.","Ling Han decided to continue comprehending the fundamental element of creation. Only by grasping the three fundamental elements would he be qualified to truly stand against the old Divine Beast, or even kill this monster.","\"Ao!\" On the island, the furious roar of the old Divine Beast was heard.","This was understandable. An incredibly important doppelganger had died just like that, so how could the old Divine Beast not be furious?","Ling Han ignored him and continued to study the fundamental element of creation.","This created another dilemma for Ling Han.","Ling Han had only been able to grasp the fundamental element of destruction because he had already learned Destructive Energy. As for the fundamental element of creation... he hadn’t grasped Creative Energy.","The four elements conflicted with each other, and had a strong exclusivity, so they could not be cultivated simultaneously.","However, since Ling Han dared to try, he naturally had some confidence.","What could he do?","Since the elements repelled one another, he would make use of this repulsive force.","Inside Ling Han’s body, the two elements repelled each other. If Ling Han hadn’t created a heaven and earth for them, they would definitely have torn Ling Han’s body apart.","However, precisely because the two elements repelled each other, would it be possible to maintain this situation while comprehending the element of creation?","Ling Han believed that this would instead be easier than other Great Emperors comprehending the second element.","—He had already imparted his experience. The other Great Emperors could not imitate him, but Ding Shu, Jing Haoran and Shui Qingchang should be able to give it a try. After all, they were also the Genesis World’s rulers, and had grasped Destructive Energy, so it was possible that they could structure the heaven and earth.","If Ding Shu and the others could also advance to the third tier, or even the second tier, then if they joined forces, the old Divine Beast would really die.","However, the road was long. They were too difficult to cultivate.","Ling Han didn’t pay any attention to others. He simply immersed himself in his own world, studying the fundamental element of creation.","Creation was the complete opposite of destruction, just like life was the opposite of death.","Ling Han made use of the repulsion of the elements of life and destruction, and took advantage of the opportunity to comprehend the element of cretaion. However, even if the two great elements were competing with each other, a powerful repulsive force was still created, to prevent Ling Han from grasping the element of creation.","Thus, his progress was overwhelmingly slow.","However, it was still the same thing. On the Imperial Island, the least valuable thing was time.","What Ling Han had to do was to compete in speed with the old Divine Beast. If he first grasped the key element to creation, he would possess strength that could completely match the old Divine Beast, and possibly even surpass it.","On the other hand, if the old Divine Beast first grasped the essence of death, then everything would be over."]},{"number":4877,"title":"Chapter 4877: Hope","paragraphs":["Ling Han continued to comprehend the fundamental element of creation.","This time, he was really trying to seek survival in the crevice. He made use of the mutual repulsion between the two great factors, and from there, comprehended the essence of creation bit by bit.","His speed was overwhelmingly slow.","But no matter how slow it was, it was still improvement.","What Ling Han had to do was to race with the old Divine Beast, and in the case of the old Divine Beast, it would still need a very, very long time to dig out the Cave of Death. He could still afford the time.","One million years, two million years, three million years... On this Imperial Island, it was as if the passing of time had not brought about any change. The cultivation levels of the Great Emperors had long since stopped improving. Their purpose here was to delay the old Divine Beast.","There were only a few exceptions.","Ling Han, Ding Shu, Jing Haoran, Shui Qingchang, and of course, the old Divine Beast, who was slowly approaching the Cave of Death.","This was his goal, and it seemed like it was also his life goal.","The Great Emperors were naturally still stopping the old Divine Beast, but after the old Divine Beast had swallowed the Lords of Death, its battle prowess had increased greatly. However, using the means of the Ten Thousand Shadows Saint Emperor to manifest millions of doppelgangers was extremely troublesome to the Great Emperors. They couldn’t effectively slow down the old Divine Beast at all.","Now, Ling Han and the old Divine Beast were both racing against time. On the surface, neither of them could do anything to the other, but in truth, as long as one of them could attain a breakthrough, the victor would be decided between them, or even life or death.","Ten million years, twenty million years, time continued to fly by.","Ling Han’s grasp of the fundamental element of creation had improved, but he was still very far from truly grasping it and being able to accommodate it into his body.","Meanwhile, Ding Shu, Shui Qingchang, and Jing Haoran were also cultivating in seclusion.","If they could also absorb the element and advance into the third tier, then even if their battle prowess was inferior to Ling Han’s, it would be four third tiers against a single second tier, which might really be able to stop the old Divine Beast.","A draw was within reach!","Thus, all the Great Emperors felt a strong hope rise up in them. Previously, they had released the Stone of Life in an attempt to break out of this dilemma. After so many years, the plans that they had previously laid out were finally effective.","They were filled with motivation. Even if they were completely no match for the old Divine Beast, so what? Every day, they would charge, be injured, and go to the Cave of Life to experience the power of life; it was an endless cycle.","\"Sigh, Saintly Material is also unreliable!\" The large black dog said gloomily, \"It actually broke Grandpa Dog’s underpants!\"","In the battle with the old Divine Beast, even a Great Emperor’s body was damaged, what more Saintly Material.","Thus, the large black dog’s iron underwear was already in tatters.","\"Hehe, why don’t you say that the old Divine Beast is interested in your behind?\" The little azure dragon snickered. However, after so many years, he finally reached the standard of maturity and became a great azure dragon.","However, his temperament was already deeply ingrained in his bones, and there was not the slightest difference from before.","\"Scram!\" The large black dog bared his teeth. There were a great many wounds on his body that were deep enough to reach his internal organs. The moment he moved, he would feel pain. Previously, he had only been deliberately diverting his attention.","It was already in such a miserable state, and what about the others?","The lower half of Brother Monkey’s body was directly severed, and the azure dragon also lost two claws. One of the little red bird’s wings was forcefully ripped off.","However, the most miserable was still the Battle Saint Emperor. The upper half of his body had been obliterated, and only his two legs remained.","However, as long as the soul imprint was not destroyed, they would not truly die, and could be nurtured and revived by the essence of life.","\"Great-grandson, good job!\" Though the Battle Saint Emperor was only left with the lower half of his body, his divine sense had already been nurtured, so it was naturally no problem for him to transmit a message through divine sense.","\"Hehe!\" Brother Monkey bared his mouth in a grin. \"Old Sun can still fight another 300 rounds!\"","\"Good, as expected of my descendant!\" The Battle Saint Emperor laughed loudly.","Everyone gritted their teeth as they watched.","Of the two generations of Monkey Kings, one was only left with the upper half, while the other was only left with the lower half. If the two were put together, they could form one.","’Heh, those who don’t know would think that there’s something wrong with you people. You’re deliberately severing yourselves into two so that you can speak to yourself.’","\"I hope Little Han comes out of seclusion as soon as possible,\" the large black dog said. \"Otherwise, I won’t be able to continue living like this.\"","He would be severely wounded and killed every few days. This was really too f****** dark.","Just think, damn it, it had always been invincible with its words. When had it ever suffered such injustice?","The little azure dragon nodded as well. At that time, their show-off trio had been glorious and invincible, but now? They were being beaten madly by an old Divine Beast.","Most importantly, it wasn’t strange to lose in a fight; who hadn’t lost before?","However, after tens of millions of years of being beaten by the same character, that would really be very, very vexing.","\"We can only wait.\"","\"I hope Little Han Han comes out of seclusion as soon as possible.\"","However, Ling Han’s progress was clearly far slower than they had imagined. Another 300 million years had passed, and Ling Han still showed no signs of coming out of seclusion, making Brother Monkey and the others anxious.","’It can’t be... that he is unable to break through, right?’","However, the Great Emperors were completely unconcerned.","Just how many years had they battled here for?","Billions and billions of years!","300 million years was only a matter of taking a nap for them, and was not considered much at all, all right?","Peng!","Right at this moment, a loud sound was heard, and the whole Imperial Island trembled slightly.","What was going on?","\"Little Han has come out of seclusion!\" The large black dog immediately jumped up.","\"That’s right. Aside from Little Han coming out of seclusion, it can’t possibly cause such a big commotion,\" the little azure dragon also said.","Even the empress, Chi Menghan, and the other women looked expectant. Was their freakish husband about to perform another miracle?","However, when they rushed over to take a look, they saw that the person who had come out of seclusion was actually Jing Haoran.","\"Yi, you all know that I have broken through, so have come to congratulate me?\" Jing Haoran said with a smile, looking like he was asking for a beating.","As one of the seven Genesis World’s rulers, it was truly a miracle that he had survived until now.","Everyone was disappointed. They had initially thought that Ling Han had come out of seclusion.","\"Hey, hey, hey, what’s with your expressions!\" Jing Haoran bared his teeth, \"For better or worse, I have now grasped two key elements, and am an elite among elites.\"","Boom!","Right at this moment, a loud bang rang out again, and another figure appeared, shapely and beautiful.","Shui Qingchang.","She had also broken through, and become a third tier Great Emperor.","\"Are you guys going to let me cultivate properly?\" Ding Shu also walked out. The aura he exuded was clearly different, and had become much stronger.","The three Genesis World’s rulers, after experiencing more than 300 million years of seclusion, successfully grasped the elements of destruction, and became the strongest below the old Divine Beast.","This time, the strength of their side had increased greatly.","\"If Ling Han comes out of seclusion, we’ll definitely be able to kill the old Divine Beast!\" the little red bird said.","\"That’s right. Now, all we have to do is wait for Little Han,\" the large black dog said with a grin. Finally, he didn’t need to be severely wounded and killed every few days.","Invigorating!","\"Haha, then let’s go and meet that old Divine Beast first,\" Ding Shu said heroically.","\"Let’s go!\" Jing Haoran also looked lazy.","They did not have any pride?","Of course not.","As the Genesis World’s rulers, they were actually extremely proud. How could they be willing to always be under Ling Han’s lead?","This time, Ling Han was in seclusion, so they would be the ones to pacify the situation."]},{"number":4878,"title":"Chapter 4878: Severed Route","paragraphs":["Ding Shu and the others led the way, and the Great Emperors charged towards the Cave of Death.","In truth, the battles at the Cave of Death had never stopped. Only the heavily injured and dead Great Emperors would go to the Cave of Life to recover, forming a cycle of battles.","However, when everyone rushed to the Cave of Death, they shockingly discovered that the battles here had actually stopped.","What was going on here?","\"A few days ago, the old Divine Beast suddenly sent us flying. Then, it used rocks to block the passageway. We have to first move the rocks away before we can continue our attack,\" the Great Emperor Wu Ya said.","The heaven and earth structure of the Imperial Island was too sturdy. Even if it was a Great Emperor, it would not be an easy task to break through the pile of rocks.","Furthermore, the old Divine Beast had blasted people out of the cave first, and then began to block the hole. Just how long was this passage?","Thus, cleaning up the rubble was also a difficult task.","\"We’ll do it!\" Ding Shu and the others stepped out. They had grasped the essence of destruction, so they were very suited to digging pits.","—The reason why the old Divine Beast could advance so rapidly was naturally also because he had grasped the essence of destruction. Otherwise, his progress would be much slower.","Moreover, this was only filled with rocks, and they were not starting from the very beginning. Naturally, the difficulty level would decrease further, and could not be compared to the old Divine Beast.","The three Genesis World’s rulers began to clear the rocks to create a hole.","\"Do you feel anything? Ever since we came here, our class has suddenly decreased,\" the large black dog said. \"Not only do we have to be beaten by the same character every day, but we also have to do jobs like mining.\"","Er, it was clearly a battle between Great Emperors, and for the sake of protecting all life in the world, such a sacred and noble cause, why did has it changed so drastically, coming out of your mouth?","\"Only you!\" Everyone pointed at the large black dog, looking like they wanted to draw a clear dividing line between them.","In terms of strength, the large black dog definitely wouldn’t be able to become the strongest in this lifetime. However, to be so despicable that even the Great Emperors would reject him, that was the height that the old Divine Beast had reached.","From this aspect, the large black dog had really lived enough in this lifetime.","In any case, they had nothing else to do, so the large black dog continued to chatter and joke around with the others.","This was called being flexible. Obviously, once the passageway was dug out, it would be another arduous battle.","Ten years, a hundred years, a thousand years. This passageway was long in the first place, and even Ding Shu and the others would need some time to destroy the solid matter here.","Thus, even after 1000 years, they still hadn’t dug to the end.","However, going by everyone’s experience, they would be able to dig to the end in another twenty years, at most.","—The old Divine Beast was progressing even slower on his side, so how many feet could he dig in over a thousand years?","Thus, as long as they dug to the end of the tunnel, they would be able to encounter the old Divine Beast.","\"However, don’t you guys find it strange?\" The large black dog scratched its head, \"That old Divine Beast doesn’t take us seriously at all, so why did it suddenly block the path?\"","Yes, this was indeed very strange.","Previously, though the Great Emperors had tried their best to stop him, the truth was that the old Divine Beast had not been affected at all. It was just that he had nothing better to do, so he could use the Great Emperors to pass some time. Otherwise, as long as he was willing to pay some price, it was not impossible for him to annihilate all the Great Emperors.","But now, he was actually blocking the way?","The possibility that he had a premonition that Ding Shu and the others would break through was too small.","Furthermore, though Ding Shu and the others had advanced into third tier, their battle prowess was still no match for Ling Han. Thus, there was absolutely no reason for the old Divine Beast to be afraid.","\"There must be something fishy about this!\" the large black dog concluded.","It was the ancestor of trickery, and immediately felt that something was off.","\"Could it be that we should allow that old beast to do as it pleases?\" Ancestral King Lingtian frowned.","\"Grandpa Dog feels that it would be better to wait for Little Han to come out of seclusion. Our power is still inferior to the old Divine Beast. Don’t let him defeat us one by one, and ruin the good hand of cards that we have been dealt,\" the large black dog said very seriously.","At this time, it was really very serious — if it had not used its claws to scratch its behind.","All the Emperors were speechless. This despicable dog always managed to ruin the atmosphere. It was clearly a tense time.","Moreover, he even said that the class of events had decreased. With you here, how could the level of class be any higher?","However, what the large black dog said was indeed reasonable. After all, it was the ancestor of being despicable. Its thoughts could be used as reference. Who knows, it may really be able to hit the nail on the old Divine Beast’s idea.","They went to ask Ding Shu and the others, and voiced everyone’s concerns.","\"It’s all right. We have already grasped the essence of destruction. If the three of us join forces, even if we are no match for that old beast, the gap would not be too big,\" Ding Shu said.","\"Moreover, this place is filled with the essence of life. As long as the old beast hasn’t grasped the essence of death, it can’t possibly kill us,\" Jing Haoran said.","\"Precisely because of this, we have to find the old Divine Beast as soon as possible to stop him from continuing to dig,\" Shui Qingchang added.","Er, these words were quite logical.","Though the old Divine Beast was strong, without grasping the essence of death, he had absolutely no ability to kill Great Emperors — it was not like Ling Han, who could absorb Regulations himself.","Thus, even if there was a shock, they wouldn’t be in danger.","The Emperors couldn’t convince Ding Shu and the others, so they could only let them continue.","\"Not good!\" The large black dog shook his head, and said, \"These three people are dissatisfied with being suppressed by Little Han all this while, so they’re trying their best to do something. They’ve already surpassed Little Han, so they’re no longer rational.\"","\"However, they have a point. In this place, aside from Little Han, who can kill Great Emperors, even the old Divine Beast can’t,\" the little azure dragon said.","\"Believe Grandpa Dog, that old b@stard is definitely up to something!\" the large black dog said with absolute certainty.","\"Then what do you think we should do?\" the empress asked. She still trusted the large black dog quite a bit, and when it came to devious ideas, there was no one that was better at it than the large black dog.","The large black dog pondered for a moment, and said, \"We’ll observe the situation. If things go awry, we’ll immediately retreat into the Cave of Creation. No matter what, we have to protect Little Han.\"","Faced with the unknown, it could not think of a way to deal with it.","\"En.\" Everyone nodded.","\"But, Old Black, could it be that you can also be serious for once? This is really unexpected!\"","The large black dog sneered, \"Grandpa Dog has always been very reliable, all right!\"","\"En.\" Everyone nodded again, but the expressions on their faces... were saying ’yeah, right’.","Everyone sat down and waited quietly.","At most, the answer would be revealed in twenty to thirty years.","Peng!","37 years later, a muffled sound came from the cave.","It was clear!","All the Great Emperors hurriedly stood up. They were going to battle with the old Divine Beast again.","\"My hands are itching to kill!\" The Battle Saint Emperor gripped his staff.","\"So is Old Sun.\" Brother Monkey was also rubbing his fists. However, his Saintly Material staff was completely useless here. He had already thrown it away, and now, he could only fight bare-handed.","Thankfully, he was already a fourth tier Great Emperor, so the effects of the Imperial Weapon would also be limited.","Boom!","Amidst a huge commotion, Ding Shu and the others rushed out of the cave, and behind them, the old Divine Beast that had transformed into an elegant scholar slowly walked out, looking calm and composed.","\"Kaka, have you all come to seek death?\""]},{"number":4879,"title":"Chapter 4879: Surrounded","paragraphs":["The old Divine Beast looked around in the crowd, and couldn’t help but frown slightly, \"Where’s Ling Han?\"","The person he wanted to kill the most was Ling Han, because only this person could truly pose a threat to him.","Though Ding Shu and the others had also advanced into third tier, they were still negligible in his eyes.","\"Old Beast, there is no need for Ling Han to move, and we would be able to suppress you!\" Jing Haoran said very flamboyantly.","\"Die!\" Shui Qingchang was much more decisive, and directly charged over.","The moment she moved, Ding Shu and Jing Haoran could only follow. Even if they had become third tier Great Emperors, there was still a very large gap between them and the old Divine Beast. Thus, if they did not join forces, they would definitely lose.","The three of them attacked together, besieging the old Divine Beast.","\"Bunch of brats!\" The old Divine Beast was extremely disdainful, and shot out a palm strike, sending Ding Shu and the others flying.","Seeing this scene, the Emperors were instead relieved.","That’s right. The old Divine Beast was still incredibly powerful, but there was not much improvement to its abilities from more than a thousand years ago.","Then... there was no need to worry.","\"Old Black, looks like you guessed wrong,\" the little azure dragon said.","The large black dog shook his head, \"Something’s not right, something’s definitely not right!\"","\"What do you mean?\" Brother Monkey asked.","\"The moment this old Divine Beast came out, it asked Little Han where he was, and even looked disappointed.\" The large black dog analyzed the situation, \"Thus, Grandpa Dog has no choice but to guess that he has actually been preparing some kind of secret weapon that can restrain Little Han all these years.\"","\"However, this kind of weapon probably couldn’t be used many times. Thus, the old Divine Beast looked disappointed because it didn’t discover Little Han at the first moment.\"","The little azure dragon was stunned. \"Old Black, I really couldn’t tell. You really spoke like it was real. However, you came to this conclusion just from the change in his expression, don’t you think it’s a bit strange?\"","\"F***, Grandpa Dog has never been so serious before,\" the large black dog said. \"The old geezer disappeared for more than a thousand years, and deliberately blocked the passage at that. That’s because he doesn’t want others to know what he’s doing.\"","\"Amongst us, the person who poses the greatest threat to him, and possibly the only one that poses a threat to him, is Little Han.\"","\"Thus, Grandpa Dog’s guess, no, I am certain. The old b@stard must be thinking of some way to trick Little Han.\"","Was that really the case?","Everyone did not speak further. Ahead of them, Ding Shu and the others were battling extremely fiercely with the old Divine Beast. The battle prowess of third tier Great Emperors was fully displayed, and was enough to restrain even the old Divine Beast.","All the Great Emperors were excited by this, and they all charged out, unleashing their ultimate moves one after another, blasting towards the old Divine Beast.","The three great third tier Great Emperors were the main generals, and there were as many as twenty over fourth tier Great Emperors as support. This time, they had really managed to stand against the old Divine Beast.","They were not losing, they really were not losing.","Then, when Ling Han came out of seclusion, and another fresh member joined thier forces, it was really possible that they would be able to suppress the old Divine Beast.","Instantly, all the Emperors were incredibly excited. After so many years, they finally had a clear view of hope.","Fight, fight, fight. With their morale greatly boosted, their battle prowess increased slightly, and they actually had a slight upper hand.","This was inconceivable, and also something that had never happened before.","This was the first time that they had gained the upper hand in a battle with the old Divine Beast!","There was hope, there really was hope!","However, the old Divine Beast was too powerful. Even if the Emperors had the upper hand, so what? If they wanted to attain an overwhelming victory, it would at least have to be a matter of a few hundred or a few thousand years later.","Furthermore, so what if he had the upper hand?","The old Divine Beast also had an undying body.","\"Huh? Ding Shu, and the others seem to be a little different from Little Han,\" the large black dog said. He, the little azure dragon, the empress, and the others didn’t participate in the battle. Instead, they focused on watching the battle.","\"En.\" Chi Menghan nodded, \"Though their battle prowess is obviously strong, their recovery ability is far inferior to Husband’s.\"","\"Little Han has opened up a new world in his body, which can accommodate the elements,\" the little azure dragon said. It stared at Ding Shu and the others for a while, then said with a frown, \"It’s extremely likely that they didn’t manage to do this, but rather used the Genesis World to hold the elements.\"","This was completely different.","The Genesis World’s structure was too small. The strongest elite was only Heavenly Venerable Tier-level, and in the outside world, they were no different from ordinary people.","However, Ling Han had created a new heaven and earth. At present, he was using the four fundamental elements as his foundation.","At this point, it could be seen that even if they were all Genesis World’s rulers, there was still a difference.","However, upon further thought, this was normal. Ling Han had cultivated more human limits than Ding Shu and the others, so how could this not have any effect?","On the path of martial arts, even the slightest inadequacy could possibly affect whether one could become a Saint or Emperor, what more when it was their present height.","Thus, though Ding Shu and the others had advanced into third tier, their battle prowess was far inferior to Ling Han’s. In fact, it was possible that they would not be able to advance any further.","This was also the reason why they had insisted on this battle. That was because they could no longer advance. This was their strongest state.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","The fierce battle was still continuing. All the Great Emperors seemed to have gotten a little carried away, and thought that suppressing the old Divine Beast was close at hand.","Three hundred years, seven hundred years, one thousand and five hundred years!","The battle continued for a very long time, and all the Great Emperors were already completely on the upper hand, beating down on the old Divine Beast.","\"Old Black, looks like you’re really wrong.\" The little azure dragon nudged the large black dog.","Yet the large black dog’s expression became even more solemn, \"Wrong, this just confirms Grandpa Dog’s thoughts. The old Divine Beast has hidden a powerful weapon, but it can only be used for a limited amount of time or a limited number of times. That is why he is patient.\"","Chi Menghan frowned slightly, and asked, \"Then should we inform the others?\"","\"No!\" The large black dog shook his head without hesitation, and said, \"If Grandpa Dog’s prediction is correct, then the old Divine Beast will definitely have the confidence to kill Little Han. We can’t let Little Han take risks!\"","Hiss!","The little azure dragon, the little red bird, and the others all looked stunned. The large black dog was planning to use the other Great Emperors as bait to expend the powerful weapon of the old Divine Beast — if there was one.","Wasn’t this too ruthless?","\"Let’s do that!\" the empress also spoke up, her expression resolute.","Even if there were 10,000 Great Emperors added together, none of them would be as important as her man. Thus, she didn’t hesitate at all.","In her eyes, Ling Han was the most important. Saving all life in the world was only something that she could do in passing. ’If there was a trap ahead of them, then please help Ling Han clean out the traps.’","Hu Niu was naturally the same. What was more important than Niu’s Ling Han?","\"Furthermore, even if we go and remind them now, who would listen?\" The large black dog pointed at the Great Emperors, who were in the midst of an intense battle.","This was the first time in hundreds of billions of years that they had gained the upper hand. Every single Great Emperor was incredibly excited, and their only thought was to win.","Moreover, it wasn’t like they hadn’t died before. What did they have to fear?","And only the large black dog would conclude that the old Divine Beast was actually enduring, and wanted to use a secret weapon to screw Ling Han over.","In the end... who was right and who was wrong?","After battling for another 30,000 years, the old Divine Beast finally couldn’t bear it any longer.","With how strong he was, when had he ever been forced to this extent?","\"Damn it!\" he roared loudly. Suddenly, two swords of light that were as dark as ink appeared in his hands, exuding an endless air of death."]},{"number":4880,"title":"Chapter 4880: Sword of Death","paragraphs":["Pu!","The old Divine Beast suddenly unleashed its might, instantly unleashing an astonishing battle prowess. He sent the Great Emperors flying with a single strike, arriving directly in front of Ding Shu.","Boom, the black sword of light in his hand stabbed out, as fast as lightning.","However, Ding Shu’s reaction speed wasn’t slow, and he immediately retreated, dodging this strike.","However, the old Divine Beast’s figure flashed, and actually appeared behind Ding Shu, stabbing again.","This was the ultimate technique of the Void Emperor. It was also the predecessor of the Strange Shadow Steps, and was most suited for assassination.","This time, Ding Shu was no longer able to dodge.","Shui Qingchang and Jing Haoran hurriedly rushed over to block this attack for Ding Shu.","However, it was too late.","The sword stabbed down, directly sinking into Ding Shu’s body.","Ding Shu was instantly killed.","\"Quick, bring him to the Cave of Life!\" the Great Emperors hurriedly said. They had nothing to fear even if they died in battle here. As long as the soul mark was not destroyed, it was only a matter of time before they revived.","However, when the old Divine Beast drew its sword, it opened its massive mouth and directly swallowed Ding Shu.","How was this possible!","Though the old Divine Beast was known as the Heaven Devouring Beast, it could only swallow corpses. Otherwise, if he swallowed every Great Emperor after killing one, how could so many things have happened?","Even if they were killed here, the soul imprint would not be erased. Thus, even if he swallowed the corpse, it would not be destroyed. At most, it would only extend the time of their revival.","However, there was a Great Emperor inside his body. Just how dangerous was this?","Wasn’t he afraid that after Ding Shu revived, he would launch an attack from within?","Even if the old Divine Beast was a second tier Great Emperor, how could the defenses inside its body be the same?","Once he was severely injured, Ling Han could appear again and draw him into the heaven and earth inside his body. At that time, he would be able to easily kill him.","Thus, how could the old Divine Beast take such a risk?","Could it be that it had been infuriated by everyone’s attacks, and was only on the spur of the moment that it wanted to devour the corpse to vent its anger?","\"Not good!\" Heaven Slashing Demon Emperor exclaimed in shock, \"Ding Shu’s spiritual mark has disappeared!\"","’What?’","All the Great Emperors could not believe it. The soul imprint had disappeared, which meant that he had really died.","However, how could the old Divine Beast suddenly possess the ability to kill a Great Emperor?","Those two swords!","All the Great Emperors were looking at the two black swords of light in the old Divine Beast’s hands. The one that had pierced into Ding Shu was no longer dark, and was slowly disappearing.","At this time, how could they not guess?","It was this sword that had killed Ding Shu.","It was capable of killing a third tier Great Emperor!","The old Divine Beast directly threw away that sword, looked very cherishingly at the other sword, and said, \"This is called the Sword of Death, and is a God Tool that I have used so many years to forge!\"","This was formed from the essence of death that had been extracted from the Cave of Death, and could completely cancel out the essence of life. Thus, when this sword pierced into a vital point, the essence of life would not be able to take effect, so naturally, the soul imprint could no longer be preserved.","However, there was too little element of death in this. It would dissipate after being used once.","When he had been digging out the Cave of Death, it was not that the old Divine Beast had not gained anything, but it could only be forged into two Swords of Death. For him, they were too useless, and he could not be bothered to use them to kill those Great Emperors.","—He could kill two of them, and there would still be a group left.","However, following the sudden appearance of Ling Han, the old Divine Beast finally realized that it was time to unleash these two Swords of Death.","Unfortunately, the first one was wasted.","The expressions of all the Great Emperors changed drastically. As it turned out, the old Divine Beast had really hidden a trump card!","Obviously, the reason why the old Divine Beast had created the Sword of Death was so that it could deal with Ling Han. However, Ling Han had not appeared, while Ding Shu and the others had advanced into third tier, and began a great battle that even he had not foreseen.","Left with no choice, he could only draw the Sword of Death. Otherwise, it was really possible that he would encounter trouble.","It could be said that everyone had accidentally uncovered a conspiracy of the old Divine Beast, but the old Divine Beast still had a Sword of Death in its hands, which was still enough to pose a threat to Ling Han.","\"Scram!\" The old Divine Beast advanced aggressively, \"That brat should be in the Cave of Creation, right? Gaga, I’ll go and kill him now!\"","\"Don’t even think about it!\"","Jing Haoran, Shui Qingchang, the Great Emperor Wu Ya, and the others all stepped forward to block the old Divine Beast.","Yi?","The old Divine Beast appeared slightly surprised. He cackled repeatedly, and said, \"Don’t you guys forget, I now have the ability to kill you guys!\"","\"You can only kill one!\" All the Great Emperors said calmly.","\"However, the person who’s going to die... is very likely you!\" The old Divine Beast attacked their mentality. \"Who’s willing to die?\"","The large black dog strode out, \"In order to stop you, Grandpa Dog is willing to step out! Brothers and sisters, we must stop this guy. Even if we die, we must force him to expend this Sword of Death!\"","The little azure dragon bared its teeth. \"Has this big black guy changed his personality? Why isn’t he afraid of death anymore?\"","Meanwhile, the empress smiled and said, \"He’s putting on an act. If we really get into a fight, he’ll definitely hide behind us.\"","However, even though she said this, the empress still strode forward.","In order to stop the old Divine Beast from killing Ling Han, she was willing to battle to the death.","Hu Niu and Chi Menghan also walked out. In this place, anyone could die, but it definitely couldn’t be Ling Han!","\"You people!\" The old Divine Beast was stunned. He had not thought that killing Ding Shu would actually not intimidate these people. Instead, it made their fighting spirit even more frightening.","What was going on here?","Shouldn’t it be the instinct of life to seek fortune and avoid calamity?","\"So, you don’t understand at all!\" the large black dog scoffed. \"You don’t know what it means to have the love for all life, comradeship, brotherhood, matrimonial love!\"","\"Thus, you are destined to fail!\"","The old Divine Beast felt that this was inconceivable. There were so many Great Emperors here, and they could clearly attain immortality here, yet they were actually willing to sacrifice their lives for the sake of others.","This was something that he could not understand.","\"Bunch of ignorant people, you all have absolutely no idea what strength is!\" he roared loudly. He withdrew the Sword of Death, and charged towards the Cave of Creation.","All the Great Emperors hurriedly intercepted it, but the old Divine Beast was too strong. It merely sent out a palm strike, and peng, seven Great Emperors were sent flying at the same time.","However, there was still Jing Haoran and Shui Qingchang!","These two people were in the third tier, which was enough to obstruct the old Divine Beast.","\"The two of you...\" the old Divine Beast roared. \"You’ve already grasped two elements, and it won’t be difficult for you to become the strongest in the world one day. Why do you have to die for others?\"","\"Hahaha, old monster, I already told you, you don’t know what affection is!\" Jing Haoran laughed loudly, his fighting spirit blazing.","Half of the reason why he and Shui Qingchang were where they were today was because of their hard work, but half of it was because of Ling Han.","Without Ling Han bringing them here, would they have been able to become Great Emperors?","Without Ling Han teaching them how to grasp the element of destruction, would they be able to advance into third tier?","To say the least, if Ling Han hadn’t rushed over to save them, they would have long since died at the hands of the Lands of Death.","Thus, so what if they fought to the death for Ling Han?","That’s right. They wanted to compete with Ling Han, but that was the pride they had as the rulers of the Genesis World, and not jealousy.","\"Don’t even think of passing!\" Shui Qingchang charged over."]},{"number":4881,"title":"Chapter 4881: Disregarding one’s own safety","paragraphs":["Jing Haoran and Shui Qingchang were both fighting with their lives on the line, trying their best to stop the old Divine Beast from advancing.","They definitely could not allow him to pass, even if it meant sacrificing their own lives.","This was the shared understanding of the two of them.","Boom! More and more Great Emperors charged over, one after another. Not a single one of them showed any sign of fear.","No one would want to die. This was also why so many Great Emperors had come to the Primitive Abyss to seek immortality. However, for the sake of righteousness, they were willing to generously die.","The old Divine Beast was stupefied.","How could this be?","Could it be that these people did not know that he possessed the ability to kill Great Emperors?","Though he could only kill one, it could be any one of them.","In the past, when the Great Emperors had battled fiercely with him, they were unafraid of death. The old Divine Beast could still understand, because everyone could come back to life, but now, what right did you all have to be so fierce?","Did they really think that he did not dare to use the Sword of Death?","In a fit of rage, the old Divine Beast summoned the Sword of Death again.","However, he had never imagined that these Great Emperors would become even more excited. One after another, they actually took the initiative to pounce towards the Sword of Death. They were so crazy that even the old Divine Beast was dumbfounded.","Only at this moment did he confirm that the Great Emperors were not putting on airs. Instead, they were really willing to use themselves to \"eliminate\" the Sword of Death.","Without the Sword of Death, the old Divine Beast would not be able to threaten Ling Han. Then, as long as Ling Han was given enough time, he would one day be able to kill the old Divine Beast.","The old Divine Beast took a deep breath.","Crazy, they had really gone crazy. How could there be such people? Furthermore, it was a whole group of them!","He frowned deeply. If it was just those Great Emperors from years ago, he would not be concerned at all. He could forcefully blast out a path. After all, he all had the advantage of two levels.","But added with Jing Haoran and Shui Qingchang, it was a different story.","The two of them were in the third tier!","Two third tiers and a group of fourth tiers could have extremely strong obstructive effects. In fact, when there were three third tiers just now, even he had been suppressed.","Unless he really drew out the Sword of Death, and killed another third tier.","The problem was, without the Sword of Death, he couldn’t do anything to Ling Han either, so what was the point of breaking out of the siege?","The old Divine Beast gritted its teeth. For the first time, it felt regret.","In the past, when the Great Emperors had sent out the Stone of Life, he had actually been able to stop them — if he was willing to pay the price of destroying a few soul marks, but as he saw it, even the fourth tier Great Emperors could not withstand a single blow, and were only worthy of becoming his toys, so why would he care about a Stone of Life?","He was very expectant. When he opened the Cave of Death, he anticipated the expressions of despair on the faces of the Great Emperors.","How boring was it to wear embroidered clothes at night? He hoped that when he succeeded, there would be someone who could be spectators on the sidelines, no matter how the spectators felt.","But now, he really regretted it.","If he had known, if he had known!","\"Ah!\" The old Divine Beast roared furiously, filled with endless emotions.","He pushed forward with great difficulty.","This had become a battlefield. With every step he took, he would have to pay the price of sending a dozen over Great Emperors flying. However, the Great Emperors were advancing one after another, using their bodies to block his path.","In fact, even the old Divine Beast was forced to put away the Sword of Death, because he was afraid that he would be accidentally bumped into by some Great Emperor.","F***, was he really holding a deadly weapon in his hand? Why did it feel like he was holding porcelain!","\"You, a bunch of stupid guys!\" the old Divine Beast called out. It clapped and waved its palms repeatedly, pushing its own strength to the extreme.","He definitely had to stop Ling Han from continuing his comprehension.","Though he had once been very confident, and thought that no Great Emperor would be able to cultivate two or more elements of heaven and earth, with Ling Han first, followed by Ding Ding Shu and the others, he no longer had such confidence.","Why was it that he could cultivate several elements at the same time?","Because he was a Heaven Devouring Beast, and had devoured countless soul marks before, it could be said that he was actually a fusion of many souls, and could not be considered an individual.","Thus, in his eyes, the exclusion of the four elements did not exist.","However, what basis did Ling Han and the others have?","He couldn’t understand, but it didn’t matter. He would kill them all, kill them all!","The old Divine Beast charged forward aggressively, and no matter how hard the Great Emperors tried, a second tier was really too strong, and could not be stopped. Just like how the old Divine Beast wanted to dig out the Cave of Death, the Great Emperors could only slow it down, and it was only their own self-perception that they were slowing it down.","This battle lasted another 700 years.","The old Divine Beast Beast advanced with great difficulty, but still charged to the front of the Cave of Creation.","\"Gaga!\" A smile appeared on the old Divine Beast’s face. As long as he was allowed to enter into the cave, he would be able to use rocks to block his path of retreat. In that way, no one would be able to stop him.","Ling Han, ultimately would die!","\"You guys can’t stop me!\" He laughed loudly. With how terrifying the Sword of Death was, killing Ling Han wouldn’t be difficult.","All the Great Emperors were even more frenzied. However, their battle prowess was far too inferior, so what did it matter even if they put their lives on the line?","Peng!","The old Divine Beast unleashed an absolutely powerful attack, sending all the Great Emperors flying. This was a powerful move of his. Even with his strength, he was panting for breath, and in the next instant, he had stepped into the Cave of Creation.","\"Gaga, goodbye!\" The old Divine Beast waved its hand, and instantly, rocks fell, locking down the passage.","All the Great Emperors charged back, but it was already too late.","All of a sudden, looks of despair appeared on their faces.","Just like how they had previously opened the Cave of Death, how much time had they spent?","More than a thousand years.","With such a long time, the old Divine Beast would have long since killed Ling Han.","What could they do?","The hope that had just risen was extinguished just like that?","\"No, Little Han will definitely survive this!\" the large black dog said with absolute confidence.","\"That’s right.\" The empress was the first to rush out, and began to dig out rocks.","\"Niu’s Ling Han is the most awesome!\" Hu Niu also joined in.","Chi Menghan didn’t say anything, and simply continued to work in silence.","Though they clearly knew that the chances of this were pitifully low, even more Great Emperors joined in, and began to excavate the rocks.","Boom!","Right at this moment, a massive tremor was heard.","Ling Han and the old Divine Beast were fighting!","\"Hurry! Hurry! Hurry!\" the little azure dragon shouted loudly. He had already taken the form of a True Dragon, using his sharp claws to claw at the stones. After cultivating to the level of Great Emperor, his terrifying physique had also reached the strongest level, and his sharp claws could cut open stones.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","Inside, the commotion caused by the battle was getting louder and louder, yet no one knew how the battle was progressing, causing all the Great Emperors to feel extremely anxious.","The only good news was that the battle was still continuing.","As long as the battle had not stopped, that meant that Ling Han was not dead, and everything was possible.","\"Quick, quick, quick!\"","They excavated with all their might, and Jing Haoran and Shui Qingchang channeled the element of destruction at all costs.","One had to realize that they hadn’t been able to construct a new heaven and earth inside their bodies like Ling Han had. Instead, they had made use of the Genesis World again. Thus, the amount of destruction that they could contain was much lesser.","For them, this kind of expenditure was too great.","However, they paid no heed to this, and merely continued to dig with all their might.","Closer, closer and closer!","Everyone could feel that the shockwaves from the battle were getting closer and closer to them.","\"We got through!\"","All the Great Emperors cheered.","Peng, a figure flew out of the gap that they had created."]},{"number":4882,"title":"Chapter 4882: Second tier!","paragraphs":["After the old Divine Beast entered the cave, it continued to block the path with rocks as it advanced.","In this way, if the people behind wanted to catch up to him, that would be a matter of one to two thousand years later.","—The Cave of Creation had long since been dug out, so it was much deeper than the Cave of Death.","However, his speed was fast, and it wasn’t long before he arrived at the bottom of the cave.","Ling Han was presently sitting cross-legged in the Pool of Creation.","A smile appeared on the old Divine Beast’s face. He stretched out his right hand, and the Sword of Death had already appeared.","He was going to take advantage of this opportunity to deliver a sword strike to Ling Han, completely eliminating any future trouble.","This was disgraceful?","What a joke. When one had reached a height like he had, would he still care about honour?","Die!","The old Divine Beast charged out, his sword stabbing towards Ling Han.","He used the ultimate move of the Void Emperor. With a flash, he had appeared in front of Ling Han, the blade of his sword exuding an endless air of death.","Logically speaking, it would be best for an assassination to appear behind the target, but how proud was a Great Emperor?","’I can’t kill you with a head-on strike?’","What kind of joke was this!","Moreover, with the movement technique of the Void Emperor, there was no difference whether he appeared in front of or behind him. After all, he would kill with a single strike.","Shua, the sword stabbed down at an incredibly fast speed.","Right at this moment, Ling Han’s eyes suddenly snapped open. There were actually three streaks of light flickering in his eyes.","Peng, Ling Han delivered a palm strike, and it actually struck the old Divine Beast’s wrist.","Even with the old Divine Beast’s physique, it still let out a pained groan. The sword that it had stabbed out was instantly deflected, and almost slipped out of its grip.","’What?’","The old Divine Beast’s mouth gaped open, as it released a soundless exclamation of shock.","F***, he had gotten a scare.","He was a second tier Great Emperor!","Ling Han smiled faintly, and turned his palm into a fist that blasted towards the old Divine Beast. Boundless power surged out.","Peng!","The old Divine Beast took it head-on, yet was directly sent backwards.","So strong?","He was shocked, and exclaimed in shock, \"You, you have grasped the essence of creation!\"","Otherwise, no matter how freakish Ling Han was, how could he be qualified to match him?","Ling Han smiled faintly, \"I just had some ideas.\"","He spread out his arms. Boom, the element of creation surged endlessly into his body, filling his own heaven and earth.","When the old Divine Beast charged in, he was naturally awakened, but it was the crucial moment of his comprehension, so he did not move. Instead, he continued to comprehend. Only when the old Divine Beast stabbed him with its sword did he react.","The element of creation surged over, and Ling Han’s enlightenment was like the brightness of the stars, three-colored light shining brilliantly in his eyes.","How could it be so coincidental!","The old Divine Beast gritted its teeth. If it wasn’t for those guys dragging things on for several hundred years, Ling Han definitely wouldn’t have grasped the key element of creation.","Damn it! Damn it!","Xiu! Ling Han counterattacked, and the might of his punch became even stronger.","Right now, he was like a resuscitated giant. With each passing second, he would become stronger.","Peng!","The old Divine Beast clashed head-on with him, yet it was no match, and was once again sent backwards.","He was in disbelief. They were both in the third tier, so why was he inferior to Ling Han?","\"You were created by heaven and earth, and you can only be limited to the limits of heaven and earth.\" Ling Han said calmly, \"But do you know that every time I break through, I have broken through the limits!\"","Hence, as a fellow second tier, he was even stronger, even if he had just advanced into this cultivation level.","The old Divine Beast was rendered speechless. Now that things had come to this, what else could he say?","However, he still had a chance to kill Ling Han, as long as he managed to pierce the latter with his sword.","However, because it could only deliver a single strike, the old Divine Beast was enduring silently. It definitely had to wait for the best opportunity.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","Ling Han unleashed a burst of power, his power boiling. He unleashed his second-tier battle prowess one strike after another, and in this process, he was also familiarizing himself with the key element of creation.","Originally, the heaven and earth inside his body was completely blank, but as the element of creation appeared, he could create things with a single thought. Multiple stars appeared, planets, moons, suns, and stars, and on the planets, countless living creatures appeared out of thin air.","Creation, bestowing life.","In an instant, tens of billions of years had passed in the heaven and earth inside his body. Planets were destroyed, and stars exploded. The end of creation was destruction.","However, there was no life that had died from exhaustion of lifespan, because in this heaven and earth, there was no element of death. Unless life was destroyed by the element of destruction, it could not die, even if it was sliced into a thousand pieces, or ten thousand pieces.","Without death, this was not a normal world.","Ling Han nodded. Death was the replenishment of life, and was also a kind of order.","Hence, all four elements could not be lacking.","Enlightenment dawned on Ling Han, but the fists he shot out became more and more terrifying.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","Not only would the old Divine Beast be sent backwards, it would even be sent flying.","Retreating and being sent flying were two completely different concepts. In the first scenario, it was that his abilities were slightly inferior, while in the other case, he was more or less overwhelmed.","As the heaven and earth in Ling Han’s body was perfected, his battle prowess also increased to a terrifying height.","The old Divine Beast was no longer a match for him.","Boom!","With a violent blast, the old Divine Beast was sent flying, and crashed into the rocks in the passage behind him, causing the old Divine Beast to grit its teeth in pain.","At this moment, he regretted it again.","If he had known earlier, why would he have blocked the passageway?","This would affect his escape.","Peng, peng, peng! Ling Han rushed over and gave him a series of violent punches.","The old Divine Beast could only suffer, feeling extremely sullen.","He, a dignified second tier Great Emperor, the strongest existence in the world, was actually pressed against the wall and thrashed. How could he accept this?","However, no matter how defiant and displeased he was, so what?","Right now, his battle prowess was genuinely no match for Ling Han.","Peng!","When Ling Han’s iron fist smashed down, the rocks behind the old Divine Beast coincidentally loosened, and the old Divine Beast was directly sent flying.","What!","Seeing the old Divine Beast being sent flying backwards, everyone was collectively confused.","In their minds, Ling Han would definitely be at a disadvantage at this moment. He would only be able to barely parry, barely managing to save his life.","Thus, once the passageway opened, they wanted to risk their lives to block the weapon, so that Ling Han could escape. Meanwhile, they would use themselves to block the old Divine Beast, and it would be best if they could directly expend the Sword of Death.","In this way, though Ling Han was still no match for the old Divine Beast, there was no need to worry about his life.","However, the one that had been sent flying was actually the old Divine Beast?","They hurriedly turned around to face the old Divine Beast, but on second thought, they turned around to look at Ling Han who was striding out.","This terrifying guy!","\"Ling Han!\"","\"Little Han!\"","Everyone exclaimed in shock. Who would have thought that Ling Han would actually be the victor?","\"You’ve grasped the key element of creation?\" the large black dog asked in excitement.","\"En.\" Ling Han nodded.","Instantly, everyone cheered.","A second tier Great Emperor, they finally had a second tier Great Emperor.","It was no wonder that even the old Divine Beast was no match for Ling Han. As a second tier Great Emperor, Ling Han, who had cultivated all the way here on his own, was definitely stronger than the Divine Beast that was created by heaven and earth.","In the distance, the old Divine Beast had also recovered. He glanced at Ling Han, then suddenly turned around and left.","He couldn’t win, and he still had to dig out the Cave of Death.","Though he had not been able to dig through it all this while, there was naturally an overflowing element of death in the Cave of Death. He had been in contact with it all this while.","Thus, as long as he unlocked the Cave of Death, he would definitely be able to grasp it before Ling Han did.","—He could condense the Sword of Death; this was clear proof."]},{"number":4883,"title":"Chapter 4883: Cave of Death opens","paragraphs":["\"Little Han, Ding Shu is dead!\" the little azure dragon said.","Ling Han frowned, \"How could—\"","He immediately thought of the sword that the old Divine Beast had stabbed over with, which exuded a powerful aura of death.","That’s right. The old Divine Beast had been digging out the Cave of Death all this while. Even if he had not dug to the end, his understanding of the fundamental element of death had definitely surpassed any other person.","Ding Shu!","Ling Han couldn’t help but think back to how he had become acquainted with Ding Shu. This was also the only Genesis World ruler that he had ever taken as a lackey.","Though this was more of a joke, it could not be denied that among the rulers of Genesis World, Ling Han and Ding Shu had the best relationship.","He was dead!","Ling Han took a deep breath, and instantly, his killing intent blazed.","Then let the old Divine Beast die in compensation.","\"Be careful!\" the empress hurriedly said. \"His sword can kill you!\"","Ling Han nodded, \"Don’t worry, I won’t let him stab me.\"","He did not need anyone’s help. He had already advanced into second tier, which was enough to suppress the old Divine Beast.","The Emperors were all invigorated. They had just struggled free from despair, yet were about to achieve victory in the grand finale. This great rise and fall was really too stimulating, that even their hearts could barely bear it.","Ling Han walked in front, and all the Great Emperors followed behind him.","Here, there was no such thing as seniority. They were all comrades-in-arms.","It wasn’t long before they arrived before the Cave of Death.","Ling Han was the first to enter, and the Great Emperors followed behind him.","After walking for a while, they saw the old Divine Beast digging with all its might ahead of them. Under the bombardment of the element of destruction, the rock layer slowly crumbled, falling at an overwhelmingly slow pace.","This was the Imperial Island, a core of heaven and earth that even a battle between Great Emperors wouldn’t be able to cause much damage to. Thus, it was naturally incredibly sturdy.","\"Old b@stard, come and accept your death!\" the large black dog called out. He had never minded using his powerful connections as an intimidation tactic.","The old Divine Beast ignored him completely, and merely continued to mine.","\"F***, you’re not giving Grandpa Dog any face. Little Han, charge!\" The large black dog waved his paw.","Ling Han smiled, \"All right!\"","He strode forward. Boom! His aura surged, and his battle prowess as a second tier surged.","The old Divine Beast finally had no choice but to turn around. He did not dare to ignore Ling Han, because the latter had the ability to kill a Great Emperor. Furthermore, after he had devoured Ding Shu’s corpse, he more or less knew the reason.","After all, even though Ding Shu had died, someone as powerful as a Great Emperor would still have some memories in his body.","It was a shame that Ding Shu hadn’t been able to create his own heaven and earth. Otherwise, he would have been able to take it for his own without much effort.","Thus, the old Divine Beast definitely didn’t dare to be severely wounded by Ling Han. If it lost the ability to resist, it would be absorbed into the heaven and earth within Ling Han’s body. At that time, it would be up to Ling Han to kill or torture it.","\"After this battle, there will be no more you in this world!\" Ling Han said calmly. It was only a very ordinary sentence, but it was filled with incomparable confidence.","\"Haha!\" The old Divine Beast merely responded with a cold smirk, as if he couldn’t care less. However, he had no choice but to admit internally that Ling Han really could do it.","He felt that this would weaken his aura, and immediately summoned the Sword of Death, then withdrew it.","This meant that he too had the ability to kill Ling Han.","But just taking it out and showing it was a kind of intimidation. Don’t think that you can force me too far, because you don’t know when I will draw my sword.","Ling Han didn’t waste any more words as he charged over.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","The two second tier Great Emperors battled fiercely, and Ling Han instantly gained the upper hand. However, the threat of the Sword of Death could not be ignored, causing Ling Han to hold back in his attacks.","Firstly, though the old Divine Beast was at a disadvantage, it would still need a very long time to be defeated, or even severely injured.","Furthermore, even if the old Divine Beast was really severely injured, would he dare to take him into the heaven and earth inside his body?","Wasn’t he afraid that the other party would unleash the Sword of Death?","If he delivered a sword strike inside his body, how could this be a joke?","Endless shockwaves of power surged out, and the two strongest Great Emperors naturally went all out. The three elements surged, forming a terrifying collision.","Visibly, the cave walls were actually slowly falling off. This speed was even faster than the full-power excavation of the old Divine Beast.","This!","The old Divine Beast had not expected that the collision of the three elements would actually have such an effect.","After being stunned for a moment, he was overjoyed.","If they continued to battle like this, it was extremely likely that the Cave of Death would be opened in the next tens of thousands of years. At that time, everyone would be able to come into contact with the essence of death. At that time, he would definitely be the first person to grasp the essence of death.","At that time, what would Ling Han be worth?","He would have grasped four key elements, and that was the number one person in the world!","If the old Divine Beast could think of it, Ling Han naturally could as well.","However, could Ling Han stop his attacks?","If he did not make a move, the old Divine Beast could still dig, though it would be slightly slower.","Though Ling Han had the advantage in strength, he was not strong enough to force the old Divine Beast out of the cave.","Just like when he was in third tier, his abilities were obviously inferior to the old Divine Beast, but the old Divine Beast was still unable to force him to jump into the Sea of Death, right?","Thus, Ling Han still maintained a terrifying offensive.","The opening of the Cave of Death needed time, and wouldn’t it be fine as long as they destroyed the old Divine Beast before that?","To say the least, Ling Han still had his pride.","Both of them would begin to comprehend the essence of death at the same time. He did not believe that he would be slower than the old Divine Beast.","Of course, this was the last resort. It was naturally best to deal with the old Divine Beast in advance.","The two Great Emperors battled fiercely. Though the other Great Emperors also pounced, even third tier Great Emperors like Jing Haoran and Shui Qingchang were unable to be of much help. They were easily sent flying left and right by the terrifying power.","And following their great battle, the Cave of Death also continued to fall, large areas of rock dispersing.","100 years, 500 years, 1000 years, and the battles were still continuing. Though it was still Ling Han who had the upper hand, the old Divine Beast was deliberately guiding Ling Han deeper into the cave.","Ling Han had no option but to face this attack.","He pursued the old Divine Beast, and the battle continued.","There were a few times that the old Divine Beast almost couldn’t hold on any longer. However, he summoned the Sword of Death, and successfully forced Ling Han to retreat, buying him a chance to catch his breath.","It should be known that for this kind of elite, as long as he could catch his breath, it was equivalent to being full of vigor again.","This was a second tier Great Emperor, after all. He was only a single step away from reaching the consummate level.","Five thousand years, ten thousand years, twenty thousand years!","An expression of delight appeared on the old Divine Beast’s face. Now, the element of death that had seeped out was practically increasing by tons. Thus, he was sure that it was definitely not too far away from the Pool of Death.","Haha, though he had been beaten for tens of thousands of years, as long as he grasped the essence of death, he would be the number one person in the world. He would be able to destroy the heavens and earth, and could freely control life and death. He was omnipotent.","From three to four, this was a qualitative change!","At this time, Ling Han also let go of his reservations.","Then let’s have a competition, and see who would be able to grasp the essence of death first!","Hong! Hong! Hong!","The cave wall was on the verge of collapse, and in another terrifying exchange, hong, the last rock also collapsed loudly, revealing a massive cave, with a pool placed in the middle.","The Cave of Death had opened!"]},{"number":4884,"title":"Chapter 4884: First Tier?","paragraphs":["\"Haha, hahahaha!\" The old Divine Beast faltered for a moment, then laughed loudly, \"Ling Han, I am the Heaven Devouring Beast, and possess more than one soul imprint. Thus, I do not have the worry of the elements rejecting one another at all.\"","\"In terms of grasping the key elements, you can’t compare to me at all!\"","\"Just you wait. When I have grasped the essence of death, I will kill all of them, one after another!\"","\"Don’t worry, I will leave you last, and admire your pained expression!\"","Ling Han shook his head, \"You speak too much nonsense!\"","His fists continued to attack, but on the other side, the essence of death surged out, and he was also appreciating.","What they were competing in now was who would be the first to grasp the key element of death.","The old Divine Beast didn’t speak any more nonsense. In fact, he wasn’t a chatterbox either, but who asked him to have been beaten too terribly by Ling Han in the past tens of thousands of years? This was something that had never happened before, making him feel sullen and resentful. No matter what, he had to throw out some mockery.","The two of them were still battling fiercely, but in the midst of the intense battle, they were also distracted, appreciating the key element of death.","This was very strange, because as they fought, their tempo would become slower and slower, but without waiting for them to stop, they would suddenly speed up their tempo, and once again, fight fiercely.","\"Go and help!\" Great Emperor Wu Ya said.","\"En!\" All the Great Emperors nodded. Even if they could not cause any damage to the old Divine Beast, they had to delay its rhythm of grasping the essence of death.","Furthermore, if the old Divine Beast was forced to use the Sword of Death, Ling Han would be able to move without any reservations and suppress the old Divine Beast.","All the Great Emperors surged forwards, unleashing their full battle prowess as they attacked the old Divine Beast.","In this place, everyone had an undying body. As long as he didn’t use a cheat code like the Sword of Death, what was there to be afraid of? Moreover, they were more willing for the old Divine Beast to use the Sword of Death. Then, Ling Han would really be safe.","The old Divine Beast roared in fury. Though none of the Great Emperors were a match for him, it was still annoying.","It was like a fly. Though it would not cause any damage, if it was buzzing around one’s ear, that would really be detestable.","Moreover, this fly was like a cockroach that couldn’t be killed no matter what, so it was naturally even more displeasing.","This greatly affected the old Divine Beast’s comprehension progress. It should be known that this was a race against time with Ling Han. Even if he thought that he had an advantage over Ling Han, he could not hold up to such a massive waste of time.","He was so furious that he really wanted to use the Sword of Death. However, once he used the Sword of Death, he would no longer be able to intimidate Ling Han. Furthermore, the Sword of Death could only kill one person. How many Great Emperors were there here?","It couldn’t be helped. No matter what, he had to swallow this anger. The Sword of Death had to be used as a deterrence, and once it was used, he could not use it a second time.","And because everyone was here, no one discovered that the fundamental elements were surging outwards from the four element caves, converging towards the center of the island.","This speed was not fast, but no one stopped it. After several decades, the four major elements finally joined together. There, a pillar of light that connected the heavens was propped up. No one knew why there was such a pillar of light here, yet it was still standing tall.","When the four major elements converged, boom, the whole pillar of light immediately trembled, and its colour was still changing.","Hong long long, the whole Imperial Island began to tremble as well, and it became more and more intense, as if an earthquake was about to happen.","This finally attracted the attention of Ling Han and the others.","What was going on?","\"I’ll go take a look!\" the large black dog volunteered. He spread his four legs and ran out of the cave.","However, before it could charge out, they heard a loud bang. Everyone felt their feet become unsteady, as pieces of rubble crashed down from the top.","With how powerful the Great Emperors were, even if these falling rocks were heavier than hundreds of millions of stars added together, they were still unable to wound them.","However, they were stunned. It should be known that the structure of the Primitive Abyss’s heaven and earth was incredibly sturdy, and the Imperial Island was several hundred times more freakish. Even a Great Emperor using his full might could not damage it.","But now?","This place was like an ordinary cave that had encountered an earthquake. Rocks fell, and it looked like it was about to collapse.","What in the world had happened?","\"Let’s go, all of us go out!\" Ling Han said. The Cave of Death had already been opened, so even if they left, they could still comprehend it, though the efficiency would be slightly lower.","However, what exactly was going on outside?","Everyone ran out one after another, and even the old Divine Beast was no exception.","How were they supposed to comprehend if they were struck by these boulders?","It should be known that this rock was equivalent to the weight of several hundred billion stars. Though it would not die if it landed on one’s body, it would definitely hurt.","How was one supposed to comprehend after suffering such a heavy blow?","It was better to come back after the cave collapsed. It would be easier to dig through the rubble, because it had already been shattered.","Thus, the group exited the Cave of Death.","The moment they exited, they saw that pillar of light that had changed colour.","\"We still haven’t dealt with the old Divine Beast, that b@stard. Don’t let him cause some trouble again!\" Jing Haoran murmured to himself.","Boom, the pillar of light suddenly erupted with a dazzling light. Even if everyone present was a Great Emperor, their eyes still hurt from the blinding light. It was as if this was the light that had appeared when the universe first split apart and exploded, which was incredibly dazzling.","Then, this pillar of light disappeared.","What replaced it was an incredibly powerful aura.","’What?’","All the Great Emperors felt their hearts tremble greatly. Even the old Divine Beast was slightly flustered, because this aura was even stronger than his.","How was this possible? How was this possible!","\"You jinx!\" The large black dog pointed at Jing Haoran.","Jing Haoran was just about to retort, but when he saw that everyone’s eyes were focused on him, he could only accept his fate and shut his mouth.","Ling Han also frowned. The strength of this aura was above even him.","However, he was already in the second tier, so how could there be an existence that was superior to him?","Unless!","\"An existence that has grasped the four fundamental elements!\" Ling Han said in a solemn voice.","Hiss!","How was that possible? Now, in terms of grasping the fundamental elements, the two strongest people were Ling Han and the old Divine Beast. However, they had only grasped three.","Where had this invincible elite come from?","Furthermore, where had he been previously?","He had slumbered on the island all this while, and it was only when the four caves of fundamantal element were opened that he was roused?","In front of everyone’s eyes, the place where the pillar of light had shot out had already become a deep pit, and at this moment, a person was slowly rising from the deep pit.","This was a man who looked to be in his thirties. He had a stocky build, and his black hair billowed wildly, exuding a rough aura.","However, that terrifying aura that surpassed second tier... originated from his body.","First tier!","A Great Emperor appeared. That was an existence that was superior to all else, and could easily kill another Great Emperor.","\"One is still fine, but two would be terrible,\" Jing Haoran murmured again.","Boom, another terrifying aura suddenly exploded, and a second person floated up from the deep pit.","This was a woman. Her red robes were as beautiful as blood, and her figure was indescribably perfect. However, she was wearing a black clown mask, which made her look extremely strange.","However, the aura she exuded was definitely not inferior to the sturdy man from before.","\"You really are a jinx!\" the large black dog said to Jing Haoran."]},{"number":4885,"title":"Chapter 4885: Invincible Great Emperor","paragraphs":["The pillar of light that had been standing in the center of Imperial Island for so long had actually collapsed!","How many trillions of years had it existed for?","Even the old Divine Beast didn’t know, because when he came here, this pillar of light was already here.","Perhaps, when the heaven and earth was first created, it had already existed, and had always been here.","Why was there a pillar of light here?","Some Great Emperors had been curious before, but they were unable to make heads or tails of the situation. This was because there was a terrifying amount of energy contained within the pillar of light. It was as if it had solidified, and even the Great Emperors were cut it, and investigate the truth behind the pillar.","And just how hard was the ground of the Imperial Island?","Just look at how the old Divine Beast dug so painstakingly at the Cave of Death. It was incredibly difficult.","—If the old Divine Beast had the energy to dig out the source of the pillar of light, then wouldn’t it be better to directly dig through the Cave of Death?","However, when everyone was already accustomed to the existence of this pillar of light, an accident happened.","The pillar of light crumbled.","If it was just a collapse, so be it. Everyone could accept that, but why had two people appeared?","An existence that surpassed second tier!","Hiss, could it be that at the beginning of the universe, there were already two first tier Great Emperors?","However, they had already reached the first tier, so they were definitely an invincible existence. Why were they suppressed under the pillar of light?","They must have been suppressed. Otherwise, they could not think of any other reason.","However, why had the pillar of light suddenly collapsed?","It had clearly existed for hundreds of millions of years, so how could it collapse just like that?","All of a sudden, everyone’s minds were filled with questions.","However, when the Empress in red appeared, a third person immediately appeared from within the cave.","This was an old man, dressed in a grey robe. He looked sanctimonious and kind, but the aura he exuded was not the slightest bit weak.","This was another invincible Great Emperor!","Heavens, three, three, three!","Everyone was speechless, and felt an indescribable fear.","The old Divine Beast was awesome enough, wasn’t it? With its own power, it had suppressed all the Great Emperors to the point that they did not even have a temper. If it was not for the fact that the Great Emperors had a flash of inspiration, or had carefully considered, and sent out the Stone of Life, which ultimately evolved into Ling Han, Ding Shu and the other Genesis World rulers, they would still be suppressed by the old Divine Beast.","However, three beings that were even more powerful than the old Divine Beast had appeared now.","If they too wanted to commit evil, who would be able to stop them?","\"There can’t be a fourth one, right?\" Jing Haoran murmured.","The moment these words left his mouth, he immediately encountered everyone’s hostility.","Don’t you know that you are a jinx?","Shut up!","Fortunately, there was no fourth invincible Great Emperor in the end.","\"We’ve finally come out!\" the Empress in red said in a sweet voice. She even stretched her arms, and her beautiful figure was completely displayed, causing one’s heart to beat wildly.","However, Ling Han could see very clearly that this Empress’s body... was not a physical body!","It was like an image, directly projected.","\"Just how many reincarnations has it been?\" The gruff and bold Great Emperor also said, \"Haha, we’ve come out much earlier than last time. We can have fun for a while.\"","\"Immeasurable Heavenly Venerate,\" the grey-robed elder mumbled.","The three Great Emperors were extremely arrogant, and it was as if they hadn’t seen Ling Han and the others at all.","\"Dare I ask how should I address you three friends?\" the Great Emperor Wu Ya asked.","No matter what, he had to find out if these three people were friends or foes.","The Empress in red ignored him. Instead, she stretched out her hand and beckoned, and an astonishing scene appeared. The four elements of heaven and earth materialized, and under her control, they took the form of an exquisite woman. Whether it was her figure or appearance, they were exactly the same as her.","Then, she fused with this elemental form, and instantly became a person.","Ling Han was astonished. This was because the Empress now gave him a feeling of solidity.","The four fundamental elements were the foundations of heaven and earth in the first place, so the body that they were used to construct naturally couldn’t be any more realistic.","\"Tsk, it’s been a long time since I’ve experienced this kind of genuine feeling.\" The Empress in red smiled beautifully, then turned to look at the Great Emperor Wu Ya, and said, \"My name is Star Moon. This old Daoist is called Boundless, and as for that gruff man, his name is Mysterious Clouds.\"","Though she had revealed the identities of the three of them, the Great Emperors did not have the slightest idea. They had never heard of these three beings before.","Meanwhile, Ling Han and the large black dog both started to complain. This Boundless Great Emperor was so narcissistic. The first thing he said was \"Boundless Heavenly Venerate\". Who would praise themselves like this?","\"Shameless,\" the large black dog said softly.","\"Extremely.\" Ling Han nodded.","However, they could only zone out for a moment. Three Great Emperors that were suspected to be of the first tier appeared out of thin air. This was practically... every single one of them could change the great power structure of the world.","\"Dare I ask why my three friends have suddenly appeared?\" Ling Han asked directly.","The Boundless Great Emperor and the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor ignored them. Instead, like the Star Moon Empress, they began to use the four elements to reform their bodies. At present, they existed in the form of soul imprints.","Theoretically speaking, soul imprints didn’t possess battle prowess. However, this didn’t apply to them. Their first-tier battle prowess hadn’t decreased in the slightest, and they were as powerful as could be.","Meanwhile, the Star Moon Empress propped up her pink cheeks, and looked like she was in deep thought. After a while, she finally said, \"This is a very big problem. Where should I start?\"","\"Why don’t we start from the beginning?\" Ling Han said.","\"All right,\" the Star Moon Empress said. \"After being trapped for so long, I can only talk to those two vulgar guys. I’m really about to die of boredom!\"","She was incredibly beautiful, and even this complaint was breathtaking and captivating.","Thankfully, the people here were all Great Emperors, and all of them had firm willpower. Otherwise, they would not have been able to hold on for millions and millions of years of hard battle.","\"This heaven and earth is beginning to collapse,\" the Star Moon Empress said first, then nodded, \"You all know, right?\"","\"Yes,\" Ling Han replied with a nod. The other Great Emperors didn’t say anything either. At this moment, they were all willing to listen for a while. Only then would they decide whether they were friend or foe.","The old Divine Beast did not speak either, revealing a pensive expression.","\"When heaven and earth is created and collapses, it is a cycle.\" The Star Moon Empress was in a good mood, and began to explain to everyone, \"However, do you guys know how many times this world has experienced this cycle?\"","This?","How could anyone possibly know?","Hold on?","Ling Han was astonished. Judging by the Empress’ words, this wasn’t the first time that heaven and earth had collapsed?","How could it be!","A shocking deduction rose up in his heart, yet he could not quite believe it.","\"As far as I know, there should be 34 times,\" the Star Moon Empress said.","When these words fell, all the Great Emperors inhaled sharply. How did she know?","\"Can you count them?\" the large black dog mumbled.","\"I really counted them,\" the Star Moon Empress said, smiling as she answered the large black dog’s question.","Er... The large black dog was instantly rendered speechless.","Then—","All the Great Emperors looked at the Star Moon Empress in shock, their eyes almost popping out of their heads.","\"That’s right. I am not from this era.\" Star Moon Empress shook her head with a smile. Then, she pointed at the two Great Emperors, Boundless and Mysterious Clouds, \"Neither are they.\"","Heavens!"]},{"number":4886,"title":"Chapter 4886: The Truth Since the Stacked Era","paragraphs":["Though the collapse had not ended, the Great Emperors all knew that once the world returned to a single point, all life would cease to exist.","Even Great Emperors could not withstand that terrifying pressure!","It should be known that the gravity fields of the Primitive Abyss were terrifying enough. Even Saints would be crushed to pieces. Only Pseudo-Emperors were able to resist.","On the Imperial Island, even Pseudo-Emperors could not hold up to it, and would have to wear Battle Armor.","Then, if all of this was compressed into a single point, an endlessly small point, just how terrifying would the pressure be?","Even a Great Emperor wouldn’t be able to withstand it.","Thus, the Lords of Death were so proactive in destroying the two realms. What they sought was immortality, and they also wanted to eliminate any future troubles on their path to immortality. Otherwise, when the heaven and earth returned to its original point, they would be crushed.","Of course, they had fallen for the old Divine Beast’s trick. The clash of the two Realms of Yin and Yang would not allow them to attain immortality, or improve their abilities further. It could only cause a great commotion on the Imperial Island, and cause the Cave of Death to open.","However, the Star Moon Empress actually said that she had experienced the replacement of heaven and earth 34 times. What kind of concept was that?","She had survived!","No wonder she didn’t have a physical body when she appeared previously. Thinking about it, it made sense. The entire heaven and earth had shrunk to the point of its origin, so what kind of body could withstand it?","However, she was able to make her soul mark indestructible and undamaged. It appeared in this era, which showed how terrifying she was.","\"Heaven and earth, creation and collapse, a cycle, is called a Stacked Era,\" the Star Moon Empress continued. Then, she smiled slightly, \"Oh, that’s right. I was the one who invented the term Stacked Era.\"","No matter what it was, it was just a name.","\"Grasping the four key elements would allow one to resist the heavy pressure of heaven and earth retracting back to its original point, and ensure that the soul imprint would not be destroyed?\" Ling Han asked.","\"Not bad, not bad.\" The Star Moon Empress clapped her hands, \"However, counting through thirty-four Stacked Eras, only a mere three people have managed to accomplish this.\"","It was her, the Boundless Great Emperor, and the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor.","\"I’m the first,\" the Star Moon Empress said with a smile. Her smile was dazzling, and she didn’t possess the austerity of a Great Emperor at all.","However, who dared to underestimate her?","This was a first tier Great Emperor, and the first one in history at that!","\"However, even if one has grasped the four fundamental elements, the physical body would still be unable to resist the pressure of the heaven and earth, and would be forcefully shattered at the end of the Stacked Era.\" The Star Moon Empress sighed, \"Furthermore, even if the heaven and earth has just been created, the soul imprint would only be trapped here, and become the slave of the heaven and earth.\"","Even if one was as strong as a first tier, they would still be unable to truly oppose heaven and earth.","—That was because the power of the Great Emperor originated from the heaven and earth, and the heaven and earth was the source of their power, so how could they resist it?","\"Unless—\" The Star Moon Empress paused.","The large black dog continued, \"Unless the caves of the four elements are all opened?\"","\"That’s right.\" This empress began applauding again, \"The heaven and earth is made up of four elements. When the caves of the elements are fully opened, it would form a violent collision. Hence, we would be able to come into being.\"","\"You guys are really not bad, opening the Four Elements Caves so quickly.\"","\"Mysterious Clouds, Boundless, can they be ranked first?\"","She turned to ask the other two invincible Great Emperors.","\"They can’t be ranked first. The seventeenth Stacked Era is even faster. The heaven and earth still haven’t begun to collapse!\" the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor said stiffly.","\"Oh.\" The Star Moon Empress nodded, and showed an apologetic expression, \"It has been too long, so it is inevitable that my memories would be a little chaotic.\"","This wasn’t a matter of it being too long. Rather, it had been endlessly long ago.","A normal Great Emperor would only be able to live for ten million years. Even if they obtained the Great Herb from the Primitive Abyss, they could live for a second life, at most, for twenty million years.","All the Great Emperors had battled here for hundreds of millions and millions of years, but at most, it had not even been half a Stacked Era.","But as for the Star Moon Empress... she had lived for 34 Stacked Eras.","This was really indescribably ancient.","As Ling Han listened, he frowned slightly. That was because why did he feel that this method seemed familiar?","’Oh!’","Wasn’t this how the old Divine Beast had deceived the Lords of Death?","The result of the clash between the two Realms would only open the caves of elements of the Imperial Island!","Hold on, now that the caves of elements had been opened, by the looks of it, the people who would benefit the most were these three invincible Great Emperors.","This... was it a coincidence?","At this time, the old Divine Beast also looked confused.","He wasn’t stupid!","\"In some Stacked Eras, right until the end of the Stacked Era, the caves of elements have not been completely opened. We can only be trapped for another Stacked Era.\" The Star Moon Empress shook her head, a desolate expression on her face.","This could be seen as the entire lifespan of heaven and earth, yet they were all trapped in the form of souls. Just how torturous was this?","Even a Great Emperor... would probably go crazy.","A vigilant expression appeared on Ling Han’s face. Who knew what a crazy person would do?","\"This old Divine Beast... does it have anything to do with you guys?\" he suddenly asked.","The Star Moon Empress glanced at Ling Han, and showed a hint of praise, \"Not bad, not bad. You are a smart person!\"","She seemed to like saying ’not bad’, was it a catchphrase?","However, her affirmation caused the expressions of the Great Emperors to change drastically.","The Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor frowned, \"Why are you speaking nonsense with these people?\"","\"After being trapped for so long, it’s rare to see something alive, so don’t you want to say a few more words?\" the Star Moon Empress countered.","The Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor did not speak further. The Boundless Great Emperor, on the other hand, had a good temper, and merely stood at the sidelines, looking benevolent.","Being called something by her, all the Great Emperors gritted their teeth slightly. However, firstly, she was really strong enough, and secondly, they still wanted to know the answer. Thirdly, if they reasoned with her, wouldn’t it be even worse if she admitted that they were nothing?","\"Bullsh*t!\" The old Divine Beast was the first to jump up.","The Star Moon Empress ignored him, and said, \"In the last two Stacked Eras, we were especially unlucky. No one could open the caves of elements to release us. Thus, when it was this Stacked Era, the three of us finally came up with a solution.\"","\"Taking advantage of the opening of the heaven and earth, when a crack was revealed, we sent out a seed.\"","\"As expected, this seed did not disappoint us. Following the call of our hearts, the seed returned here, and began to excavate the caves of elements.\"","This!","Hearing this, all the Great Emperors were rendered speechless with shock.","After such a long time, the old Divine Beast was actually paving the way for someone else!","\"Grandpa Dog knew it!\" The large black dog slapped his thigh, and exclaimed in excitement, \"How could a guy that doesn’t even have a name be the final great villain?\"","The old Divine Beast’s expression instantly turned dark. Then, he began to reflect deeply on his actions.","It seemed to be true... From the moment he was born, he had a clear goal. He would first lay low, then go and devour the corpses of those old dead Divine Beasts. After he had reached Great Accomplishment level, he came to the Primitive Abyss, where he began his life’s work.","Why did he have to put his life on the line?","All this while, his aim had been to grasp the four key elements, and become the strongest in the world. However, what was the purpose of becoming the strongest?","He had never considered this.","For this one goal, he had worked so hard for so many years?","Now that he thought about it, his beast life was really too tragic."]},{"number":4887,"title":"Chapter 4887: Temporarily at peace","paragraphs":["All the Great Emperors couldn’t help but sigh.","They had fought so hard here for so long, and they were actually only fighting a tough battle with the lackey of another?","This, they were really speechless.","But could this be blamed on the Star Moon Empress and the others?","Their purpose was to escape, and had not committed any heinous crime.","To say the least, if it was the Great Emperors that were trapped, would they also think of this method to escape?","The question was, how were the three invincible Great Emperors going to play next?","\"I don’t believe it!\" The old Divine Beast looked like it was about to collapse.","First, he had lost to Ling Han, and now, he was told that he was actually just a chess piece of someone else. This was a huge blow to him.","For a long time, he had been the number one person in the world — or beast. In any case, it did not matter. Even if he was being ganged up on by the Great Emperors, he was still incredibly carefree, and was completely unafraid.","That was because he was strong!","But now, he was no longer the number one elite. In fact, he couldn’t even be ranked in the top three, and it also proved that he was actually just a puppet. He thought that he was doing something great, but in the end, he was serving someone else. Furthermore, he was so stupid that he thought too highly of himself.","F***, he was a Great Emperor, not a miner!","\"The Heaven Devouring Beast has only appeared once in history. Thankfully, I still remember a sliver of its mark of life, which allowed me to create it,\" the Star Moon Empress said calmly. \"This kind of extraordinary beast would cause even heaven and earth to feel wariness.\"","Indeed, being able to devour the corpses of other Great Emperors and transform them into his own Mystical Powers, this was indeed extraordinary.","Ling Han asked calmly, \"Then what are the three Great Emperors planning to do next? Do you want to destroy the world?\"","\"Destroy the world?\" The Star Moon Empress laughed delicately. Her beautiful figure was like a willow in the wind, lightly trembling and swaying, filled with beauty.","She shook her head, \"It wasn’t easy for us to escape. If we destroy this heaven and earth, what fun would there be left?\"","Hearing these words, all the Great Emperors felt their hearts relax.","If these three Great Emperors committed evil, no one would be able to stop them.","Because they were existences that had cultivated the four elements, and were first tier Great Emperors, even if Ling Han and the old Divine Beast joined forces, they would still be no match.","However, Ling Han frowned.","Because in the words of the empress, destroying the world was only a matter of whether it was fun or not.","Such an important matter was only a matter of fun for her?","This kind of thought was too dangerous.","Ling Han knew that these three invincible Great Emperors had seen many replacements of heaven and earth. Thus, to them, so what if they destroyed the heavens and earth? They would just wait for the next reincarnation.","However, Ling Han was unable to accept this.","This world was too important to him.","His family and friends were all in this heaven and earth. If they died, and Ling Han had successfully cultivated the four elements, being able to continuously experience the change of heaven and earth like the Star Moon Empress and the others, what meaning was there to it?","However, now was definitely not the time to question, and become hostile with the three invincible Great Emperors.","If they became hostile, they would definitely die.","Since these three had no plans to destroy the world at present, Ling Han could also accumulate his abilities first. When he too advanced into the first tier, he would be qualified to match them.","\"Then let me first congratulate the three of you on escaping.\" Ling Han smiled, then pointed, \"We still have some debts to settle with this old Divine Beast, and hope that the three of you would not interfere either.\"","\"Brat!\" The Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor spoke up, \"Are you issuing commands to us?\"","Ling Han was neither servile nor overbearing, and said, \"This old b@stard killed my friend, I want revenge!\"","The old Divine Beast rolled its eyes. Just think, he was once the strongest being in this world, and he was actually called the old b@stard. How could he not be happy?","\"This is our pet,\" the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor said haughtily. \"Even if you want to beat a dog, you have to see who is the owner first. Are you planning to become enemies with us?\"","Ling Han paused for two seconds before replying, \"I wouldn’t dare!\"","Although he said he didn’t dare, his eyes were resolute and his brows were raised, exuding an unyielding aura.","The Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor’s killing intent instantly soared. What kind of existence was he?","He was truly the strongest in the world, and had stood for several Stacked Eras. Furthermore, after being trapped for a long time, all his hot-bloodedness and passion had been worn away, leaving behind only violence.","\"Hehe, what is there to argue about with a little kid?\" The Star Moon Empress stretched out a hand to stop him.","She had the most authority among the three of them. Thus, though the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor humphed coldly, he no longer had the intention to make a move.","The old Divine Beast was extremely defiant. He was a second tier Great Emperor!","\"What is it? Are you still not convinced?\" The Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor stretched out a hand, and grabbed the old Divine Beast.","Hiss, the old Divine Beast that had once been invincible was actually not even qualified to dodge or parry.","There was a gulf of 10,000 levels between the first tier and the second tier!","Cultivating the four elements to the consummate level was a qualitative change. Even if heaven and earth retreated to the original point, they still could not be killed, which showed how powerful it was.","\"Let’s go. We should go and take a look at this beautiful world,\" the Star Moon Empress said, and was the first to fly out.","The Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor grabbed onto the old Divine Beast, and left quickly without even looking at them.","\"Boundless Great Emperor!\" The Boundless Great Emperor had clearly left, but after taking a step, he suddenly turned his head, and gave a shout. Instantly, a wave rippled out towards Ling Han and the others.","Pu! Pu! Pu!","Instantly, aside from Ling Han, Jing Haoran, and Shui Qingchang, the other Great Emperors all threw up blood madly, feeling as if all the bones in their bodies had been shattered.","Even Ling Han and the others were pale, feeling indescribably uncomfortable.","Only now did everyone know that even though this Boundless Great Emperor looked benevolent, he was the most temperamental and merciless.","In this attack, the Boundless Great Emperor had used the essence of death. Though it was not a very large amount, it still caused every single Great Emperor to be enshrouded in an air of death, which was enough to torment them for a very, very long time.","With the appearance of such a temperamental Great Emperor, what kind of calamity would be caused?","Most importantly, to say nothing of the fact that Ling Han and the others were unable to leave, even if they could leave, would they be able to stop them?","Now, each of them had surpassed the limit of their lifespans, and had the support of the element of life here, but once they left, they would naturally die immediately.","At this moment, everyone’s eyes were focused on Ling Han.","Only Ling Han would have the chance to cultivate the four elements, and battle those three strongest Great Emperors.","Who would have thought that after battling hundreds of billions of enemies, that was actually just a lackey?","This kind of understanding caused a great blow to the Great Emperors. Just think, which one of them had not ruled over their own era, yet they were actually unable to deal with even someone’s dog?","This was far too displeasing.","Ling Han took a deep breath. Though the Star Moon Empress was the leader of the three of them, she seemed to be the easiest to deal with, and the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor was ruthless, and the Boundless Great Emperor was temperamental. From the attack he delivered just before he left, it was clear that this person’s temperament was extremely sinister.","More importantly, if a great conflict really broke out, the Star Moon Empress may not be able to stop the two of them.","They were all Great Emperors, so who would be weaker than the other?","\"I want to cultivate in seclusion!\" Ling Han said. He entered the Cave of Death and moved the rocks away. He then sat beside the pond.","Of course, he didn’t dare to enter the pool. That was the Pool of Death, and it was filled with the essence of death. Even if Ling Han’s body had the essence of life, he would still be severely injured by this thing. If he came into contact with it too much, he would die.","After all, the element of life in his body was limited, and he was still unable to grow endlessly."]},{"number":4888,"title":"Chapter 4888: Comprehending the essence of death","paragraphs":["Ling Han felt a strong sense of urgency.","Who knew what the Star Moon Empress would do? There were three Great Emperors that had been trapped for more than two Stacked Eras, so it was possible that they would go crazy.","Moreover, to such Great Emperors, even if heaven and earth returned to its origin, they would still be unable to die. At that time, they would be trapped again.","Perhaps they could still appear in the next Stacked Era, or perhaps not. Thus, they had even more reason to be crazy.","This world... was only a toy to them, and also a cage for them.","Thus, so what if they damaged this world? After several years, the heaven and earth would regenerate, and everything would only repeat itself.","Would such Great Emperors take pity on the common people?","Wasn’t this a joke?","Thus, Ling Han had to hurry up and stop the three Great Emperors before they destroyed the world.","What he could do was to grasp the essence of death.","The Star Moon Empress and the others had been overconfident. They had only thought that Ling Han had only \"simply\" grasped the four elements. They would never have imagined that Ling Han had already constructed his own heaven and earth within his body. He was only missing the single element of death.","Once he took this step, Ling Han would be equivalent to a different heaven and earth.","It was never the Great Emperor that could stand against the heaven and earth, but rather another heaven and earth!","From the fact that Ling Han had crushed the old Divine Beast, it could be seen that the true way to go was for him to have such a grasp of the fundamental elements.","If he was given time, he could do it.","However, how was one supposed to grasp the essence of death?","The first key element was relatively easy to grasp, and the subsequent elements would be difficult. With the repulsion of the key elements, the group of Great Emperors were completely at a loss.","Only the old Divine Beast had devoured countless souls, and had more than one spiritual mark in his body, which allowed him to continue comprehending the fundamental elements without being affected. Then, it was Ling Han, Jing Haoran, and the other Genesis World rulers. Because they had long since grasped the fundamental element of destruction, they could achieve success in a roundabout manner.","And when it came to the second tier, only Ling Han had managed to cultivate the element of creation by relying on the repulsion of the elements of life and destruction.","However, how was he supposed to grasp the fourth key element?","Previously, when Ling Han had been battling fiercely with the old Divine Beast, he had been thinking about it. However, he had never had a clue.","From a certain aspect, the appearance of the Star Moon Empress and the others had actually helped Ling Han out of his predicament. Otherwise, it was really possible that the old Divine Beast would be the first to grasp the key element of death.","Of course, Ling Han belonged to the category of characters who had more explosive power the greater the pressure they were under. Perhaps, in that kind of situation, his brain would run wild, and he would come up with a solution.","There was no point talking about this now. Ling Han calmed his mind and continued to comprehend.","Tens of thousands of years had passed, and Ling Han had no clue at all.","He was not in a rush. It was difficult to grasp the fundamental elements in the first place, what more when he now had to reach consummate level.","Another three million years passed, and Ling Han had already tried out all the usual methods.","It did not work.","He came to this conclusion.","He couldn’t help but wonder, ’How did the Star Moon Empress and the others succeed?’","After some thought, he set this question aside.","How others did it was their own business.","And after at least thirty-four Stacked Eras, only three people had managed to grasp all four key elements, which showed how difficult it was.","Since the heaven and earth had birthed an existence like the Divine Beasts, who knows, there may be someone that could have two souls in one body?","Er, he said he didn’t want to, but why was he thinking about it again?","Ling Han forcefully suppressed this thought, and focused his attention on himself.","Ordinary methods were completely impossible.","Then, how should he take the unconventional path?","Ling Han fell into deep thought.","Another million years later, he decided to take the risk.","Since he wanted to grasp the key element, why not just touch it directly?","In the outside world, this could not be done, because the essence of death could not be seen or touched, and could only be sensed. However, in this place, the essence of death had taken solid form, and fused into the pool.","Ling Han walked over and touched it with his hand.","Boom, instantly, endless power of death assaulted, wanting to destroy his vitality.","Thankfully, Ling Han had only come into contact with a little bit of it. Using the three major elements to resist, this was not enough to kill him.","This method was feasible!","Ling Han’s idea was very simple, and that was to use the large amount of element of death here to resist the three elements in his body. Then, when he went to comprehend the element of death, he would not encounter any obstruction.","This was very, very difficult.","He had to maintain an absolute balance. Otherwise, if there was less element of death drawn in, those three elements would still disturb him, and if there was too much, it would directly destroy his vitality.","This was really a situation of neither advancing nor retreating. He had to maintain an incredibly fragile balance.","And just like that, as he walked on the edge of the cliff, Ling Han began to comprehend the essence of death.","Progress was slow.","There were quite a few times that Ling Han made mistakes, and almost led to a great disaster. There was even one time that he was completely disfigured. Thankfully, the empress and Hu Niu discovered it in time and sent him to the Cave of Life, where he lay for a whole thirty thousand years before he finally recovered.","The moment he recovered, Ling Han went to the Cave of Death again.","When the other Great Emperors found out, they decided to take the risk and make an attempt as well.","They had all grasped the essence of life. Thus, they also possessed the ability to resist the essence of death. However, they were extremely fragile, and would be killed if they were the slightest bit careless.","However, none of them were afraid.","Now, they didn’t even have to fight the old Divine Beast anymore. Could it be that they would have to wait here until the day the heaven and earth returned to square one?","What difference did this have to prison?","They would go crazy.","Furthermore, Great Emperors all had great intelligence, great decisiveness, and would definitely not hesitate to take a gamble.","In the past, they had not had the chance, but now, Ling Han had pushed open a door for them.","Time passed, and 70,000 years later, a Great Emperor died.","It was a newly promoted Great Emperor, Luo Yang, the son of the Heavenly Saint Emperor. He had been eroded by the power of death, and had been sent to the Cave of Life. It was useless, as the soul imprint had long since dimmed.","However, this did not affect the Great Emperors in the slightest.","One million years, ten million years, 100 million years!","When time had reached more than 960 million years, Ling Han finally attained a breakthrough, and the other Great Emperors also saw the light of dawn gradually, but they still needed time to truly master it.","Inside Ling Han’s body, the essence of death turned into a trickle that was converging in his small heaven and earth.","However, this was still extremely fragile, and could not resist the three major elements. Thus, Ling Han was still stimulating even more element of death to enter, and continued to resist the three major elements.","Another 100 million years passed, and the inside of Ling Han’s body had changed completely in appearance.","His life force that had been growing madly all this while was now under control, and he was experiencing normal aging and death.","There was life and death, beginning and ending. This was a perfect balance and cycle.","Realization dawned on him. Why could the Genesis World only be called a small world? That was because Celestial Kings and above could attain immortality. This did not align with Dao.","Weng, his eyes suddenly snapped open. Four-coloured light flickered, penetrating through the heaven and earth.","Boom, a powerful aura surged out of his body, indescribably terrifying.","First tier!","After so many years, he had finally successfully grasped the four elements, and became the fourth person in countless Stacked Eras to have grasped the four elements.","Furthermore, unlike the Star Moon Empress and the others, Ling Han had not only grasped the four elements, he had even developed another heaven and earth in his body."]},{"number":4889,"title":"Chapter 4889: Flawless consummate level","paragraphs":["After entering the Primitive Abyss for close to a billion years, Ling Han finally reached the limit of martial arts.","Consummate level of the four elements. He had constructed his own heaven and earth, which was perfect and flawless.","He was the embodiment of heaven and earth.","Ling Han had a feeling that if he were to fight with the old Divine Beast now, he would be able to crush it with a single finger.","There were tens of thousands of third tiers separating the first and second tiers.","And what made Ling Han even happier was the fact that there was an endless supply of element of life in his body now, and he could already regenerate them on his own. The collision of the four elements was not destructive, but rather endless.","Having formed his own heaven and earth, he naturally could produce the four main elements on his own.","This meant that not only could he leave the Imperial Island, but others could as well.","What did he have to fear now that his lifespan had dried up?","He was a human-shaped supply station for the element of life!","Ling Han swept an eye over them. Most of the Great Emperors were still cultivating in seclusion, so he did not disturb them either. Instead, he began to stroll by the coast.","In fact, he had even entered into the great ocean. The main element of death was no longer the fatal assassin, and was like an ordinary wave crashing down on him, incredibly gentle.","To him, there were no more dangerous places in this world.","—He was the heaven and earth , and could overwhelm everything else, so what danger would there be?","After cultivating the four fundamental elements, one would possess the ability to transcend the heaven and earth. Thus, the Star Moon Empress and the others could ignore the limits of their lifespans, and traverse one Stacked Era after another. However, they did not have their own heaven and earth, but lived in this heaven and earth, yet were destined to be suppressed again.","The passing of one Stacked Era after another was a torture to their immortality.","Moreover, they couldn’t die even if they wanted to. The heaven and earth couldn’t kill them, and neither could they themselves.","This kind of life... it would be strange if they weren’t crazy.","Ling Han continued to familiarize himself with the use of the four elements. Mastering them was one matter, but how to completely unleash their might was another matter.","The three first tier Great Emperors had been stuck at this cultivation level for far, far too long, so their mastery of the four fundamental elements was definitely far superior to his. Thus, even though he had the advantage of heaven and earth, he still couldn’t be blindly confident.","Of course, the three of them definitely wouldn’t be able to kill him. They had also grasped four key elements, and that meant invincibility.","On the other hand, Ling Han could kill them.","Why?","That was because as long as the three Emperors were dragged into his heaven and earth, this would be another world for the three of them. The four elements they had grasped would slowly be exhausted, and ultimately, they would be killed by him.","After waiting for another seven million years, the Great Emperors gradually came out of seclusion.","A great many Great Emperors had advanced into third tier, but there were also a great many that had not managed to take this step. They were basically Great Emperors that had broken through in the Primitive Abyss, and lacked too much accumulation.","After all, those who could become Great Emperors in the outside world all possessed great fortune.","Ling Han related his thoughts of leaving, and obtained the agreement of a great many Great Emperors.","After having left for so long, they all wanted to return to see what that universe had become.","However, there were still a great many Great Emperors that expressed that they wanted to stay on the Imperial Island. They had not yet comprehended the essence of death, and wanted to continue.","There were also some third tier Great Emperors that were going to stay behind. They were all maniacs of martial arts, and wanted to break through to second tier.","For example, Jing Haoran and Shui Qingchang also decided to stay behind. They were too far behind Ling Han, and wanted to catch up to him.","However, they hadn’t formed their own heaven and earth, so it was almost impossible for them to grasp the third key elemtn.","They had all come from the Stone of Life, yet Ling Han had stolen all of their fortune.","Survival of the fittest; this was also the way of nature.","Everyone set out, leaving the island.","To say nothing of the fact that Ling Han was leading the way, even if he wasn’t, this Sea of Death wasn’t much, because everyone had basically grasped the key element of death.","Of course, even if they had grasped the essence of death, they did not dare to come into direct contact with it for too long. That would still result in death.","Of course, this was unless they could reach Ling Han’s level and reach the consummate level of the four elements.","Ling Han gifted them some element of life, allowing the Great Emperors to maintain their lifespans.","Each portion could allow the Great Emperors to live for as long as 100,000 years. Thus, there was absolutely no need for them to worry.","—Even if they went to the outside world, how long would it take for the Great Emperors to return to the Imperial Island?","After exiting the Sea of Death, the storm of heaven and earth appeared once more.","However, Ling Han merely waved his hand lightly, and the storm of heaven and earth suddenly disappeared.","This was the power of a Great Emperor!","Even the Great Emperors couldn’t help but click their tongues in wonder and admit their inferiority.","Because they were walking straight ahead, their speed was very fast. In less than half a day, they had already exited the Primitive Abyss.","Yi?","Everyone was shocked, because the Primitive Abyss was incredibly close to the borders of heaven and earth, but now?","The surroundings were dotted with stars, as if they had appeared in the centre of the universe.","What the hell!?","\"Let’s split up and take a look,\" the Great Emperors all said. Initially, they had also planned to separate after leaving the Imperial Island.","The Great Emperors all left, while Ling Han nodded. Even if he had left the Imperial Island, he could still grasp the four key elements at any time.","No wonder the Star Moon Empress and the others could leave without any reservations, and need not worry about the problem of their lifespans.","In truth, this kind of connection was active. The four elements surging into his body was like instinct.","Thus, theoretically speaking, even if the Star Moon Empress and the others wanted to commit suicide, they would not be able to do so.","Ling Han casually grabbed a ball of element of life and inserted it into the large black dog’s body.","\"Little Han, what are you doing?\" the large black dog asked curiously.","\"Oh, an experiment,\" Ling Han said casually.","\"Pei, don’t experiment on Grandpa Dog!\" the large black dog hurriedly spat.","Ling Han smiled, and stretched out a hand. A small dot of light appeared in the palm of his hand, which then slowly became larger, and actually turned into a piece of metal!","\"Origin Gold!\" the large black dog immediately exclaimed in astonishment. He recognized what it was.","The empress and the others were also astonished. How had Ling Han suddenly created a piece of Origin Gold?","\"I’m my own heaven and earth, so creating Origin Gold is only a matter of thought for me,\" Ling Han said with a smile. Moreover, his heaven and earth was born from this world, so the two were completely similar.","The large black dog snatched the Origin Gold from him, then immediately stuffed it back, and said, \"Little Han, you directly forge it into a tool for Grandpa Dog, and upgrade it to become the Transcendent Weapon!\"","Ling Han smiled, \"You really have a lot of requests.\"","\"Those who are capable do more work!\" The large black dog was extremely shameless.","Ling Han didn’t refuse. With a thought, the grade of the Origin Gold began to increase.","The so-called Metal of Creation was a form of the element of creation, so he naturally had no difficulty at all.","\"What form do you want—\" Ling Han was just about to ask the large black dog what shape the Transcendent Weapon would be made into, but when he saw the perverted expression on the large black dog’s face, he resolutely didn’t ask further.","A pair of shining golden iron underwear quickly took form.","\"Take it!\" Ling Han tossed the Transcendent Weapon to the large black dog. He then placed his hand on his forehead. In the future, he definitely wouldn’t admit that this Transcendent Weapon was created by him.","How humiliating!","Meanwhile, the large black dog happily put on his iron underwear. Then, he began to refine it, turning it into the true Transcendent Weapon. Otherwise, it would only be a Spirit Tool.","\"You guys have a share too.\" Ling Han nodded at the empress and the others. They were already eager."]},{"number":4890,"title":"Chapter 4890: The world has changed","paragraphs":["It didn’t take long before everyone possessed a Transcendent Weapon.","For Ling Han, this was only a matter of time.","Unlike the large black dog, the little azure dragon and the others only required the Transcendent Weapon to be practical — of course, the so-called practicality of the large black dog was not recognized by anyone at all, but in the case of the empress and the others, they had many more requests.","Firstly, it had to be aesthetically pleasing!","This was the top priority.","Ling Han simply chose to forge a Battle Armor for each of them. Because he was too familiar with the women, the Battle Armor he forged naturally fit them extremely well, outlining every single curve of their bodies.","Beautiful!","This made the women very happy. Each of them gave Ling Han a sweet kiss.","\"Hey, hey, hey. Do you want us to leave first?\" the large black dog asked with a smile.","\"Is one day enough?\" the little azure dragon asked with a smile. He and the large black dog were a perfect team.","The large black dog immediately glared at him, \"Are you looking down on Little Han? What need is there for a day? At most, three minutes!\"","\"Hahaha!\" The little azure dragon instantly roared with laughter.","Peng! Peng!","The empress and Hu Niu both lashed out, kicking the large black dog and little azure dragon into oblivion.","Ling Han smiled faintly, \"Come, let’s go and take a look too.\"","When a Great Emperor traveled, crossing the galaxy was only the matter of a single thought. Hence, they had only taken a single step, and landed on a planet.","At this time, the large black dog and little azure dragon had also returned.","Everyone sized up this star, their expressions filled with surprise.","This was definitely a newly born star. It had only existed for eight million years, and everyone was very sure of this fact. However, this star was filled with all kinds of living creatures.","Ordinarily, eight million years of evolution was completely insufficient to create the most primitive life forms, but in this place, there were already cultivators here, and the strongest among them was Saint-level.","Thus, how could this not be shocking?","Was it related to the collapse of the universe?","No, that was definitely impossible.","\"It’s those three!\" Everyone immediately reached a unanimous conclusion.","It had been about a billion years since those three invincible Great Emperors had left the Primitive Abyss. In this heaven and earth, it would have been about ten million years. Thus, it made sense that they had created the stars here after coming out.","Only those Great Emperors who had grasped the four fundamental elements could create things out of thin air, and only then could they bestow life, and only then could they allow a world to evolve to this extent in such a short period of time.","\"Walk slowly, and take a look slowly.\"","Ling Han said, and took the lead.","They entered into a city. There were many people here, and cultivators ran rampant.","\"This is your girl?\" They were walking on the streets, and had not thought that a sturdy man would suddenly appear out of nowhere. His eyes were fixed on the empress, but these words were directed at Ling Han.","Ling Han gave the empress a look, telling her to calm down. Then, he smiled and said, \"That’s right.\"","\"Let me have her!\" the brawny man said, his expression self-righteous, as if he was just saying something very ordinary.","Ling Han shook his head, \"Why should I let you have her?\"","\"If you don’t, I’ll beat you to death!\" the brawny man said. True enough, he moved directly, waving his hand at Ling Han.","He was merely a Cauldron Forging Tier.","Since when had Cauldron Forging Tiers become so arrogant?","Though Ling Han and the others had completely returned to simplicity, and their auras were not obvious, even Saints could not possibly tell that they were extraordinary, the problem was that a Cauldron Forging Tier was only a minor character on a planet that had Saints.","A minor character actually dared to commit a crime in public, and snatch someone else’s wife?","What kind of world was this?","Ling Han tapped out a finger, and pa, this sturdy man turned into a shower of blood.","Such a decisive attack instantly intimidated those around them who were also eager to give it a try, and they did not dare to make the slightest move.","They were violent and lawless, but they were not so stupid that they would still attack even if they knew that they would definitely die.","However, after Ling Han and the others had walked for a while, they encountered some idiots who wanted to snatch the empress and the others by force. In fact, even the large black dog was targeted by others, and they wanted to capture him to become their pet beast.","This infuriated the large black dog, and he immediately aimed his butt at him. The Transcendent Weapon unleashed a dazzling glow, causing the person to vanish into thin air.","And along the way, Ling Han saw people openly robbing and killing people, kidnapping women, and even committing rape in public.","There was no order, only chaos, and only elites could do as they liked.","What kind of world was this?","Weng, a powerful aura suddenly appeared. Then, an elder appeared. Peng, peng, peng! The aura swept over, and many people had no time to escape at all. Instantly, they were crushed into pieces, crushed to death on the spot.","This was a Saint.","This Saint stared at the large black dog’s black dog. To be more exact, he was staring at his underpants.","He had been attracted by the light emitted by the Saint Tool, and that was why he had moved. And with his insight, he could tell with a single glance that this pair of iron underwear was extraordinary.","Saint Tool!","He thought, and couldn’t help as his greed blazed.","However, he was also a little conflicted internally. Which b@stard was so reckless to actually forge Saintly Material into underpants?","In the future, when he encountered powerful enemies, he would fight them, and in order to conclude the battle once and for all, he would suddenly summon the Saint Tool. When his opponent saw that it was actually a pair of iron underwear, would he burst out laughing?","However, since he had encountered such a Saint Tool, how could he possibly miss out on it?","\"Hand over the Saint Tool, and I can spare your life,\" the Saint said calmly. It was as if he were doing them a favor.","The large black dog flew into a thunderous rage, \"Shameless old b@stard, you actually want to peel Grandpa Dog’s underpants? You old b@stard, old and indecent, old and undying, old and corrupt...\"","It was the king of verbal abuse, and it was about to curse in a single breath, causing even that Saint to be dumbfounded.","Heavens, so he could actually curse like this!","As it turned out, insults also had such terrifying might, making him want to throw up blood!","—Ordinary verbal battles naturally did not have such might, but the large black dog was different. It was presently a Great Emperor. Though it was still only in fourth tier, with a word from the Great Emperor, heaven and earth would follow. This was the Regulation of Karma!","Thus, the Saint was naturally feeling terrible. This was the pressure exerted by heaven and earth.","\"Enough!\" That Saint couldn’t help but roar. He felt like the world was spinning around him. He was really afraid that he would be directly scolded unconscious by the large black dog. If that happened, he would really be leaving his name in history.","\"Just because you say enough, it is enough? Who do you think you are? Grandpa Dog doesn’t want face?\" the large black dog scoffed.","The Saint was so infuriated that his entire body was trembling. He then launched a palm strike at the large black dog.","To say nothing of the fact that he didn’t know that the large black dog was a Great Emperor, even if he did, he would probably be so furious that he couldn’t care less.","The large black dog chuckled as he pointed his butt at the Saint. Weng! The Transcendent Weapon unleashed its might and shot out a column of light.","Boom! The pillar of light surged past, and that Saint was also turned into dust. Not even ashes could be found.","The large black dog clearly had countless ways to kill Saints, yet he had used the most despicable method.","\"The most despicable person in the world!\"","\"Eternal Despicable Great Emperor!\"","The little azure dragon and the little red bird both felt rueful. Even if he had become a Great Emperor, he wouldn’t be able to change his despicable nature. Sure enough, it was easy to change mountains and rivers, but hard to change one’s despicable nature."]},{"number":4891,"title":"Chapter 4891: Settling the Chaos","paragraphs":["Joking was one thing, but the scene they saw on this planet made everyone frown.","Though this place was filled with vitality, the overall atmosphere was extraordinarily violent.","In this place, there was no order. Everything was decided through violence.","Thus, all kinds of evil deeds could be seen continuously. Killing, robbing, and humiliation were the main theme of the entire planet.","With such chaos, why could such a large population be maintained? Shouldn’t they have long since sought their own demise?","Ling Han and the others discovered that firstly, the birth rate here was too high. On the one hand, people were being killed, but on the other, new lives were continuously being born. Furthermore, the time of pregnancy had been shortened to a mere month.","Moreover, the growth rate of Spiritual Herbs was also ridiculously fast. Most of them only needed to grow for a few years to have the effects of a hundred years old, or even a thousand years old.","It was as if the entire planet was nurturing the people on it in an overdrafted manner.","This star had clearly only been born for eight million years, and logically speaking, it hadn’t even passed the time of infancy. However, Ling Han observed for a moment, and discovered that more than half of the energy in the core of planet had already been lost.","At this rate, at most, in another eight million years, this planet would be heading towards destruction.","At that time, aside from those above Spirit Transformation True Lords, everyone else would die.","Oh, no, there was no need to wait until that time. When the star dried up, and could no longer nurture these people, it was believed that the majority would have long since starved to death, and no new life would be born. There was absolutely no need to worry about the problem of the star heading towards death.","Ling Han and the others went to another planet, and the scene they saw was almost the same.","Three, four, five, all the stars were the same, barbaric and wild.","Not long after, the Great Emperors all returned.","Everyone shared what they had seen and heard, and the result was the same. The whole galaxy had become a barbaric world, where there was only slaughter, ruled by the most primitive desires.","\"It must be the doing of those three!\" In the end, all the Great Emperors came to a conclusion.","Those three people had been imprisoned for too long. Even if they had once been the most upright and kindest people, it would not be strange for them to have gone crazy.","Being imprisoned for two Stacked Eras at the drop of a hat, it would be strange if one didn’t go crazy.","Ling Han frowned. He decided to return to the Four Origin Planet first.","However, from the moment he left to the moment he returned, more than a billion years had passed in the Primitive Abyss. In this outside world, more than ten million years had also passed.","After such a long time, even a Great Emperor would have to live a second life to be able to survive. If it was a Saint, they would have long since died over a dozen times.","In other words, the people that Ling Han had known all those years ago had long since died.","Ling Han was extremely rueful. He very much wanted to know how his descendants were doing.","Although he had brought a group of people into the inner world, there were still more people who had stayed outside.","This time, Ling Han only traveled with the empress and the large black dog. There weren’t many of them.","At first, he had still held onto a sliver of hope, but after coming here, he was disappointed.","Four Origin Planet... also became an unreasonable world.","The Nine Suns Holy Landwas still here, and it was still the strongest force of Four Origin Planet. However, it had also become a force that used its power to bully others.","Just ask around, and the evil deeds committed by Nine Suns Holy Land were innumerable.","\"What are those three playing at? Even if they have gone mad, there is no need for the whole world to go mad, right?\" Even the large black dog could not bear to watch any longer.","In other places, they could still be detached from the outside world as they would be outsiders. However, Four Origin Planet was their ancestral grounds.","It had also become like this!","Ling Han nodded, and said, \"Then let’s start correcting the chaos and re-establishing order!\"","The Four Origin Planet was of extraordinary significance to him, so he definitely had to take it back and start over again.","Since the Nine Suns Holy Land was Four Origin Planet’s strongest force, Ling Han and the others naturally headed directly to the Nine Suns Holy Land.","When he arrived in front of the mountain gates of the Nine Suns Holy Land, he saw that there was a massive stone statue erected at the entrance. It was thirty thousand meters tall, and had even surpassed the highest mountain peak in the Holy Land.","\"Who is this?\" the large black dog called out. He couldn’t recognize this stone statue at all.","Theoretically speaking, the first person who was qualified to have a stone statue erected in his memory would naturally be the Founder, the Nine Suns Saint. The second person would be the Nine Mountains Old Man. For the sake of the Nine Mountains Holy Land, he could be said to have done his utmost, right until death.","Of course, Ling Han was also qualified. To say nothing of his identity as a Great Emperor, he had also done an equally great service for the Nine Suns Holy Land.","However, the statue of a stranger had now been erected.","\"You’ve come to become disciples?\" Someone walked over. It was a young man who looked alright. His eyes swept over the empress, Hu Niu, and Chi Menghan, and he said, \"Three beauties, if you follow me, I can guarantee that you’ll become disciples of the Holy Land!\"","This was really blatant poaching.","\"Scram!\" the empress said coldly.","Meanwhile, the young man looked dazed and captivated. He felt that the empress looked beautiful when she was angered, and his heart throbbed wildly.","\"Haha, since you’ve delivered yourself to my doorstep, then I won’t be reserved!\" the young man said. At first, he had wanted to play soft. If the three women were willing to follow him, that would naturally be best. After all, though the melon that was forcibly plucked had a unique flavor, it was not sweet after all.","However, just the sight of these melons was fragrant. He was definitely going to get hold of them!","He charged over, looking like he was going to grab the empress and the others.","However, as he ran, he realized that his legs had disappeared. Then, his arms had also disappeared, leaving behind only a torso.","He was astounded. More importantly, it was as if his arms and legs were naturally non-existent. Not a single drop of blood dripped from his wounds.","This, this, this, were these people demons?","\"Hurry up and return my arms and legs to me!\" the young man shouted loudly. \"My older brother is Lord Sect Master’s ninth disciple!\"","Seeing a conflict arise here, quite a number of people gathered around, but all of them only crossed their arms over their chests, their expressions filled with delight at the misfortune of others. They completely treated themselves as spectators watching the excitement.","This kind of sect did not have the slightest atmosphere of friendliness.","No, there was no longer any element of \"love\" in the whole world. Everyone was like a beast, preying on the weak.","\"Brat, you’re definitely going to die. Why don’t you give the three girls to me, and I’ll take care of them for you? I guarantee that I will feed them to their heart’s content every day,\" someone said to Ling Han, their words extremely vulgar.","\"Junior Brother Xu, with that thin staff of yours, to say nothing of giving you three beauties, even if there was only one, how many minutes would you be able to last?\" Immediately, someone undermined him.","\"Just give them to me!\"","\"Give them to me!\"","\"Give themto me!\"","A great many people were calling out, and some were even glaring. They were about to come to blows.","Ling Han shook his head, and with a flick of his finger, everyone in the surroundings instantly disappeared.","It was not death, but rather disappearance.","Element of destruction!","The young man at the beginning naturally saw this, and this time, he finally knew fear.","\"You, don’t be rash!\" he said in a trembling voice, his two rows of teeth chattering.","Ling Han pointed at the towering stone statue, and asked, \"Who is this person?\"","\"Lord Sect Master, of course,\" the young man replied.","’F*ck! How shameless!’"]},{"number":4892,"title":"Chapter 4892: Ancestor!","paragraphs":["\"Which maniac dares to come to our Nine Suns Holy Land, and act wantonly?\" With a loud shout, eleven figures flew over from the mountain.","\"Brother! Brother!\" When the young man saw him, it was as if he had seen his savior.","These were the eleven disciples of Lord Sect Master. The weakest was Spirit Transformation Tier, and the strongest had even advanced into Venerate Tier.","There was hope for him.","When the elder brother of that young man, Huo Ming, saw how his younger brother had lost all four limbs, he couldn’t help but be both shocked and furious. He directly charged towards Ling Han, \"Madman, die!\"","Boom, he delivered a palm strike, and the strength of a Sect Master completely burst forth.","Ling Han casually snapped his fingers. Pa! Huo Ming instantly transformed into a cloud of blood.","Hiss, he had killed a Sect Master with a snap of his fingers?","All of a sudden, these eleven disciples were all greatly shocked. Only two of them managed to maintain their composure, because they were both Venerate Tiers.","The young man from before was transfixed with shock. This was his older brother, the most prodigious prodigy of the Huo Clan. He had also entered the Nine Suns Holy Land as he had wished, and become a Sect Master of the Nine Suns Holy Land.","But now?","He had been insta-killed with a single snap of his fingers. This was unbelievable.","\"Sir, dare I ask how our Nine Suns Holy Land has offended you?\" A Venerate Tier clasped his hands and said. He was dressed in blue.","Ling Han’s strength caused these people who only had ruthlessness in their blood to feel wary.","After all, fear of death was also instinctive.","Ling Han ignored him and simply flicked a finger at the stone statue. Pa! The stone statue instantly exploded into pieces.","\"How dare you!\" the remaining ten disciples all shouted.","This was the stone statue of the Lord Sect Master, and it was a symbol of the Saint’s glorious achievements. Yet, Ling Han had actually destroyed it. The Lord Sect Master would definitely fly into a thunderous rage later.","They could no longer hold back, and they all pounced towards Ling Han.","\"Are you people worthy of exchanging blows with Little Han?\" The large black dog scoffed, and a pillar of light shot out from his iron underwear, sweeping towards the 10 people.","The pillar of light swept past, and the ten people were instantly annihilated.","’Holy f*ck!’","When the young man saw this, he was almost scared out of his wits.","Insta-killing two Venerate Tiers... Was this a Saint?","\"Hehe, how have I, Liu Qinghe, offended you to the point that my friend would fly into such a thunderous rage?\" Amidst a long bout of laughter, the current Sect Master of the Nine Suns Holy Land, Liu Qinghe, finally appeared.","He was of medium build, and looked to be in his fifties. However, he looked sage-like.","Ling Han shook his head. Eleven personal disciples had died, yet he didn’t look angry at all. This person’s coldness was clear for all to see.","This wasn’t a matter of him alone. Instead, it was a matter of the entire universe having their side of good suppressed, leaving behind only the evil side.","Ling Han smiled calmly, and said, \"I’ll borrow your Nine Suns Holy Land.\"","Liu Qinghe frowned, and said, \"Friend, you’ve gone too far!\"","To demand for his position as Sect Master right from the start, you are really too ambitious.","\"Er, do you know who this person standing in front of you is?\" The large black dog couldn’t help but ask. This was another chance for him to show off.","\"Who?\" Liu Qinghe asked casually. However, he couldn’t help but glance at the large black dog again.","It was rare to see a dog wearing iron underwear!","Furthermore, why did he feel a sense of deja vu?","\"This is Ling Han, the first Sect Master of the Nine Suns Holy Land of the Four Origin Planet!\" The large black dog pointed at Ling Han, and said, \"Junior, why aren’t you kneeling down to pay your respects after seeing your ancestors?\"","Liu Qinghe couldn’t help but feel furious.","’I treat you all as my friends, yet you all want to become my ancestors?’","He had gone too far!","\"Humph, you guys have really gone too far. You actually dare to make fun of me!\" he declared balefully. Did they really think that he did not dare make a move?","The large black dog chuckled. Boom! Imperial might spread through the air.","’F*ck!’","Liu Qinghe instantly knelt down, \"This unworthy disciple pays respects to Ancestor!\"","The large black dog faltered upon hearing this. He hadn’t expected this person to be so cowardly.","As long as they were stronger than you, you would acknowledge them as your father?","\"Old Black, this guy has your bearing,\" the little azure dragon teased.","\"Scram!\" The large black dog immediately rebuked, \"Though Grandpa Dog has achieved dao through despicable means, I am definitely not one to be afraid of death!\"","It spoke boldly and righteously, and Ling Han and the others also believed it.","Though the large black dog would run when he encountered danger, if Ling Han, the empress, and the others encountered danger, he would definitely step out.","A thought suddenly flashed through Liu Qinghe’s mind. He finally understood why the large black dog looked so familiar.","In the ancient records of the sect, it was recorded that there was a grand elder, and that was a large black dog.","However, according to the records, this grand elder had an upright and righteous image. The only similarity was that in a painting, the large black dog in the portrait was wearing iron underwear.","Er, there should be no other dog in this world with such a wretched image.","According to rumors, this grand elder hadn’t died. Instead, he had entered the Primitive Abyss to search for a path to immortality.","Could it be that it had succeeded?","That’s right. If he had not succeeded, how could that Great Emperor-level aura just now have intimidated him to the point that even his mind had gone blank?","Thinking of this, he no longer felt aggrieved. Instead, he felt extremely proud.","An ancestor that had become a Great Emperor, then wouldn’t he be invincible in this world?","Though he was a Saint, he was only a Two Star Saint. However, with an ancestor that was a Great Emperor, he was the Second in the World!","Wasn’t that awesome enough?","\"Ancestor, you have finally returned. Grand-disciple has missed you dearly!\" Liu Qinghe was very shameless as he knelt all the way, and when he reached the large black dog’s side, he hugged the large black dog’s leg.","Thankfully, the large black dog was wearing iron underwear. Otherwise, Liu Qinghe’s face would probably be stuck onto his behind.","The large black dog gritted his teeth. He had never seen such a shameless Saint before.","\"Get lost, don’t even think about having any ideas about Grandpa Dog’s underwear!\"","When Liu Qinghe heard this, he became even more excited, \"Ancestor, are you going to pass on this heirloom underwear to your grand-disciple? Don’t worry, grand-disciple will definitely keep it safe for you. I will carefully wipe it every day, and guarantee that there will not be the slightest bit of dust.\"","As he spoke, he continued to sprawl over it.","\"Scram!\" The large black dog was enraged, and he kicked Liu Qinghe away.","\"Ancestor!\" Liu Qinghe was neither angry nor discouraged, and immediately knelt back down.","\"Old Black, you really have a successor,\" Ling Han said with a shake of his head. However, while the large black dog’s despicability was to disgust his enemies, Liu Qinghe’s despicability was to disgust his own people.","Thus, it was best not to be on the same side as him.","\"How dare you! You actually dare to speak to Ancestor like this!\" Liu Qinghe found a chance to curry favor. He immediately got to his feet, and shouted at Ling Han.","\"Hehe.\" The little azure dragon shook its head and said with a laugh, \"Flatterer, you really have a pair of dog’s eyes this <anno data-annotation-id=\"f33c2def-15b4-46e3-b555-a7fc81691f49\" data-title=\"time!\">time! 1 </anno>\"","\"Woof!\" the large black dog shouted in displeasure.","\"I already told you just now. This is the first Sect Master of the Nine Suns Holy Land after the Nine Suns Holy Land moved to the Four Origin Planet. Didn’t you hear me?\" the little azure dragon continued.","Liu Qinghe was taken aback. Who was the first Sect Master?","Ling Han!","That was a character whose name would go down in history. His natural talent in martial arts was known as the strongest in all of history. In the Primitive Abyss, he had attained Dao as a Great Emperor, and when he came out, he had killed the Great Emperor of the current era, and had even suppressed the darkness single-handedly.","An incredibly awesome character!","This, this, this, this person was Ling Han?","<annotations style=\"display: none;\">The little azure dragon means that he has poor vision.</annotations>"]},{"number":4893,"title":"Chapter 4893: Creation, Great Emperor!","paragraphs":["Liu Qinghe was even more excited. Compared to the large black dog, this was his true backer.","\"Ancestor Ling Han!\" He pounced over again, kneeling by Ling Han’s feet.","Just as it looked like he was about to grab onto Ling Han’s thigh, Ling Han couldn’t help but kick him.","Peng! Liu Qinghe was kicked into pieces.","\"Er... I accidentally used too much force,\" Ling Han said apologetically.","Pei, what accident? It must have been deliberate.","The others naturally wouldn’t reprimand him. This Liu Qinghe was far too despicable. They were rendered speechless by his actions.","\"These people, is there any medicine that can save them?\" Ling Han frowned slightly as he looked at the group of shivering people.","He had overwhelming power, but the human heart has never been something that could be changed with mere power.","\"Everyone is afraid of death. Let’s control them with strict rules first. After a few more generations, the overall atmosphere should improve,\" the large black dog said with some experience.","\"The Despicable Emperor already said so, so it must be so.\" The little azure dragon nodded.","\"Get lost!\"","Ling Han couldn’t massacre the entire planet and galaxy just because these people were bloodthirsty and violent. He entered the Nine Suns Holy Land and issued a strict order for them to abide by the rules, or they would be killed without mercy.","However, these people had never been restrained by the law. Though the decree had been issued, it was practically useless. Everyone would still commit violence and murder without any scruples.","Ling Han was furious, and began the first round of harsh punishment.","In just one day, the population of Four Origin Planet had decreased by a whole tenth.","And after this day, Four Origin Planet had its own rules.","Those who did not want to die would obediently adhere to the rules. Gradually, the word ’discipline’ appeared in everyone’s hearts.","Of course, this was the result of high pressure. Once Ling Han was gone, everything would return to normal.","However, what Ling Han wanted to change was not them, but rather the second and third generation.","The Great Emperors gradually returned. They were also very dissatisfied with the current situation. The entire galaxy was in chaos, which made them feel extremely uncomfortable.","After learning of Ling Han’s thoughts, the Great Emperors were also willing to lend him a helping hand.","Thus, laws gradually appeared on the planets one after another. Massacre and other atrocities were under control. Though they could not be completely eliminated, they were much better than before.","Ling Han felt like there weren’t enough people.","Though this universe was chaotic now, it was too prosperous. There were countless stars and countless people.","He needed more helpers.","Ling Han thought for a moment, then decided to create something.","For example, the old Divine Beast, who had lost a leg and only grasped the three elements, could also create living creatures, and the Star Moon Empress and the others had single-handedly created the extremely prosperous situation now.","Why couldn’t Ling Han do the same?","Not only had he grasped the four key elements, he had also formed his own heaven and earth.","With a thought from Ling Han, a human figure appeared in the heaven and earth of his inner world. It changed according to his thoughts, and then turned into an ordinary-looking young man.","He had bestowed the highest cultivation level on the other.","A Great Emperor!","Ling Han was stunned. He could actually create a Great Emperor, though he was only in the eighth tier.","The old Divine Beast could create Great Emperors, and in fact, it could create a Great Emperor as strong as the sixth tier, but that was different.","That could not be considered to have been created out of thin air. Instead, it was the old Divine Beast that had first devoured the corpse of the corresponding Divine Beast, and added with his own soul, strictly speaking, that was a doppelganger, and not a pure creation.","But he... had actually created a Great Emperor out of thin air!","However, this kind of Great Emperor was also limited to the eighth tier, with no possibility of advancing further.","\"Greetings, Milord!\" When this man was released, he immediately half-knelt on the ground.","Ling Han nodded, \"Do you know why I created you?\"","\"Yes.\" The man nodded, \"Master wants me to safeguard the laws of this world.\"","\"En.\" Ling Han smiled, \"You are my first Emperor Tier creation, used to maintain order. Your significance is extraordinary, so I bestowed upon you the name... ’Shou <anno data-annotation-id=\"d7ab3951-92a8-4fdd-b352-07ecc84f17ff\" data-title=\"Ji’.\">Ji’. 1 </anno>\"","\"Thank you, lord!\" Shou Ji bowed in thanks.","Subsequently, Ling Han began to create Emperors again, creating 99 in a single go. Only then did he feel strained, and felt that this was his limit.","If he wanted to create another Great Emperor, he would have to wait until one or several of them died first.","At the beginning of heaven and earth, Divine Beasts appeared one after another, numbering close to a hundred. Was it the same?","Ling Han was still no match for the great heaven and earth, because back then, the Divine Beasts were all in the fifth tier.","\"Compared to this heaven and earth, the four elements I possess are still too little,\" Ling Han thought to himself. Though he had been absorbing the four elements all this while, and was also producing the four elements himself, compared with the accumulation of heaven and earth over several hundred Stacked Eras, that naturally was child’s play.","It was fine. He was becoming stronger at every moment.","With the help of these 99 Great Emperors, the efficiency of Ling Han’s management naturally increased greatly.","And when they found out that Ling Han could actually create a Great Emperor, the Great Emperor Wu Ya and the others were all dumbfounded.","If they wanted to become Great Emperors, not only would they have to go through untold hardships and experience hundreds of deathly dangers, they would also have to compete with prodigies of the same era and different eras. In the end, the heaven and earth would favour them, and only then would they be able to stand out and become the strongest of their era.","But when it came to Ling Han, Great Emperors could actually be mass-produced!","How could they not sigh with emotion?","Thankfully, Ling Han’s creations were only eighth tier, at most, which gave them some comfort. Otherwise, it was hard to guarantee that Great Emperors would also bleed internally from fury.","What they didn’t know was that Ling Han would also be able to create a fifth tier Great Emperor one day.","However, what he had created was ultimately not comparable to a Great Emperor that had cultivated every step of the way. The fifth tier was definitely the limit, and he would never be able to advance into the fourth tier.","However, 99 Great Emperors was already impressive enough.","Aside from the Great Emperors, Ling Han had also created a great many Saints, numbering in the thousands.","With so many elites helping to maintain order, the nearby galaxy soon gained order. Furthermore, it was still spreading out in all directions at an extremely fast speed. In this way, it would probably only need ten thousand years, and the order of the entire universe would be completely renewed.","Ling Han was extremely pleased with this kind of progress.","However, he was also on guard, because those three invincible Great Emperors should not just sit by and watch.","As expected, after several hundred years, someone came to visit.","This was a young man who looked to be around 20 years old. However, he radiated with a powerful saintly might, and there was also a black-robed man following behind him. His entire body was wrapped in black cloth, and he didn’t release a single wisp of his aura.","\"Who goes there, to actually dare oppose the three Lords!\" This young man smirked coldly. In a few steps, he had arrived in front of the main gate of the Nine Suns Holy Land.","He stood with his hands clasped behind his back, surveying the surroundings, as if there was no one around.","\"This is the Nine Suns Holy Land. If you’re here to become a disciple or a visitor, please register here first,\" a disciple who was on duty immediately walked up and said to the young man.","\"Hahaha!\" The young man laughed madly, \"I am the dignified Xuan Mingyu. Who in this world is worthy of becoming my Master?\"","Then are you crazy!","The disciple on duty was neither servile nor overbearing, neither happy nor angry. He continued, \"Since you are not a disciple nor a visitor, then please leave. This place is not open to the public!\"","<annotations style=\"display: none;\">His name means ’Respect for Regulations’.</annotations>"]},{"number":4894,"title":"Chapter 4894: Invader","paragraphs":["\"What a joke, a mere Cauldron Forging Tier cultivator actually dares to control my actions?\" Xuan Mingyu sneered. \"Kneel!\"","The disciple on duty was unmoved, and said, \"This is the Heavenly Emperor’s Holy Land, and everyone has to act according to the rules!\"","\"Heavenly Emperor?\" Xuan Mingyu laughed madly again, \"What a joke, is Heavenly Emperor a title that any random person can casually call himself?\"","\"How dare you!\" The disciple on duty immediately rebuked.","\"Are you seeking death?\" Xuan Mingyu suddenly released his own aura. That was Saint-level.","The disciple on duty instantly felt as if there was a huge rock weighing down on his chest. He couldn’t breathe, and his face was as white as a sheet.","\"I’ll give you a chance to live. Kneel!\" Xuan Mingyu said coldly.","\"I’m not going to kneel!\" Unexpectedly, this disciple on duty was extremely unyielding, and directly refused.","\"Do you think I don’t dare to kill you?\" Xuan Mingyu humphed, and the aura he released instantly increased by a hundred times. Pa, the left arm of that disciple on duty instantly exploded.","\"Kneel or not?\" Xuan Mingyu revealed a cruel smile. He would never get tired of playing this kind of game.","\"To dare commit a crime in the Nine Suns Holy Land, you’re dead!\" The disciple on duty was still unafraid.","F***!","Xuan Mingyu felt extremely displeased. He was obviously just a minor character of Cauldron Forging Tier, so how could he be so unyielding?","\"Humph!\" He snapped his fingers again. Pa! The other arm of the disciple that was on guard exploded into pieces.","\"How about it?\" he asked again. \"If you don’t kneel down to me, every piece of skin and every bone in your body will explode like this! And I promise you, next, I will be very, very slow. I guarantee that I will have enough time to play with you!\"","\"Sir, that’s enough!\" At this moment, a voice rang out, and a person walked out from the mountain.","\"Who are you?\" Xuan Mingyu looked towards that person.","\"Servant of the Heavenly Emperor, Can Ye,\" the person replied.","\"Can Ye?\" Xuan Ming Yu muttered, and couldn’t help but laugh out loud. \"You should be called an idiot, to actually dare tell me to stop. Where did you get such courage from?\"","\"You have already violated the laws enacted by the Heavenly Emperor, and if you surrender now, you can still get a light punishment,\" Can Ye said calmly.","\"Hahaha!\" Xuan Mingyu laughed madly again, but there was no hint of a smile on his face, \"You guys have really had enough, one by one. What Heavenly Emperor, shameless boasting.\"","He looked towards that disciple on duty, \"I am going to kill this person now. If you have the ability, then come and stop me. That Heavenly Emperor or whatever, if you have the ability, then come and stop me!\"","\"Stubborn!\" Can Ye’s hand shook, and a sword appeared in his hand.","Shua, he attacked Xuan Mingyu, but Xuan Mingyu only sent out a palm strike, and peng, Can Ye was sent flying. Then, Xuan Mingyu sent out another palm strike at the disciple on duty. Pa, that disciple was immediately smashed into a bloody mess.","\"Wa!\" Can Ye fell onto the ground, throwing up blood madly.","\"Pei, what Heavenly Emperor!\" Xuan Mingyu spat, his expression filled with disdain.","He, a Saint, was capable of sweeping aside all opposition. Was this even worthy of being called a Heavenly Emperor?","Can Ye struggled to get back to his feet. Today was really too coincidental. Ling Han just happened to be out on a trip, and the various Great Emperors had been establishing order outside all this while. There were no elites keeping watch in the sect.","In truth, the Nine Suns Holy Land was already an overlord-level existence in the universe, and no one dared to trifle with them at all. Who would have thought that a Saint would suddenly barge in today?","\"Since even I can’t be stopped, what meaning is there for this place to exist?\" Xuan Mingyu sneered, \"Let me flatten it!\"","With a loud shout, he blasted towards the mountains ahead of him, wanting to destroy them with a single strike.","Boom!","A terrifying power surged past, and then, the mountains were still there, as if they had not suffered any attack at all.","This!","Xuan Mingyu felt a little embarrassed. Just now, he had still been so confident, yet in the end, with a palm strike, not even the slightest bit of damage was caused. How could he endure this?","\"So there is the protection of an Imperial Formation!\" The corners of his lips quirked up, \"However, would this be enough to stop me?\"","Weng, right at this moment, a powerful aura surged over.","\"Who dares to come to our Nine Suns Holy Land and act wantonly?\" Xiu, a figure descended, and saintly might filled the air.","Xuan Mingyu looked towards the other, \"And who are you?\"","That person humphed, \"Heavenly Emperor’s disciple, Ding Ping!\"","\"Oh?\" Xuan Mingyu’s eyes lit up. \"I’m very interested in killing you now.\"","Ding Ping frowned upon hearing this. Was this person crazy?","However, the Heavenly Emperor and the other Great Emperors had already treated the galaxy for many years, so the lunatics in the surroundings should have all been cured by now. Those who hadn’t been cured wouldn’t dare to act recklessly, so why had another come out?","\"Die!\" Xuan Mingyu charged towards Ding Ping.","Ding Ping was unafraid, and he continued to battle against Xuan Mingyu.","In these few hundred years, Ling Han had also given some guidance to his disciples.","It should be known that Ling Han had already formed his own heaven and earth, capable of creating things with a single thought. Even Origin Gold could be created out of thin air, so what treasured medicine could he not produce?","Thus, his disciples had all improved significantly. In just a few hundred years, they had all advanced into Saint Tier.","However, if they wanted to take another step further, it would be impossible. Limited by their natural talent, they were unable to step into Pseudo-Emperor Tier.","This meant that even if Ling Han possessed an endless supply of element of life, Ding Ping and the others would still die of old age one day.","And this time, Ling Han did not plan to take anyone else into the inner world.","Birth, old age, sickness, and death were natural laws, and he did not want to destroy them.","The two Saints battled fiercely. Though it had caused a shocking wave of battle, this place had been reinforced by Ling Han. Even if Saints battled fiercely, it would only throw around a few rocks, and could not cause much damage.","Slowly, Ding Ping gained the upper hand.","Xuan Mingyu did not dare believe this. With how noble his status was, they were both Nine-Star Saints, so why was he inferior to the other?","However, that was the truth. His disadvantage was getting larger and larger, and he was already teetering on the verge of defeat.","\"Fourth!\" Xuan Mingyu finally couldn’t help but roar.","Instantly, the mysterious person who was standing motionlessly behind him, his whole body enshrouded in black, finally moved. He stretched out a hand and pressed down on Ding Ping.","With this press, Imperial Might spread out, and it was probably indescribable!","Ding Ping was astonished. This was actually a Great Emperor!","Regardless of how powerful he was, he was still only a Saint. To say nothing of being able to rival a Great Emperor, he wouldn’t be able to block even a wisp of aura from a Great Emperor.","Fortunately, this was the Nine Suns Holy Land.","\"Come!\" he shouted lightly, and a ray of light immediately flew out of the mountain, turning into a sword of light that slashed out from Ding Ping’s hand.","Peng!","The Sword of Light slashed onto the black-robed man’s wrist, and though it immediately crumbled, it still managed to block the black-robed man.","Ding Ping was filled with disbelief. As a Great Emperor, he was actually following the lead of a Saint?","Furthermore, even in this golden age, when the Great Emperors of the world were standing side by side, the environment of heaven and earth was still unable to allow the appearance of a new Great Emperor.","Was this a new Emperor that had been born in the Primitive Abyss?","But no matter what, why would a Great Emperor be commanded by a Saint?","This was too illogical, and too hard to believe."]},{"number":4895,"title":"Chapter 4895: Invitation","paragraphs":["\"Destroy this mountain!\" Xuan Mingyu was flustered and exasperated.","Since this mountain was protected by an imperial formation, he would destroy this mountain first. Then, he could kill whoever he wanted.","The black-robed Great Emperor lashed out at the imperial formation.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","Massive explosions rang out endlessly. A Great Emperor had moved, and just how terrifying was that? Destroying a planet would only be the matter of snapping his fingers.","However, this was Four Origin Planet, which had been reinforced by Ling Han’s power of elements. Thus, added with the protection of the imperial formation, it couldn’t be said to be impregnable, but even if a fourth tier Great Emperor wanted to damage it, he would still have to expend some effort.","However, this black-robed Great Emperor was only in the eighth tier.","An eighth tier Great Emperor had about the same might as an Imperial Weapon, and about the same might as an Imperial Formation.","Thus, though the black-robed Great Emperor was attacking fiercely, the imperial formation remained unmoved.","\"Trash! Trash!\" Xuan Mingyu shouted endlessly, but the black-robed Great Emperor turned a deaf ear to him. He merely continued to attack, as if he was a machine or a puppet.","\"Are you done yet?\"","Right at this moment, a calm voice rang out. Though it was not loud, it was filled with might.","A look of delight instantly appeared on Ding Ping’s face. He half-knelt and said, \"Master!\"","Ling Han had returned!","Xuan Mingyu was also slightly stunned, but when he recalled his own identity, he couldn’t help but feel extremely proud, and asked, \"You are that Heavenly Emperor Han?\"","Ling Han appeared. He was dressed in a long green robe, and his attire could be said to be very ordinary-looking. However, he had an intimidating aura that made people involuntarily hold their breaths.","Originally, he had been reconstructing order at a very far location, but sensing that the imperial formation was under attack, he returned in a single step.","His eyes swept over the surroundings, and saw the blood and Qi that was still wafting in the air.","\"I am Ling Han,\" he said calmly.","\"Listen, I am the 35,867th son of the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor,\" Xuan Mingyu said, \"Today, under the command of my father, I have deliberately come to command you to stay here obediently. Don’t run around everywhere. Otherwise, my father will break your legs!\"","Hehe, the reconstruction of order had finally suffered a backlash from the three great invincible Great Emperors. However, the first person to jump out was the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor.","If these three people didn’t appear, Ling Han wouldn’t be able to find a reason to deal with them.","However, the conflict had come now.","Ling Han ignored him, and stretched out a hand to grab. The blood and Qi that wafted in the skies immediately condensed, and very soon, took the form of a human figure.","As Xuan Mingyu watched, his eyes involuntarily widened.","This was the disciple on duty that he had just killed!","He had already been blasted into so many pieces, yet he could still reform?","What kind of great power was this?","Ling Han tore open the barrier between the two realms again, and directly reached into the Netherworld.","’Holy f*ck!’","Xuan Mingyu almost fainted. He could do that?","That was the Netherworld!","Did he think that the barrier between the two realms was made of paper? He could tear it apart just like that?","When Ling Han withdrew his hand, he also brought out a soul, which he pressed into the body of the disciple on duty.","Instantly, this disciple released a loud roar, and suddenly stood up.","He was alive, he was alive!","He had come back to life.","If it weren’t for the fact that Xuan Mingyu had personally killed this disciple on duty, he really wouldn’t believe that someone could actually revive the dead!","This was too terrifying. This had surpassed the ability of a Great Emperor!","Only then did Ling Han look at Xuan Mingyu, and said, \"You have killed someone here.\"","This was not a question.","Xuan Mingyu was still stubborn, \"So what? I am the son of the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor. To say nothing of killing this kind of minor character, even if I killed your son, what could you do to me?\"","Ling Han smiled eerily, \"Those who commit murder should be killed.\"","He raised his hand and pressed it down on Xuan Mingyu.","Xuan Mingyu was shocked, and hurriedly exclaimed, \"Fourth, save me!\"","The black-robed Great Emperor immediately leaped over, greeting Ling Han’s palm strike.","However, when the palm landed, it was like the heavens were collapsing. It was not something that any power could stop at all.","Peng! The black-robed Great Emperor immediately crumbled, transforming into a cloud of blood and flesh. Meanwhile, Ling Han’s palm was completely unaffected, and it continued to slam down.","\"No—\" Xuan Mingyu released a terrible scream, and still wanted to stretch out his hand to block, but how could a mere Saint be able to block the attack of the Invincible Great Emperor?","With a single palm strike, Xuan Mingyu instantly disappeared from sight.","\"Master!\" Ding Ping walked over, and said, \"You killed the son of the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor, so he definitely won’t let the matter go. It’s possible that a huge battle will break out!\"","Ling Han smiled calmly, \"It’s fine.\"","He was also a Great Emperor, so he was naturally unafraid of the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor. However, he definitely had to choose a suitable location for the battle. Otherwise, if the two invincible Great Emperors fought, they could easily destroy half the universe.","He acted as if nothing had happened, and continued to construct order.","However, he couldn’t help but complain. This Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor was really too fertile, wasn’t he?","Even if he had already stayed outside for ten million years, but more than thirty thousand sons? Added with daughters, even if it was just doubling that amount, it would be sixty thousand; what kind of terrifying reproduction ability was that?","Were they actually born, or were they created?","Several months later, Ling Han received an invitation.","It was a message from the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor, telling him to attend the ceremony for his millionth wife.","A million!","When Ling Han saw this, he couldn’t help but grit his teeth. Could you f****** manage to find the time?","Was this really an invincible Great Emperor?","You haven’t touched a woman in your last life? No, you haven’t touched a woman in hundreds of millions of lifetimes, so you have to make up for it in this lifetime!","However, upon further thought, he had been trapped for several Stacked Eras, and even if it was calculated according to the fact that the Great Emperor had lived for tens of thousands of years, there were really tens of thousands of lifetimes that he had not touched a woman.","Stop, stop, stop. Ling Han sighed. He didn’t want to become a Heavenly Emperor of Mockery.","\"Are you going?\" the empress asked.","Ling Han cracked a smile, \"Let’s go!\"","It was impossible for him and the three invincible Great Emperors to get along peacefully. There would eventually be a battle.","Thus, he definitely had to make this trip.","Looking at the time, it was only three days later.","This wasn’t rushed at all. Ling Han was a Great Emperor, and he could traverse the universe in a few steps.","If he went this time, there might be a commotion. Ling Han decided to only bring a few people with him. If a fight really broke out, he would be able to have less worries.","In the end, it was still the three show-off group.","Two days later, Ling Han, the large black dog and the little azure dragon set out, heading towards the Mysterious Clouds Planet where the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor was located.","In just a few steps, they had already arrived at the Mysterious Clouds Planet.","This place was bustling with noise and excitement.","How could it not be lively when a Great Emperor was getting married?","But the problem here was this was the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor’s 100,000th wife. Though it was very memorable, there were a total of a hundred thousand wives. On average, he would have to marry one every ten years. Who would really treat it as a big matter?","Had this Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor focused all his energy on getting wives and having children?","Er, he was already the strongest in the world, and also had an undying body. What else did he have to aspire for?","Moreover, he had been imprisoned for more than two Stacked Eras, so it seemed understandable that he would do something crazy.","Ling Han, the large black dog, and the little azure dragon grumbled as they entered the venue for the wedding."]},{"number":4896,"title":"Chapter 4896: Another Wedding","paragraphs":["\"Invitation card.\" There was a guard at the door, and very proficiently, he accepted the invitation card, as if he had already done it a few hundred to over a thousand times.","En, this was definitely not an adjective.","Ling Han handed over his invitation. When that person saw it, he hurriedly said respectfully, \"So it’s Heavenly Emperor Han! Please, please!\"","He let another person take over, while he personally brought Ling Han and the others into the venue, arranging for Ling Han and the others to sit at a very close position.","After a cordial reception, he finally retreated.","The large black dog stroked his chin, and said, \"In Grandpa Dog’s opinion, there will probably be a bloody calamity today.\"","\"Why?\" the little azure dragon asked in a timely manner.","\"You see, the few weddings that Little Han has attended have basically all ended with snatching the bride, and there is no lack of bloodshed.\" The large black dog teased, \"So, I suspect that after today, this Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor may also be cuckolded.\"","Ling Han couldn’t help but roll his eyes—you are really mischievous!","Quite a number of people had come, but aside from Ling Han and the other two, the highest cultivation level was only Saint-level.","—Would a Great Emperor come to attend the event where someone would be marrying his 100,000th wife? Though this indeed had the significance of breaking records.","Furthermore, even the Saints all looked calm, without the slightest bit of excitement.","After all, they had participated in this kind of event a lot. On average, it would happen once every ten years. When such events were held closely together, it was possible that there would be two to three such events in a year. How could they still be excited?","\"Yi, why can these three sit there?\" Someone set their eyes on Ling Han and the others.","That was because Ling Han and the other two were seated in the most prominent positions, and the other seats were like stars surrounding the moon, gathered around with them as the centre.","\"That’s right. What right do they have to sit there?\"","\"Humph, they have indeed sat down, but without abilities, how long can they sit for?\"","The people of this world were ruthless by nature, magnifying the negative emotions in human nature to the extreme. Thus, just as someone said a few words, someone directly walked towards Ling Han and the others.","\"Your seats are not too bad, I’ll take them!\" This was a Saint, and commanded Ling Han and the others.","\"Are you sure you want it?\" the large black dog asked with a grin.","\"Humph! Do you think I’m afraid?\" the Saint said in a haughty voice.","\"Come, I’ll let you sit.\" The large black dog walked away obediently.","Yi?","Had Old Black changed his personality?","Of course, this was impossible. Thus, Ling Han and the little azure dragon also stood up and cooperated.","That Saint was very pleased with himself. They were really three cowards. They would retreat with just a scare.","He sat down boldly, but he had just sat down, when he heard a swoosh.","\"Pu!\"","Everyone spluttered in laughter upon hearing this. As it turned out, the Saint had plonked down onto the ground, yet the fabric on his behind had already been torn apart. A fair bottom was instantly revealed.","Though this Saint was male, he had actually bared his bottom in full public in front of so many people, which still caused his face to flush red in embarrassment. Hurriedly, he darted out, and instantly disappeared without a trace.","The large black dog snickered, \"See, this seat is not so easy to sit in. Can’t you see that Grandpa Dog has deliberately worn iron underwear?\"","Everyone naturally did not believe this, and thought that it should be the large black dog and the others that were behind this. However, this did not seem to be possible, because to tease a Saint like this, what cultivation level did he have to be at?","There were only two invincible Great Emperors in the world!","—The Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor and Boundless Great Emperor had each established a colossal force, practically splitting the entire universe into two. Meanwhile, the Star Moon Empress seemed to have disappeared without a trace.","Hence, in the territory under the rule of the Boundless Great Emperor and Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor, everyone knew that there were only these two Great Emperors.","Could it be that this was a test set by the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor? Only the strongest person would be qualified to sit in the most noble position?","\"I’ll go!\" Immediately, another Saint leaped out.","Since this was a test, then there must be a chance of passing. Otherwise, how could it be called a test?","—But he had forgotten another possibility, and that was a certain dog was especially deceitful, so despicable that he did not play by the usual rules!","\"Come, come, come. Please take a seat.\" The large black dog was very cordial, and invited that Saint to sit beside him.","The Saint unleashed his full power before slowly sitting down.","Three inches, two inches, one inch away from the chair, okay, he had sat down solidly!","The corners of the Saint’s lips had just curled up into a smile. However, a cracking sound suddenly traveled over, and his face immediately became as white as a sheet.","He was done for.","\"Hahaha!\" Laughter instantly erupted, one after another.","A considerable number of Saints had come here. Furthermore, the people here were all fierce and barbaric. Thus, no one would give them any face.","Xiu! The Saint also fled.","\"Who else is there?\" the large black dog shouted loudly. It was clear that he hadn’t played enough.","Needless to say, there had always been Saints who refused to admit defeat. One after another, they walked over to undergo the \"test\". In the end, they naturally all bared their bottoms in public, completely embarrassed.","When the master of ceremonies walked onto the stage and was about to announce the start of the wedding, he saw the Saints leaving one after another. Even if he was experienced and knowledgeable, he still couldn’t help but grimace.","Had he come to the wrong place?","Was this a butt-revealing competition for Saints?","\"What are you guys doing!\" he roared loudly, his voice rolling out, instantly causing everyone to fall silent.","He was a Nine-Star Saint, so the might of his roar was indeed world-shaking.","Only then did the other Saints that were itching to give it a try sit down sheepishly, still feeling slightly defiant. If they could successfully sit down, they may be able to gain the favor of the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor. From then onwards, they would become close subjects of the Great Emperor.","\"Old b@stard, do you want to give it a try?\" The large black dog made a gesture of invitation.","\"Humph, the wedding is about to begin, yet you people are making such a ruckus. Aren’t you afraid that the Great Emperor will be angry?\" The Saint who was the master of ceremonies looked coldly at the large black dog. He had finally seen through it. This dog was the only one that was playing tricks, and was extraordinarily lively.","\"You don’t understand, do you? This is called lively. Shouldn’t a wedding be lively?\" The large black dog looked at everyone and asked, \"Don’t you all agree?\"","\"That’s right!\" A great many people agreed.","The ruthless side of people nowadays was completely unleashed, and correspondingly, their intelligence had also become a little limited.","\"Look.\" The large black dog spread out his paws.","\"How dare you!\" The master of ceremonies Saint was furious, \"All of you, get out. You are not welcome here.\"","At this time, Ling Han finally spoke up, and said, \"We are guests invited by Mysterious Clouds. You are not yet qualified to make us leave.\"","\"You actually dare to call the name of the Great Emperor!\" The master of ceremonies Saint’s expression changed drastically, and the other Saints also stood up one after another. This was really too audacious. This could practically be considered treason!","Ling Han smiled, \"Don’t be rash. Otherwise, if the wedding turns into a funeral, Mysterious Clouds would probably be displeased.\"","\"You!\" Everyone was both shocked and furious. Ling Han actually dared to directly address the Great Emperor by name time and time again. Just how outrageously bold was he?","Even if you wanted to seek death, you wouldn’t do such a thing, right?","\"Haha! When I capture you, I’ll deliver you to the Great Emperor!\" A Saint leaped forward and said.","Weng, right at this moment, an imposing and domineering aura swept out.","The Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor appeared."]},{"number":4897,"title":"Chapter 4897: A game","paragraphs":["\"Greetings, Great Emperor!\" Everyone knelt on the ground.","Emperors were lofty beings who ruled the world.","Of course, this world was a little chaotic. Emperors were no longer unique to an era, and a situation of two Great Emperors standing side by side had appeared.","And if these people could find out more, they would know that there were actually far more than two Great Emperors in this world.","The Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor raised his hand casually, then looked at the Saint that had jumped out, \"You want to avenge me?\"","\"I am willing to serve the Great Emperor!\" That Saint was overjoyed.","This was an excellent opportunity to curry favor.","\"If you can kill him, I’ll bestow you with a great opportunity,\" the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor said.","\"Thank you, Great Emperor!\" the Saint said as he knelt again.","The great opportunity that the Great Emperor spoke of was definitely extremely awesome.","Ling Han and the others were astonished. Others didn’t know that they were Great Emperors, but how could it be that the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor did not know either?","Since he knew, why did he still have to trick his own subordinates?","Was he temperamental? Or did he not take human life seriously at all?","It should be both.","After being trapped for countless years, the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor’s personality must have changed drastically. Thus, after he escaped, he tried his best to marry and have children. To him, subordinates were only toys, so how could he take them to heart?","\"Who are you? I allow you to announce yourself, and I can also erect a tombstone for you after death,\" that Saint said. In front of the Great Emperor, he naturally had to perform well.","Ling Han smiled and said, \"Then there’s no need. It’s just a matter of raising my hand.\"","\"What did you say?\" The Saint flew into a thunderous rage. Did this mean that he was no match for Ling Han?","\"I had initially wanted you to have someone to pay respects to after your death. However, it’s a shame that you insisted on seeking death!\" the Saint said in a baleful voice. He then leaped forward and charged at Ling Han.","Ling Han and the others didn’t move. However, the Saint started to crumble on his own when he was only nine meters away from Ling Han.","His arms and legs were the first to disappear, causing him to be greatly shocked. His expression was incredibly terrified, and when he opened his mouth to call for help, he had already disappeared completely.","\"Looks like you won’t be able to obtain my good fortune,\" the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor murmured to himself. However, a smile tugged at the corners of his lips, and it was as if he were enjoying a show.","\"Is it interesting?\" Ling Han asked.","\"It is.\" The Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor nodded, and said, \"In this world now, no matter how I look or play with it, it is all interesting.\"","\"Since that’s the case, why don’t you cherish this world?\" Ling Han asked.","\"This world would ultimately be destroyed, so why cherish it?\" the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor countered.","Ling Han shook his head, and said, \"We walk different paths, so we can’t work together!\"","Hearing the conversation between the two of them, everyone felt their scalps go numb.","To be able to converse as an equal with the Great Emperor, who was he?","He could only be a Great Emperor!","Heavens, they had actually shouted at a Great Emperor just now?","However, shouldn’t the other Great Emperor be the Boundless Great Emperor?","This person in front of them... didn’t look like him at all.","\"I didn’t kill you last time, so why didn’t you stay on that island? Why did you insist on coming to your death?\" the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor asked calmly. There was no anger in his voice.","Who was he?","This was a great elite that had traversed many Stacked Eras and was truly invincible in this world. He definitely had an undying body.","Having lived long enough, he was naturally unconcerned about anything.","He had single-handedly directed the present prosperous times, but who knows, with a single thought, he might be able to erase all life in an instant.","In any case, their lives would all end one day.","Everything was just a cycle.","This damn loop!","Ling Han shook his head, and said, \"I can’t agree with your decision. The world has its own rules, so it’s best that neither you nor I interfere!\"","\"Hahahaha, if I don’t agree, could it be that you want to kill me?\" The Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor laughed loudly, his voice incredibly rough.","This was really a joke. It had been a long time since he had laughed so loudly.","After all, there were really not many people in this world that were qualified to make him laugh.","Ling Han did not smile, and merely said calmly, \"Let’s go to the Primitive Abyss for a battle!\"","With their level, once a battle broke out, it would really be world-destroying. After a battle, it was probable that there would not be a single complete star left in the entire universe.","\"Why go to so much trouble?\" The Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor sent a palm strike at Ling Han.","He didn’t care about this star at all. So what if these people died? In any case, he could create things and give them life with a single thought.","Ling Han didn’t take it head-on. He had his reservations about fighting here.","He merely moved, and guided the attack of the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor into the galaxy. Though it created multiple black holes in space, it did not cause any deaths.","\"Soft-hearted!\" the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor said coldly.","Everyone was stunned upon seeing this.","Ling Han was clearly an enemy, yet he was taking their lives into consideration. Meanwhile, the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor didn’t care about their lives at all.","This kind of understanding rendered them speechless.","Ling Han smiled faintly, \"These are at least toys that you have created. No matter what, it must have cost you a lot of effort, right? Don’t you think it is a pity to destroy them just like that?\"","The Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor laughed loudly, and said, \"Alright, since you’re so close to becoming one of us, I’ll grant your request this once.\"","\"Then let’s battle!\" Ling Han took a step forwards, heading towards Primitive Abyss.","The Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor shrugged nonchalantly, and followed after him.","The large black dog and little azure dragon hurriedly followed. Their speed was slightly slower, and they immediately lost track of Ling Han and the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor. However, this didn’t matter. In any case, they were definitely in the Primitive Abyss.","Seeing the large black dog and little azure dragon also leave on the golden path, the Imperial Might that diffused from them didn’t dissipate for a long time, and the Saints couldn’t help but be dumbfounded.","\"That dog... is actually also a Great Emperor!\"","Heavens, how was this possible?","\"Even such a despicable dog can become Emperor!\"","\"Is the heavens blind?\"","Their first reaction, as well as the most shocking thing for them was that the large black dog, being so despicable, had still become Emperor, and it was not that there were clearly two Great Emperors standing side by side, so how could a new Emperor be allowed to appear in this world?","From this, it could be seen just how despicable the large black dog was.","No wonder no one had been able to sit down previously, and even their pants had exploded.","With the evil intentions of a Great Emperor, what Saint would be able to withstand it?","’However, you’re a Great Emperor, so is there any need for you to play such tricks?’","Despicable, he was really despicable!","Everyone came to a unified understanding. From today onwards, the name of the Despicable Emperor would also spread throughout the world.","...","In the Primitive Abyss, Ling Han and the Mysterious Spirit Great Emperor faced off against each other.","\"Being able to leave that island means that you’ve also grasped the four key factors,\" the Celestial Spirit Emperor said. \"So, what’s the point of battling me?\"","’You can’t kill me, and I can’t kill you either. Even if there’s still some difference in the grasp of the four elements, advantage and disadvantage won’t affect the final outcome at all.’","In any case, both sides were immortal and indestructible.","\"Important!\" Ling Han said in a solemn voice. \"I can’t stand the sight of you!\"","\"Haha, hahaha!\" The Celestial Spirit Emperor couldn’t help but laugh loudly. After laughing for a while, a nostalgic expression appeared on his face, and he said, \"A long time ago, so long ago that even I almost forgot about it, I was also as childish as you.\""]},{"number":4898,"title":"Chapter 4898: Battle of first tiers","paragraphs":["\"Brat, one day, you will also become as indifferent as me,\" the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor said. \"This isn’t a derogatory term, but rather stating a fact.\"","\"When you’ve seen too many eras pass, your mentality will naturally change.\"","\"We are high and noble, surpassing all else.\"","Ling Han laughed loudly, \"I am the type to deliberately stomp on those who are not convinced. You are high and noble, so I will pull you off your horse, and stomp on you firmly!\"","\"Junior, you’re far too arrogant!\" The Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor shook his head, and said, \"No matter what, I’m still your senior. You need to respect your senior as much as possible!\"","Boom, he threw a punch.","It was simple and direct, but because there were four elements wrapped around it, this punch was also indescribably violent.","With a single punch, it was guaranteed that even a second tier Great Emperor would be instantly killed!","Merging and connecting the four elements had actually surpassed the level of a Great Emperor, and reached an indescribable height.","Ling Han was unafraid, and faced it head-on with a punch.","Hong long long, the two invincible Great Emperors immediately broke out into an intense battle. With every exchange of blows, the ground around them would be completely destroyed, leaving behind multiple crevasses, like a dried up sea.","It should be known that with the sturdiness of the ground here, even an Imperial Weapon would find it difficult to create a small crater. However, the shockwaves created by the battle between Ling Han and the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor were able to cause such damage, which showed just how strong these two people were.","The simple word ’strong’ could no longer describe how terrifying they were.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","Ling Han no longer had any qualms. He unleashed his full battle prowess, focusing all his anger and emotions on his fists, and smashed them madly at the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor.","However, the older one was, the wiser they were.","How many years earlier had the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor become a first tier Great Emperor before Ling Han?","There were at least a dozen over Stacked Eras, right?","What a long time this was, and it also allowed the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor to reach perfection in the use of the four elements.","The four main elements were not just used for attack.","When Ling Han threw punch after punch, multiple shields appeared on the body of the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor. Although they were destroyed with a single punch from Ling Han, the damage still dropped to rock bottom.","This was naturally the use of the key element of creation, but to use it so proficiently, it required incredible understanding and mastery.","Though Ling Han was also using the element of creation to form a shield, in such a fast battle, if he wanted to form a defense at the parts that he should have defense in such a short period of time, he would need a strong ability of prediction.","Directly protect his entire body?","Firstly, in this way, he would not be able to attack. Secondly, with his battle prowess, only by shrinking his defenses to a point could he possibly block the attacks of his opponent. If he wanted to defend in all aspects, he would only become unable to withstand a single blow, and it would be completely ineffective.","Thus, Ling Han was repeatedly hit. After all, this was the first time he had come across a battle on this level.","Not long after, he was riddled with wounds.","However, this didn’t matter. The essence of life channeled by itself, instantly healing his injuries. If it weren’t for his tattered clothes, no one would believe that he had once been so severely injured.","When the large black dog and little azure dragon arrived, the battle between Ling Han and the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor had already reached its climax.","\"This is the first time I’ve seen Little Han being suppressed by someone when their cultivation levels are equal,\" the large black dog said solemnly.","\"It can’t be helped. He’s been immersed in this level for who knows how many years, so it’s normal that Little Han is no match.\" The little azure dragon wasn’t worried. \"In any case, that guy already has an undying body.\"","The essence of life flowed through his body. To say nothing of the fact that others could not kill him, even if he wanted to commit suicide, he would not be able to.","At this point, he was truly undying and indestructible.","No wonder people would become lunatics as time passed.","For example, the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor had directly married a million wives, and given birth to tens of thousands of children.","However, as the battle continued, Ling Han received fewer and fewer wounds.","For him, battle was the best teacher.","In the intense battle, his experience was rapidly increasing, and his understanding and use of the four elements was also rapidly increasing.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","The Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor unleashed a three-hit combo, yet they were all blocked by Ling Han’s shield of earth. At the beginning, Ling Han had to sustain at least two attacks. Afterward, he would only sustain one out of the three strikes, and right until this moment, he had blocked all of them.","\"Not bad, not bad. Your comprehension ability in battle is very strong. Perhaps, even I was inferior to you in the past,\" the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor said. However, his attacks didn’t stop.","He was no longer limited to using his fists, palm strikes, finger taps, or kicks. Every move was indescribably amazing, but its might was also indescribably great.","He was a Great Emperor, and he could summon clouds with a flip of his hand and rain with a wave of his hand.","The stronger his opponent was, the more astonishing Ling Han’s rebound would be.","He had already gotten used to the rhythm of the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor’s attacks. Not only had he blocked its attacks, but he had even begun to counterattack.","At this, the two Great Emperors started to suffer injuries.","After reaching their height, who would be weaker than the other?","Thus, if anyone retained a portion of their power for defense, that would definitely lead to insufficient attack power, and they would not be able to wound their opponent at all.","And if he defended with all his might, he would only be beaten.","With the pride of a Great Emperor, would he choose to defend passively?","Thus, the two Great Emperors chose to attack with all their might without hesitation.","You punch me, and I kick you. With their attacks that were strong to the extreme, they could easily tear through each other’s bodies, and cause great damage.","However, when the essence of life surged past, no matter how serious the injury, it would immediately recover.","In fact... even if their physical bodies were destroyed, the soul mark could still be revived with a single thought, and recover to their original state.","As for the soul mark, even heaven and earth wouldn’t be able to destroy it if it shrank back to a single point.","Thus, they truly had undying bodies.","The battle was incredibly intense, with Imperial Blood spraying everywhere. However, just as the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor had said before, the battle between them was meaningless. Since they were undying bodies, no matter how intense the battle was, it would only be a waste of time.","Of course, for them, time itself was meaningless. The only difference was that sometimes, they could move freely, but at other times, they would be trapped for a few Stacked Eras.","\"Junior, do you still want to continue the battle?\" the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor asked calmly. There was no emotion on his face.","After experiencing a long life, he had long since lost all emotion.","Sorrow, joy, delight, and anger had long since disappeared without a trace. His actions were all based on his will, and he did not care about good or evil.","Ling Han released a battle cry, and began to increase his power.","Boom, it was not just the four elements that came from the surroundings. He was also using the four elements of his own body, which was equivalent to the overlap of two heavens and earths.","Instantly, his battle prowess began to spike madly.","’Hmm?’","A hint of surprise appeared on the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor’s face.","This made him feel refreshed. Who knew how many years it had been? He had long since become numb, and had seen too many things. There was already nothing in this world that could attract his attention.","However, his interest was piqued now.","Interesting, this was really interesting.","When one had reached a height like they had, the four fundamental elements that they could sense and use were all the same. The difference lay in the method of use and the level of proficiency. This needed time.","However, the amount of four elements that Ling Han shot out far surpassed him."]},{"number":4899,"title":"Chapter 4899: Blinded","paragraphs":["A strong sense of curiosity welled up in the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor’s heart. Although the amount of four elements that Ling Han could unleash wasn’t double his, it was at least 20% more than what he could unleash.","When one had reached a height like they had, they could no longer advance any further. Thus, even if it was only a 20% increase, this was still a massive advantage.","This was also inconceivable.","What granted you the ability to have this boost?","Peng!","The Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor received Ling Han’s punch head-on, yet he was still sent flying.","Ling Han caught up with him, and sent out his fists in a barrage of punches.","Peng, peng, peng! Each punch landed solidly, and it wasn’t long before the chest of the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor cracked open, revealing his white bones. Even his heart was exposed.","However, the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor only needed to think for a moment, and his injuries would immediately heal, leaving no trace behind.","Ling Han indeed had an advantage in terms of battle prowess, and it was a very great advantage at that. Yet, he was still unable to kill the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor.","He wanted to draw the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor into his own heaven and earth, but he was completely unable to do so.","The gap in battle prowess between the two of them had not reached the extent of overwhelming.","\"You really are a strange junior!\" the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor exclaimed ruefully. He then stroked his chin, and said, \"I had initially thought that my power had already reached its limit. Who would’ve thought that there was still room for improvement?\"","\"I’m not going to play with you anymore. I’m going into seclusion to comprehend.\"","Seclusion, this was a term that was already incredibly unfamiliar to him. Ever since he had cultivated the four elements, he was invincible and undying, so what was the point of going into seclusion?","Even the destruction of heaven and earth couldn’t kill him.","But for those that could become a Great Emperor, which one of them did not have the heart to become invincible?","And now, there was actually someone whose battle prowess surpassed his. Even if he was still undying and indestructible, there was still a lot of displeasure in his heart, and he had gained an ambition.","Another could, but why couldn’t he?","They were the only four first tier Great Emperors in this universe.","The Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor was extremely decisive, and he immediately turned around to leave.","Ling Han didn’t pursue him. After all, so what if he caught up to him? He couldn’t draw him into the heaven and earth inside his body, so he couldn’t kill him.","And once a battle broke out in the outside world, just how great would the loss of life be?","The difference between Ling Han and the three invincible Great Emperors was that he still had a kind heart.","This was not soft-heartedness. If there came a day when Ling Han really had the strength to suppress the three Great Emperors, then even if they had to battle in the outside world, he would not hesitate to battle.","Without destruction, there would be no construction. Only by dealing with these three Great Emperors would the development of the world be able to conform to nature, and not, because of their interference, the world had become their toy.","Ling Han pondered deeply. When the four elements in his body reached the same level as this heaven and earth, would he be able to suppress those three?","He had no idea, because no one had reached this kind of battle prowess before, so he naturally could only fantasize.","The Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor went into seclusion just like that, ignoring all of his million wives and tens of thousands of children.","Without this Great Emperor standing guard, his territory was completely divided between Ling Han and the Boundless Great Emperor.","Ling Han was re-establishing order, while the Boundless Great Emperor continued to destroy order, advocating violence.","Tens of thousands of years later, the borders of the two great forces were already close, and it was inevitable that conflict would arise.","However, the Boundless Great Emperor never made a move..","As he saw it, any contest for supremacy was only a game. He was the one who was playing the game, so how could he personally participate in the battle?","It didn’t matter if he won or lost. It was just a game. Worse come to worst, he could enter the next Stacked Era and start a new game.","Ling Han was different.","Great Emperor Wu Ya and the others, added with Shou Ji and the other Great Emperors that he had created, had an absolute advantage in terms of numbers of Great Emperors. Naturally, they pushed forwards, and the number of planets they conquered ncreased.","Though the Boundless Great Emperor had also created Great Emperors, firstly, they were only in eighth tier, and secondly, there were only a mere nine of them. Naturally, they were powerless to stop them.","After a million years, the territory of the Boundless Great Emperor had already shrunk to one-tenth of its original size. Its share in the entire universe was already less than five percent.","All the Great Emperors were just about to continue their efforts, and conquer all the territory of the Boundless Great Emperor, but right at this moment, they encountered a powerful enemy, which was also an old enemy.","—The old Divine Beast.","Theoretically speaking, the old Divine Beast would only be able to die if it left the Imperial Island. However, who asked him to be taken away by the three invincible Great Emperors?","They could also freely obtain element of life, allowing the old Divine Beast to extend its lifespan, just like the Great Emperor Wu Ya and the others.","This character was in the second tier!","Who could block the attack of a second tier Great Emperor?","Even if the Great Emperor Wu Ya and the others had already advanced to the third tier, they were still no match in a one-on-one battle.","Moreover, they were also apprehensive, because if Great Emperors attacked with their full strength, the damage caused would be too great.","Just look at how the twelve Lords of Death battled Xuan Taiyu, causing the entire North Heavenly Realm’s fortune to decline for tens of millions of years.","Right now, not only were there more Great Emperors, but their battle prowess was also at the second tier or third tier. Thus, the damage caused by this was naturally even greater.","The biggest difference between the Boundless Great Emperor, the old Divine Beast, and Ling Han and the others was that they could ignore all life in the world and do as they liked.","When Ling Han received the news, he immediately moved out.","He stood in the galaxy, and there was a massive white star in front of him. The old Divine Beast was standing guard there.","Behind him was the empress, the large black dog, the Great Emperor Wu Ya, and so on.","Ling Han moved, grabbing out at the star in front of him.","Weng, immediately, an Imperial Might spread out, and the old Divine Beast took a step and arrived in the galaxy.","\"What a joke, where did you guys get the courage to actually dare to invade this place!\" The old Divine Beast sneered, while its eyes were fixed on Ling Han, \"Junior, do you think that just because you have become a second tier, you can compete with those three?\"","\"Yi, the information of this old b@stard is so outdated. He still doesn’t know that Ling Han once battled with the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor,\" the large black dog said in surprise.","\"True.\" The little azure dragon nodded. \"He’s only a servant. The Boundless Great Emperor doesn’t need to report to him.\"","\"Sigh, letting our Little Han battle with a servant is really demeaning!\" The large black dog shook his head, \"Just see how Grandpa Dog will deal with him!\"","The large black dog turned around, and aimed his behind at the old Divine Beast.","\"Junior, if you don’t want to die, scram quickly. Don’t wait— wu!\" The old Divine Beast wanted to subdue Ling Han’s troops without fighting. After all, he had fought Ling Han before, and was already no match for the latter.","However, before he could finish speaking, he felt a strong light shine over, causing his eyes to hurt.","What was going on?","He focused his gaze and looked over. Shockingly, he saw that despicable dog shaking its behind at him, and what was shining brightly and causing his eyes to hurt was precisely the iron underwear that the other was wearing.","’Holy f*ck!’","Even with the strength of the old Divine Beast, it still couldn’t help but shed tears. This was naturally not something like grief, but purely because of the strong light.","It should be known that that was a Transcendent Weapon. It should have possessed the might of fifth tier, and its explosive power could reach fourth tier. Now, however, the large black dog had exploited all of its might, and it instantly lost all destructive power.","But because of this, how bright would this light be?","Even a second tier would be dazzled by the light, or even shed tears!"]},{"number":4900,"title":"Chapter 4900: Annihilating the old Divine Beast","paragraphs":["This, the old Divine Beast shed tears!","All the Great Emperors felt rueful. They had battled with the old Divine Beast for millions and millions of years, yet they had not even managed to wound the old Divine Beast. And as for the large black dog, with a shake of his behind, the old Divine Beast was blinded so badly that it was shedding tears.","Despicable indeed, but it could not be denied that this was their best battle merit against the old Divine Beast.","He was clearly despicable, so why had he succeeded instead?","All the Emperors were speechless. This kind of victory made them feel too embarrassed to celebrate.","\"Hahaha!\" Only the large black dog laughed proudly, and twisted his behind even more happily. Xiu, xiu, xiu! Blinding light flashed madly. Unless this was a first tier Great Emperor like Ling Han, anyone would feel annoyed.","\"Despicable dog, I’m going to kill you!\" The old Divine Beast was in a towering rage, and with a wave of its hand, delivered a palm strike at the large black dog.","What he hated the most now was not Ling Han, but rather the large black dog.","He was so despicable that he gritted his teeth.","Ling Han immediately lashed out. Pa! He easily blocked the strike.","The large black dog switched positions, and continued to dazzle the surroundings.","The old Divine Beast had no choice but to cover its face with its hands. Otherwise, nothing could block this kind of light.","After roaming the world for so long, when had he ever been in such a sorry state?","\"Despicable dog! Despicable dog! Despicable dog!\" he roared in exasperation.","The large black dog picked his ears, and said to Ling Han, \"Grandpa Dog is feeling great now, so I’ll leave the matters afterwards to you.\"","This show-off acted like he was even more awesome than Ling Han.","Ling Han naturally did not take it to heart. He merely smiled, and asked the old Divine Beast, \"Do you have any last words to say?\"","\"Haha!\" The old Divine Beast turned to look at Ling Han, \"Junior, do you think that just because you have killed a few Great Emperors, you can kill even me?\"","\"En.\" Ling Han nodded, and moved directly, grabbing out at the old Divine Beast.","The old Divine Beast was enraged, and brandished a palm strike at Ling Han.","However, when he delivered this strike, it was like mud sinking into the ocean, directly disappearing without a trace.","’What?’","He couldn’t help but gape in shock. Just how powerful was this attack of his? Why did it seem like it had not been delivered at all?","\"You!\" Realization suddenly dawned on him, and the gaze he directed at Ling Han was filled with envy and jealousy.","First tier!","Ling Han had already mastered all four elements, and had become an invincible Great Emperor.","How could this not make him jealous?","That was because this had always been his pursuit. Furthermore, just when it looked like he was about to succeed, he was stopped by Star Moon Empress and the others, and what was the result?","Now, Ling Han had become an invincible Great Emperor, while he was a lackey.","He was filled with hatred!","Boom, Ling Han’s attack landed, and instantly, only half of the old Divine Beast’s body was left. No matter how tough his physique was, it was still insufficient in front of Ling Han.","\"You can’t possibly grasp the four elements,\" Ling Han said calmly. \"You are created by the heaven and earth, so how can you possibly rival the heaven and earth?\"","It had to be a Great Emperor that had cultivated to perfection in every cultivation level, and only then could he possibly become an invincible Great Emperor.","Hence, even if the old Divine Beast was an extraordinary breed like the Heaven Devouring Beast, grasping the three fundamental elements was the finishing line. If he wanted to forcefully comprehend the four fundamental elements, he would only be crushed by the power of the fundamental elements.","Throughout history, there had been at least 34 Stacked Eras. However, there were only a measly four Great Emperors of the first tier. From this, it could be seen just how difficult it was to reach this level.","\"No, as long as I was given a little more time, I would definitely be able to reach this step as well!\" the old Divine Beast said defiantly. He had once crushed this young man in front of him, but now, the latter had severed half of his body with a single move.","The gap in battle prowess was already indescribably wide.","Ling Han shook his head. The old Divine Beast that he had once viewed as a great enemy was completely unable to withstand a single blow from him now. It was not even qualified to make him take it seriously.","\"Ling Han, what kind of expression is that!\" The old Divine Beast was already in a terrible mood, yet Ling Han’s disdainful attitude still caused him to be completely battered. How could he endure this?","\"Ah!\"","He screamed again, because that despicable light shone over again, dazzling him to the point that his single eye was tearing up.","Thankfully, he was now missing one side of his body, and only had one eye. The damage caused by this was directly halved.","\"Hehe, who asked you to be so arrogant!\" the large black dog said, swaying his behind.","\"Despicable dog, you’re using your powerful connections as an intimidation tactic!\" the old Divine Beast roared.","\"Wrong, wrong. Little Han is Grandpa Dog’s brother. How can this be called using powerful connections as an intimidation tactic?\" The large black dog giggled.","Ling Han shook his head, and pressed down another hand.","\"No—\" the old Divine Beast called out in defiance. He was originally the strongest in this era, and had the highest chance of becoming an invincible and undying Great Emperor. In the end, he first became a lackey, and now, he couldn’t even save his life.","Boom, Ling Han’s attack swept over, and the old Divine Beast instantly disappeared into thin air.","When the element of destruction swept past, there would naturally be nothing left of him.","Ling Han waited for a while longer, yet he didn’t see the Boundless Great Emperor make a move.","He knew that it was not because he was afraid. He was already undying and indestructible, so what was there to be afraid of?","He was like the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor, viewing all life as a toy. Meanwhile, he was high and mighty, looking down on the show that he had directed.","Since the Boundless Great Emperor didn’t attack, Ling Han didn’t engage in battle either. Instead, he turned around and left.","Another two thousand years later, order had been re-established in the entire universe.","And by this time, everyone could sense that the signs of becoming Emperor had appeared in the heaven and earth.","More than 10 million years had passed, and the shockwaves from the previous Great Emperor had already dispersed completely. The heaven and earth would allow a new Emperor to appear.","All the young prodigies were rubbing their fists, wanting to contend for this once in a thousand years opportunity.","Although there were hundreds of Great Emperors in the world at this moment, it couldn’t be denied that the level of Great Emperor was still the most powerful battle prowess in the world. Everyone wanted to squeeze into this group.","Ling Han also wanted his descendants to fight for this great opportunity.","Although they could also become Emperors in the Primitive Abyss, there would be limitations. Ultimately, they would not have been blessed by heaven and earth.","Of course, this was unless they obtained all four of the key elements. However, this was far too difficult. Out of the dozens of Stacked Eras, only four had appeared.","Jing Haoran and Shui Qingchang also came out of seclusion one after another. They could only reach second tier, and could not advance any further.","Consummate level of the four elements was really, really too difficult. Even if they were the masters of the Genesis World, they would not be able to accomplish this.","If two, or even more, invincible Great Emperors appeared from this Stacked Era, that would really be strange.","However, all the Great Emperors had long since reached the end of their lifespans. They could only travel the world by depending on the element of life provided by Ling Han. Otherwise, if they wanted to live, they could only stay on the Imperial Island.","The heaven and earth allowed a new Emperor to appear, and this also welcomed a heyday of cultivation. Outstanding talents appeared from all over the world.","Ling Han valued prodigies. He had the Nine Suns Holy Land recruit prodigies, and he would also personally guide them, wanting to take a gamble on the fortune of heaven and earth.","He sat cross-legged on a rock, while his disciples sat around him, listening quietly to his teachings.","These disciples all knew that this was an invincible Great Emperor. Even if any one of them became a Great Emperor, they would still have to be extremely respectful in front of Ling Han.","A Great Emperor who woudl attain Dao in this era would clearly be very depressed. He should have been invincible in this world, and suppressed an era, but what happened in the end?","There were many Great Emperors, and there were even invincible Great Emperors.","Hong long long, countless golden lotuses suddenly appeared out of thin air in the heaven and earth, blooming everywhere.","A new Emperor was about to be born!","However, how could it be so fast!","Everyone was astounded. No Pseudo-Emperors had appeared among them, so it was naturally impossible that one of them had attained Dao.","Meanwhile, Ling Han’s expression was filled with shock. This f******, the one who had attained Dao was him!"]}]);
